    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Mito's Birthday Order\" is here! Featuring new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3! All ★4 Skill Records are Mito!\nShop\n2026-08-03 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Mito's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Violet Lightning Scythe] Mito\n\" and \"\n[Violet Battlefield Shadow] Mito\n\" are now available!\n\"\nMito's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Mito guaranteed on Step 3!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3, one ★4 \"Mito\" is guaranteed!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Violet Lightning Scythe] Mito\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nHoly Split Burst\nSkill Name\nHoly Split\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nBlunt/\nHoly\nElement\nBlunt/\nHoly\nActivation Requirements\nHoly\n→Blunt→\nHoly\n→(\nHoly\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n36\nSwitch Gauge\n36\nBreak Gauge\n37\nBreak Gauge\n74\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n2100% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Enhance Attack 4/Buff] Attack +15% for 20 sec./[Holy Element Enhance4/Buff] Holy element damage +9% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n5800% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Bonus] When enemy's HP is 50% or up, attack will increase 250%./[Bonus] Holy element damage increases x 0.5% the number of Debility stacks when the player is inflicted with the Debility status ailment./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Agil's Skill Records in the same set, Damage done to enemies weak to blunt +100%.\n・While Full Burst state/[Ruinous Shine 4/Buff]Holy element damage +75% for 20 sec.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[Violet Battlefield Shadow] Mito\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Enhance Attack/Shine Conversion/Beating\nAttack\n53\nDefense\n32\nHP\n2575\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 4] Attack +900./[Enhance Attack 4] Attack +15%./[Shine Conversion 5] Dark element's damage to enemies -15% and holy element's damage to enemies +30%.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Beating 4] Damage done to enemies weak to blunt +25%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nExtra effect time 7.5 sec.\nLimit Break extends Accele Skill effect time.\n*Maximum Breakthrough\n- Duration\nAugust 3, 2026 (Mon) 0:00 - August 12, 2026 (Wed) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1,250 Arcana Gems (50% Off)\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nOne ★4 \"Mito\" guaranteed!\nOn every Step, all ★4 Skill Records are \"Mito\"!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nThere is no voice production when ★4 \"Mito\" Skill Records are drawn.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
