    "snippet": "Para celebrar el cumpleaños de Yui, ¡los nuevos récords de habilidades ★4 \"[Fluttering Pink Wings] Yui\" y \"[Blessed Candles] Yui\" ya están disponibles! ¡El \"Pedido de Cumpleaños de Yui\" ya está aquí! ¡Obtén una Yui ★4 garantizada en el Paso 3!  ¡En el Paso 1, puedes obtener 11 pedidos por 1250 gemas arcanas! ¡En el Paso 3, se garantiza un \"Yui\" de ★4! Hazaña...",
    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Yui's Birthday Order\" is here! Featuring new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3! All ★4 Skill Records are Yui!\nShop\n2026-08-01 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Yui's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Fluttering Pink Wings] Yui\n\" and \"\n[Blessed Candles] Yui\n\" are now available!\n\"\nYui's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Yui guaranteed on Step 3!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3, one ★4 \"Yui\" is guaranteed!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Fluttering Pink Wings] Yui\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nEarth Creep\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n96\nBreak Gauge\n41\nSkill Effect\n2250% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Motion Range]/[Earth Pile/Buff] Earth element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Earth Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Earth element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nEarth damage +50% when using earth skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise earth damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Blessed Candles] Yui\nSkill Name\nVital Assention/Light Magic/Earth Boost\nAttack\n56\nDefense\n32\nHP\n2350\nSkill Effect\n[Vital Assention 3] Defense +400./[Light Magic 4] DEF increase with own level ×0.17%. (max 34%)/[Earth Boost 5] Elemental damage other than Earth dealt to enemies -50%(Non-elemental included), and Earth element's damage to enemies +45%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Duration\nAugust 1, 2026 (Sat) 0:00 - August 10, 2026 (Mon) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1,250 Arcana Gems (50% Off)\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nOne ★4 \"Yui\" guaranteed!\nOn every Step, all ★4 Skill Records are \"Yui\"!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
