    "snippet": "Para celebrar el lanzamiento de Echoes of Aincrad, ¡estamos realizando un bono de inicio de sesión especial en SAOIF! ¡Inicia sesión durante el evento para obtener el avatar de Iori el día 1 y el avatar de Lara el día 2!  ¡Únete a la emoción por la última historia de Aincrad mientras juegas SAOIF!  Período 9 de julio de 2026 (jueves) 4:00 - 24 de julio de 2026 (viernes)...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nReceive Avatars of Iori and Lara! The Echoes of Aincrad Release Celebration Login Bonus is here!\nEVENT\n2026-07-09 04:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate the release of Echoes of Aincrad, we're holding a special Login Bonus in SAOIF!\nLog in during the event to get\nIori's Avatar\non Day 1 and\nLara's Avatar\non Day 2!\nJoin in the excitement for Aincrad's latest story while playing SAOIF!\nPeriod\nJuly 9, 2026 (Thu) 4:00 - July 24, 2026 (Fri) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nReward Details\nNumber of Days Logged In\nReward\nDay1\nRainbow Concert Costume A×1\nRainbow Concert Ribbon A×1\n(Iori)\nDay2\nRainbow Concert Costume B×1\nRainbow Concert Ribbon B×1\n(Lara)\nImportant\nLogin Bonuses can be claimed after completing \"Another Reality\" (1F).\nDaily distribution time will be from 4:00 AM to 3:59 AM of the next day. (JST/UTC+9)\nPlease note that the distribution date does not switch when the date changes.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
