    "full_details": "Notices\nThe Labyrinth of Deduction Order is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2026-07-08 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThrough observation and deduction, Eugeo and Koharu uncover the truth in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe Labyrinth of Deduction Order is here! Get one ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3!\nThe 6% total drop rate does not include the guaranteed ★4 Skill Record, and new ★4 Skill Records are featured Skill Records with high drop rates!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Brilliant Deduction] Eugeo\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nAqua Double Down Burst\nSkill Name\nAqua Double Down\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nBlunt/\nWater\nElement\nBlunt/\nWater\nActivation Requirements\nWater\n→Blunt→\nWater\n→(\nWater\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n52\nSwitch Gauge\n52\nBreak Gauge\n48\nBreak Gauge\n96\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n2460% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Enhance Attack 4/Buff] Attack +15% for 20 sec./[Water Element Enhance4/Buff] Water element damage +9% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n6000% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Bonus] When enemy's HP is 50% or up, attack will increase 250%./[Bonus] Water element damage increases x 0.5% the number of frostbite stacks when the player is inflicted with the frostbite status ailment./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Agil's Skill Records in the same set, Damage done to enemies weak to blunt +100%.\n・While Full Burst state/[Ruinous Water 4/Buff] Water element damage +75% for 20 sec.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[In Search of a Mystery] Koharu\nSkill Name\nBloody Battle Strike/Aqua Conversion\nAttack\n56\nDefense\n32\nHP\n2350\nSkill Effect\n[Bloody Battle Strike 3] Attack +35% when attacking with blunt element./[Aqua Conversion 4] Fire element's damage to enemies -10% and water element's damage to enemies +25%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Ability\nFor each piece of equipment in the same set, the number of activations in additional Full Burst state increases by 1 (1 activation per skill)\nStock Type: Resets remaining time for Full Burst skill activation, and extends duration of Full Burst state (+10 sec per 1 equipment)\nChain Type: Increases burst skill damage used in Full Burst state (+5% per 1 equipment)\n*Burst activated Sword Skills during Full Burst state will activate normally until Full Burst State ends.\n\"[Brilliant Deduction] Eugeo\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nAfter July 8, 2026 (Wed) maintenance - Before August 5, 2026 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
