    "full_details": "Notices\nThe Lv. 295 Dark Black Series \"Optimized Thing Chaos\" is here! New boss monster added to the \"Chaos Showdown\"!\nEVENT\n2026-07-08 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe high-difficulty dungeon, \"Chaos Showdown\", has been updated!\nGet the powerful \"Dark Black Series\" armor!\nDungeon Duration\nAfter July 8, 2026 (Wed) maintenance - Before July 23, 2026 (Thu) maintenance (JST/UTC+9)\nNew Boss monster\nOptimized Thing Chaos\nDetails\nSince this is a field with unusable items, some items cannot be used.\nWhen battle starts, it will use a Critical Resistance buff.\nIt is breakable with Blunt element skills.\nWhen a Break happens, the boss will be temporarily immobilized and all its buffs will be removed.\nIt's Break time is long.\nWith a certain attack, it gets a powerful buff to reduce damage.\nIt will split up and merge during battle.\nWhen its HP falls beneath a certain amount, it will use the Chaos Recollection buff.\nWeakness\nBlunt Element\nWater Element\nResistance\nSlash Element\nThrust Element\nFire Element\nWind Element\nEarth Element\nHoly Element\nDark Element\nCritical\nDamage\nBuffs used\n\"Critical resistance\" and \"Chaos Recollection\"\n\"Reduces damage\"\nStatus Ailments and Debuffs used\nStatus ailments \"Stun\", \"Debility\" and \"Iceburn\"\n* Break: Filling the entire Break Gauge will temporarily immobilize the boss and remove all of its buff effects.\n* Chaos Recollection: A powerful aura that surrounds the body and reduces damage. (Awakening is effective.)\nFor details on the effects of \"Status Ailments\", please check in-game via \"Menu\" > \"System\" > \"Help\" > \"Buff, Debuff, and Status Ailments\".\nAlternatively, please refer to the\n\"Status Ailments\"\nsection of the Play Guide.\nBoss Appearing\nDifficulty\nBoss Name\nWeakness\nObtainable Chaos Crystals\nChallenge with party\nChaos Showdown 90\nDark Black Thunder Bull\nSlash Element\n・\nWind Element\nCrimson Chaos Crystal\nOK\nChaos Showdown 95\nDark Black False Statue\nThrust Element\n・\nFire Element\nAmber Chaos Crystal\nOK\nChaos Showdown 110\nDark Black Frozen Evil\nBlunt Element\n・\nDark Element\nTopaz Chaos Crystal\nOK\nChaos Showdown 135\nDark Black Griffin\nThrust Element\n・\nWater Element\nEmerald Chaos Crystal\nOK\nChaos Showdown 155\nDark Black Half Beast\nThrust Element\n・\nEarth Element\nSapphire Chaos Crystal\nOK\nChaos Showdown 175\nDark Black Crossgigas\nSlash Element\n・\nHoly Element\nIndigo Chaos Crystal\nOK\nChaos Showdown 195\nDark Black Butterfly\nBlunt Element\n・\nWind Element\nAmethyst Chaos Crystal\nOK\nChaos Showdown 215\nDark Black Sea Snake\nBlunt Element\n・\nHoly Element\nQuartz Chaos Crystal\nOK\nChaos Showdown 235\nDark Black Hundred Arms\nThrust Element\n・\nWater Element\nRose Quartz Chaos Crystal\nNO\nChaos Showdown 255\nDark Black Overseer\nSlash Element\n・\nHoly Element\nSky Chaos Crystal\nNO\nChaos Showdown 275\nDark Black Extreme Wyrm\nSlash Element\n・\nWind Element\nDeep Emerald Chaos Crystal\nNO\nChaos Showdown 295\nDark Black Optimized Thing\nBlunt Element\n・\nWater Element\nDeep Amethyst Chaos Crystal\nNO\n\"Dark Black Series\" equipment can be produced at the Workshop using Chaos Crystals and production materials dropped from the boss.\nEach \"Chaos Crystal\" can be obtained by collecting the correlating \"Crystal Shards\" and using them for production.\nDark Black Series List\nIcon\nItem Name\nDefense ₍Max₎\nHP Bonus ₍Max₎\nRequired Level\nDark Black Thunder Bull Armor\n816\n12210\nLv.90\nDark Black Thunder Bull Greaves\n670\n8547\nLv.90\nDark Black False Statue Armor\n866\n12810\nLv.95\nDark Black False Statue Greaves\n710\n8967\nLv.95\nDark Black Frozen Evil Armor\n917\n14010\nLv.110\nDark Black Frozen Evil Greaves\n752\n9807\nLv.110\nDark Black Griffin Armor\n1257\n20190\nLv.135\nDark Black Griffin Greaves\n1031\n14133\nLv.135\nDark Black Half Beast Armor\n1358\n21990\nLv.155\nDark Black Half Beast Greaves\n1114\n15393\nLv.155\nDark Black Crossgigas Armor\n1460\n24400\nLv.175\nDark Black Crossgigas Greaves\n1197\n16303\nLv.175\nDark Black Butterfly Armor\n1563\n26850\nLv.195\nDark Black Butterfly Greaves\n1282\n17253\nLv.195\nDark Black Sea Snake Armor\n1667\n29350\nLv.215\nDark Black Sea Snake Greaves\n1367\n18253\nLv.215\nDark Black Hundred Arms Armor\n1772\n31900\nLv.235\nDark Black Hundred Arms Greaves\n1453\n19303\nLv.235\nDark Black Overseer Armor\n1878\n34500\nLv.255\nDark Black Overseer Greaves\n1540\n20403\nLv.255\nDark Black Extreme Wyrm Armor\n1985\n37150\nLv.275\nDark Black Extreme Wyrm Greaves\n1628\n21553\nLv.275\nDark Black Optimized Thing Armor[NEW!]\n2093\n39850\nLv.295\nDark Black Optimized Thing Greaves[NEW!]\n1716\n22753\nLv.295\nRandom Bonus\nThe value and type of the Dark Black Series bonus are random.\nExample: Equippable Lv. 295 Dark Black Series\nStatus\nUpper\nLower\nAttack\n30\n30\nDefense\n120\n50\nHP\n2500\n6000\nExample: If three types of defenses are given to Dark Black Optimized Thing Armor, defense will increase by 360 total.\n* Succession cannot be used for the Dark Black Series.\nParticipation Requirements\nClear the 10F Main Quest through the end\nAccept it from the \"Chaos Showdown\" NPC at the \"Blackiron Palace\".\nImportant\nChaos Showdown is a permanent dungeon where the boss changes approximately every two weeks. The rotation will start over again after six weeks.\nYour score reward and challenge reward information will not reset when each dungeon returns.\nCheck the game for details about the rewards of each dungeon.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
