    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Labyrinth Strategy Campaign\" is on now!\nCampaign\n2026-06-30 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nCollect the Bronze Floor Coins dropped by monsters on 13F and onward of the Labyrinth, then exchange what you've collected for tons of items!\nRewards\nThere are a variety of items at the Trader, including Awakening Stars, Medals of Combat Arts, and up to 50\n\"Memoria Niter S\"\n.\nTrade \"Bronze Floor Coin\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nMemoria Niter S\n75\n50\nMedal of Combat Arts\n75\n25\nAwakening Star\n15\n100\nGreat Blue Jewel\n30\n20\nGreat Red Jewel\n30\n20\nGreat Green Jewel\n30\n20\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n30\n20\nRelease Crystal (L)\n50\n20\nRelease Crystal (M)\n25\n40\nBronze Floor Coin Trader\nFor more info, go to Menu > Items > Enhance/Trade > Trade Limited Items and tap the Bronze Floor Coin Trader banner.\nCampaign Duration\nAfter June 30, 2026 (Tue) maintenance - Before July 15, 2026 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9)\nTrader Period\nAfter June 30, 2026 (Tue) maintenance - Before July 22, 2026 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9)\nImportant\nMonsters in the target Labyrinth Dungeons from 13F and onward drop Bronze Floor Coins.\nBronze Floor Coins do not drop from the All Out Battle monsters The Skull Reaper and An Incarnate of the Radius.\n\"Bronze Floor Coin\" will be removed on July 22, 2026 (Wed) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nDue to an error in the announcement, corrections were made on [6/30 17:00]. \r\nWe sincerely apologize for any confusion this may have caused.\nGo to Notice List",
