    "snippet": "Aviso para aquellos usuarios que inicien sesión en \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".  El mantenimiento que hemos implementado desde el 30/6 de 2026 a las 13:00 se completó el 30/6 de 2026 a las 17:00 (JST/UTC+9). Las siguientes son nuevas actualizaciones.  ▼ Eventos nuevos y recientemente implementados Underworld Boss Rush \"¡Watermelon Panic!\" está de vuelta \"Pequeña cicatriz...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(6/30)\nMAINT.\n2026-06-30 13:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 6/30, 2026, 13:00, was completed on 6/30, 2026, 17:00(JST/UTC+9).\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\nUnderworld Boss Rush\n\"Watermelon Panic!\" is back\n\"Bit scary?! Cave Exploration\" is back\nLabyrinth Strategy Campaign\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\n▼Scheduled Maintenance dates\n6/30, 2026 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\nUnderworld Boss Rush\n\"Watermelon Panic!\" is back\n\"Bit scary?! Cave Exploration\" is back\nLabyrinth Strategy Campaign\n▼Ending Soon! Available until the start of the 6/30 Maintenance\n[Holiday Campaign] The \"Golden Colossus Hunt\"\n[Holiday Campaign] Boss Ingot Increased Drop Rate Campaign\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
