    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Rain's Birthday Order\" is here! Featuring new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3! All ★4 Skill Records are Rain!\nShop\n2026-06-21 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Rain's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Unbound Sword Formation] Rain\n\" and \"\n[Friendship Through Smiles] Rain\n\" are now available!\n\"\nRain's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Rain guaranteed on Step 3!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3, one ★4 \"Rain\" is guaranteed!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Unbound Sword Formation] Rain\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nDark Turbulence\nSP Cost\n18\nElement\nSlash/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n54\nBreak Gauge\n35\nSkill Effect\n2800% damage (6x hit/Single Foe)[Center/Arc/Mid]/[Dark Pile/Buff] Dark element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Dark Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, dark element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nLink Skill\nLink Level increases by attacking during Link State.\nSkill Power increases by Link Level x 4%.\n*Counts as a Link Skill only when using a compatible weapon type.\nWhen Activated: Dark element damage +50%.\nLLv50：Dark element damage +50%.\nLLv100: Your own attack increases by defense x 1.\nLLv250: Damage done to enemies weak to slashing +50%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Friendship Through Smiles] Rain\nSkill Name\nVital Assention/Duet\nAttack\n54\nDefense\n34\nHP\n2425\nSkill Effect\n[Vital Assention 4] Defense +450./[Duet 2] Switch gauge amount +10%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nLink Skill\nEffect duration is extended.\nThe higher the Limit Break level, the more Link Level increases when attacking with Link Sword Skills.\nWhen Activated: Attack +500 when using Link Sword Skills.\nLLv100: Skill Power is added +100%.\nLLv250: Dark element damage +20%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n\"[Unbound Sword Formation] Rain\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nJune 21, 2026 (Sun) 0:00 - June 30, 2026 (Tue) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1,250 Arcana Gems (50% Off)\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nOne ★4 \"Rain\" guaranteed!\nOn every Step, all ★4 Skill Records are \"Rain\"!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nThere is no voice production when ★4 \"Rain\" Skill Records are drawn.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
