    "snippet": "¡Completa las mazmorras diarias dos veces más! ¡\"Daily Dungeon +2\" ya está aquí!  Acerca de Daily Dungeon Las \"Daily Dungeons\" son un tipo especial de mazmorra en solitario que solo puedes completar una vez al día. Hay diez variedades de \"Mazmorras Diarias\" para elegir, cada una con diferentes recompensas como EXP y equip...",
    "full_details": "Notices\n[Holiday Campaign] \"Daily Dungeon +2\" is here! Clear it up to 3 times a day!\nEVENT\n2026-06-12 04:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nClear the Daily Dungeons an additional two times!\n\"Daily Dungeon +2\"\nis here!\nAbout Daily Dungeon\n\"Daily Dungeons\" are a special type of solo dungeon that you can only clear once per day. There are ten varieties of \"Daily Dungeons\" to choose from, each with different rewards such as EXP and equipment enhancement items.\nOnce you clear a Daily Dungeon, you can't challenge a new one until the system resets at 4:00 AM (JST/UTC+9).\nPlus, during this event you can clear Daily Dungeons up to 3 times per day!\nYou can either clear one dungeon three times, or clear three different dungeons once each. Feel free to play in a way that suits your style!\nHow to Participate\nTalk to the \"Daily Dungeon\" NPC at the \"Blackiron Palace\" to challenge it.\nDaily Dungeon\nCampaign Duration\nJune 12, 2026 (Fri) 4:00 - June 26, 2026 (Fri) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete Main quest [The Indomitable Fang]\nList of \"Daily Dungeons\"\nDungeon\nRewards\nMain Attainable Items\nWeapon Proficiency Enhancement Version\nWeapon Proficiency Items\nMartial Arts Text, All Release Crystals\nEXP Version\nEXP\nExp Crystal M\nCol Version\nCol\nCol\nSkill Enhancement Version\nSkill Record enhancement materials\nRecord Frame L\nEquipment Enhancement Version\nEquipment enhancement materials\nGlare Dragon Stone\nEquipment Transformation Version\nEquipment transformation materials\nEach Stone, Each Stone+, Blocking Stone, Blocking Stone+, Refining Hammer, Refining Hammer+\nSkill Transform & Awaken Ver./R\nSkill Record Transformation & Awakening materials (Slash Element)\nAwakening Star, each Red Jewel\nSkill Transform & Awaken Ver./G\nSkill Record Transformation & Awakening materials (Thrust Element)\nAwakening Star, each Green Jewel\nSkill Transform & Awaken Ver./Y\nSkill Record Transformation & Awakening materials (Blunt Element)\nAwakening Star, each Yellow Jewel\nSkill Transform & Awaken Ver./B\nSkill Record Transformation & Awakening materials (Ability)\nAwakening Star, each Blue Jewel\nImportant\n\"Daily Dungeons\" are updated daily at 4:00am. After this, the previous day's dungeons cannot be attempted.(JST/UTC+9)\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
