    "news_category": "EVENT",
    "snippet": "¡El 23 de mayo es el cumpleaños de Yuuki! ¡Estamos realizando varias campañas en SWORD ART ONLINE Integral Factor para celebrar el cumpleaños de Yuuki! ¡Celebremos todos juntos este maravilloso día!  Para más detalles, consulta los anuncios de cada evento y Pedido. Además, tenga en cuenta que los períodos de eventos son diferentes para...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nMay 23 is Yuuki's birthday! Tons of events and Orders! You've gotta check out this announcement!\nEVENT\n2026-05-23 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nMay 23 is Yuuki's birthday!\nWe're holding various campaigns in SWORD ART ONLINE Integral Factor to celebrate Yuuki's birthday!\nLet's all celebrate this wonderful day together!\nFor more details, check the announcements for each event and Order.\nAlso, please note that event periods are different for each.\n* There are some events and Orders that have yet to begin at the time of this announcement's posting.\nRaising Assisting Character Campaign for Yuuki\nWe're holding a campaign where you can get Yuuki's chat stamp, items that increase your Friendship, and more!\nPeriod\nMay 23, 2026 (Sat) 4:00 - May 30, 2026 (Sat) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nYuuki's Birthday Order\nAll ★4 Skill Records are Yuuki!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\nYuuki's Birthday Order is here!\nDuration\nMay 23, 2026 (Sat) 0:00 - June 1, 2026 (Mon) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n★4 Yuuki Guaranteed Free Once Daily Order\nA free Order that guarantees a ★4 Yuuki is here to celebrate Yuuki's birthday!\nIt's available once per day during the event period, so don't forget!\nPeriod\nMay 23, 2026 (Sat) 4:00 - June 1, 2026 (Mon) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nBirthday Panels\nPanels featuring illustrations of Yuuki have been placed in four in-game locations!\nTry taking a screenshot together with them if you come across one!\nPlacement Period\nMay 23, 2026 (Sat) 0:00 - June 1, 2026 (Mon) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nYuuki Birthday Login Bonus\nLog in during the event period to get 100 Arcana Gems every day, for a total of up to 1,000 Arcana Gems over 10 days!\nPeriod\nMay 23, 2026 (Sat) 4:00 - June 2, 2026 (Tue) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nArcana Gem Gift\nLog in on the day of Yuuki's birthday to get a gift of 250 Arcana Gems!\nTime Limit\nAvailable until May 23, 2026 (Sat) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nImportant\n・The schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
