    "snippet": "Para celebrar el cumpleaños de Lisbeth, ¡los nuevos récords de habilidades ★4 \"[Pulse of Iron Smoke] Lisbeth\" y \"[Thunderous Icebreaker] Lisbeth\" ya están disponibles! ¡\"El pedido de cumpleaños de Lisbeth\" ya está aquí! ¡Obtén una Lisbeth de ★4 garantizada en el Paso 3!  ¡En el Paso 1, puedes obtener 11 pedidos por 1250 gemas arcanas! Con nuevo ★4 Sk...",
    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Lisbeth's Birthday Order\" is here! Featuring new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3! All ★4 Skill Records are Lisbeth!\nShop\n2026-05-18 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Lisbeth's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Pulse of Iron Smoke] Lisbeth\n\" and \"\n[Thunderous Icebreaker] Lisbeth\n\" are now available!\n\"\nLisbeth's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Lisbeth guaranteed on Step 3!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\nOn Step 3, one ★4 \"Lisbeth\" is guaranteed!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Pulse of Iron Smoke] Lisbeth\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nArrogate Burst\nSkill Name\nArrogate\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n15\nElement\nNone\nElement\nNone\nActivation Requirements\nEarth\n→\nEarth\n→Blunt→\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n0\nSwitch Gauge\n0\nBreak Gauge\n0\nBreak Gauge\n0\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n[Enhance Attack 5/Buff (PT)] Own and Party's attack +20% for 10 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n[The Proud Crowd 4/Buff (PT)] Own and Party's attack +1.25% per stack (Stack50) during 20 sec.　Effect will be removed with damage.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Thunderous Icebreaker] Lisbeth\nSkill Name\nBloody Battle Strike/Earth Conversion/Iron-Fisted Punishment\nAttack\n48\nDefense\n36\nHP\n2500\nSkill Effect\n[Bloody Battle Strike 4] Attack +40% when attacking with blunt element./[Earth Conversion 4] Wind element's damage to enemies -10% and earth element's damage to enemies +25%./[Iron-Fisted Punishment 3] Attack +400 when attacking with blunt element.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Duration\nMay 18, 2026 (Mon) 0:00 - May 27, 2026 (Wed) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1,250 Arcana Gems (50% Off)\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nOne ★4 \"Lisbeth\" guaranteed!\nOn every Step, all ★4 Skill Records are \"Lisbeth\"!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\n*The contents of the banner was edited on 5/19 at 13:20. We apologize for any confusion this may have caused.\nGo to Notice List"
