    "snippet": "¡Asuna, Sachi, Alice y Eugeo están vestidos como señores de la guerra feudales marchando por zonas de guerra en estos nuevos Registros de habilidades ★4! ¡La \"Orden de los Héroes de la Era Tumultuosa\" ya está aquí! ¡Obtén un nuevo récord de habilidad ★4 garantizado en el paso 5! La tasa de caída total del 6% no incluye el Registro de Habilidad ★4 garantizado ni el nuevo R de Habilidad ★4...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Tumultuous Age Heroes Order\" is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2026-05-01 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nAsuna, Sachi, Alice and Eugeo are dressed as feudal warlods marching through warzones in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nTumultuous Age Heroes Order\n\" is here! Get one new ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\nThe 6% total drop rate does not include the guaranteed ★4 Skill Record, and new ★4 Skill Records are featured Skill Records with high drop rates!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Dashing Martial Artist] Asuna\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nMist Shower Burst\nSkill Name\nMist Shower\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nThrust/\nWater\nElement\nThrust/\nWater\nActivation Requirements\nWater\n→Thrust→\nWater\n→(\nWater\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSwitch Gauge\n70\nSwitch Gauge\n70\nBreak Gauge\n48\nBreak Gauge\n96\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n2400% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Water Element Enhance4/Buff] Water element damage +9% for 15 sec./[Weakness Attack 3/Buff] Critical damage +10% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n5800% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Bonus] Attack +2000 against enemies with the slash element./[Bonus] While debuff to raise your own damage taken is effective, attack power will increase 150%./[Bonus] Critical rate +1000%.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[Cross Spear of Violet Clouds] Sachi\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nWater Charge\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n92\nBreak Gauge\n47\nSkill Effect\n2240% damage (All Foes)[Motion Range]/[Aqua Pile/Buff] Water element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Aqua Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, water element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec./[Slash Destruction Mark/Debuff] For slash element enemies, the next attack the enemy receives will induce 2.5x damage. (Applies to other party member's attacks. Effect will disappear after 10 sec if not activated.)\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect 30 sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n★4[Flower in the Garden] Alice\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nCrag Slay\nSP Cost\n18\nElement\nSlash/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n42\nBreak Gauge\n38\nSkill Effect\n2500% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Earth Force 4/Buff] Earth element damage +15% for 15 sec./[Enhance Slash 2/Buff] Damage done to enemies weak to Slash +20% for 20 sec.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Slash Boost 3/Buff] Adds a buff where slash elemental weakness damage +1% per 1 Stack (Stack 3) for 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nLink Skill\nLink Level increases by attacking during Link State.\nSkill Power increases by Link Level x 4%.\n*Counts as a Link Skill only when using a compatible weapon type.\nWhen Activated: Earth element damage +50%.\nLLv50: Earth element damage +50%.\nLLv100: Your own attack increases by defense x 1.\nLLv250: Damage done to enemies weak to slashing +50%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Blade Like Flowing Water] Eugeo\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Enhance Attack/Exciting\nAttack\n56\nDefense\n32\nHP\n2725\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 4] Attack +900./[Enhance Attack 4] Attack +15%./[Exciting 4] Defense -30% and during the buff effect for increased max HP the critical damage -300%\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nLink Skill\nEffect duration is extended.\nThe higher the Limit Break level, the more Link Level increases when attacking with Link Sword Skills.\nWhen Activated: Attack +500 when using Link Sword Skills.\nLLv100: Skill Power is added +100%.\nLLv250: water element damage +20%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n\"[Dashing Martial Artist] Asuna\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nMay 1, 2026 (Fri) 0:00 - May 31, 2026 (Sun) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
