    "full_details": "Notices\n[Special Campaign] The Early Summer: Free Once Daily 11x Order is on now!\nShop\n2026-04-25 04:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nSpecial Campaign!\nThe\nEarly Summer: Free Once Daily 11x Order\nis here! Get up to 132 Skill Records!\nYou will be able to get a free 11x Order per day during the event period, so don't forget!\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Cute Walker] Koharu\nSkill Name\nAdvance Trooper/Flame Conversion\nAttack\n61\nDefense\n34\nHP\n2650\nSkill Effect\n[Advance Trooper 5] Attack +500./[Flame Conversion 4]Water element's damage to enemies -10% and fire element's damage to enemies +25%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nExtra effect time 7.5 sec.\nLimit Break extends Accele Skill effect time.\n*Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Charming Dress] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nPhoton Viper\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n84\nBreak Gauge\n28\nSkill Effect\n1870% damage (6x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Shine Pile/Buff] Holy element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Shine Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, holy element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n*More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Bonus] Raises 3 stacks for all Stack buffs that are on yourself.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect 30 sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n★4[Full-On Street] Lisbeth\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nShine Disruption\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n48\nBreak Gauge\n82\nSkill Effect\n1230% damage (3x hit/All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using holy skills./[Bonus] When equipping 1 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +500.\n* Increase in break gauge amount.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Lollipop Wolf] Leafa\nSkill Name\nIron-Fisted Punishment/Prosper/Mallet Blow\nAttack\n54\nDefense\n32\nHP\n2800\nSkill Effect\n[Iron-Fisted Punishment 4] Attack +500 when attacking with blunt element./[Prosper 4] Attack +20% when HP is above 50%./[Mallet Blow 4] Damage done to enemies weak to blunt +30% against enemies with debuff status (Mark, Small Mark, Death Mark, Thrust Erosion Mark, Slash Destruction Mark).\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n- Period\nApril 25, 2026 (Sat) 4:00 - May 7, 2026 (Thu) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Important\nThere is no single Order.\nNew days begin at 4:00 am every day (JST/UTC+9).\nIncludes ★2 to ★4 Skill Records.\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nPlease be aware that the period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
