    "news_date": 1776970800,
    "news_category": "EVENT",
    "snippet": "¡The Raising Dungeon está aquí para ayudar a impulsar el crecimiento del personaje!  ¡Derriba a Yuuki y consigue objetos útiles para la batalla! ¡Límpialo hasta tres veces al día! ¡El extremadamente difícil Serious Match, donde puedes luchar contra Yuuki con todo, también está en marcha ahora! ¡La potencia total recomendada es 250.000!  Recompensas El desafío...",
    "full_details": "Notices\n【Raising Dungeon】Clears +2! Get items to increase drop rates and boost EXP from the \"Great Enhancement Event  VS Yuuki +2\" on now!\nEVENT\n2026-04-24 04:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe Raising Dungeon is here to help boost character growth!\nTake down Yuuki and get useful items for battle!\nClear it up to three times a day!\nThe extremely difficult\nSerious Match\n, where you can fight Yuuki going all out, is also on now! The Recommended Total Power is 250,000!\nRewards\nThe challenge rewards for the \"\nGreat Enhancement Event  VS Yuuki +2\n\" include Incense, an item that doubles the drop rate and amount of EXP earned.\nUse Incense to get double the drop rate and EXP for 10 minutes!\nUse more than one to increase the effect's duration.\nDoing so will help you out in a variety of situations\n.\nIn the\nGreat Enhancement Event  VS Yuuki +2\n, you can select and clear one of the dungeons that drop Incense up to three times per day.\nYou can also select and clear one of the extremely difficult\nSerious Match\ndungeons that drop Incense up to three times a day.\nItem Expiration\nThere is an expiration date on the Incense to Increase Exp S and Incense to Increase Luck S.\nThe items will disappear once the time limit has passed.\nItem Name\nItem Expiration\nIncense to increase Exp S\nUntil 5/11/2026 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nItem Name\nItem Expiration\nIncense to increase Luck S\nUntil 5/11/2026 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nEffects\n\"Incense to increase Exp S\" and \"Incense to increase Luck S\" effects will activate once a monster is defeated.\n* EXP gained during quests will not be boosted.\nIf you use Guild Skills with the same effect at the same time, the effect rates will be added together.\nExample:\nOnly \"Incense to increase Exp S\"\nEXP earned:\n100%\nincrease (\n2x the base amount\n)\n\"Incense to increase Exp S\" + Guild Skill (Player EXP UP I)\nEXP earned: 100% + 10% =\n110%\nincrease (\n2.1x the base amount\n)\nBoost Mode\n+ \"Incense to increase Exp S\"\nEXP earned: 300% + 100% =\n400%\nincrease (\n5x the base amount\n)\nSee here for more details on Boost Mode.\nHow to Participate\nTalk to \"Yuuki\" at the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to challenge the dungeon.\nEvent Period\nStarts after the April 24, 2026 (Fri) 4:00 - May 8, 2026 (Fri) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete Main quest [The Indomitable Fang]\nScore Rewards\nIncrease Exp\nIncrease Drop Rate\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n100\nEmergency Crystal\n1\n100\nEmergency Crystal\n1\n200\nEmergency Crystal\n1\n200\nEmergency Crystal\n1\n300\nEmergency Crystal\n1\n300\nEmergency Crystal\n1\n400\nEmergency Crystal\n1\n400\nEmergency Crystal\n1\n500\nEmergency Crystal\n1\n500\nEmergency Crystal\n1\n600\nEmergency Crystal\n1\n600\nEmergency Crystal\n1\n700\nEmergency Crystal\n1\n700\nEmergency Crystal\n1\n800\nEmergency Crystal\n1\n800\nEmergency Crystal\n1\nChallenge Rewards\nIncrease Exp\nChallenge Name\nReward\nAmount\nWin against Yuuki(Able to achieve repeatedly)\nIncense to increase Exp S\n3\nCompleted without any tumble(Able to achieve repeatedly)\nRecord Frame M\n5\nCompleted within 3 minutes(Able to achieve repeatedly)\nRestorative Potion\n1\nIncrease Drop Rate\nChallenge Name\nReward\nAmount\nWin against Yuuki(Able to achieve repeatedly)\nIncense to increase Luck S\n3\nCompleted without any tumble(Able to achieve repeatedly)\nRecord Frame M\n5\nCompleted within 3 minutes(Able to achieve repeatedly)\nRestorative Potion\n1\nExtremely difficult \"Serious Matches\"\nScore Rewards [Serious Matches]\nIncrease Exp\nIncrease Drop Rate\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n100\nHealing Crystal\n1\n100\nHealing Crystal\n1\n200\nHealing Crystal\n1\n200\nHealing Crystal\n1\n300\nHealing Crystal\n1\n300\nHealing Crystal\n1\n400\nHealing Crystal\n1\n400\nHealing Crystal\n1\n500\nHealing Crystal\n1\n500\nHealing Crystal\n1\n600\nHealing Crystal\n1\n600\nHealing Crystal\n1\n700\nHealing Crystal\n1\n700\nHealing Crystal\n1\n800\nHealing Crystal\n1\n800\nHealing Crystal\n1\nChallenge Rewards [Serious Matches]\nIncrease Exp\nChallenge Name\nReward\nAmount\nWin against Yuuki(Able to achieve repeatedly)\nIncense to Increase Exp S\n3\nCompleted without any tumble(Able to achieve repeatedly)\nLife Potion\n1\nCompleted within 7 minutes(Able to achieve repeatedly)\nRevive Crystal\n1\nIncrease Drop Rate\nChallenge Name\nReward\nAmount\nWin against Yuuki(Able to achieve repeatedly)\nIncense to Increase Luck S\n3\nCompleted without any tumble(Able to achieve repeatedly)\nLife Potion\n1\nCompleted within 7 minutes(Able to achieve repeatedly)\nRevive Crystal\n1\nImportant\nChallenge rewards will reset every day at 4:00 (JST/UTC+9).\nThis event will be a solo dungeon.\nKoharu will not join for Serious Matches.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
