    "snippet": "Para cumplir con las nuevas regulaciones, realizaremos los siguientes cambios en los servicios brindados a los clientes residentes en Brasil. A partir de hoy, los clientes de Brasil ya no podrán realizar compras de Arcana Gems. Entendemos que esto tendrá un impacto en el disfrute de nuestros jugadores en Br...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nChanges to Services Due to the Enforcement of Brazil's Digital ECA Law\nIMPORTANT\n2026-04-22 13:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo comply with new regulations, we will be making the following changes to the services provided to customers residing in Brazil.\nFrom today, customers in Brazil will no longer be able to make purchases of Arcana Gems.\nWe understand that this will have an impact on the enjoyment of our players in Brazil, but we are making these changes so that our players can continue to play Sword Art Online: Integral Factor.\nWe kindly ask that you cancel any active Boost Mode subscriptions you currently have.\nIf you have any questions regarding the cancellation process, please contact Support.\nWe sincerely apologize for the inconvenience.\nGo to Notice List"
