    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Leafa's Birthday Order\" is here! Featuring new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3! All ★4 Skill Records are Leafa!\nShop\n2026-04-19 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Leafa's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Fierce Yet Gorgeous] Leafa\n(Link Skill)\" and \"\n[Verdant Gale] Leafa\n(Accele Skill)\" are now available!\n\"\nLeafa's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Leafa guaranteed on Step 3!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\nOn Step 3, one ★4 \"Leafa\" is guaranteed!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Fierce Yet Gorgeous] Leafa\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nHoly Turbulence\nSP Cost\n18\nElement\nSlash/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n54\nBreak Gauge\n35\nSkill Effect\n2500% damage (6x hit/Single Foe)[Center/Arc/Mid]/[Shine Force 4/Buff] Holy element damage +15% for 15 sec./[Enhance Slash 2/Buff] Damage done to enemies weak to Slash +20% for 20 sec.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Slash Boost 3/Buff] Adds a buff where slash elemental weakness damage +1% per 1 Stack (Stack 3) for 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nLink Skill\nLink Level increases by attacking during Link State.\nSkill Power increases by Link Level x 4%.\n*Counts as a Link Skill only when using a compatible weapon type.\nWhen Activated: Holy element damage +50%.\nLLv100: Your own attack increases by defense x 1.\nLLv250: Damage done to enemies weak to slashing +50%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Verdant Gale] Leafa\nSkill Name\nCombination/Veteran Sword Technique/Shine Boost/Golden Opportunity\nAttack\n58\nDefense\n32\nHP\n2575\nSkill Effect\n●[Combination 4] Skill's power is added +100% when used in switch./[Veteran Sword Technique 4] Attack power increase with own level×0.17%. (max 34%)/[Shine Boost 5] Elemental damage other than holy dealt to enemies -50%(Non-elemental included), and holy element's damage to enemies +45%.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Golden Opportunity 4] Critical damage +50%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nExtra effect time 7.5 sec.\nLimit Break extends Accele Skill effect time.\n*Maximum Breakthrough\n- Duration\nApril 19, 2026 (Sun) 0:00 - April 28, 2026 (Tue) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1,250 Arcana Gems (50% Off)\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nOne ★4 \"Leafa\" guaranteed!\nOn every Step, all ★4 Skill Records are \"Leafa\"!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
