    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"★4 Alice or Eugeo Guaranteed Free Once Daily Order\" is here! A free Order consisting only of ★4 Alice or Eugeo!\nShop\n2026-04-09 04:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nCelebrating Alice and Eugeo's birthday!\nThe \"★4 Alice or Eugeo Guaranteed Free Once Daily Order\" is here, where you're guaranteed a Alice or Eugeo ★4 Skill Record!\nIt's available once per day during the event period, so don't forget!\n- Period\nApril 9, 2026 (Thu) 4:00 - April 18, 2026 (Sat) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Autumn Leaf Teahouse] Alice\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nShadow Creep\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n96\nBreak Gauge\n41\nSkill Effect\n2550% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Motion Range]/[Dark Pile/Buff] Dark element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Dark Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, dark element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nDark damage +50% when using dark skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise Dark element damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Pocket Guide] Eugeo\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nHoly Ravage\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n46\nBreak Gauge\n27\nSkill Effect\n1790% damage (2x hit/All Foes)[Front/Long/Mid]/▲▲▲[Bonus] Damage +100% to enemies when using holy skills./[Bonus] When equipping 3 or more of Eugeo's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1200.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Big Flowers in the Sky] Alice\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nNight Square\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n96\nBreak Gauge\n37\nSkill Effect\n2110% damage (4x hit/Single Foe)[Center/Arc/Mid]/[Dark Pile/Buff] Dark element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Dark Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, dark element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n*More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Jar of Ice 4/Buff] Defense +10 per stack (Stack 9) during 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect 30 sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n★4[Avid Reader] Eugeo\nSkill Name\nEnhance Thrust/Gale Blade/Prosper/Accelerated Healing\nAttack\n58\nDefense\n32\nHP\n2575\nSkill Effect\n[Enhance Thrust 4] Damage done to enemies weak to thrusting +24%./[Gale Blade 4] Deals +20% Wind element's damage to enemy./[Prosper 5] Attack +25% when HP is above 50%.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Accelerated Healing 4] Recovers a max of 4% HP per 3 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nExtra effect time 7.5 sec.\nLimit Break extends Accele Skill effect time.\n*Maximum Breakthrough\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nPlease be aware that the period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
