    "news_date": 1774929600,
    "news_category": "NOTICES",
    "snippet": "¡La alineación de Medal of Combat Arts Trader se actualizará el 1 de abril de 2026 (miércoles) a las 4:00 (JST/UTC+9)!  ¡Recoge \"Medalla de las artes de combate\" y obtén una variedad de artículos en Trader! ¡Hemos preparado \"Core Metal\", \"Armament Stone\" y \"Release Crystal\" que son necesarios para adquirir habilidades de competencia!  Sobre la Medalla de...",
    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Medal of Combat Arts\" Trader lineup update planned for 4/1, 2026 (Wed)!\nNOTICES\n2026-03-31 13:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe Medal of Combat Arts Trader's lineup will be updated on  4/1, 2026 (Wed) 4:00 (JST/UTC+9)!\nCollect \"Medal of Combat Arts\" and get a variety of items at the Trader!\nWe've prepared \"Core Metal\", \"Armament Stone\", and \"Release Crystal\" that are needed to acquire proficiency skills!\nAbout Medal of Combat Arts.\nParticipate in the events and gather Medal of Combat Arts!\nYou can get some Medals of Combat Arts from different in-game events.\n\"Medal of Combat Arts\" Trader\nFind the Trader by going to Menu → Items → Enhance/Trade → Trade Limited Items and tapping the Trade Medal of Combat Arts banner.\nYou can also check by going to NPC Trader → Trade Limited Items and tapping the Trade Medal of Combat Arts banner.\nMerchant District/NPC\"Trader\"\nMedal of Combat Arts Trader Planned to update 4/1, 2026 (Wed)!\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nPermanent Lineup\nCore Metal\n100\n2\nSticky Thing Armament Stone\n50\n1\nCrossgigas Armament Stone\n47\n1\nAsura Armament Stone\n44\n1\nOne-Eyed Beast Armament Stone\n36\n1\nHalf Beast Armament Stone\n33\n1\nBlazing Armament Stone\n30\n1\nAmber Chaos Crystal\n40\n1\nCrimson Chaos Crystal\n30\n1\nRelease Crystal (L)\n5\n20\nRelease Crystal (M)×2\n1\n50\nMartial Arts Text×5\n1\n20\nAwakening Star×5\n3\n10\nGreat Red Jewel\n3\n5\nGreat Green Jewel\n3\n5\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n3\n5\nGreat Blue Jewel\n3\n5\nExp Crystal L\n3\n1\nExp Crystal M×5\n2\n1\nMemoria Niter L\n50\n1\nMemoria Niter M×10\n50\n1\nMemoria Niter S×20\n50\n1\nRevive Crystal×3\n1\n20\nLimited-Time Only Lineup\n★4[Occasional Breaks] Asuna\n50\n1\n★4[This Is for You] Sinon\n47\n1\nMomentary Sword\n27\n1\nTrick-or-Vest Top\n29\n1\nTrick-or-Pants Bottoms\n18\n1\nTrick-or-Dress Top\n29\n1\nTrick-or-Dress Bottoms\n18\n1\nTrick-or-Cape\n10\n1\nTrick-or-Hat\n10\n1\n★3[Unyielding Swordsman] Kirito\n50\n1\n★3[Girl on the Run] Yuuki\n26\n1\n★4[Scarlet Loyalty] Asuna\n44\n1\nTrick-or-Pump A\n7\n1\nTrick-or-Pump B\n7\n1\nTrick-or-Pump C\n7\n1\nWitch Pump Mask A\n7\n1\nWitch Pump Mask B\n7\n1\nWitch Pump Mask C\n7\n1\nBear Suit Top and Bottom White\n35\n1\nBear Suit Head A White\n4\n1\nBear Suit Head B White\n4\n1\nBear Paw Badge A White\n1\n1\nBear Paw Badge B White\n1\n1\nBear Suit Top and Bottom Brown\n35\n1\nBear Suit Head A Brown\n4\n1\nBear Suit Head B Brown\n4\n1\nBear Paw Badge A Brown\n1\n1\nBear Paw Badge B Brown\n1\n1\nBear Suit Top and Bottom Peach\n35\n1\nBear Suit Head A Peach\n4\n1\nBear Suit Head B Peach\n4\n1\nBear Paw Badge A Peach\n1\n1\nBear Paw Badge B Peach\n1\n1\nBear Suit Top and Bottom\n35\n1\nBear Suit Head A\n4\n1\nBear Suit Head B\n4\n1\nBear Paw Badge A\n1\n1\nBear Paw Badge B\n1\n1\nRare Mush Bow\n7\n1\nRare Mush Bow Bright\n24\n1\n* The following Skill Records have been added to the [1x Only] Medal of Combat Arts Trader Lineup:\n★4[Swinging Blade] Kirito\n★3[Unshakable Conviction] Heathcliff\n★4[Man of the Day] Kirito\n★4[Black Pioneer] Kirito\n★3[Peaceful Smile] Yui\nAvatar\nItem Icon\nItem Name\nType\nWitch Pump Mask A\nAccessory Avatar\nWitch Pump Mask B\nAccessory Avatar\nWitch Pump Mask C\nAccessory Avatar\nTrick-or-Pump A\nAccessory Avatar\nTrick-or-Pump B\nAccessory Avatar\nTrick-or-Pump C\nAccessory Avatar\nMomentary Sword\n1H Sword Avatar\nAvatar Images\nImportant\nThere are some limited-time items in the Medal of Combat Arts Trader that will update once every 3 months.\nThe trade limit will reset on the 1st of every month at 4:00 (JST/UTC+9).\nThe next lineup update is planned for 7/1, 2026 (Wed) 4:00 (JST/UTC+9).\nDepending on the event, \"Medal of Combat Arts\" may not be available as a reward.\nThe schedule and lineup may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
