    "snippet": "Para celebrar el cumpleaños de Philia, ¡los nuevos registros de habilidades ★4 \"[Drowsy Morning Sun] Philia (Link Skill)\" y \"[Golden Treasure] Philia (Accele Skill)\" ya están disponibles! ¡La \"Orden de Cumpleaños de Philia\" ya está aquí! ¡Obtén una Philia ★4 garantizada en el Paso 3!  ¡En el Paso 1, puedes obtener 11 pedidos por 1250 gemas arcanas! Característica...",
    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Philia's Birthday Order\" is here! Featuring new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3! All ★4 Skill Records are Philia!\nShop\n2026-03-31 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Philia's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Drowsy Morning Sun] Philia\n(Link Skill)\" and \"\n[Golden Treasure] Philia\n(Accele Skill)\" are now available!\n\"\nPhilia's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Philia guaranteed on Step 3!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\nOn Step 3, one ★4 \"Philia\" is guaranteed!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Drowsy Morning Sun] Philia\nSkill Name\nKing of Daggers/Bloody Blow/Bisect\nAttack\n51\nDefense\n42\nHP\n2725\nSkill Effect\n[King of Daggers 3] Attack +1000 when using daggers./[Bloody Blow 4] Attack +24% against bleeding enemies.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Bisect 4] Damage done to enemies weak to slashing +25%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nLink Skill\nEffect duration is extended.\nThe higher the Limit Break level, the more Link Level increases when attacking with Link Sword Skills.\nWhen Activated: Attack +500 when using Link Sword Skills.\nLLv100: Skill Power is added +100%.\nLLv250: Wind element damage +20%\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Golden Treasure] Philia\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nWind Slip\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n68\nBreak Gauge\n32\nSkill Effect\n2300% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Motion Range]/[Wind Pile/Buff] Wind element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Wind Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Wind element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n*More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Burn/Status Ailments] It will Burn (Stack 18) at a specific rate for 30 sec./[Frostbite/Status Ailments] It will Frostbite (Stack 18) at specific rate for 30 sec./[Bleed/Status Ailments] It will Bleed (Stack 18) at specific rate for 30 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect 30 sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n\"[Golden Treasure] Philia\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nMarch 31, 2026 (Tue) 0:00 - April 9, 2026 (Thu) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1,250 Arcana Gems (50% Off)\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nOne ★4 \"Philia\" guaranteed!\nOn every Step, all ★4 Skill Records are \"Philia\"!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nThere is no voice production when ★4 \"Philia\" Skill Records are drawn.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
