    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Chain Step-Up Order\" is here! One ★4 Chain Skill is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2026-03-04 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nAll ★4 Skill Records are \"Chain Skills\"!\nThe \"\nChain Step-Up Order\n\" is here!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nAdditionally, on Step 3, one\n★4 Chain Skill is guaranteed!\nMore Chain Skill Details Here\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Piercing Gleam] Sinon\nSkill Name\nFive Sharp Weapons/Risk Taker\nAttack\n52\nDefense\n46\nHP\n2500\nSkill Effect\n[Five Sharp Weapons 3] Attack +800 when attacking with thrust element./[Risk Taker 4] Adds a buff (Risk Taker 4) when using the Switch, The lower your own HP, attack increases (Stack 5) for 20 sec. (Invalid when equipped by Partner)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nExtra effect time 7.5 sec.\nFor each 1 equipped in the same set, switch damage during the chain state increases, and the effect time is extended.\n・Effect during Chain\nDamage done to enemies weak to thrusting +15%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Visionary Arcana] Yuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nWind Roll\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n96\nBreak Gauge\n42\nSkill Effect\n2360% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Wind Pile/Buff] Wind element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Wind Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Wind element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n*More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nWind damage +50% when using wind skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise wind damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Turning Point of Destiny] Yuuki\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nWind Whirlpool\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n132\nBreak Gauge\n43\nSkill Effect\n2250% damage (6x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Wind Pile/Buff] Wind element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Wind Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Wind element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n*More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nWind damage +50% when using wind skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise wind damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Duration\nAfter the March 4, 2026 (Wed) maintenance - March 13, 2026 (Fri) 16:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\nAll ★4 Skill Records are Chain Skill!\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nAll ★4 Skill Records are Chain Skill!\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nAll ★4 Skill Records are Chain Skill!\nOne ★4 Chain Skill guaranteed!!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
