    "snippet": "¡El 11 de febrero es el cumpleaños de Sachi! ¡Estamos realizando varias campañas en Sword Art Online Integral Factor para celebrar el cumpleaños de Sachi! ¡Celebremos todos juntos este maravilloso día!  Para más detalles, consulta los anuncios de cada evento y Pedido. Además, tenga en cuenta que los períodos de los eventos son diferentes...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nFebruary 11 is Sachi's birthday! Tons of events and Orders! You've gotta check out this announcement!\nEVENT\n2026-02-11 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nFebruary 11 is Sachi's birthday!\nWe're holding various campaigns in Sword Art Online Integral Factor to celebrate Sachi's birthday!\nLet's all celebrate this wonderful day together!\nFor more details, check the announcements for each event and Order.\nAlso, please note that event periods are different for each.\nRaising Assisting Character Campaign for Sachi\nWe're holding a campaign where you can get a Sachi chat stamp, the \"Special Gift for Sachi,\" which increases your Friendship with Sachi, and more!\nPeriod\nFebruary 6, 2026 (Fri) 4:00 - February 13, 2026 (Fri) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nSachi's Birthday Order\nAll ★4 Skill Records are Sachi!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\nSachi's Birthday Order is here!\nDuration\nFebruary 11, 2026 (Wed) 0:00 - February 20, 2026 (Fri) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nBirthday Panels\nPanels featuring illustrations of Sachi have been placed in four in-game locations!\nTry taking a screenshot together with them if you come across one!\nPlacement Period\nFebruary 11, 2026 (Wed) 0:00 - February 20, 2026 (Fri) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nArcana Gem Gift\nLog in on the day of Sachi's birthday to get a gift of 250 Arcana Gems!\nTime Limit\nAvailable until February 11, 2026 (Wed) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nImportant\n・The schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
