    "snippet": "Para celebrar el cumpleaños de Sachi, ¡los nuevos registros de habilidades ★4 \"[Búsqueda del conocimiento] Sachi (habilidad de enlace)\" y \"[Song of the Frozen Spear] Sachi (habilidad de ráfaga completa)\" ya están disponibles! ¡\"El pedido de cumpleaños de Sachi\" ya está aquí! ¡Obtén un Sachi ★4 garantizado en el Paso 3!  En el Paso 1, puede obtener 11 pedidos por 1250 Arcanos G...",
    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Sachi's Birthday Order\" is here! Featuring new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3! All ★4 Skill Records are Sachi!\nShop\n2026-02-11 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Sachi's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Pursuit of Knowledge] Sachi\n(Link Skill)\" and \"\n[Song of the Frozen Spear] Sachi\n(Full Burst Skill)\" are now available!\n\"\nSachi's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Sachi guaranteed on Step 3!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\nOn Step 3, one ★4 \"Sachi\" is guaranteed!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Pursuit of Knowledge] Sachi\nSkill Name\nKing of Spears/Wind Accumulation\nAttack\n59\nDefense\n36\nHP\n2350\nSkill Effect\n[King of Spears 3] Attack +1000 when using 2H Spear./[Wind Accumulation 3] Wind element's damage rises by the number of Sachi Skill Records in the same set x 10%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nLink Skill\nEffect duration is extended.\nThe higher the Limit Break level, the more Link Level increases when attacking with Link Sword Skills.\nWhen Activated: Attack +500 when using Link Sword Skills.\nLLv100: Skill Power is added +100%.\nLLv250: Wind element damage +20%\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Song of the Frozen Spear] Sachi\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nTerrible Wind Burst\nSkill Name\nTerrible Wind\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nThrust/\nWind\nElement\nThrust/\nWind\nActivation Requirements\nWind\n→\nWind\n→Thrust→(\nWind\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSwitch Gauge\n80\nSwitch Gauge\n80\nBreak Gauge\n39\nBreak Gauge\n78\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n2460% damage (8x hit/All Foes)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Wind Element Weak 4/Debuff] Wind element damage to monster +25% for 10 sec./[Wind Force 4/Buff] Wind element damage +15% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n6000% damage (8x hit/All Foes)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Gale Demon 5/Buff] Wind element damage +65% for 8 sec./[Bonus] Attack +2000 against enemies with debuff status./[Bonus] When equipping 3 or more of Sachi's Skill Records in the same set, Damage done to enemies weak to thrusting +100%.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n\"[Song of the Frozen Spear] Sachi\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nFebruary 11, 2026 (Wed) 0:00 - February 20, 2026 (Fri) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1,250 Arcana Gems (50% Off)\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nOne ★4 \"Sachi\" guaranteed!\nOn every Step, all ★4 Skill Records are \"Sachi\"!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
