    "full_details": "Notices\nThe scenario event \"Female Swordsman, Female Knight, and a Chocolate\" is back! Get ★4 Yuuki and Asuna Skill Records!\nEVENT\n2026-02-04 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe Scenario Event \"Female Swordsman, Female Knight, and a Chocolate\" is back!\nWhat is \"Female Swordsman, Female Knight, and a Chocolate\"?\nA NPC who looks like \"Kirito\"(?)\nappeared in the town all of a sudden and started demanding things...!?\nRewards\nCollect tradable \"Valentine Card\" from dungeon monsters and rewards!\nTrade the \"Valentine Card\" for exclusive Memory Stamps, or\n★4 \"Asuna\"\nand\n\"Yuuki\"\nSkill Records!\nThe limited-edition recovery item \"Friendship Chocolate\" drops on \"DANGER\" and \"Special\" dungeon difficulties.\nGet up to 500\n\"Arcana Gems\"\nfrom the entire event.\nFor this returning event, acquisition status of Total Score Rewards, Challenge Rewards and Trader Rewards from last time will be reset, allowing players to acquire these rewards once more.\nSkill Record\n★4[Chef in Love] Asuna\nSkill Name\nPrecise Attack\nAttack\n39\nDefense\n40\nHP\n800\nSkill Effect\n[Precise Attack 4] Critical rate +15%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Sweet Affection] Yuuki\nSkill Name\nWeakness Attack\nAttack\n41\nDefense\n38\nHP\n750\nSkill Effect\n[Weakness Attack 4] Critical damage +15%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n* [Chef in Love] Asuna and [Sweet Affection] Yuuki start with a max level of 30! Max Limit Break them and reach level 100!\nChat Stamps\nStamp Name\nStamp Displayed\nItems for Acquisition\nMaking Chocolate\nMemory Stamp 60\nGift of Rose\nMemory Stamp 61\nGift of Blue Rose\nMemory Stamp 62\nGift of Fragrant Olive\nMemory Stamp 63\nLimited-Edition Recovery Item\nIcon\nItem Name\nEffect\nFriendship Chocolate\nRecover 500 HP of the party members who are in the same field\nHow to Participate\nOpen the List of Events from the Menu in the upper left corner of the screen, and tap the \"Female Swordsman, Female Knight, and a Chocolate\" banner to go to the \"Valentine Town\" event map.\nTalk to \"Mr. Kirito\" in the \"Valentine Town\" event map to accept the scenario quest.\nThere are 4 scenario quests. Clear them all to unlock the dungeon.\nEvent Period\nStarts after the February 4, 2026 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the March 4, 2026 (Wed) maintenance.\nTrader Period\nStarts after the February 4, 2026 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the March 11, 2026 (Wed) maintenance.\nHigh difficulty\n\"Special\"\nItem use inside the\n\"Special\"\ndifficulty dungeon is restricted, and \"Revive Crystals\" can only be used up to 3 times.\nYou can complete the\n\"Special\"\ndifficulty dungeon is 3 times per day.\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete the 1F Main Quest\nBoss Monster\nPinky Choco Glutton\nDetails\nIt uses long vine or bite attacks.\nWeakness\nSlash Element\nFire Element\nChocolatier Heart Seeker\nDetails\nAppears on \"Special\" difficulty.\r\nIt attacks by charging, performing a body press, or using large cacao beans as weapons.\nWeakness\nThrust Element\nFire Element\nTrade \"Valentine Card\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\n★4[Chef in Love] Asuna\n400\n1\n★4[Chef in Love] Asuna\n500\n4\n★4[Sweet Affection] Yuuki\n400\n1\n★4[Sweet Affection] Yuuki\n500\n4\nMemory Stamp 60\n100\n1\nMemory Stamp 61\n100\n1\nMemory Stamp 62\n100\n1\nMemory Stamp 63\n100\n1\nFriendship Chocolate\n30\n50\nScore Rewards\nEntry\nInterior\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n400\nValentine Card\n5\n500\nValentine Card\n10\n800\nHealing Potion\n5\n1000\nHealing Potion\n10\n1200\nRecord Frame M\n10\n1500\nRecord Frame M\n15\n1600\nValentine Card\n10\n2000\nValentine Card\n15\n2000\nHealing Potion\n10\n3000\nCleansing Potion\n10\n2500\nFriendship Chocolate\n5\n4000\nFriendship Chocolate\n10\n3000\nValentine Card\n20\n6000\nValentine Card\n35\n3500\nRecord Frame M\n20\n8000\nRecord Frame L\n25\n4000\nArcana Gem\n50\n10000\nArcana Gem\n50\n5000\nValentine Card\n40\n12000\nValentine Card\n60\nDepth\nDANGER\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n800\nValentine Card\n15\n900\nValentine Card\n20\n1600\nRestorative Potion\n5\n1800\nRestorative Potion\n10\n2400\nRecord Frame L\n10\n2700\nRecord Frame L\n15\n3200\nValentine Card\n20\n3600\nValentine Card\n30\n4000\nRestorative Potion\n10\n6100\nRelease Crystal (S)\n5\n6500\nEmergency Crystal\n10\n8600\nEmergency Crystal\n15\n9000\nRelease Crystal (S)\n3\n11100\nRecord Frame L\n30\n11500\nRecord Frame L\n20\n14000\nValentine Card\n50\n14000\nArcana Gem\n50\n17000\nArcana Gem\n50\n17000\nRelease Crystal (S)\n5\n20000\nRelease Crystal (S)\n10\nSpecial\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n3000\nMemoria Niter S\n5\n4500\nRelease Crystal (S)\n10\n6000\nSmall Gift\n1\n7500\nRelease Crystal (S)\n20\n9000\nMemoria Niter S\n10\n10500\nRelease Crystal (M)\n20\n12000\nMemoria Niter M\n10\nImportant\nPlease check all Rewards in the game.\nIf the ★4 Skill Records you acquire as rewards for this event have already reached their Limit Break max, they will be exchanged for \"Memoria Niter L\".\nIf you receive a stamp you already own, it will not have any effect when used.\n\"Valentine Card\" will be deleted on March 11, 2026 (Wed) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nAfter you clear a \"Special\" difficulty dungeon 3 times, you can't play it again until the limit resets at 4:00 (JST/UTC+9).\nScenario quests cannot be attempted with an Assist Party.\nThis event does not support Story Replay.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
