    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Memoirs of a Sugary Bond Order\" is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2026-02-01 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nA sweet gift to express yourself! Yuuki, Leafa, Koharu, and Yuna are here as new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nMemoirs of a Sugary Bond Order\n\" is here! Get one new ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\nThe 6% total drop rate does not include the guaranteed ★4 Skill Record, and new ★4 Skill Records are featured Skill Records with high drop rates!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Chocolate Made Together] Yuuki\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nWind Heart V Square\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n104\nBreak Gauge\n40\nSkill Effect\n2250% damage (4x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Wind Pile/Buff] Wind element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Wind Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Wind element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n*More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nWind damage +50% when using wind skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise wind damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Love's Hidden Flavor] Leafa\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nHot Heart Ravage Burst\nSkill Name\nHot Heart Ravage\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nBlunt/\nFire\nElement\nBlunt/\nFire\nActivation Requirements\nFire\n→\nFire\n→Blunt→(\nFire\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n58\nSwitch Gauge\n58\nBreak Gauge\n54\nBreak Gauge\n108\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n2100% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Enhance Attack 4/Buff] Attack +15% for 20 sec./[Fire Element Enhance4/Buff] Fire element damage +9% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n5800% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Bonus] When enemy's HP is 50% or up, attack will increase 250%./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Agil's Skill Records in the same set, Damage done to enemies weak to blunt +100%./[Bonus] Fire element damage increases x 0.5% the number of burn stacks when the player is inflicted with the burn status ailment.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[Innocent Valentine] Koharu\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nShining Heart Riposte\nSP Cost\n18\nElement\nThrust/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n33\nBreak Gauge\n33\nSkill Effect\n2500% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Shine Force 4/Buff] Holy element damage +15% for 15 sec./[Enhance Thrust 2/Buff] Damage done to enemies weak to thrust +20% for 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nLink Skill\nLink Level increases by attacking during Link State.\nSkill Power increases by Link Level x 4%.\n*Counts as a Link Skill only when using a compatible weapon type.\nWhen Activated: Holy element damage +50%.\nLLv100: While debuff to raise your own damage taken is effective, attack power will increase 100%.\nLLv250: Damage done to enemies weak to thrusting +50%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Serenade of Gratitude] Yuna\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Shine Conversion/Protection Detail\nAttack\n55\nDefense\n38\nHP\n2575\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 3] Attack +800./[Shine Conversion 5] Dark element's damage to enemies -15% and holy element's damage to enemies +30%./[Protection Detail 5] When equipping 1 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +25%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nLink Skill\nEffect duration is extended.\nThe higher the Limit Break level, the more Link Level increases when attacking with Link Sword Skills.\nWhen Activated: Attack +500 when using Link Sword Skills.\nLLv100: Skill Power is added +100%.\nLLv250: Holy element damage +20%\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Duration\nFebruary 1, 2026 (Sun) 0:00 - February 28, 2026 (Sat) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
