    "full_details": "Notices\n[That Time I Got Reincarnated as a Slime] Collab Happy Dungeon is here! Get up to 1,000 Arcana Gems or limited-edition collab Skill Records!\nEVENT\n2026-01-15 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe solo event \"\nTenSura Collab Happy Dungeon\n\" is here! Attempt the dungeon with the That Time I Got Reincarnated as a Slime characters and Koharu!\nThe dungeon has three maps. You can fight alongside Shion and Diablo on map one, alongside Benimaru and Shuna on map two, and alongside Rimuru and Milim on map three.\nRewards\nClear the dungeon to get up to 1,000\nArcana Gems\nand 2 Skill Record\n★4 [A Slime Here Too] Rimuru\n!\nPeriod\nAfter the January 15, 2026 (Thu) maintenance - January 30, 2026 (Fri) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete Main quest [The Indomitable Fang]\nHow to Participate\nTalk to \"Kirito\" at the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to challenge.\nScore Rewards\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n100\n★4[A Slime Here Too] Rimuru\n1\n200\nArcana Gems\n100\n300\nArcana Gems\n50\n400\nArcana Gems\n50\n500\nArcana Gems\n100\n600\nArcana Gems\n50\n700\n★4[A Slime Here Too] Rimuru\n1\n800\nArcana Gems\n50\n900\nArcana Gems\n100\n1000\nArcana Gems\n50\n1100\nArcana Gems\n50\n1200\nArcana Gems\n100\n1300\nArcana Gems\n50\n1400\nArcana Gems\n50\nChallenge Rewards\nChallenge Name\nReward\nAmount\nDefeat all enemies(Able to achieve repeatedly)\nHi-potion\n20\nCompleted without any tumble\nArcana Gem\n100\nCompleted within 3 minutes\nArcana Gem\n100\nImportant\nCleared dungeons will be reset the following day at 4:00am (JST/UTC+9) and can be re-attempted after that.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
