    "snippet": "Aviso para aquellos usuarios que inician sesión en Sword Art Online Integral Factor.  El mantenimiento estará vigente durante las fechas siguientes.  - Fechas de mantenimiento programadas 1/8, 2026 11:00 a 12:00 (JST/UTC+9) * Puede haber cambios con la fecha.  - Contenido de mantenimiento Se solucionó el problema por el cual “[A Slime Here Too] R...",
    "full_details": "Notices\n[Edited]Notice for maintenance completed(1/8)\nMAINT.\n2026-01-08 10:10:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nMaintenance we have implemented from 1/8, 2026 11:00, was completed on 1/8, 2026 11:50(JST/UTC+9).\n- Maintenance Contents\nFixed the issue where “[A Slime Here Too] Rimuru” could not be equipped to a ring\nCorrected the Skill Record obtainable from the “That Time I Got Teleported to SAO” event Total Score Reward to “[A Slime Here Too] Rimuru”\nPlayers who obtained incorrect rewards before the fix have been distributed “[A Slime Here Too] Rimuru” in the amount equal to the number obtained.\n- Apology for Issues & Maintenance Compensation Details\n50 Arcana Gems\n- Pick up period\n1/15, 2026 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nOnce again, we apologize for any inconvenience and trouble that this issue has caused.\nWe hope that you continue to enjoy Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\n--------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\n- Scheduled maintenance dates\n1/8, 2026 11:00 to 12:00 (JST/UTC+9)\n* There may be changes with the date.\n- Maintenance Contents\nFixed the issue where “[A Slime Here Too] Rimuru” could not be equipped to a ring\nCorrected the Skill Record obtainable from the “That Time I Got Teleported to SAO” event Total Score Reward to “[A Slime Here Too] Rimuru”\nPlease note that the game can not be played during maintenance.\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\nGo to Notice List"
