    "full_details": "Notices\n[That Time I Got Reincarnated as a Slime] Collab Order Vol. 1 is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2026-01-07 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nKirito, Silica, Koharu, and Argo are dressed in\nThat Time I Got Reincarnated as a Slime\ncharacter outfits in these new ★4 Skill Records!\n\"\nThat Time I Got Reincarnated as a Slime Collab Order VOL. 1\n\" is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nThe 6% total drop rate does not include the guaranteed ★4 Skill Record, and new ★4 Skill Records are featured Skill Records with high drop rates!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Black Storm Dragon] Kirito\nSkill Name\nPlay it by Ear/Engrave\nAttack\n59\nDefense\n38\nHP\n2650\nSkill Effect\n[Play it by Ear 5] Attack +25% when HP is above 50%, and defense +15% when HP is under 50%./[Engrave] When equipping 3 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set and hitting with switch, adds debuff (Mark).(Invalid when equipped by Partner)The next attack the enemy receives will induce double damage.(Applies to other party member's attacks. Effect will disappear after 10 sec if not activated.)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Little Destroyer] Silica\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nDrago Buster\nSkill Name\nDrago Buster\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nActivation Requirements\nFire\n→\nFire\n→Slash→(\nFire\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSwitch Gauge\n96\nSwitch Gauge\n96\nBreak Gauge\n63\nBreak Gauge\n126\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n1990% damage (6x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Analyze 4/Debuff] Chance to raise critical damage against enemies by 20% for 15 sec./[Burn/Status Ailments] Make it burn (Stack 1) for 30 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n5500% damage (6x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Bonus] Attack +1000 against enemies with the blunt element./[Bonus] Critical rate +500% when equipping 3 or more of Silica's Skill Records in the same set./[Bonus] When equipping 7 or more of Silica's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +400%.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[Guiding Hand] Koharu\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nInferno Rush\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n100\nBreak Gauge\n36\nSkill Effect\n2550% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Flame Pile/Buff] Fire element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Flame Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Fire element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nFire damage +50% when using fire skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise fire damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[First Informant] Argo\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nDemon's Dive\nSP Cost\n18\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n57\nBreak Gauge\n57\nSkill Effect\n2820% damage (All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Dark Element Weak 4/Debuff] Dark element damage to enemies +25% for 10 sec./[Enhance Thrust 2/Buff] Damage done to enemies weak to thrust +20% for 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nLink Skill\nLink Level increases by attacking during Link State.\nSkill Power increases by Link Level x 4%.\n*Counts as a Link Skill only when using a compatible weapon type.\nWhen Activated: Dark element damage +50%.\nLLv100：Attack +100% against debuffed enemies.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n\"[Guiding Hand] Koharu\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nAfter the January 7, 2026 (Wed) maintenance - January 30, 2026 (Fri) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
