    "full_details": "Notices\n[That Time I Got Reincarnated as a Slime] Collab Avatar Order is here! One new ★4 Avatar added!\nShop\n2026-01-07 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nCostumes of Rimuru, Benimaru, Shuna, Shion, Milim, and Diablo of\nThat Time I Got Reincarnated as a Slime\nadded as Avatars!\nGet one new ★4 avatar guaranteed\nin the \"\nThat Time I Got Reincarnated as a Slime Collab Avatar Order\n\" on now!\n【New avatar】\nItem Icon\nItem Name\nType\n★4\nRimuru's Clothes\nFull Body Avatar/Male Only\n★4\nBenimaru's Clothes\nFull Body Avatar/Male Only\n★4\nShuna's Clothes\nFull Body Avatar/Female Only\n★4\nShion's Clothes\nFull Body Avatar/Female Only\n★4\nMilim's Clothes\nFull Body Avatar/Female Only\n★4\nDiablo's Clothes\nFull Body Avatar/Male Only\nRimuru Hat\nAccessory Avatar\nBenimaru's Horns\nAccessory Avatar\nShuna's Horns\nAccessory Avatar\nShion's Horns\nAccessory Avatar\nDiablo's Gloves\nAccessory Avatar\nBenimaru's Sword\nWeapon Avatar\nShion's Sword\nWeapon Avatar\n- Duration\nAfter the January 7, 2026 (Wed) maintenance - January 30, 2026 (Fri) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Offers\n11 Orders for 2,000 Arcana Gems\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nWeapon avatars will only display when they match with the weapon type you have equipped.\nSome of the avatars available in this Order have equip conditions that depend on the equipped character's gender.\nAll avatars, both female and male, are available in the Order regardless of your own character's gender.\nKoharu can also equip female avatars and accessories.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
