    "news_url": "https://saoif.nayu.fun/shop_information/detail/4868.html",
    "news_date": 1765353600,
    "news_category": "Shop",
    "snippet": "¡Koharu, Kirito, Asuna y Yuna disfrutan de un momento conmovedor en la ciudad bajo el centelleante cielo invernal como nuevos récords de habilidades ★4! ¡El \"Orden de Navidad con Corazón\" ya está aquí! ¡Obtén un nuevo récord de habilidad ★4 garantizado en el paso 5! La tasa de caída total del 6 % no incluye el récord de habilidad ★4 garantizado ni el nuevo ★4 S...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Heartful Christmas Order\" is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2025-12-10 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nKoharu, Kirito, Asuna, and Yuna enjoy a heartwarming time in the town under the twinkling winter sky as new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nHeartful Christmas Order\n\" is here! Get one new ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\nThe 6% total drop rate does not include the guaranteed ★4 Skill Record, and new ★4 Skill Records are featured Skill Records with high drop rates!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Warmth on a Snowy Night] Koharu\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nBrick Fan\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n96\nBreak Gauge\n44\nSkill Effect\n2790% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Motion Range]/[Earth Pile/Buff] Earth element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Earth Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Earth element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nEarth damage +50% when using earth skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise earth damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Escort of the Shining Town] Kirito\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nSharpened Snow\nSP Cost\n18\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n45\nBreak Gauge\n36\nSkill Effect\n2800% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Enhance Attack 4/Buff] Attack +15% for 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nLink Skill\nLink Level increases by attacking during Link State.\nSkill Power increases by Link Level x 4%.\n*Counts as a Link Skill only when using a compatible weapon type.\nWhen Activated: Water element damage +50%.\nLLv100：Your own attack increases by defense x 1.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[An Xmas Full of Joy] Asuna\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nNight Burdock Burst\nSkill Name\nNight Burdock\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nActivation Requirements\nDark\n→\nDark\n→Thrust→(\nDark\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSwitch Gauge\n38\nSwitch Gauge\n38\nBreak Gauge\n35\nBreak Gauge\n70\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n2400% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Dark Element Enhance4/Buff] Dark element damage +9% for 15 sec./[Weakness Attack 3/Buff] Critical damage +10% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n5800% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Bonus] Attack +2000 against enemies with the slash element./[Bonus] While debuff to raise your own damage taken is effective, attack power will increase 150%./[Bonus] Critical rate +1000%.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[A Sacred Night's Gift] Yuna\nSkill Name\nIron-Fisted Punishment/Prosper\nAttack\n52\nDefense\n36\nHP\n2500\nSkill Effect\n[Iron-Fisted Punishment 4] Attack +500 when attacking with blunt element./[Prosper 4] Attack +20% when HP is above 50%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nLink Skill\nEffect duration is extended.\nThe higher the Limit Break level, the more Link Level increases when attacking with Link Sword Skills.\nWhen Activated: Attack +500 when using Link Sword Skills.\nLLv100: Skill Power  is added +100%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n\"[Warmth on a Snowy Night] Koharu\", \"[Escort of the Shining Town] Kirito\", and \"[An Xmas Full of Joy] Asuna\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nStarts after the December 10, 2025 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the January 7, 2026 (Wed) maintenance.\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
