    "full_details": "Notices\n[Holiday Campaign] Free 11x Every Day! \"Holiday Campaign Free Order\" is on now!\nShop\n2025-12-05 04:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nHoliday Campaign!\nFree 11x Every Day! \"\nHoliday Campaign Free Order\n\" is here! Get up to 253 Skill Records!\nDuring this campaign, players will receive one free 11x Order per day up to 23 times (23 days total).\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Brave Figure in Black] Kirito\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nVorpal Crack\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n86\nBreak Gauge\n48\nSkill Effect\n1650% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Earth Pile/Buff] Earth element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Earth Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Earth element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect 30 sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n★4[Empress of the Abyss] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nWater Brush\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nThrust/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n30\nBreak Gauge\n24\nSkill Effect\n1810% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Parry4/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, the damage you receive decreases at 50%.(Effect will disappear after 20 sec if not activated).\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nAttack +1000 → 3000 → 5000 when using water skills.\nWhen equipping 2 or more of Yuuki's Skill Records in the same set, Water element damage +50% → 100% → 150%.\n★4[Flowery Beast Girl] Koharu\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nExtreme Prism Burst\nSkill Name\nExtreme Prism\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nThrust/\nHoly\nElement\nThrust/\nHoly\nActivation Requirements\nHoly\n→Thrust→\nHoly\n→(\nHoly\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSwitch Gauge\n90\nSwitch Gauge\n90\nBreak Gauge\n38\nBreak Gauge\n76\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n1680% damage (10x hit/All Foes)[Front/Cone/Wide]/[Holy Element Weak 4/Debuff] Holy element damage to monster +25% for 10 sec./▲▲[Bonus] Attack increase effect will be removed from enemy.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4620% damage (10x hit/All Foes)[Front/Cone/Wide]/[Holy Light Demon 5/Buff] Holy element damage +65% for 8 sec./[Bonus] Attack +2000 against enemies with debuff status.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[Return of the Full Moon] Yuuki\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nAqua Spinning Dive\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n55\nBreak Gauge\n74\nSkill Effect\n1330% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Aqua Pile/Buff] Water element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./▲▲[Bonus] Increase status ailment stacks by 8 on enemies when hitting poisoned enemies.\n*Increase in break gauge amount.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nStack Boost\n[When Rush Activates] Raises 10 stacks for all Stack buffs that are on yourself.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n- Period\nDecember 5, 2025 (Fri) 4:00 - March 1, 2026 (Sun) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Important\nThere is no single Order.\nNew days begin at 4:00 am every day (JST/UTC+9).\nIncludes ★2 to ★4 Skill Records.\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nPlease be aware that the period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
