    "snippet": "¡Campaña navideña! ¡Completa las mazmorras diarias dos veces más! ¡La Mazmorra Diaria +2 está en marcha! ¡Despeja la mazmorra hasta tres veces al día!  Las \"mazmorras diarias\" son un tipo especial de mazmorra en solitario que solo puedes completar una vez al día. Hay diez variedades de \"Daily Dungeons\" para elegir, cada una con...",
    "full_details": "Notices\n[Holiday Campaign] \"Daily Dungeon +2\" is here! Clear it up to 3 times a day!\nCampaign\n2025-12-05 04:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nHoliday Campaign!\nClear the Daily Dungeons an additional two times!\nDaily Dungeon +2\nis underway! Clear the dungeon up to three times a day!\n\"Daily Dungeons\" are a special type of solo dungeon that you can only clear once per day. There are ten varieties of \"Daily Dungeons\" to choose from, each with different rewards such as EXP and equipment enhancement items.\nOnce you clear a Daily Dungeon, you can't challenge a new one until the system resets at 4:00 AM (JST/UTC+9).\nEvent Start\nBlackiron Palace\nDaily Dungeon\nEvent Period\nDecember 5, 2025 (Fri) 4:00 - December 12, 2025 (Fri) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete Main quest [The Indomitable Fang]\nList of \"Daily Dungeons\"\nWeapon Proficiency Enhancement Version(Weapon Proficiency items attainable)\nMain Attainable Items:\nMartial Arts Text, Release Crystal (S), Release Crystal (M), Release Crystal (L)\nEXP Version (EXP attainable)\nMain Attainable Items:\nExp Crystal M\nCol Version (Col attainable)\nMain Attainable Items:\nCol\nSkill Enhancement Version(Skill Record enhancement materials attainable)\nMain Attainable Items:\nRecord Frame L\nEquipment Enhancement Version (Equipment enhancement materials attainable)\nMain Attainable Items:\nGlare Dragon Stone\nEquipment Transformation Version (Equipment transformation materials attainable)\nMain Attainable Items:\nSlicing Stone, Piercing Stone, Striking Stone, Blocking Stone, Refining Hammer\nSlicing Stone+, Piercing Stone+, Striking Stone+, Blocking Stone+, Refining Hammer+\nSkill Transform & Awaken Ver./R (Get Skill Record awakening material and Red Jewel transformation material)\nMain Attainable Items:\nAwakening Star, Red Jewel, High Red Jewel, Great Red Jewel\nSkill Transform & Awaken Ver./G (Get Skill Record awakening material and Green Jewel transformation material)\nMain Attainable Items:\nAwakening Star, Green Jewel, High Green Jewel, Great Green Jewel\nSkill Transform & Awaken Ver./Y (Get Skill Record awakening material and Yellow Jewel transformation material)\nMain Attainable Items:\nAwakening Star, Yellow Jewel, High Yellow Jewel, Great Yellow Jewel\nSkill Transform & Awaken Ver./B (Get Skill Record awakening material and Blue Jewel transformation material)\nMain Attainable Items:\nAwakening Star, Blue Jewel, High Blue Jewel, Great Blue Jewel\nImportant\n\"Daily Dungeons\" are updated daily at 4:00am. After this, the previous day's dungeons cannot be attempted.(JST/UTC+9)\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
    "startTime": "2025-12-04T19:00:00+00:00",
    "endTime": "2025-12-11T18:59:00+00:00"
