    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Chaos Evolution Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2025-12-03 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nYuuki and Koharu don Dark Black Series and Nox Integral Series concept costumes in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nChaos Evolution Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3!\nThe 6% total drop rate does not include the guaranteed ★4 Skill Record, and new ★4 Skill Records are featured Skill Records with high drop rates!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Harnessing Chaos] Yuuki\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nAqua V Square Burst\nSkill Name\nAqua V Square\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nActivation Requirements\nWater\n→\nWater\n→Slash→(\nWind\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n52\nSwitch Gauge\n52\nBreak Gauge\n40\nBreak Gauge\n80\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n2400% damage (4x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Enhance Defense 4/Buff] Defense +15% for 15 sec./[Water Element Enhance4/Buff] Water element damage +9% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n5800% damage (4x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Bonus] Your own attack increases by defense x 2./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, Damage done to enemies weak to slashing +100%./[Bonus] Water element damage increases x 0.5% the number of frostbite stacks when the player is inflicted with the frostbite status ailment.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[Severing the Chaos Vortex] Koharu\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nAqua Descent\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n60\nBreak Gauge\n29\nSkill Effect\n2170% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Motion Range]/[Aqua Pile/Buff] Water element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Aqua Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, water element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nWater damage +50% when using water skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise water damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n\"[Harnessing Chaos] Yuuki\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nAfter the December 3, 2025 (Wed) maintenance - December 31, 2025 (Wed) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
