    "news_category": "EVENT",
    "snippet": "¡Vuelve el evento de escenario \"Banquete Gourmet de Noche Santa\"!  El escenario del evento \"Banquete gourmet de la Noche Santa\" Un día, Koharu y tú recibéis una carta de invitación.  En el interior estaba escrito... Recompensas ¡Obtén los sellos de memoria de Argo y Apple Rabbit limitados por eventos, así como también el Cristal de lanzamiento (L)! Intercambia el Mis...",
    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Holy Night Gourmet Banquet\" is back! Get the event-limited Memory Stamp and Release Crystal (L)!\nEVENT\n2025-12-03 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe Scenario Event \"Holy Night Gourmet Banquet\" is back!\nThe Scenario Event \"Holy Night Gourmet Banquet\"\nOne day you and Koharu receive a letter of invitation.\nInside was written...\nRewards\nGet the event-limited Argo and Apple Rabbit Memory Stamps, as well as Release Crystal (L)!\nExchange the Mischievous Shell Candy and Tank Crab Paste you obtain from the event at the exclusive Trader to get items.\n\"Star Fragments\" may drop on certain difficulty levels!\nFor this returning event, acquisition status of Total Score Rewards, Challenge Rewards and Trader Rewards from last time will be reset, allowing players to acquire these rewards once more.\nMemory Stamp\nStamp Name\nStamp Displayed\nSanta Argo\nApple Rabbit Platter\nEvent-limited recovery item\nIcon\nItem Name\nEffect\nApple Rabbit Meat\nA popular delicacy Instantly recover 2000 HP and status ailment.\nTrade \"Mischievous Shell Candy\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nMemory Stamp 188\nUse to obtain the \"Apple Rabbit Platter\" stamp.\n150\n1\nMedal of Combat Arts\n300\n3\nAwakening Star\n20\n30\nRelease Crystal (L)\n300\n2\nRelease Crystal (M)\n100\n5\nGreat Blue Jewel\n40\n4\nGreat Red Jewel\n40\n4\nGreat Green Jewel\n40\n4\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n40\n4\nTrade \"Tank Crab Paste\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nArcana Gems×10\n20\n30\nMedal of Combat Arts\n300\n2\nAwakening Star\n20\n20\nRelease Crystal (L)\n200\n2\nRelease Crystal (M)\n50\n5\nGreat Blue Jewel\n40\n3\nGreat Red Jewel\n40\n3\nGreat Green Jewel\n40\n3\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n40\n3\nTrader\nSee each Trader NPC for more info, or go to Menu > Items > Enhance:Trade > Trade Limited Items and tap the \"Mischievous Shell Candy Tank Crab Paste Trade\" banner.\nTotal Score Reward\nYou'll earn a certain score by clearing the dungeon.\nScores earned in \"Starting Point\", \"Depth\", \"DANGER\" and \"Gaining Ground\", difficulties all count toward the\n\"Total Score Reward\"\n. Your rewards will be based on your score.\nThe score earned in \"Extreme\" difficulty is not added to the \"Total Score Reward\", but you will receive rewards based on your score.\nDungeon\nScore calculation\nMax Score\nStarting Point\nBasic Clear Bonus:74P＋Survival Bonus:1P per surviving player\n80\nDepth\nBasic Clear Bonus:170P＋Survival Bonus:5P per surviving player\n200\nDANGER\nBasic Clear Bonus:420P＋Survival Bonus:10P per surviving player\n480\nGaining Ground\nBasic Clear Bonus:2280P＋Survival Bonus:20P per surviving player\n2400\nExtreme\nBasic Clear Bonus:1000P＋Survival Bonus:20P per surviving player\n1120\nThere will be Total Power restrictions for players who join Gaining Ground and Extreme difficulty Quick Parties.\nGaining Ground: Quick Party participation requirement - Total Power 40,000 or higher\nExtreme: Quick Party participation requirement - Total Power 60,000 or higher\n\"\nGaining Ground\n\"\nYou can get a high score in the \"\nGaining Ground\n\" difficulty bonus dungeon.\nYou can clear the \"\nGaining Ground\n\" one time per day.\nTake it on every day to get more total rewards!\nHigh difficulty \"\nExtreme\n\"\nIn the high-difficulty dungeon \"\nExtreme\n\", item use is restricted and Revive Crystals can only be used once.\nThe high-difficulty dungeon, \"\nExtreme\n\", has a recommended Total Power of 120,000. The boss has weaknesses that are different from those on other difficulty levels.\nSpecial items that can be received from Total Score Rewards\nArcana Gems×600\nMedal of Combat Arts×10\nAwakening Star×25\nGreat Red Jewel×5\nGreat Green Jewel×5\nGreat Yellow Jewel×5\nGreat Blue Jewel×5\nMemoria Niter S×40\nRelease Crystal (M)×10\n\"Extreme\" Score Rewards\nExtreme\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n1000\nGreat Blue Jewel\n1\n2000\nGreat Red Jewel\n1\n3000\nGreat Green Jewel\n1\n4000\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n1\n5000\nGreat Blue Jewel\n2\n6000\nGreat Red Jewel\n2\n7000\nGreat Green Jewel\n2\n8000\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n2\n9000\nMartial Arts Text\n5\n10000\nRecord Frame L\n30\nAchievement Rewards\nComplete the conditions and receive event-limited records and items from achievement rewards.\nRecord\nAchievement Requirements\nAchievement Rewards\nHappy Red Rabbit\nLet's collect a total of 100 Apple Rabbit Meats in the time period\nRevive Crystal×1\nHoly Night Gourmet\nLet's collect a total of 5000 Mischievous Shells in the time period\nRevive Crystal×1\nHunter of Delicacies\nLet's collect a total of 2000 Tank Crab Pastes in the time period\nRevive Crystal×1\nHow to Participate\nTalk to the \"Xmas event 2021\" NPC at the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to start the scenario quest.\nThere are 5 scenario quests. Clear them all to unlock the dungeon.\nEvent Period\nStarts after the December 3, 2025 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the January 7, 2026 (Wed) maintenance.\nTrader Period\nStarts after the December 3, 2025 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the January 15, 2026 (Thu) maintenance.\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete the 1F Main Quest\nBoss Monster\nMelvin the Megalos Tarandus\nDetails\nIts attacks can inflict you with Stun and Frostbite.\nWhen its HP falls below a certain amount, it gains buffs that increase its attack and defense.\nAt the start of battle in dungeons, it gives itself a buff that reduces the damage it takes from players.\nThis buff can be removed by defeating Apple Rabbit.\nWeakness\nThrust Element\nWater Element\nWeakness\n* Only \"Extreme\"difficulty\nSlash Element\nFire Element\nBuffs used\nBuff \"Increase Attack\", \"Increase Defense\" and \"Reduces damage\"\nStatus Ailments used\nStatus ailments \"Stun\" and \"Frostbite\"\nImportant\nPlease check all Rewards in the game.\nIf you receive a stamp you already own, it will not have any effect when used.\nIf you have previously played the \"Holy Night Gourmet Banquet\" event, your progress will continue from the following points.\nAchievements and achievement progress\nEven if you have completed the scenario quest previously, you will be able to accept the request from the beginning and receive rewards.\nOnce you clear the dungeon on \"Gaining Ground\" difficulty, you cannot play again until it resets at 4:00 AM (JST/UTC+9).\nItem use inside the \"Extreme\" difficulty dungeon is restricted, and Revive Crystals can only be used once.\n\"Mischievous Shell Candys\", \"Tank Crab Pastes\" and \"Apple Rabbit Meats\" will be deleted on January 15, 2026 (Thu) at 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nThere are no first or last attack bonuses on any difficulty.\nThis event does not support Story Replay.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
