    "full_details": "Notices\n[Holiday Campaign] ★4 Full Burst Guaranteed Free 11x Order is here!\nShop\n2025-12-03 04:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nHoliday Campaign!\nSeven days straight of free 11x Orders! One ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\nDifferent free Orders will be available daily: Burst, Awakening, MOD, Connect, Accele, Full Burst, and Chain!\nEvent period for various Orders\nOrder\nPeriod\n★4 Burst Guaranteed Free 11x Order\nAfter the November 28, 2025 (Fri) maintenance - November 29, 2025 (Sat) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n★4 Awakening Guaranteed Free 11x Order\nNovember 29, 2025 (Sat) 4:00 - November 30, 2025 (Sun) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n★4 MOD Guaranteed Free 11x Order\nNovember 30, 2025 (Sun) 4:00 - December 1, 2025 (Mon) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n★4 Connect Guaranteed Free 11x Order\nDecember 1, 2025 (Mon) 4:00 - December 2, 2025 (Tue) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n★4 Accele Guaranteed Free 11x Order\nDecember 2, 2025 (Tue) 4:00 - December 3, 2025 (Wed) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n★4 Full Burst Guaranteed Free 11x Order\nDecember 3, 2025 (Wed) 4:00 - December 4, 2025 (Thu) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n★4 Chain Guaranteed Free 11x Order\nDecember 4, 2025 (Thu) 4:00 - December 5, 2025 (Fri) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n* Players can take advantage of these offers once per period.\nIntroducing the\n★4 Full Burst Guaranteed Free 11x Order\n!\n- Period\nDecember 3, 2025 (Wed) 4:00 - December 4, 2025 (Thu) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[The Man at the Lead] Kirito\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nProminence Punishment Burst\nSkill Name\nProminence Punishment\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n32\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nActivation Requirements\nFire\n→Slash→\nFire\n→(\nDark\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n112\nSwitch Gauge\n112\nBreak Gauge\n59\nBreak Gauge\n118\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n1920% damage (8x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Fire Element Enhance4/Buff] Fire element damage +9% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4500% damage (8x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Bonus] Your own attack increases by defense x 2.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP32)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[Man of Fortitude] Agil\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nGaia Fan\nSkill Name\nGaia Fan\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n32\nElement\nBlunt/\nEarth\nElement\nBlunt/\nEarth\nActivation Requirements\nEarth\n→\nEarth\n→Blunt→(\nEarth\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n48\nSwitch Gauge\n48\nBreak Gauge\n44\nBreak Gauge\n88\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n2090% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Motion Range]/[Earth Element Enhance4/Buff] Earth element damage +9% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4960% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Motion Range]/[Bonus] Attack increases in proportion with your remaining HP x 200%.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP32)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[Driving Blow] Lisbeth\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nCrag Blow Burst\nSkill Name\nCrag Blow\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n32\nElement\nBlunt/\nEarth\nElement\nBlunt/\nEarth\nActivation Requirements\nEarth\n→Blunt→\nEarth\n→(\nWind\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n30\nSwitch Gauge\n30\nBreak Gauge\n30\nBreak Gauge\n60\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n1460% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Small Mark/Debuff] The next attack the enemy receives will induce 1.5x damage.(Applies to other party member's attacks. Effect will disappear after 10 sec if not activated.)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4090% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Bonus] Attack +100% against enemies with debuff status (Mark, Small Mark, Death Mark, Thrust Erosion Mark, Slash Destruction Mark).\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP32)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[Two Powers at Work Together] Silica\nSkill Name\nAdvance Trooper/High Battle Healing\nAttack\n56\nDefense\n30\nHP\n2800\nSkill Effect\n[Advance Trooper 5] Attack +500./[High Battle Healing 3] Recovers a max of 1.2% HP per 3 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Ability\nFor each piece of equipment in the same set, the number of activations in additional Full Burst state increases by 1 (1 activation per skill)\nStock Type: Resets remaining time for Full Burst skill activation, and extends duration of Full Burst state (+10 sec per 1 equipment)\nChain Type: Increases burst skill damage used in Full Burst state (+5% per 1 equipment)\n*Burst activated Sword Skills during Full Burst state will activate normally until Full Burst State ends.\n- Important\nThere is no single Order.\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nIncludes ★2 to ★4 Skill Records.\nPlease be aware that the period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
