    "snippet": "Aviso para aquellos usuarios que inicien sesión en \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\". El mantenimiento estará vigente durante las fechas siguientes.  ▼Fechas de mantenimiento programadas 12/11, 2025 13:00 a 17:00 (tentativo) (JST/UTC+9) ▼Eventos nuevos y recientemente implementados \"Guild of Guilds\" Comienza la temporada 65 \"Violet Glider Hunt\" comienza...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(11/12)\nMAINT.\n2025-11-11 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\n▼Scheduled Maintenance dates\n11/12, 2025 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Season 65 begins\n\"Violet Glider Hunt\" begin\n[Aincrad Day] \"Chaos Crystal Increased Drop Rate Campaign\" begin\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to [Aincrad Day] \"LafCof Assault 2025\"\nAdded \"Attack of the Cactus Trio! 2025\" Event rewards\n\"Mother's Rosary\" is back\n\"Ring Production Campaign\" begin\n\"Multiple Rounds: 2x Experience Character Quest Campaign\" begin\n\"Chaos Showdown\" update\nNew Order begins\n▼Ending Soon! Available until the start of the 11/12 Maintenance\n[Aincrad Day] \"VS Heathcliff\"\n[Aincrad Day] \"Ruby Palace Celebration\"\n[Aincrad Day] \"Armament Stone Increased Drop Rate Campaign\"\n\"Labyrinth Strategy Campaign\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
