    "full_details": "Notices\n[10/31 15:00 Update] Regarding the Issue Where Menu Buttons Become Unresponsive After Purchasing an Order\nNOTICES\n2025-10-31 15:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\n[10/31 15:00 Update]\nThis issue was fixed during the emergency maintenance conducted on October 31, 2025.\nWe sincerely apologize for any inconvenience this may have caused and appreciate your understanding.\n---------------\nThis is an announcement for users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\"\nWe have currently confirmed the following issue.\n・After purchasing an Order, closing the Shop may cause the menu buttons to stop responding.\nIf this issue occurs, please log in again to continue playing normally.\nWe apologize for the inconvenience and are currently working on resolving the issue.\nWe will notify you as soon as there are any updates.\nGo to Notice List"
