    "full_details": "Notices\n[Worldwide 7.5 Year Anniversary] \"Worldwide 7.5 Year Anniversary! Up to 220 Free Avatar Orders\" is here!\nShop\n2025-10-21 04:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nSword Art Online Integral Factor's Worldwide 7.5 Year Anniversary!\n\"\nWorldwide 7.5 Year Anniversary! Up to 220 Free Avatar Orders\n\" is here! Get up to 220 Avatars!\nDuring this event, players will receive one free 11x Orders per day for up to 20 days total!\n【Lineup】\n‧Cheer Squad Avatar\n‧Puppet Master Avatar\n‧Cyber Dimension Avatar\n‧Resplendent Avatar\n‧Pirate Avatar\n‧Wonderland Avatar\n‧Fluffy Cat Avatar\n‧New Year Dress Avatar\n‧Priestess and Priest Avatar\n‧Fox Avatar\n‧French Maid/Butler Avatar\n‧Idol Avatar\n‧Knight Avatar\n‧Musketeer Avatar\n‧Assassin Avatar\n‧Samurai Spirit Avatar\n‧Flower Power Avatar\n‧Candy Avatar\n‧Demonic Swordsman Avatar\n- Period\nOctober 21, 2025 (Tue) 4:00 - Before the November 28, 2025 (Fri) maintenance (JST/UTC+9)\n【Avatar Images】\nCheer Squad Avatar\nPuppet Master Avatar\nCyber Dimension Avatar\nResplendent Avatar\nPirate Avatar\nWonderland Avatar\nFluffy Cat Avatar\nNew Year Dress Avatar\nPriestess and Priest Avatar\nFox Avatar\nFrench Maid/Butler Avatar\nIdol Avatar\nKnight Avatar\nMusketeer Avatar\nAssassin Avatar\nSamurai Spirit Avatar\nFlower Power Avatar\nCandy Avatar\nDemonic Swordsman Avatar\n-\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nThere is no single Order.\nSome of the avatars available in this Order have equip conditions that depend on the equipped character's gender.\nAll avatars, both female and male, are available in the Order regardless of your own character's gender.\nKoharu can also equip female avatars and accessories.\nNew days begin at 4:00 am every day (JST/UTC+9).\nIncludes ★2 to ★4 avatars.\nPlease be aware that the period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
