    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Kirito's Birthday Order\" is here! Featuring new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3! All ★4 Skill Records are Kirito!\nShop\n2025-10-07 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Kirito's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Revival Strike] Kirito\n(Full Burst Skill)\" and \"\n[When the Battle Ends] Kirito\n(Full Burst Skill)\" are now available!\n\"\nKirito's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Kirito guaranteed on Step 3!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\nOn Step 3, one ★4 \"Kirito\" is guaranteed!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Revival Strike] Kirito\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nStarburst Stream\nSkill Name\nStarburst Stream\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n35\nElement\nSlash\nElement\nSlash\nActivation Requirements\nHoly\n→\nFire\n→\nWind\n→(Slash)\nSkill Cool Time\n20.0\nSkill Cool Time\n40.0\nSwitch Gauge\n80\nSwitch Gauge\n80\nBreak Gauge\n62\nBreak Gauge\n124\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n2290% damage (16x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Enhance Defense 4/Buff] Defense +15% for 15 sec./[Dyna Pile/Buff] Non-elemental damage +0.5% per stack (Stack 5) for 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n5510% damage (16x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Bonus] Your own attack increases by defense x 2./[Bonus] Non-elemental damage +100%, when equipping no Heathcliff Skill Records in the same set./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Asuna's Skill Records in the same set, Critical rate +500%./[Bonus] When HP is under 25%, Critical damage +100%.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP35)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[When the Battle Ends] Kirito\nSkill Name\nAdvance Trooper/High Battle Healing/Deep Affection\nAttack\n56\nDefense\n36\nHP\n2575\nSkill Effect\n[Advance Trooper 5] Attack +500./[High Battle Healing 4] Recovers a max of 1.5% HP per 3 sec./[Deep Affection 4] Defense rises by 4% x the number of Asuna Skill Records in the same set.Attack rises by 7% x the number of Leafa Skill Records in the same set.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Ability\nFor each piece of equipment in the same set, the number of activations in additional Full Burst state increases by 1 (1 activation per skill)\nStock Type: Resets remaining time for Full Burst skill activation, and extends duration of Full Burst state (+10 sec per 1 equipment)\nChain Type: Increases burst skill damage used in Full Burst state (+5% per 1 equipment)\n*Burst activated Sword Skills during Full Burst state will activate normally until Full Burst State ends.\n\"[Revival Strike] Kirito\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nOctober 7, 2025 (Tue) 0:00 - October 16, 2025 (Thu) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1,250 Arcana Gems (50% Off)\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nOne ★4 \"Kirito\" guaranteed!\nOn every Step, all ★4 Skill Records are \"Kirito\"!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
