    "full_details": "Notices\n[Worldwide 7.5 Year Anniversary] \"Up to 110! Free Search Campaign\" is here!\nShop\n2025-10-01 04:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nSword Art Online Integral Factor's Worldwide 7.5 Year Anniversary!\nGet up to 110 items in the \"\nUp to 110! Free Search Campaign\n\" available now!\nThe\nSearch\nlineup includes items that can unlock MOD Slots, enhance Assisting Characters, and temporarily increase drop rates.\nSearch 11 for free, once a day during the campaign period, up to 10 times (10 days) total!\nMore MOD Skill Details Here\n- Period\nOctober 1, 2025 (Wed) 4:00 - October 11, 2025 (Sat) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nItem Name\nItem Effect\nUnlock MOD III (1H Sword)\nUnlock the 3rd slot for MOD Skills.　For 1H Sword skills.\nUnlock MOD III (1H Rapier)\nUnlock the 3rd slot for MOD Skills.　For 1H Rapier skills.\nUnlock MOD III (2H Spear)\nUnlock the 3rd slot for MOD Skills.　For 2H Spear skills.\nUnlock MOD III (1H Club)\nUnlock the 3rd slot for MOD Skills.　For 1H Club skills.\nUnlock MOD III (2H Axe)\nUnlock the 3rd slot for MOD Skills.　For 2H Axe skills.\nUnlock MOD III (Dagger)\nUnlock the 3rd slot for MOD Skills.　For Dagger skills.\nUnlock MOD III (Bow)\nUnlock the 3rd slot for MOD Skills.　For Bow skills.\nUnlock MOD II SS\nUnlock the 2nd slot for MOD Skills.　For Sword skills.\nGorgeous Present (Kirito)\nGet 180 Friendship EXP towards Kirito.An expensive present item.\nGorgeous Present (Asuna)\nGet 180 Friendship EXP towards Asuna.An expensive present item.\nGorgeous Present (Silica)\nGet 180 Friendship EXP towards Silica.An expensive present item.\nGorgeous Present (Lisbeth)\nGet 180 Friendship EXP towards Lisbeth.An expensive present item.\nGorgeous Present (Sachi)\nGet 180 Friendship EXP towards Sachi.An expensive present item.\nGorgeous Present (Leafa)\nGet 180 Friendship EXP towards Leafa.An expensive present item.\nGorgeous Present (Yuuki)\nGet 180 Friendship EXP towards Yuuki.An expensive present item.\nGorgeous Present (Sinon)\nGet 180 Friendship EXP towards Sinon.An expensive present item.\nGorgeous Present (Alice)\nGet 180 Friendship EXP towards Alice.An expensive present item.\nLife Crystal I\nRecovers party member's HP in the same field by 8000.\nLife Crystal II\nRecovers party member's HP in the same field by 12000.\nLife Crystal III\nRecovers party member's HP in the same field by 20000.\nExp Crystal XL\nA crystal that grants you 10,000,000 EXP.\nRecord Frame LL\nMaterial used toenhance SkillRecords.\nGlare Sacred Stone\nMaterial used toenhance equipment.\nAroma to Increase Luck I\nIncreases the drop rate by x1.5 for 60 min when used.\nAroma to Increase Luck II\nIncreases the drop rate by x2.2 for 60 min when used.\nAroma to Increase Luck III\nIncreases the drop rate by x2.8 for 60 min when used.\nAroma to Increase EXP I\nIncreases the Exp by x2.2 for 60 min when used.\nAroma to Increase EXP II\nTriples the amount of Expacquired for 60 min when used.\nAroma to Increase EXP III\nQuadruples the amount of Expacquired for 60 min when used.\nAroma to Increase Weapon EXP I\nDoubles Proficiency level EXP for 30 min when used.\nAroma to Increase Weapon EXP II\nDoubles Proficiency level EXP for 60 min when used.\nAroma to Increase Weapon EXP III\nDoubles Proficiency level EXP for 90 min when used.\nSpecial Sacred Tree Leaf\nA leaf from the \"Sacred Tree\" of the Elves.\r\nRecovers 3000 HP of players within a 100m radius.\nHigh Sacred Tree Leaf\nA leaf from the \"Sacred Tree\" of the Elves.\r\nRecovers 3000 HP of players within a 50m radius.\nSacred Tree Leaf\nA leaf from the \"Sacred Tree\" of the Elves.\r\nRecovers 3000 HP of players within a 25m radius.\nDragon Water\nInstantly recovers 3000 HP.　Cure status ailments.\nAssisting Character (Enhance Attack)\nIncreases Assisting Character's attack by 200% for 60 sec.\nAssisting Character (Enhance Defense)\nIncreases Assisting Character's defense by 100% for 60 sec.\nAssisting Character (Enhance HP)\nIncreases Assisting Character's max HP by 100% for 60 sec.\nAssisting Character (Precise Attack)\nIncreases Assisting Character's critical rate by 50% for 60 sec.\nAssisting Character (Weakness Attack)\nIncreases Assisting Character's critical damage by 100% for 60 sec.\nAssisting Character (Evasion)\nIncreases Assisting Character's evasion rate by 50% for 60 sec.\nManual to Increase Production I\nIncreases the random bonus rate for equipment and ring production by 20% for 30 min when used.\nManual to Increase Production II\nIncreases the random bonus rate for equipment and ring production by 40% for 30 min when used.\nManual to Increase Production III\nIncreases the random bonus rate for equipment and ring production by 60% for 30 min when used.\nRecovery Potion I\nAdds an effect that gradually recovers 400 HP for 30 sec.\nRecovery Potion II\nAdds an effect that gradually recovers 400 HP for 60 sec.\nRecovery Potion III\nAdds an effect that gradually recovers 600 HP for 60 sec.\n* When items that provide the same amounts of an effect are used together, the effect duration will be extended.\n(Example)\nAroma to Increase Weapon EXP I (Doubles proficiency level EXP for 30 min when used.)\nAroma to Increase Weapon EXP II (Doubles proficiency level EXP for 60 min when used.)\nIf both of the above items are used at the same time, the duration of the doubled proficiency level EXP will be 90 minutes (30 minutes + 60 minutes).\n* Items with differing amounts of an effect will each activate their own effects.\n(Example)\nAroma to Increase Luck I (Increases the drop rate by 50% for 60 min when used.)\nAroma to Increase Luck II (Increases the drop rate by 120% for 60 min when used.)\nIf both of the above items are used at the same time, the drop rate will be increased by 170% of its base value (50% + 120%).\n- Important\nDuring the event period, you can Search 11 once a day for up to 10 days.\nThere is no Search 1.\nNew days begin at 4:00 am every day (JST/UTC+9).\nPlease be aware that the period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
