    "full_details": "Notices\nThe Fragrant Olive Seasonal Selection Order is here! One ★4 Alice Skill Record is guaranteed per 11 Orders!\nShop\n2025-09-25 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nOne ★4 Alice Skill Record carefully selected to be fun in any season is guaranteed per 11 Orders!\nGet ready for the\nFragrant Olive Seasonal Selection Order\n!\n- Duration\nAfter the September 25, 2025 (Thu) maintenance - October 14, 2025 (Tue) 16:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Offers\n1 Order for 250 Arcana Gems\n11 Orders for 2,500 Arcana Gems\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Sweet Heart] Alice\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nHoly Wave\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n84\nBreak Gauge\n43\nSkill Effect\n2250% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Shine Pile/Buff] Holy element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Shine Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, holy element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n*More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nHoly damage +50% when using Holy skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise Holy damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Ring the Sacred Bell] Alice\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nArdent Ripper\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n72\nBreak Gauge\n37\nSkill Effect\n2550% damage (Single Foe)[Center/Arc/Mid]/[Flame Pile/Buff] Fire element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Flame Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Fire element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nFire damage +50% when using fire skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise fire damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Winner's Privilege] Alice\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nAtmos Bump Burst\nSkill Name\nAtmos Bump\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nSlash/\nWind\nElement\nSlash/\nWind\nActivation Requirements\nWind\n→Slash→\nWind\n→(\nEarth\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n56\nSwitch Gauge\n56\nBreak Gauge\n57\nBreak Gauge\n114\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n1520% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Enhance Defense 4/Buff] Defense +15% for 15 sec./[Wind Element Enhance4/Buff] Wind element damage +9% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4260% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Bonus] Your own attack increases by defense x 2./[Bonus] Wind element damage increases x 0.5% the number of bleed stacks when the player is inflicted with the bleed status ailment.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[Court Officer Girl] Alice\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nPhoton Slash\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n42\nBreak Gauge\n35\nSkill Effect\n1380% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using holy skills./[Bonus] When equipping 3 or more of Alice's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[The Way to Happiness] Alice\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Flame Conversion/Incarnation: Force\nAttack\n53\nDefense\n32\nHP\n2575\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 3] Attack +800./[Flame Conversion 4]Water element's damage to enemies -10% and fire element's damage to enemies +25%./[Incarnation: Force 4] When equipping 3 or more of Alice's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +20%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Summer Slash] Alice\nSkill Name\nAdvance Trooper/Aqua Conversion\nAttack\n51\nDefense\n42\nHP\n2350\nSkill Effect\n[Advance Trooper 4] Attack +400./[Aqua Conversion 4] Fire element's damage to enemies -10% and water element's damage to enemies +25%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Important\nCheck the in-game Order details for more information on the entire lineup and the drop rates.\nPlease be aware that the period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
