    "snippet": "Aviso para aquellos usuarios que inicien sesión en \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\". El mantenimiento estará vigente durante las fechas siguientes.  ▼Fechas de mantenimiento programadas 25/9, 2025 13:00 a 17:00 (tentativo)(JST/UTC+9) ▼Eventos nuevos y recientemente implementados El capítulo 2 \"Aincrad 58F\" \"Evento Start Dash 58F\" comienza \"Nacimiento...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(9/25)\nMAINT.\n2025-09-24 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 9/25, 2025, 13:00, was completed on 9/25, 2025, 17:00(JST/UTC+9).\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\nChapter 2 \"Aincrad 58F\"\n\"58F Start Dash Event\" begins\n\"Birthday Battle Rush\" begins\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to [Worldwide 7.5 Year Anniversary] \"Harvest Assault\"\n\"Fragrant Olive Seasonal Selection Order\" begins\n\"Arcana Gem Super Boost Campaign\" begins\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼Official Live Stream Rewards\nWe have sent out rewards for correct answers to the quiz corner on the official livestream on 9/19, 2025.\nArcana Gems×600\nMemoria Niter L×10\nReceive by: Until 10/2, 2025, 23:59(JST/UTC+9)\n▼New Events\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\n▼Scheduled Maintenance dates\n9/25, 2025 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\nChapter 2 \"Aincrad 58F\"\n\"58F Start Dash Event\" begins\n\"Birthday Battle Rush\" begins\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to [Worldwide 7.5 Year Anniversary] \"Harvest Assault\"\nNew Order begins\n▼Ending Soon! Available until the start of the 9/25 Maintenance\n\"Platinum Prince Order\"\n\"Autumn Colors Selection Order\"\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Season 63\n[Worldwide 7.5 Year Anniversary] \"Greedy Kobold Lord Hunt\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
