    "full_details": "Notices\n[Worldwide 7.5 Year Anniversary] \"Grand Order\" is here! ★4 birthday Skill Records are part of this lineup!\nShop\n2025-09-21 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nSword Art Online Integral Factor's Worldwide 7.5 Year Anniversary!\nThe \"\nGrand Order\n\" is here, and ★4 Skill Records are part of this lineup, including birthday Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn all Steps, the\ntotal drop rate for ★4 Skill Records is 8.0%\n!\nAdditionally, on Step 3,\none ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed\n!\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Instant Sword Flash] Yuuki\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nMother's Rosary\nSkill Name\nMother's Rosary\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n35\nElement\nSlash\nElement\nSlash\nActivation Requirements\nDark\n→\nWater\n→\nHoly\n→Slash\nSkill Cool Time\n20.0\nSkill Cool Time\n40.0\nSwitch Gauge\n44\nSwitch Gauge\n44\nBreak Gauge\n56\nBreak Gauge\n112\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n2290% damage (11x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Enhance Defense 4/Buff] Defense +15% for 15 sec./[Dyna Pile/Buff] Non-elemental damage +0.5% per stack (Stack 5) for 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n5510% damage (11x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Bonus] Your own attack increases by defense x 2./[Bonus] Non-elemental damage +100%, when equipping no Kirito Skill Records in the same set./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Asuna's Skill Records in the same set, Critical rate +500%./[Bonus] Critical damage +100% when your own HP is above 75%.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Bonus] Damage done to enemies weak to slashing +50%.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP35)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Relentless Effort] Eugeo\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nResonate Nature Burst\nSkill Name\nResonate Nature\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n35\nElement\nSlash\nElement\nSlash\nActivation Requirements\nEarth\n→Slash→Slash→(\nWater\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n18.0\nSkill Cool Time\n36.0\nSwitch Gauge\n87\nSwitch Gauge\n87\nBreak Gauge\n45\nBreak Gauge\n90\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n2290% damage (3x hit/All Foes)[Center/Arc/Wide]/[Enhance Defense 4/Buff] Defense +15% for 15 sec./[Dyna Pile/Buff] Non-elemental damage +0.5% per stack (Stack 5) for 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n5510% damage (3x hit/All Foes)[Center/Arc/Wide]/[Bonus] Your own attack increases by defense x 2./[Bonus] Non-elemental damage +100%, when equipping 2 or more of Alice's Skill Records in the same set.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP35)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[Warrior's Aura] Agil\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nWind Scrap Burst\nSkill Name\nWind Scrap\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nBlunt/\nWind\nElement\nBlunt/\nWind\nActivation Requirements\nWind\n→\nWind\n→Blunt→(\nWind\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n63\nSwitch Gauge\n63\nBreak Gauge\n51\nBreak Gauge\n102\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n1680% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Enhance Attack 4/Buff] Attack +15% for 20 sec./[Wind Element Enhance4/Buff] Wind element damage +9% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4620% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Bonus] Attack increases in proportion with your remaining HP x 200%./[Bonus] Wind element damage increases x 0.5% the number of bleed stacks when the player is inflicted with the bleed status ailment.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[Angel-Like Partner] Koharu\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nShadow Converge\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n46\nBreak Gauge\n24\nSkill Effect\n2170% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Dark Pile/Buff] Dark element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Dark Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, dark element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nDark damage +50% when using dark skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise Dark element damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Heart-Skipping Moment] Klein\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nShadow Wheel\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n51\nBreak Gauge\n42\nSkill Effect\n2020% damage (3x hit/All Foes)[Center/Arc/Mid]/[Dark Pile/Buff] Dark element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Dark Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, dark element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec./[Slash Destruction Mark/Debuff] For slash element enemies, the next attack the enemy receives will induce 2.5x damage. (Applies to other party member's attacks. Effect will disappear after 10 sec if not activated.)\n*More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect 30 sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n★4[Informant's Insight] Argo\nSkill Name\nCombination/Ace of Daggers\nAttack\n52\nDefense\n36\nHP\n2500\nSkill Effect\n●[Combination 4] Skill's power is added +100% when used in switch./[Ace of Daggers 4] Attack +40% when using daggers.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nPincer Attack\n[During Rush] Damage +15% when using switch.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n- Duration\nSeptember 21, 2025 (Sun) 17:00 - September 30, 2025 (Tue) 16:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems\n8.0% total Drop Rate for ★4 Skill Records!\nSTEP2\n11 Orders for 2,500 Arcana Gems\n8.0% total Drop Rate for ★4 Skill Records!\nSTEP3\n11 Orders for 2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n8.0% total Drop Rate for ★4 Skill Records!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nCertain characters do not have voice effects when obtaining their Skill Records.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
