    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Eydis's Birthday Order\" is here! Featuring new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3! All ★4 Skill Records are Eydis!\nShop\n2025-09-04 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Eydis's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[A Will to Defy Fate] Eydis\n(Chain Skill)\" and \"\n[Butterfly Smile] Eydis\n(Chain Skill)\" are now available!\n\"\nEydis's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Eydis guaranteed on Step 3!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3, one ★4 \"Eydis\" is guaranteed!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[A Will to Defy Fate] Eydis\nSkill Name\nAdvance Trooper/Dark Boost\nAttack\n50\nDefense\n42\nHP\n2425\nSkill Effect\n[Advance Trooper 5] Attack +500./[Dark Boost 4] Elemental damage other than dark dealt to enemies -50%, and dark element's damage to enemies +40%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nExtra effect time 7.5 sec.\nFor each 1 equipped in the same set, switch damage during the chain state increases, and the effect time is extended.\n・Effect during Chain\nDeals +5% Dark element's damage to enemy.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Butterfly Smile] Eydis\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nDark Scar\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n66\nBreak Gauge\n33\nSkill Effect\n2550% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Dark Pile/Buff] Dark element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Dark Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, dark element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nDark damage +50% when using dark skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise Dark element damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n\"[Butterfly Smile] Eydis\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nSeptember 4, 2025 (Thu) 0:00 - September 13, 2025 (Sat) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1,250 Arcana Gems (50% Off)\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nOne ★4 \"Eydis\" guaranteed!\nOn every Step, all ★4 Skill Records are \"Eydis\"!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nThere is no voice production when ★4 \"Eydis\" Skill Records are drawn.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
