    "snippet": "¡Esperamos que estéis todos bien! El calor del verano aún no ha terminado, ¡pero Koharu tiene regalos de bonificación de inicio de sesión para tres días para ti! Obtén 40 Exp Crystal L y un total de 1250 Arcana Gems, ¡lo justo para sacar un cuerpo de esa lentitud veraniega!  Cada Exp Crystal L te otorga 1.000.000 de EXP. Eso significa...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nGet a total of 1,250 Arcana Gems and 40 million EXP! \"Koharu's Balmy Summer Visit Login Bonus\" on now!\nCampaign\n2025-08-29 04:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nWe hope you are all staying cool!\nThe summer heat isn't over yet, but Koharu has three days' worth of login bonus presents for you!\nGet 40 Exp Crystal L and a total of 1,250 Arcana Gems, just thing to snap a body out of that summer sluggishness!\nEach Exp Crystal L gives you 1,000,000 EXP.\nThat means with 40, you can gain a grand total of 40,000,000 EXP!\nNote: This is enough EXP to instantly take a Lv1 character to Lv90.\nAnd make sure to use those Arcana Gems on stuff like the current Order!\nPeriod\nAugust 29, 2025 (Fri) 4:00 - September 5, 2025 (Fri) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nReward Details\nNumber of Days Logged In\nReward\nIcon\nDay1\nExp Crystal L×40\nDay2\nArcana Gems×250\nDay3\nArcana Gems×1000\nImportant\nLogin Bonuses can be claimed after completing the 1F main quest.\nDaily distribution time will be from 4:00 AM to 3:59 AM of the next day. (JST/UTC+9)\nPlease note that the distribution date does not switch when the date changes.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
