    "news_category": "MAINT.",
    "snippet": "Aviso para aquellos usuarios que inicien sesión en \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".  El mantenimiento que hemos implementado desde el 6/8 de 2025 a las 12:00 se completó el 6/8 de 2025 a las 17:00 (JST/UTC+9). Las siguientes son nuevas actualizaciones.  ▼ Comienzan los eventos nuevos y recientemente implementados \"Guild Battle Challenge VS Witch\" \"Carnival Beast Hun...",
    "full_details": "Notices\n[8/7 11:00 (JST/UTC+9) UPDATE] Notice for maintenance(8/6)\nMAINT.\n2025-08-07 11:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 8/6, 2025, 12:00, was completed on 8/6, 2025, 17:00(JST/UTC+9).\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Guild Battle Challenge VS Witch\" begins\n\"Carnival Beast Hunt\" begins\n\"2025 Midsummer Fishing Competition\" begins\n\"Klein's Test of Courage Operation [Returning]\" is back\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to \"Agil Summer Festival 2025\"\nAdded \"Heat the Beach!\" Event rewards\n\"Boss Ingot Increased Drop Rate Campaign\" begins\n\"Chaos Showdown\" update\n▼Added Features & Feature Adjustments\nAdded limited time only emote\nFestival Dance\n\"Limited time only emotes\" are scheduled to be deleted on August 27, 2025 (Wed) at maintenance.\n▼Fixed Issues\nFixed an issue where the list of Passive Skills was not displayed when the device language was set to certain languages used in some countries or regions\nFixed an issue where some cape-style avatars that change colors depending on hair color were not displaying correctly\nFixed the chest movement behavior for each \"Summer Beach Dress Top\"\nFixed the loading process when logging in\nFixed an issue where \"[Ice Sniper] Sinon\"'s \"Pierce 4\" was incorrectly displayed as \"Pierce 3\"\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼New Events\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\n▼Scheduled Maintenance dates\n8/6, 2025 12:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Guild Battle Challenge VS Witch\" begins\n\"Carnival Beast Hunt\" begins\n\"2025 Midsummer Fishing Competition\" begins\n\"Klein's Test of Courage Operation [Returning]\" is back\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to \"Agil Summer Festival 2025\"\nAdded \"Heat the Beach!\" Event rewards\n\"Boss Ingot Increased Drop Rate Campaign\" begins\n\"Chaos Showdown\" update\n▼Ending Soon! Available until the start of the 8/6 Maintenance\n\"Fenrir Attack! 2025\"\n\"Ring Production Campaign\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
