    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Mito's Birthday Order\" is here! Featuring new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3! All ★4 Skill Records are Mito!\nShop\n2025-08-03 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Mito's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Windpiercer] Mito\n(Chain Skill)\" and \"\n[Radiant Chain Strike] Mito\n(Burst Skill)\" are now available!\n\"\nMito's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Mito guaranteed on Step 3!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3, one ★4 \"Mito\" is guaranteed!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Windpiercer] Mito\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nCubic Flame\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n88\nBreak Gauge\n34\nSkill Effect\n2170% damage (4x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Flame Pile/Buff] Fire element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Flame Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Fire element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nFire damage +50% when using fire skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise fire damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Radiant Chain Strike] Mito\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nWind Ravage Burst\nSkill Name\nWind Ravage\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nBlunt/\nWind\nElement\nBlunt/\nWind\nActivation Requirements\nWind\n→Blunt→\nWind\n→\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n58\nSwitch Gauge\n58\nBreak Gauge\n54\nBreak Gauge\n108\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n2170% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Enhance Attack 4/Buff] Attack +15% for 20 sec./[Wind Element Enhance4/Buff] Wind element damage +9% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n6000% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Bonus] Attack increases in proportion with your remaining HP x 200%./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Agil's Skill Records in the same set, Damage done to enemies weak to blunt +100%./[Bonus] Wind element damage increases x 0.5% the number of bleed stacks when the player is inflicted with the bleed status ailment.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Duration\nAugust 3, 2025 (Sun) 0:00 - August 12, 2025 (Tue) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1,250 Arcana Gems (50% Off)\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nOne ★4 \"Mito\" guaranteed!\nOn every Step, all ★4 Skill Records are \"Mito\"!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nThere is no voice production when ★4 \"Mito\" Skill Records are drawn.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
