    "full_details": "Notices\nAgil, Agil, Agil—it's all about Agil! The \"11 Free Once Daily-Agil Guaranteed Order\" is now underway!\nShop\n2025-07-30 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nAnother free, Agil-only Order is here for the summer!\nWe present the \"\n11 Free Once Daily-Agil Guaranteed Order\n\", where you can get 11 draws on the house once per day!\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Tropical] Agil\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nBeach Judgement\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nBlunt/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n25\nBreak Gauge\n33\nSkill Effect\n1240% damage (All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Frostbite/Status Ailments] It will Frostbite (Stack 3) at specific rate for 30 sec./▲[Bonus] Critical damage +20% against enemies with the thrust element.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nMind's Eye\n[During Rush] Critical damage +7.5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Strategy Supporter] Agil\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nRumbling Bless\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nBlunt/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n13.0\nSwitch Gauge\n46\nBreak Gauge\n47\nSkill Effect\n1320% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Enhance Attack 4/Buff] Attack +15% for 20 sec./[Dusk 4/Debuff] Enemy's hit rate -15% for 15 sec.(Evasion more likely to occur)/▲▲[Bonus] When this skill direct hits, reduces all skill's cool times by 2 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nLightning Flash\n[During Rush] Critical rate +20%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Fierce Cannon] Agil\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nField Smite\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nBlunt/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n9.0\nSwitch Gauge\n59\nBreak Gauge\n37\nSkill Effect\n1080% damage (All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Earth Element Weak 4/Debuff] Earth element damage to monster +25% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Period\nStarts after the July 30, 2025 (Wed) maintenance and ends August 8, 2025 (Fri) 16:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Important\nDuring the event, players can try the 11x Orders once a day.\nThere is no single Order.\nNew days begin at 4:00 am every day (JST/UTC+9).\nThe lineup consists entirely of versions of Agil appearing in orders up to 2020.\nIncludes ★2 to ★4 Skill Records.\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nPlease be aware that the period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
