    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Silica's Heapin' 40M EXP Event\" on now!\nEVENT\n2025-07-09 17:30:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nYou can earn tons of EXP in the special quest on now!\nAccept the quest, move to the designated map, and clear it by defeating the monsters to claim your rewards.\nPlus, the difficulty increases as you progress through the quest.\nRewards\nGet a total of 40 million EXP from quest rewards!\nAim to clear all the quests!\nHow to Participate\nTalk to the \"Silica\" in the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to accept the quest.\nEvent Period\nStarts after the July 9, 2025 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the July 24, 2025 (Thu) maintenance.\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete Main quest [The Indomitable Fang]\nQuest Rewards\nRelease Dates\nRelease Quest\nRewards\nAmount\nRelease condition\nStarts after the July 9 Maintenance\nHeapin' 40M EXP Event 1\nEXP\n200,000\nー\nRevive Crystal\n10\nRestorative Potion\n30\nCleansing Potion\n30\nJuly 10 14:00 - (JST/UTC+9)\nHeapin' 40M EXP Event 2\nEXP\n400,000\nClear the 2F Main Quest through the end.\nRevive Crystal\n10\nRestorative Potion\n30\nCleansing Potion\n30\nJuly 11 14:00 - (JST/UTC+9)\nHeapin' 40M EXP Event 3\nEXP\n1,000,000\nClear the 3F Main Quest through the end.\nRevive Crystal\n10\nRestorative Potion\n30\nCleansing Potion\n30\nJuly 12 14:00 - (JST/UTC+9)\nHeapin' 40M EXP Event 4\nEXP\n1,600,000\nClear the 4F Main Quest through the end.\nRevive Crystal\n10\nRestorative Potion\n30\nCleansing Potion\n30\nJuly 13 14:00 - (JST/UTC+9)\nHeapin' 40M EXP Event 5\nEXP\n2,400,000\nClear the 5F Main Quest through the end.\nRevive Crystal\n10\nRestorative Potion\n30\nCleansing Potion\n30\nJuly 14 14:00 - (JST/UTC+9)\nHeapin' 40M EXP Event 6\nEXP\n3,600,000\nClear the 6F Main Quest through the end.\nRevive Crystal\n10\nRestorative Potion\n30\nCleansing Potion\n30\nJuly 15 14:00 - (JST/UTC+9)\nHeapin' 40M EXP Event 7\nEXP\n4,800,000\nClear the 7F Main Quest through the end.\nRevive Crystal\n10\nRestorative Potion\n30\nCleansing Potion\n30\nJuly 16 14:00 - (JST/UTC+9)\nHeapin' 40M EXP Event 8\nEXP\n6,000,000\nClear the 8F Main Quest through the end.\nRevive Crystal\n10\nRestorative Potion\n30\nCleansing Potion\n30\nJuly 17 14:00 - (JST/UTC+9)\nHeapin' 40M EXP Event 9\nEXP\n8,000,000\nClear the 9F Main Quest through the end.\nRevive Crystal\n10\nRestorative Potion\n30\nCleansing Potion\n30\nJuly 18 14:00 - (JST/UTC+9)\nHeapin' 40M EXP Event 10\nEXP\n12,000,000\nClear the 10F Main Quest through the end.\nRevive Crystal\n10\nRestorative Potion\n30\nCleansing Potion\n30\nImportant\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
