    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Celestial Steeds in the Night Sky Order\" is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2025-07-01 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nAsuna, Sinon, Alice, and Lisbeth speed across the night sky on beautiful celestial horses as new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nCelestial Steeds in the Night Sky Order\n\" is here! Get one new ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\nThe 6% total drop rate does not include the guaranteed ★4 Skill Record, and new ★4 Skill Records are featured Skill Records with high drop rates!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Pegasus's Guidance] Asuna\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nWind Burdock Burst\nSkill Name\nWind Burdock\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nThrust/\nWind\nElement\nThrust/\nWind\nActivation Requirements\nWind\n→\nWind\n→Thrust→(\nWind\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSwitch Gauge\n38\nSwitch Gauge\n38\nBreak Gauge\n35\nBreak Gauge\n70\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n2020% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Wind Element Enhance4/Buff] Wind element damage +9% for 15 sec./[Weakness Attack 3/Buff] Critical damage +10% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n5600% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Bonus] Attack +2000 against enemies with the slash element./[Bonus] While debuff to raise your own damage taken is effective, attack power will increase 150%./[Bonus] Critical rate +1000%.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[Aim set on a Target] Sinon\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nWind Pressure\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n106\nBreak Gauge\n53\nSkill Effect\n2190% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Wind Pile/Buff] Wind element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Wind Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Wind element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n*More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nWind damage +50% when using wind skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise wind damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[A Skyborne Golden Knight] Alice\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nAqua Bite\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n72\nBreak Gauge\n30\nSkill Effect\n2550% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Aqua Pile/Buff] Water element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Aqua Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, water element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nWater damage +50% when using water skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise water damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Tame the Divine Beast] Lisbeth\nSkill Name\nCombination/Veteran Sword Technique/Icy Blade\nAttack\n51\nDefense\n36\nHP\n2575\nSkill Effect\n●[Combination 4] Skill's power is added +100% when used in switch./[Veteran Sword Technique 4] Attack power increase with own level×0.17%. (max 34%)/[Icy Blade 4] Deals +20% Water element's damage to enemy.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n\"[A Skyborne Golden Knight] Alice\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nJuly 1, 2025 (Tue) 0:00 - July 31, 2025 (Thu) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
