    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Scythe-Wielding Beauty Order\" is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2025-06-24 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nSinon, Yuuki, Lisbeth, and Sachi are beauties with giant scythes in hand in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nScythe-Wielding Beauty Order\n\" is here! Get one new ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\nThe 6% total drop rate does not include the guaranteed ★4 Skill Record, and new ★4 Skill Records are featured Skill Records with high drop rates!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Dark Night Visitor] Sinon\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nIce Rain Burst\nSkill Name\nIce Rain\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nThrust/\nWater\nElement\nThrust/\nWater\nActivation Requirements\nWater\n→\nWater\n→Thrust→\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n45\nSwitch Gauge\n45\nBreak Gauge\n38\nBreak Gauge\n76\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n1990% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Target Location/Arc/Mid]/[Water Element Enhance4/Buff] Water element damage +9% for 15 sec./[Enhance Thrust 1/Buff] Damage done to enemies weak to thrust +15% for 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n5500% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Target Location/Arc/Mid]/[Bonus] The lower your own HP, attack increases.(max 200%)/[Bonus] Water element damage increases by number of frostbite stacks x 0.5% when the player is inflicted with the frostbite status ailment.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[The Girl Who Reaps Souls] Yuuki\nSkill Name\nAir Suction/Enhance Clotting/Retribution/Roar of the Gale\nAttack\n61\nDefense\n38\nHP\n2500\nSkill Effect\n[Air Suction 4] When the player is Status Ailments (Bleed), Attack +50%./●[Enhance Clotting 3] Bleed damage -30%./[Retribution 3] Adds Bloodshed effect on yourself for 30 sec when you hit using Switch (Stack 50). 2.2% +(number of stacks x 0.2%) damage and 4.4% +(number of stacks x 0.4%) evasion rate decrease.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Roar of the Gale 4]Deals +15% Wind element's damage to enemy.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nExtra effect time 7.5 sec.\nLimit Break extends Accele Skill effect time.\n*Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Smiling Scythe Wielder] Lisbeth\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nDemolishing Wind\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nBlunt/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSwitch Gauge\n48\nBreak Gauge\n37\nSkill Effect\n1730% damage (4x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[PT Enhance Blunt 4/Buff] Damage done to enemies weak to blunt +30% for your party for 20 sec./[Bolt Breaker 4/Buff (PT)] Break gauge amount +20% for you and your party for 10 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nStack Boost\n[When Rush Activates] Raises 10 stacks for all Stack buffs that are on yourself.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[The All-Reaping Blade] Sachi\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nBurrowing Water\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n112\nBreak Gauge\n33\nSkill Effect\n2110% damage (8x hit/All Foes)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Aqua Pile/Buff] Water element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Frostbite/Status Ailments] When equipping 4 or more of Koharu's Skill Records in the same set, Frostbite (Stack 10) will affect the player for 30 sec./[Aqua Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, water element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Stigma/Debuff] Increases damage taken by enemies for 18 sec (Stack 9) +0.5% for every Stack 1.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect 30 sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n\"[Smiling Scythe Wielder] Lisbeth\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nJune 24, 2025 (Tue) 17:00 - Before the July 24, 2025 (Thu) maintenance (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
