    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Rain's Birthday Order\" is here! Featuring new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3! All ★4 Skill Records are Rain!\nShop\n2025-06-21 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Rain's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Dazzling Summer Night] Rain\n\" and \"\n[Art of Many Swords] Rain\n(Accele Skill)\" are now available!\n\"\nRain's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Rain guaranteed on Step 3!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3, one ★4 \"Rain\" is guaranteed!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Dazzling Summer Night] Rain\nSkill Name\nLoyal Friend/Enhance Slash/Inflict Bleed\nAttack\n56\nDefense\n46\nHP\n2575\nSkill Effect\n[Loyal Friend 2] Attack rises 7% x the number of Sanya Skill Records in the same set./[Enhance Slash 3] Damage done to enemies weak to slashing +15%./[Inflict Bleed] When the target is hit using the Switch, make it Bleed (Stack 5) for 30 sec. (Invalid when equipped by Partner)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Art of Many Swords] Rain\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nShine Whirlpool\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n132\nBreak Gauge\n43\nSkill Effect\n1930% damage (6x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Shine Pile/Buff] Holy element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Debility/Status Ailments] When equipping 4 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, Debility (Stack 10) will affect the player for 30 sec./[Shine Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, holy element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n*More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Jar of Ice 4/Buff] Defense +10 per stack (Stack 9) during 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect 30 sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n- Duration\nJune 21, 2025 (Sat) 0:00 - June 30, 2025 (Mon) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1,250 Arcana Gems (50% Off)\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nOne ★4 \"Rain\" guaranteed!\nOn every Step, all ★4 Skill Records are \"Rain\"!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nThere is no voice production when ★4 \"Rain\" Skill Records are drawn.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
