    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Argo's Birthday Order\" is here! Featuring new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3! All ★4 Skill Records are Argo!\nShop\n2025-06-05 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Argo's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Informant's Insight] Argo\n(Awakening Skill)\" and \"\n[Target Tracker] Argo\n(Full Burst Skill)\" are now available!\n\"\nArgo's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Argo guaranteed on Step 3!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3, one ★4 \"Argo\" is guaranteed!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Informant's Insight] Argo\nSkill Name\nCombination/Ace of Daggers\nAttack\n52\nDefense\n36\nHP\n2500\nSkill Effect\n●[Combination 4] Skill's power is added +100% when used in switch./[Ace of Daggers 4] Attack +40% when using daggers.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nPincer Attack\n[During Rush] Damage +15% when using switch.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Target Tracker] Argo\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nEarth Descent Burst\nSkill Name\nEarth Descent\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nSlash/\nEarth\nElement\nSlash/\nEarth\nActivation Requirements\nEarth\n→\nEarth\n→Slash→(\nEarth\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSwitch Gauge\n30\nSwitch Gauge\n30\nBreak Gauge\n29\nBreak Gauge\n58\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n2350% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Motion Range]/[Weak Slash 4/Debuff] Slash element's weakness damage +25% for 8 sec./[Poison/Status Ailments] IInflict Poison (Stack 1) for 30 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n5700% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Motion Range]/[Bonus] Attack +1500 against enemies with the blunt element./[Bonus] Increases attack against enemies with status ailments (Poison, Burn, Bleed, Frostbite). +1% for every Stack 1./[Bonus] Earth element damage increases x 0.5% the number of poison stacks when the player is inflicted with the poison status ailment.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n\"[Target Tracker] Argo\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nJune 5, 2025 (Thu) 0:00 - June 14, 2025 (Sat) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1,250 Arcana Gems (50% Off)\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nOne ★4 \"Argo\" guaranteed!\nOn every Step, all ★4 Skill Records are \"Argo\"!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
