    "snippet": "Aviso para aquellos usuarios que inicien sesión en \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\". El mantenimiento estará vigente durante las fechas siguientes.  Fechas de mantenimiento programadas 4/6 de 2025 12:00 a 17:00 (tentativo) (JST/UTC+9) ▼Eventos nuevos y recientemente implementados [Campaña navideña] Comienza \"Golden Colossus Hunt 2025\" [Vacaciones...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(6/4)\nMAINT.\n2025-06-04 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 6/4, 2025, 12:00, was completed on 6/4, 2025, 17:00(JST/UTC+9).\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n[Holiday Campaign] \"Golden Colossus Hunt 2025\" begins\n[Holiday Campaign] \"Multiple Rounds: 7x Experience Character Quest Campaign\" begins\n\"[Returning] Bride's dress is with a Smile\" is back\n\"[Returning] Surprise Wedding\" is back\n▼Added Features & Feature Adjustments\nThe Guild Room will be re-themed for a limited time for Holiday Campaign\n▼Fixed Issues\nFixed an issue where the icon under \"History\" for gifts was being displayed as larger than ususal.\nFixed a bug where changing servers caused players to appear in unintended locations and become unable to move.\nFixed an issue where, after transferring leadership of a party, party settings could no longer be adjusted.\nFixed an issue where the Equipment Set list screen did not open properly for some players.\nAs part of this fix, registered equipment set data may have been deleted.\nWe sincerely apologize for the inconvenience and ask that you re-register your sets if necessary.\nFixed an issue where some items in the Exchange Shop could not be exchanged.\nAs a result, the trade period and item deletion date for events originally scheduled to end before maintenance on Wednesday, June 4 have been extended to before maintenance on Wednesday, June 11.\nRelated Events:\n・\nThe 6th Squad Jumble\n・\nMononoke Assault\n・\nUnital King Incredible Foreigner\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼New Events\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n6/4, 2025 12:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n[Holiday Campaign] \"Golden Colossus Hunt 2025\" begins\n[Holiday Campaign] \"Multiple Rounds: 7x Experience Character Quest Campaign\" begins\n\"[Returning] Bride's dress is with a Smile\" is back\n\"[Returning] Surprise Wedding\" is back\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 6/4 Maintenance\n[Holiday Campaign] \"100% Awakening Lv1→2 Success Campaign\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
