    "snippet": "¡Agil, Sinon, Yui y Yuuki observan todas las estrellas en el cielo en estos nuevos Registros de Habilidades ★4! ¡La \"Orden Kaleidotraveler\" ya está aquí! ¡Obtén un récord de habilidad ★4 garantizado en el paso 3! La tasa de caída total del 6% no incluye el Registro de Habilidad ★4 garantizado, y los nuevos Registros de Habilidad ★4 incluyen Registros de Habilidad con...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Kaleidotraveler Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2025-05-27 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nAgil, Sinon, Yui, and Yuuki observe all the stars in the sky in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nKaleidotraveler Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3!\nThe 6% total drop rate does not include the guaranteed ★4 Skill Record, and new ★4 Skill Records are featured Skill Records with high drop rates!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Just You Wait, Stars] Agil\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nWind Waltz\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n90\nBreak Gauge\n51\nSkill Effect\n2490% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Wide]/[Wind Pile/Buff] Wind element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Wind Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Wind element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n*More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nWind damage +50% when using wind skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise wind damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Searching the Stars] Sinon\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nShadow Shell\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n112\nBreak Gauge\n44\nSkill Effect\n2190% damage (4x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Dark Pile/Buff] Dark element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Dark Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, dark element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nDark damage +50% when using dark skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise Dark element damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Map of the Heavens] Yui\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nStorm Asterisk Burst\nSkill Name\nStorm Asterisk\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nBlunt/\nWind\nElement\nBlunt/\nWind\nActivation Requirements\nWind\n→\nWind\n→Blunt→\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n57\nSwitch Gauge\n57\nBreak Gauge\n48\nBreak Gauge\n96\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n2420% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Motion Range]/[Wind Force 5/Buff(PT)] Wind element damage +20% for you and your party for 5 sec./[Small Mark/Debuff] The next attack the enemy receives will induce 1.5x damage.(Applies to other party member's attacks. Effect will disappear after 10 sec if not activated.)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n5900% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Motion Range]/[Bonus] Attack +100% against enemies with debuff status (Mark, Small Mark, Death Mark, Thrust Erosion Mark, Slash Destruction Mark)./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, Damage done to enemies weak to blunt +100%./[Bonus] Wind element damage increases x 0.5% the number of bleed stacks when the player is inflicted with the bleed status ailment.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Seizing the Sky] Yuuki\nSkill Name\nBloody Battle Strike/Wind Conversion\nAttack\n58\nDefense\n36\nHP\n2425\nSkill Effect\n[Bloody Battle Strike 3] Attack +35% when attacking with blunt element./[Wind Conversion 4] Earth element's damage to enemies -10% and wind element's damage to enemies +25%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Ability\nFor each piece of equipment in the same set, the number of activations in additional Full Burst state increases by 1 (1 activation per skill)\nStock Type: Resets remaining time for Full Burst skill activation, and extends duration of Full Burst state (+10 sec per 1 equipment)\nChain Type: Increases burst skill damage used in Full Burst state (+5% per 1 equipment)\n*Burst activated Sword Skills during Full Burst state will activate normally until Full Burst State ends.\n\"[Map of the Heavens] Yui\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nMay 27, 2025 (Tue) 17:00 - June 24, 2025 (Tue) 16:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
