    "news_date": 1747494000,
    "news_category": "Shop",
    "snippet": "Para celebrar el cumpleaños de Lisbeth, ¡los nuevos registros de habilidades ★4 \"[Dazzling in the Mirror] Lisbeth (Chain Skill)\" y \"[Another Happy Day] Lisbeth (Chain Skill)\" ya están disponibles! ¡\"El pedido de cumpleaños de Lisbeth\" ya está aquí! ¡Obtén una Lisbeth de ★4 garantizada en el Paso 3!  En el Paso 1, puedes obtener 11 Órdenes por 1250 Arcanos...",
    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Lisbeth's Birthday Order\" is here! Featuring new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3! All ★4 Skill Records are Lisbeth!\nShop\n2025-05-18 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Lisbeth's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Dazzling in the Mirror] Lisbeth\n(Chain Skill)\" and \"\n[Another Happy Day] Lisbeth\n(Chain Skill)\" are now available!\n\"\nLisbeth's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Lisbeth guaranteed on Step 3!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3, one ★4 \"Lisbeth\" is guaranteed!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Dazzling in the Mirror] Lisbeth\nSkill Name\nIron-Fisted Punishment/Hot-Blooded Spear\nAttack\n53\nDefense\n40\nHP\n2650\nSkill Effect\n[Iron-Fisted Punishment 4] Attack +500 when attacking with blunt element./[Hot-Blooded Spear 4] Adds a buff when you hit using Switch, your own ATK increases for 40 sec.(Stack 10)+0.5% per 1 Stack.(Invalid when equipped by Partner)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nExtra effect time 7.5 sec.\nFor each 1 equipped in the same set, switch damage during the chain state increases, and the effect time is extended.\n・Effect during Chain\nDeals +5% Water element's damage to enemy.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Another Happy Day] Lisbeth\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nAqua Stamp\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n78\nBreak Gauge\n39\nSkill Effect\n2060% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Aqua Pile/Buff] Water element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Aqua Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, water element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nWater damage +50% when using water skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise water damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Duration\nMay 18, 2025 (Sun) 0:00 - May 27, 2025 (Tue) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1,250 Arcana Gems (50% Off)\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nOne ★4 \"Lisbeth\" guaranteed!\nOn every Step, all ★4 Skill Records are \"Lisbeth\"!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
