    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Dragon-Style Heir Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2025-05-08 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nKirito, Asuna, Leafa, and Silica are warriors dressed in dragon scale armor in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nDragon-Style Heir Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3!\nThe 6% total drop rate does not include the guaranteed ★4 Skill Record, and new ★4 Skill Records are featured Skill Records with high drop rates!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Supreme Black Dragon Armor] Kirito\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nShadow Beat\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n110\nBreak Gauge\n48\nSkill Effect\n2550% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Dark Pile/Buff] Dark element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Dark Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, dark element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nDark damage +50% when using dark skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise Dark element damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Charming White Dragon Armor] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nFlame Torrent\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n10.0\nSwitch Gauge\n72\nBreak Gauge\n46\nSkill Effect\n1630% damage (6x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Flame Force 4/Buff] Fire element damage +15% for 15 sec./[Flame Pile/Buff] Fire element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nStack Boost\n[When Rush Activates] Raises 10 stacks for all Stack buffs that are on yourself.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Powerful Green Dragon Armor] Leafa\nSkill Name\nProsper/Engrave\nAttack\n59\nDefense\n36\nHP\n2725\nSkill Effect\n[Prosper 4] Attack +20% when HP is above 50%./[Engrave] When equipping 3 or more of Leafa's Skill Records in the same set and hitting with switch, adds debuff (Mark).(Invalid when equipped by Partner)The next attack the enemy receives will induce double damage.(Applies to other party member's attacks. Effect will disappear after 10 sec if not activated.)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Guarding Red Dragon Armor] Silica\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nHoly Loiter Burst\nSkill Name\nHoly Loiter\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nSlash/\nHoly\nElement\nSlash/\nHoly\nActivation Requirements\nHoly\n→\nHoly\n→Slash→\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSwitch Gauge\n48\nSwitch Gauge\n48\nBreak Gauge\n44\nBreak Gauge\n88\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n2420% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Motion Range]/[Weak Slash 4/Debuff] Slash element's weakness damage +25% for 8 sec./[Bleed/Status Ailments] Inflict Bleed (Stack 1) for 30 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n5900% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Motion Range]/[Bonus] Attack +1500 against enemies with the blunt element./[Bonus] Increases attack against enemies with status ailments (Poison, Burn, Bleed, Frostbite). +1% for every Stack 1./[Bonus] Holy element damage increases x 0.5% the number of Debility stacks when the player is inflicted with the Debility status ailment.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n\"[Supreme Black Dragon Armor] Kirito\", \"[Guarding Red Dragon Armor] Silica\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nAfter the May 8, 2025 (Thu) maintenance - June 8, 2025 (Sun) 16:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
