    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Returning! Alicization Avatar Order\" is on now! One ★4 avatar is guaranteed per 11 Orders!\nShop\n2025-04-30 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nCostumes of original goddess accounts from\nSword Art Online Last Recollection\nfor Silica, Yuuki, and Lisbeth are here as avatars!\nThe rest of the lineup consists of only avatars based on clothes worn by characters seen in the SWORD ART ONLINE –Alicization– War of Underworld anime!\nThe \"\nReturning! Alicization Avatar Order\n\" is here!\nOne ★4 avatar guaranteed per 11 Orders!\nImages of Some Avatars\nAppearing Avatar\nNew Goddess Avatars\nItem Icon\nItem Name\nType\n★4\nArdent Heart\nWeapon Avatar\n★4\nFierce Scourge\nWeapon Avatar\n★4\nThorough Triumph\nWeapon Avatar\n★4\nFire Goddess Robe Set\nFull Body Avatar/Female Only\n★4\nWind Goddess Robe Set\nFull Body Avatar/Female Only\n★4\nSword Goddess Robe Set\nFull Body Avatar/Female Only\nFire Goddess Headband\nAccessory Avatar/Female Only\nFire Goddess Beads\nAccessory Avatar/Female Only\nWind Goddess Hair Ribbons\nAccessory Avatar/Female Only\nWind Goddess Raiment\nAccessory Avatar/Female Only\nSword Goddess Veil\nAccessory Avatar/Female Only\nSword Goddess Head Scarf\nAccessory Avatar/Female Only\nOther Avatars in the Lineup\nItem Icon\nItem Name\nType\n★4\nDancing Blue Rose Sword\nWeapon Avatar\n★4\nDancing Night-Sky Blade\nWeapon Avatar\n★4\nOsmanthus Blade\nWeapon Avatar\n★4\nDancing Osmanthus Blade\nWeapon Avatar\n★4\nRed Rose Sword\nWeapon Avatar\n★4\nDancing Red Rose Sword\nWeapon Avatar\n★4\nVerdurous Anima\nWeapon Avatar\n★4\nRadiant Light\nWeapon Avatar\n★4\nAnnihilation Ray\nWeapon Avatar\n★4\nOtherworldly Black Suit (Male) Top\nTop Avatar/Male Only\n★4\nOtherworldly Black Suit (Female) Top\nTop Avatar/Female Only\n★4\nOtherworldly Blue Suit (Male) Top\nTop Avatar/Male Only\n★4\nOtherworldly Blue Suit (Female) Top\nTop Avatar/Female Only\n★4\nOtherworldly White Robe Set\nFull Body Avatar/Female Only\n★4\nOtherworldly Blue Robe Set\nFull Body Avatar/Female Only\n★4\nOtherworldly Green Robe Set\nFull Body Avatar/Female Only\nCardinal's Staff\nWeapon Avatar\nOtherworldly Black Suit (Male) Bottoms\nBottom Avatar/Male Only\nOtherworldly Black Suit (Female) Bottoms\nBottom Avatar/Female Only\nOtherworldly Blue Suit (Male) Bottoms\nBottom Avatar/Male Only\nOtherworldly Blue Suit (Female) Bottoms\nBottom Avatar/Female Only\nOtherworldly White Head Dress\nAccessory Avatar/Female Only\nOtherworldly Blue Ribbon Feather\nAccessory Avatar/Female Only\nOtherworldly Blue Levitator\nAccessory Avatar/Female Only\nOtherworldly Green Barrette\nAccessory Avatar/Female Only\n- Duration\nStarts after the April 30, 2025 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the May 28, 2025 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\n- Offers\n1 Order for 150 Arcana Gems\n11 Order for 1,500 Arcana Gems\n- Important\nKoharu can also equip female avatars and accessories.\nSome of the avatars available in this Order have equip conditions that depend on the equipped character's gender.\nFaces and hairstyles of characters seen in sample images are not included in the lineup.\nAll avatars, both female and male, are available in the Order regardless of your own character's gender.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
