    "snippet": "¡Celebrando el evento conjunto Unital King! ¡Estamos celebrando un evento conjunto en SWORD ART ONLINE: Integral Factor que va más allá de los límites del juego para celebrar el lanzamiento de la nueva historia corta, \"Unital King\" del autor Reki Kawahara! ¡Estamos celebrando el bono de inicio de sesión del evento conjunto de Unital King! Iniciar sesión...",
    "full_details": "Notices\n[Unital King Joint Event] Eight SAOVS stamps appear in SAOIF! Plus, the Unital King Joint Event Login Bonus, where you can get up to 1,500 Arcana Gems, is here!\nCampaign\n2025-04-24 04:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nCelebrating the Unital King Joint Event!\nWe're holding a joint event in SWORD ART ONLINE: Integral Factor that goes beyond the boundaries of the game to celebrate the release of the new short story, \"Unital King\" by author Reki Kawahara!\nWe're holding the Unital King Joint Event Login Bonus! Log in during this period to get 8 Sword Art Online Variant Showdown stamps and 1,500 Arcana Gems over 10 days!\nPeriod\nApril 24, 2025 (Thu) 4:00 - May 28, 2025 (Wed) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nReward Details\nNumber of Days Logged In\nReward\nIcon\n1日目\nSAOVS Stamp 1\n2日目\nSAOVS Stamp 2\n3日目\nSAOVS Stamp 3\n4日目\nSAOVS Stamp 4\n5日目\nArcana Gems×500\n6日目\nSAOVS Stamp 5\n7日目\nSAOVS Stamp 6\n8日目\nSAOVS Stamp 7\n9日目\nSAOVS Stamp 8\n10日目\nArcana Gems×1000\nImportant\nLogin Bonuses can be claimed after completing the 1F main quest.\nDaily distribution time will be from 4:00 AM to 3:59 AM of the next day. (JST/UTC+9)\nPlease note that the distribution date does not switch when the date changes.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
