    "snippet": "¡Durante esta campaña, obtén el doble de experiencia en submisiones de rondas múltiples! ¡Esta es tu oportunidad de elevar fácilmente tu nivel de jugador!  La duración de la campaña comienza después del mantenimiento del 23 de abril de 2025 (miércoles) y finaliza antes del mantenimiento del 30 de abril de 2025 (miércoles) (JST/UTC+9).  Submisiones Puedes aceptar solicitudes para...",
    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Multiple Rounds: 2x Experience Subquest Campaign\" On Now!\nCampaign\n2025-04-23 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nDuring this campaign, get\n2x\nthe experience in Multiple Rounds Subquests!\nThis is your chance to easily raise your player level!\nCampaign Duration\nStarts after the April 23, 2025 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the April 30, 2025 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nSubquests\nYou can accept requests from people with \"!\" marks. These are subquests.\nImportant\nDoes not include First-time Subquests.\nx2 EXP not included when a monster is defeated.\nIf the campaign ends before you turn in the subquest, you will gain the normal amount of EXP.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
    "startTime": "2025-04-22T19:00:00+00:00",
    "endTime": "2025-04-29T19:00:00+00:00"
