    "full_details": "Notices\nApril 19 is Leafa's birthday! To celebrate, Leafa's hairstyle has been added to player hairstyle choices! Lots of other campaigns are being held too!\nEVENT\n2025-04-19 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nApril 19 is Leafa's birthday!\nWe're holding various campaigns in SWORD ART ONLINE: Integral Factor to celebrate Leafa's birthday!\nLet's all celebrate this wonderful day together!\nLeafa's Hairstyle Added\nAs of midnight on April 19, 2025 (Sat) (JST/UTC+9), Leafa's hairstyle has been added to player hairstyle choices!\nYou can now select Leafa's hairstyle from Makeup or when creating a new character.\n* If this hairstyle does not appear on the list, please try rebooting the app.\nThis hairstyle is only for female characters.\nHappy Dungeon with Leafa\nWe're holding an event where you can get an Leafa chat stamp and up to 500 Arcana Gems!\nPlease see here for more details.\nPeriod\nApril 18, 2025 (Fri) 4:00 - April 25, 2025 (Fri) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nLeafa's Birthday Order\nAll ★4 Skill Records are Leafa!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\nLeafa's Birthday Order is here!\nPlease see here for more details.\nDuration\nApril 19, 2025 (Sat) 0:00 - April 28, 2025 (Mon) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nBirthday Panels\nPanels featuring illustrations of Leafa have been placed in four in-game locations!\nTry taking a screenshot together with them if you come across one!\nPlacement Period\nApril 19, 2025 (Sat) 0:00 - April 28, 2025 (Mon) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nArcana Gem Gift\nLog in on the day of Leafa's birthday to get a gift of 250 Arcana Gems!\nPlease see here for more details.\nTime Limit\nAvailable until April 19, 2025 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nImportant\n・The schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
