    "snippet": "Gracias por utilizar los servicios y productos de Bandai Namco Entertainment Inc. Este es un anuncio sobre las consultas recibidas durante el período comprendido entre el sábado 26 de abril de 2025 y el martes 6 de mayo de 2025.  ■Durante este período, esperamos un gran volumen de consultas, por lo que nuestra respuesta puede tardar un poco...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice Regarding Inquiries Received During Golden Week\nIMPORTANT\n2025-04-18 18:10:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThank you for using the services and products of Bandai Namco Entertainment Inc.\nThis is an announcement regarding inquiries received during the period from 2025 April 26 Saturday to 2025 May 6 Tuesday.\n■During this period, we expect a high volume of inquiries, so our response might take a bit longer than usual.\n■Inquiries requiring confirmation from management or the development team will be addressed after 2025 May 7 Wednesday in the order they were received.\nWe sincerely apologize for any inconvenience this may cause and greatly appreciate your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
