    "snippet": "¡Todos los récords de habilidades ★4 son \"habilidades completas\"! ¡La \"Orden de avance completo\" ya está aquí!  ¡En el Paso 1, puedes obtener 11 pedidos por 1250 gemas arcanas! Además, en el paso 3, ¡se garantiza una habilidad Full Burst de ★4!  Más detalles completos de habilidades de ráfaga aquí 【Algunos récords de habilidades ★4】 ★4 [Nuestros deseos combinados] AsunaNor...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Full Burst Step-Up Order\" is here! One ★4 Full Burst Skill is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2025-04-16 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nAll ★4 Skill Records are \"Full Burst Skills\"!\nThe \"\nFull Burst Step-Up Order\n\" is here!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nAdditionally, on Step 3, one\n★4 Full Burst Skill is guaranteed!\nMore Full Burst Skill Details Here\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Our Wishes Combined] Asuna\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nMother's Rosary\nSkill Name\nMother's Rosary\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n35\nElement\nThrust\nElement\nThrust\nActivation Requirements\nHoly\n→Thrust→Thrust→(\nDark\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n18.0\nSkill Cool Time\n36.0\nSwitch Gauge\n66\nSwitch Gauge\n66\nBreak Gauge\n49\nBreak Gauge\n98\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n2290% damage (11x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Dyna Pile/Buff] Non-elemental damage +0.5% per stack (Stack 5) for 20 sec./[Peak Descent 3/Buff/Debuff] Own critical rate and critical damage rises 2% per stack for 20 sec (Stack 3).Triggers a debuff that raises the damage you take by 0.5% per stack (Stack 9).\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n5510% damage (11x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Bonus] Attack +2000 against enemies with the slash element./[Bonus] While debuff to raise your own damage taken is effective, attack power will increase 150%./[Bonus] Non-elemental damage +100%, when equipping 2 or more of Yuuki's Skill Records in the same set.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP35)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[To the Skies of Freedom] Koharu\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nHydro Cutter Burst\nSkill Name\nHydro Cutter\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nActivation Requirements\nWater\n→Slash→\nWater\n→(\nWater\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSwitch Gauge\n36\nSwitch Gauge\n36\nBreak Gauge\n37\nBreak Gauge\n74\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n1470% damage (Single Foe)[Motion Range]/[Weak Slash 4/Debuff] Slash element's weakness damage +25% for 8 sec./[Water Element Enhance4/Buff] Water element damage +9% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4090% damage (Single Foe)[Motion Range]/[Bonus] Attack +1500 against enemies with the blunt element./[Bonus] Attack +100% against enemy with status ailments (Poison, Burn, Bleed, Frostbite).\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[Boldly and Head-On] Sinon\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nNight Blast-Shot Burst\nSkill Name\nNight Blast-Shot\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nActivation Requirements\nDark\n→\nDark\n→Thrust→(\nFire\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n34\nSwitch Gauge\n34\nBreak Gauge\n35\nBreak Gauge\n70\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n1550% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Dark Element Enhance4/Buff] Dark element damage +9% for 15 sec./[Enhance Thrust 1/Buff] Damage done to enemies weak to thrust +15% for 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4260% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Bonus] The lower your own HP, attack increases.(max 200%)/[Bonus] Critical damage +100% towards enemies on break.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n- Duration\nAfter the April 16, 2025 (Wed) maintenance - April 25, 2025 (Fri) 16:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\nAll ★4 Skill Records are Full Burst Skill!\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nAll ★4 Skill Records are Full Burst Skill!\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nAll ★4 Skill Records are Full Burst Skill!\nOne ★4 Full Burst Skill guaranteed!!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
