    "news_date": 1744617600,
    "news_category": "Shop",
    "snippet": "¡Todos los récords de habilidades de ★4 son Lisbeth o Silica! ¡La Orden de la Tregua Romántica ya está aquí, donde tienes garantizado un récord de habilidad de Lisbeth o Silica de ★4 por cada 11 órdenes! ¡Esta Orden está llena de posibilidades para que aparezcan estos dos personajes esenciales en la progresión por Aincrad!  【Algunos récords de habilidades ★4】 ★4[Revelado...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Romantic Truce Order\" is here! Only ★4 Skill Records of Lisbeth and Silica! One ★4 Lisbeth or Silica Skill Record Guaranteed!\nShop\n2025-04-14 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nAll ★4 Skill Records are\nLisbeth\nor\nSilica\n!\nThe Romantic Truce Order is here, where you're guaranteed a ★4 Lisbeth or Silica Skill Record per 11 Orders!\nThis Order is full of chances for these two essential characters in the progression through Aincrad to appear!\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Revealed Feelings] Lisbeth\nSkill Name\nBattle with Ease/Engrave\nAttack\n50\nDefense\n46\nHP\n3025\nSkill Effect\n[Battle with Ease 4] Attack +25% while the buff that gradually recovers HP depending on the Skill Record is in effect./[Engrave] When equipping 3 or more of Lisbeth's Skill Records in the same set and hitting with switch, adds debuff (Mark).(Invalid when equipped by Partner)The next attack the enemy receives will induce double damage.(Applies to other party member's attacks. Effect will disappear after 10 sec if not activated.)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nPincer Attack\n[During Rush] Damage +15% when using switch.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Walking After The Rain] Silica\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Dark Conversion/Back Up\nAttack\n56\nDefense\n36\nHP\n2575\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 3] Attack +800./[Dark Conversion 4] Holy element's damage to enemies -10% and dark element's damage to enemies +25%./[Back Up 1] Effect changes depending on the Skill Records in the same set.When equipping 2 or more of Silica's Skill Records: Attack +25%.When equipping 3 or more of Silica's Skill Records: Damage done to enemies weak to slashing +15%.When equipping 1 or more of Lisbeth's Skill Records: Skill's power is added +200% when used in switch.When equipping 2 or more of Lisbeth's Skill Records: Damage done to enemies weak to blunt +15%.When equipping 1 or more of Agil's Skill Records: Max HP increase 10%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nDragon Qi\n[When Rush Activates] Recover all status ailments.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Chocolate Veil] Lisbeth\nSkill Name\nSpirit Unity/Veteran Sword Technique/Ground Dance\nAttack\n48\nDefense\n40\nHP\n2650\nSkill Effect\n[Spirit Unity 3] + 5 increase to Awakening rate./[Veteran Sword Technique 4] Attack power increase with own level×0.17%. (max 34%)/[Ground Dance 4] Deals +20% Earth element's damage to enemy.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Escape in the Nick of Time] Silica\nSkill Name\nSuper Enhance Heal/Peak/Hold the Front\nAttack\n53\nDefense\n34\nHP\n2875\nSkill Effect\n[Super Enhance Heal] Effect of healing items and field objects +100%./[Peak 3] Attack +40% when HP is above 80%./[Hold the Front 4] Recovers a max of 5%+200 HP per 3 sec when HP is under 50%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Dangerous Scheme] Lisbeth\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Enhance Attack/Crude Tactics\nAttack\n50\nDefense\n38\nHP\n2575\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 4] Attack +900./[Enhance Attack 4] Attack +15%./[Crude Tactics 2] Defense -30% and, when HP is under 50%, non-elemental damage -400%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nFury\n[When Rush Activates] Own max HP 20% recovers.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Apprentice Sorceress] Silica\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Frostbite Blow\nAttack\n59\nDefense\n30\nHP\n2575\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 3] Attack +800./[Frostbite Blow 5] Attack against enemies with frostbite increases 30%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Ability\nFor each piece of equipment in the same set, the number of activations in additional Full Burst state increases by 1 (1 activation per skill)\nStock Type: Resets remaining time for Full Burst skill activation, and extends duration of Full Burst state (+10 sec per 1 equipment)\nChain Type: Increases burst skill damage used in Full Burst state (+5% per 1 equipment)\n*Burst activated Sword Skills during Full Burst state will activate normally until Full Burst State ends.\n- Duration\nApril 14, 2025 (Mon) 17:00 - Before the April 23, 2025 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9)\n- Offers\n11 Order for 2,500 Arcana Gems\n- Important\nThere is no single Order.\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nIncludes ★2 to ★4 Skill Records.\nPlease be aware that the period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
