    "full_details": "Notices\n250 Arcana Gems! An Eugeo Birthday Present Campaign!\nCampaign\n2025-04-10 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nToday (4/10) is Eugeo's birthday!\n250 Arcana Gems have been sent to your present box in celebration of Eugeo's birthday on April 10.\nLet's all celebrate Eugeo's birthday together!\n▼Receive by date (Arcana Gems)\n4/10 until 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n▼Notes\n・Please note that the schedule and the content of the present are subject to change without notice.\nGo to Notice List"
