    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Animal Ear Selection Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed per 11 Orders!\nShop\n2025-03-26 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nOne animal-ear-themed ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed per 11 Orders!\nThe \"\nAnimal Ear Selection Order\n\" is here!\n- Duration\nAfter the March 26, 2025 (Wed) maintenance - April 4, 2025 (Fri) 16:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Offers\n1 Order for 250 Arcana Gems\n11 Order for 2,500 Arcana Gems\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Outlaw Wolf] Kirito\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nShadow Bite\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nSlash/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n36\nBreak Gauge\n30\nSkill Effect\n1870% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Jar of Ice 4/Buff] Defense +10 per stack (Stack 3) during 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nReduces status ailment stacks by 5 → 10 → 15 on yourself, when hitting with skills while inflicted with Burn (Will not be below 1).\nRecovers 1500 → 3000 → 4500 HP when hitting with skills.\n★4[Carefree Wolf Boy] Eugeo\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nGreedy Blaze\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n62\nBreak Gauge\n57\nSkill Effect\n1760% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using fire skills./[Bonus] When equipping 4 or more of Eugeo's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1500.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Order Up!] Yuuki\nSkill Name\nAdvance Trooper/Wind Conversion\nAttack\n54\nDefense\n44\nHP\n2800\nSkill Effect\n[Advance Trooper 5] Attack +500./[Wind Conversion 4] Earth element's damage to enemies -10% and wind element's damage to enemies +25%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nExtra effect time 7.5 sec.\nLimit Break extends Accele Skill effect time.\n*Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Can I Take Your Order?] Leafa\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nGreedy Break\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nSlash\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n62\nBreak Gauge\n57\nSkill Effect\n870% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲[Bonus] When enemy's HP is 50% or up, attack will increase 100%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Lady Demon] Alice\nSkill Name\nEnhance Berserk/Enhance Paralysis Res./Hostility: Poison\nAttack\n62\nDefense\n28\nHP\n2425\nSkill Effect\n[Enhance Berserk 4] When the player is Status Ailments (Poison, Burn, Bleed, Frostbite, Curse, Debility), Attack +25%./●[Enhance Paralysis Res. 4] Paralysis Res. increase 70%./[Hostility: Poison] When equipping 1 of Kirito's Skill Records in a set, adds poison effect on yourself for 30 sec when you hit using Switch (Stack 1).\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Lady Fox] Sinon\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nDark Blast-Shot\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n34\nBreak Gauge\n35\nSkill Effect\n1290% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Adversity 3/Buff] The lower your own HP, critical damage increases for 15 sec./▲[Bonus] All the Stack Buff effected to the enemy will -2 in numbers of Stacks (Will not be below 1).\n*Less likely to attract aggro from enemies.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nPincer Attack\n[During Rush] Damage +15% when using switch.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n- Important\nCheck the in-game Order details for more information on the entire lineup and the drop rates.\nPlease be aware that the period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
