    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(3/26)\nMAINT.\n2025-03-25 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 3/26, 2025, 13:00, was completed on 3/26, 2025, 17:00(JST/UTC+9).\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Chaos Boss Dungeon Part 23\" White Wyrm Chaos begins\nAdded [Worldwide 7 Year Anniversary] \"Greedy Kobold Lord Hunt 2025\" Event rewards\n[Worldwide 7 Year Anniversary] \"Armament Stone Increased Drop Rate Campaign\" begins\n\"Animal Ear Selection Order\" begins\n\"Arcana Gem Super Boost Campaign\" begins\n▼Added Features & Feature Adjustments\nRaised the drop rate of production materials for floor boss avatars from 1F to 12F\nChanged \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to the normal design\nThe Guild Room will be re-themed for a limited time for spring\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼New Events\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n3/26, 2025 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Chaos Boss Dungeon Part 23\" White Wyrm Chaos begins\nAdded [Worldwide 7 Year Anniversary] \"Greedy Kobold Lord Hunt 2025\" Event rewards\n[Worldwide 7 Year Anniversary] \"Armament Stone Increased Drop Rate Campaign\" begins\nNew Order begins\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 3/26 Maintenance\nThe 5th \"Squad Jumble\"\n[Worldwide 7 Year Anniversary] \"White Day Assault 2025\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
