    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Youth in Panorama Order\" is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2025-03-19 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nEugeo, Lisbeth, Sachi, and Sinon wear school uniforms as they celebrate their youth in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nYouth in Panorama Order\n\" is here! Get one new ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\nThe 6% total drop rate does not include the guaranteed ★4 Skill Record, and new ★4 Skill Records are featured Skill Records with high drop rates!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Mysterious Classmate] Eugeo\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nGod Recoil\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n38\nBreak Gauge\n78\nSkill Effect\n1610% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/▲▲▲[Bonus] Damage +100% to enemies when using holy skills./[Bonus] When equipping 4 or more of Eugeo's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1200.\n*Increase in break gauge amount.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[After-School Anticipation] Lisbeth\nSkill Name\nKing of Maces/Alcor/Mace Support\nAttack\n56\nDefense\n42\nHP\n2725\nSkill Effect\n[King of Maces 3] Attack +1000 when 1H Club is equipped/[Alcor] When equipping 2 or more of Koharu's Skill Records in the same set and hitting with switch, adds debuff (Death Mark).(Invalid when equipped by Partner)Increases damage to enemy by x1.1 for 12 sec./[Mace Support 1] Switch gauge amount +15%, when using 1H Club.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Innocent Girl] Sachi\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nEarth Wheel\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n51\nBreak Gauge\n42\nSkill Effect\n2070% damage (3x hit/All Foes)[Center/Arc/Mid]/[Earth Pile/Buff] Earth element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Earth Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Earth element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Stigma/Debuff] Increases damage taken by enemies for 18 sec (Stack 9) +0.5% for every Stack 1.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect 30 sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n★4[Intriguing Classmate] Sinon\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nEarth Impact\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nThrust/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n30\nBreak Gauge\n16\nSkill Effect\n2210% damage (3x hit/All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Muscle Build Up 4/Buff] Attack + 1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nRaises 3 → 6 → 9 stacks for all Stack buffs that are on yourself when hitting with skills.\nRaises 1 → 2 → 3 stacks for all Stack buffs that are on yourself when hitting with skills and equipping 2 or more of Koharu's Skill Records in the same set.\n\"[Intriguing Classmate] Sinon\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nAfter the March 19, 2025 (Wed) maintenance - April 18, 2025 (Fri) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
