    "full_details": "Notices\nMarch 9 is Agil's birthday! To celebrate, we'll be holding lots of campaigns!\nEVENT\n2025-03-09 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nMarch 9 is Agil's birthday!\nWe're holding various campaigns in SWORD ART ONLINE: Integral Factor to celebrate Agil's birthday!\nLet's all celebrate this wonderful day together!\nHappy Dungeon with Agil\nWe're holding an event where you can get an Agil chat stamp and up to 500 Arcana Gems!\nPlease see here for more details.\nPeriod\nMarch 7, 2025 (Fri) 4:00 - March 15, 2025 (Sat) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nAgil's Birthday Order\nAll ★4 Skill Records are Agil!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\nAgil's Birthday Order is here!\nPlease see here for more details.\nDuration\nMarch 9, 2025 (Sun) 0:00 - March 18, 2025 (Tue) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nAgil's Birthday Panels\nPanels featuring illustrations of Agil have been placed in four in-game locations!\nTry taking a screenshot together with them if you come across one!\nPlacement Period\nMarch 9, 2025 (Sun) 0:00 - March 18, 2025 (Tue) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nArcana Gem Gift\nLog in on the day of Agil's birthday to get a gift of 250 Arcana Gems!\nPlease see here for more details.\nTime Limit\nAvailable until March 9, 2025 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nImportant\n・The schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
