    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Black Raiment Selection Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed per 11 Orders!\nShop\n2025-02-27 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nOne ★4 Kirito-color Skill Record guaranteed per 11 Orders!\n★4 Skill Records that appeared in a joint event with SWORD ART ONLINE Arcade: Deep Explorer are also available!\nThe \"\nBlack Raiment Selection Order\n\" is here!\n- Duration\nAfter the February 27, 2025 (Thu) maintenance - March 8, 2025 (Sat) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Offers\n1 Order for 250 Arcana Gems\n11 Order for 2,500 Arcana Gems\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Black Waves] Kirito\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nVorpal Frost\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n43\nBreak Gauge\n43\nSkill Effect\n1550% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using water skills./[Bonus] When equipping 4 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1200.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Bewitching Black Sword] Yuuki\nSkill Name\nBloody Battle Slash/Aqua Conversion\nAttack\n56\nDefense\n38\nHP\n2500\nSkill Effect\n[Bloody Battle Slash 3] Attack +35% when attacking with slash element./[Aqua Conversion 4] Fire element's damage to enemies -10% and water element's damage to enemies +25%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Ability\nFor each piece of equipment in the same set, the number of activations in additional Full Burst state increases by 1 (1 activation per skill)\nStock Type: Resets remaining time for Full Burst skill activation, and extends duration of Full Burst state (+10 sec per 1 equipment)\nChain Type: Increases burst skill damage used in Full Burst state (+5% per 1 equipment)\n*Burst activated Sword Skills during Full Burst state will activate normally until Full Burst State ends.\n★4[Black Smith's Hammer] Lisbeth\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nSand Disorder\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nBlunt/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n77\nBreak Gauge\n44\nSkill Effect\n1530% damage (7x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Parry4/Buff] When this skill direct hits, the damage you receive decreases at 50%(Effect will disappear after 20 sec if not activated).\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nBoost 10 → 20 → 30 to your own switch guage when hitting with skills.\nWhen equipping 2 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, recover +4 → 12 → 20 SP when this skill direct hits.\n★4[Girl in Black] Silica\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nAqua Loiter\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n96\nBreak Gauge\n44\nSkill Effect\n1700% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Motion Range]/[Muscle Atrophy 4/Debuff] Enemy's attack -0.3% per stack (Stack 3) for 20 sec./[Muscle Atrophy 4/Debuff] When the target is hit using the Switch, enemy's attack -0.3% per stack (Stack 9) for 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect 30 sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n★4[A Black Knight's Rest] Alice\nSkill Name\nEncircle Break/Iron-Fisted Punishment\nAttack\n62\nDefense\n32\nHP\n2275\nSkill Effect\n[Encircle Break 3] Increase in break gauge to enemy by +27.5%/[Iron-Fisted Punishment 4] Attack +500 when attacking with blunt element.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Jet Black Rose] Eugeo\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nDark Rose Ripper Burst\nSkill Name\nDark Rose Ripper\nSP Cost\n22\nSP Cost\n22\nElement\nSlash/\nDark\nElement\nSlash/\nDark\nActivation Requirements\nDark\n→Slash→Slash→\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSkill Cool Time\n24.0\nSwitch Gauge\n29\nSwitch Gauge\n29\nBreak Gauge\n28\nBreak Gauge\n56\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n1060% damage (All Foes)[Center/Arc/Mid]/[Dark Element Weak 3/Debuff] Dark element damage to enemies +15% for 10 sec./▲[Bonus] The higher your own defense, the more additional damage increases.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n2540% damage (All Foes)[Center/Arc/Mid]/[Dark Element Weak 3/Debuff] Dark element damage to enemies +15% for 20 sec./[Bonus] The higher your own defense, the more additional damage increases.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Obsidian Guard] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nWater Comet\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n40\nBreak Gauge\n40\nSkill Effect\n1180% damage (4x hit/Single Foe)[Motion Range]/[Frostbite/Status Ailments] It will Frostbite (Stack 3) at specific rate for 30 sec./▲[Bonus] Restore 8000 HP when hitting with this skill while using switch.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n- Important\nCheck the in-game Order details for more information on the entire lineup and the drop rates.\nPlease be aware that the period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
