    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(2/27)\nMAINT.\n2025-02-26 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 2/27, 2025, 13:00, was completed on 2/27, 2025, 17:00(JST/UTC+9).\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\nChapter 2 \"Aincrad 33F\"\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to \"Koharu Birthday Festival Defense Battle\"\nAdded \"Chocolate Meiolania Hunt 2025\" Event rewards\n[Worldwide 7 Year Anniversary] \"Silica's Heapin' 40M EXP Event\" begins\n\"Black Raiment Selection Order\" begins\n\"Arcana Gem Super Boost Campaign\" begins\n▼Added Features & Feature Adjustments\nThe Guild Room will be changed to the usual theme.\n▼Fixed Issues\nFixed an issue where Random Bonus Succession could be used for Gale El Nino\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼Official Live Stream Rewards\nWe have sent out rewards for correct answers to the quiz corner on the official livestream on 2/21, 2025.\nArcana Gems×600\nMemoria Niter L×10\nReceive by: Until 3/6, 2025 23:59(JST/UTC+9)\n▼New Events\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n2/27, 2025 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\nChapter 2 \"Aincrad 33F\"\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to \"Koharu Birthday Festival Defense Battle\"\nAdded \"Chocolate Meiolania Hunt 2025\" Event rewards\n[Worldwide 7 Year Anniversary] \"Silica's Heapin' 40M EXP Event\" begins\nNew Order begins\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 2/27 Maintenance\n\"Female Swordsman, Female Knight, and a Chocolate\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
