    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Koharu Masterpiece Showcase\" Koharu Birthday Festival is here! Take a look at Koharu illustration panels placed in various locations!\nEVENT\n2025-02-23 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nKoharu Birthday Festival!\nGo on a journey to view illustration panels depicting Koharu placed all around Aincrad!\nThe \"Koharu Masterpiece Showcase\" is on now!\nIn the \"Koharu Masterpiece Showcase\", use the on-screen hints to get to your destination.\nOnce you've arrived, new hints will appear to help you get to the next one.\nComplete the quest by reaching the final destination and finding the treasure box.\nIf you lose track of the hints along the way, you can check them at any time by tapping \"Show hint\" on the quest details screen.\nHints for these panels will be limited to the special characteristics of the illustrations.\nTry visiting lots of different floors and sharing information with your friends to find where they're placed!\n* There are a total of six quest-related illustration panels.\nQuest Reward\nKoharu Stamp 19\nKoharu Stamp 20\nKoharu Stamp 21\nArcana Gems×100\n1,000,000Col\nEXP 3,000,000\nStamp\nStamp Name\nStamp Displayed\nKoharu Stamp 19\nKoharu Stamp 20\nKoharu Stamp 21\nAchievement Rewards\nRecord\nAchievement Requirements\nAchievement Rewards\nMasterpiece Collector\nClear the [Riddle] Koharu Masterpiece Showcase\nRevive Crystal×1\nHow to Participate\nTalk to the \"Male Minstrel\" NPC at the Teleport Gate Plaza to accept the quest.\nEvent Period\nFebruary 23, 2025 (Sun) 0:00 - Before the March 12, 2025 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete 1F (Main Quest \"Labyrinth Strategy\")\n* We recommend progressing through the main quest so that you have access to each floor.\nImportant\nThe \"[Riddle] Koharu Masterpiece Showcase\" is a 1x Only quest.\nYou can proceed through the quest without Koharu accompanying you, but just imagine how she'll feel looking at the panels together with you.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
    "startTime": "2025-02-22T15:00:00+00:00",
    "endTime": "2025-03-11T19:00:00+00:00"
