    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Passionate Approach Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2025-02-01 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nKoharu, Alice, Asuna, and Yui are here with Valentine's chocolates and kind smiles as new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nPassionate Approach Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3!\nBoosted rates for the featured new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Wholehearted] Koharu\nSkill Name\nAdvance Trooper/Shine Boost\nAttack\n58\nDefense\n30\nHP\n2650\nSkill Effect\n[Advance Trooper 5] Attack +500./[Shine Boost 4] Elemental damage other than holy dealt to enemies -50%, and holy element's damage to enemies +40%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Ability\nFor each piece of equipment in the same set, the number of activations in additional Full Burst state increases by 1 (1 activation per skill)\nStock Type: Resets remaining time for Full Burst skill activation, and extends duration of Full Burst state (+10 sec per 1 equipment)\nChain Type: Increases burst skill damage used in Full Burst state (+5% per 1 equipment)\n*Burst activated Sword Skills during Full Burst state will activate normally until Full Burst State ends.\n★4[Sweet Heart] Alice\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nHoly Wave\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n84\nBreak Gauge\n43\nSkill Effect\n2250% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Shine Pile/Buff] Holy element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Shine Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, holy element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n*More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nHoly damage +50% when using Holy skills.\nAttack +1000 when using Holy skills while the buff to raise Holy damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Sweet Happiness] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nAqua Pulsar\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n80\nBreak Gauge\n40\nSkill Effect\n2550% damage (Single Foe)[Motion Range]/[Aqua Pile/Buff] Water element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Aqua Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, water element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nWater damage +50% when using water skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise water damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Shape of Affection] Yui\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nFire Split Burst\nSkill Name\nFire Split\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nBlunt/\nFire\nElement\nBlunt/\nFire\nActivation Requirements\nFire\n→\nFire\n→Blunt→(\nFire\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n36\nSwitch Gauge\n36\nBreak Gauge\n37\nBreak Gauge\n74\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n1680% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Enhance Attack 4/Buff] Attack +15% for 20 sec./[Fire Element Enhance4/Buff] Fire element damage +9% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4620% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Bonus] Attack increases in proportion with your remaining HP x 200%./[Bonus] Fire element damage increases x 0.5% the number of burn stacks when the player is inflicted with the burn status ailment.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n\"[Sweet Happiness] Asuna\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nFebruary 1, 2025 (Sat) 0:00 - February 28, 2025 (Fri) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
