    "snippet": "Aviso para aquellos usuarios que inicien sesión en \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\". El mantenimiento estará vigente durante las fechas siguientes.  Fechas de mantenimiento programadas 29/1, 2025 12:00 a 17:00 (tentativo) (JST/UTC+9) ▼Eventos nuevos y recientemente implementados Comienza el cuarto \"Squad Jumble\" Se agregaron recompensas y dificultad alta...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(1/29)\nMAINT.\n2025-01-28 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 1/29, 2025, 12:00, was completed on 1/29, 2025, 17:00(JST/UTC+9).\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\nThe 4th \"Squad Jumble\" begins\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to \"Boss Rush VS Nocte\"\n\"Female Swordsman, Female Knight, and a Chocolate\" is back\n\"Multiple Rounds: 2x Experience Subquest Campaign\" begins\n▼Added Features & Feature Adjustments\nTeleport Gate Plaza and the Merchant District have been changed to Valentine themed maps\nAdjusted the description of the following Ingots (No changes have been made to the actual effects.)\nHermit Ingot\nUtsuroubou Ingot\nNocte Ingot\nWormy Puppeteer Ingot\nUnited Unicorn Ingot\n▼Fixed Issues\nFixed an issue where Wave Releaser could not be used for [Leader Through Peril] Griselda.\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼New Events\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n1/29, 2025 12:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\nThe 4th \"Squad Jumble\" begins\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to \"Boss Rush VS Nocte\"\n\"Female Swordsman, Female Knight, and a Chocolate\" is back\n\"Multiple Rounds: 2x Experience Subquest Campaign\" begins\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 1/29 Maintenance\n\"Wonder Animal Assault 2025\"\n\"Multiple Rounds: 2x Experience Character Quest Campaign\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
