    "news_category": "Shop",
    "snippet": "¡Alice, Koharu, Agil y Yui luchan contra la festividad de Setsubun vistiendo trajes con temática de demonios en estos nuevos ★4 Skill Records! ¡La orden \"No ser derrotado por la orden Bean\" ya está aquí! ¡Obtén un nuevo récord de habilidad ★4 garantizado en el paso 5! ¡Tarifas mejoradas para nuevos récords de habilidades ★4!  En el Paso 1, puede obtener 11 pedidos para...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Be Not Defeated by the Bean Order\" is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2025-01-22 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nAlice, Koharu, Agil, and Yui fight against the Setsubun holiday wearing demon-themed outfits in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nBe Not Defeated by the Bean Order\n\" is here! Get one new ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Demon's Aura] Alice\nSkill Name\nCombination/Veteran Sword Technique/Purifying Flame\nAttack\n53\nDefense\n36\nHP\n2425\nSkill Effect\n●[Combination 4] Skill's power is added +100% when used in switch./[Veteran Sword Technique 4] Attack power increase with own level×0.17%. (max 34%)/[Purifying Flame 4] Deals +20% Fire element's damage to enemy.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Approaching Crimson Demon] Koharu\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nProminence Fall Burst\nSkill Name\nProminence Fall\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nBlunt/\nFire\nElement\nBlunt/\nFire\nActivation Requirements\nFire\n→\nFire\n→Blunt→(\nWater\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n40\nSwitch Gauge\n40\nBreak Gauge\n40\nBreak Gauge\n80\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n1860% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Fire Element Enhance4/Buff] Fire element damage +9% for 15 sec./[Small Mark/Debuff] The next attack the enemy receives will induce 1.5x damage.(Applies to other party member's attacks. Effect will disappear after 10 sec if not activated.)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4390% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Bonus] Attack +100% against enemies with debuff status (Mark, Small Mark, Death Mark, Thrust Erosion Mark, Slash Destruction Mark)./[Bonus] Fire element damage increases x 0.5% the number of burn stacks when the player is inflicted with the burn status ailment.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[Brute Force Blow] Agil\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nFlame Buster\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n96\nBreak Gauge\n44\nSkill Effect\n2490% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Motion Range]/[Flame Pile/Buff] Fire element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Flame Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Fire element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nFire damage +50% when using fire skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise fire damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[A Little Demon Appears] Yui\nSkill Name\nEnhance Stun Res./Reinforced Strike\nAttack\n62\nDefense\n36\nHP\n2500\nSkill Effect\n●[Enhance Stun Res. 4] Stun resistance +70%./[Reinforced Strike 3] Adds a buff where blunt elemental weakness damage +1% per 1 Stack (Stack 3) for 30 sec when using Switch. (Invalid when equipped by Partner)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nExtra effect time 7.5 sec.\nFor each 1 equipped in the same set, switch damage during the chain state increases, and the effect time is extended.\n・Effect during Chain\nSkill's power is added +150% when used in switch.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n\"[Approaching Crimson Demon] Koharu\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nAfter the January 22, 2025 (Wed) maintenance - February 17, 2025 (Mon) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
