    "news_date": 1737532800,
    "news_category": "EVENT",
    "snippet": "¡Se han agregado el monstruo jefe \"Caos de nueve colas\" y la serie de equipamiento Dark Black Lv.255 \"Zorro negro oscuro de nueve colas\"! ¡Consigue la poderosa armadura \"Dark Black Series\"!  ¡Los siguientes niveles de dificultad están abiertos a fiestas!  Enfréntate al nivel 90 de Chaos Showdown para conseguir a Dark Black King, que puede e...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nThe Lv.225 Dark Black series \"Dark Black Nine-tailed Fox\" is here! New boss monster added to the \"Chaos Showdown\"!\nEVENT\n2025-01-22 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe boss monster \"Nine-tailed Chaos\" and the Lv.255 Dark Black equipment series \"Dark Black Nine-tailed Fox\" have been added!\nGet the powerful \"Dark Black Series\" armor!\nThe following difficulty levels are open to parties!\nTake on Chaos Showdown 90 difficulty to get Dark Black King, which can be equipped from Equipment Lv. 90.\nTake on Chaos Showdown 95 difficulty to get Dark Black Sea Horse, which can be equipped from Equipment Lv. 95.\nTake on Chaos Showdown 110 difficulty to get Dark Black Colossal, which can be equipped from Equipment Lv. 110.\nTake on Chaos Showdown 135 difficulty to get Dark Black Snake Samurai, which can be equipped from Equipment Lv. 135.\nTake on Chaos Showdown 155 difficulty to get Dark Black Blazing, which can be equipped from Equipment Lv. 155.\nTake on Chaos Showdown 175 difficulty to get Dark Black Asura, which can be equipped from Equipment Lv. 175.\nDungeon Duration\nJanuary 22, 2025 (Wed) 14:00 - February 5, 2025 (Wed) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nNew Boss monster\nNine-tailed Chaos\nDetails\nSince this is a field with unusable items, some items cannot be used.\nThe beginning of battle, it uses a \"Critical resistance\" buff.\nYou can break it with 2H Axe skills.\nWhen HP falls below a certain amount, Break condition changes to 1H Club skills.\nSkill Breaks can be performed with skills that are both Blunt Element and Fire Element.\nWith each Break or Skill Break, it will be weakened by a stack debuff that increases damage dealt from players.\nAccompanying monsters will appear when it reaches a certain HP.\nAlso, the boss uses a stack buff \"Reduces damage\" whenever reinforcements appear.\nDefeating reinforcement monsters reduces the number of buff stacks.\nWhen its HP falls beneath a certain amount, it will use the Chaos Recollection buff.\nWeakness\nBlunt Element\nFire Element\nResistance\nSlash Element\nThrust Element\nWater Element\nWind Element\nEarth Element\nHoly Element\nDark Element\nCritical\nDamage\nBuffs used\nBuff \"Critical resistance\" and \"Chaos Recollection\"\nStack Buff \"Reduces damage\"\nStatus Ailments used\nStatus ailments \"Debility\", \"Scorch\" and \"Stun\"\nDebuff \"Seal item\"\n* Break: Filling the entire Break Gauge will temporarily immobilize the boss and remove all of its buff effects.\n* Skill Break: By completely lowering the Skill Break Gauge, the boss will be temporarily immobilized and all of its buff effects will be removed.\n* Chaos Recollection: A powerful aura that surrounds the body and reduces damage. (Awakening is effective.)\nFor details on the effects of \"Status Ailments,\" please check in-game via \"Menu\" > \"System\" > \"Help\" > \"Buff, Debuff, and Status Ailments.\"\nAlternatively, please refer to the\n\"Status Ailments\"\nsection of the Play Guide.\nBoss Appearing\nDifficulty\nBoss Name\nWeakness\nObtainable Chaos Crystals\nChaos Showdown 90\nDark Black King\nBlunt Element\nCrimson Chaos Crystal\nChaos Showdown 95\nDark Black Sea Horse\nThrust Element\n・\nEarth Element\nAmber Chaos Crystal\nChaos Showdown 110\nDark Black Colossal\nThrust Element\n・\nHoly Element\nTopaz Chaos Crystal\nChaos Showdown 135\nDark Black Snake Samurai\nSlash Element\n・\nWind Element\nEmerald Chaos Crystal\nChaos Showdown 155\nDark Black Blazing\nSlash Element\n・\nDark Element\nSapphire Chaos Crystal\nChaos Showdown 175\nDark Black Asura\nBlunt Element\n・\nWater Element\nIndigo Chaos Crystal\nChaos Showdown 195\nDark Black Warden\nThrust Element\n・\nDark Element\nAmethyst Chaos Crystal\nChaos Showdown 215\nDark Black White Wyrm\nSlash Element\n・\nWater Element\nQuartz Chaos Crystal\nChaos Showdown 235\nDark Black Land Devourer\nBlunt Element\n・\nDark Element\nRose Quartz Chaos Crystal\nChaos Showdown 255\nDark Black Nine-tailed Fox\nBlunt Element\n・\nFire Element\nSky Chaos Crystal\n\"Dark Black Series\" equipment can be produced at the Workshop using Chaos Crystals and production materials dropped from the boss.\nEach \"Chaos Crystal\" can be obtained by collecting the correlating \"Crystal Shards\" and using them for production.\nDark Black Series List\nIcon\nItem Name\nDefense ₍Max₎\nHP Bonus ₍Max₎\nRequired Level\nDark Black King Armor\n816\n12210\nLv.90\nDark Black King Greaves\n670\n8547\nLv.90\nDark Black Sea Horse Armor\n866\n12810\nLv.95\nDark Black Sea Horse Greaves\n710\n8967\nLv.95\nDark Black Colossal Armor\n917\n14010\nLv.110\nDark Black Colossal Greaves\n752\n9807\nLv.110\nDark Black Snake Samurai Armor\n1257\n20190\nLv.135\nDark Black Snake Samurai Greaves\n1031\n14133\nLv.135\nDark Black Blazing Armor\n1358\n21990\nLv.155\nDark Black Blazing Greaves\n1114\n15393\nLv.155\nDark Black Asura Armor\n1460\n24400\nLv.175\nDark Black Asura Greaves\n1197\n16303\nLv.175\nDark Black Warden Armor\n1563\n26850\nLv.195\nDark Black Warden Greaves\n1282\n17253\nLv.195\nDark Black White Wyrm Armor\n1667\n29350\nLv.215\nDark Black White Wyrm Greaves\n1367\n18253\nLv.215\nDark Black Land Devourer Armor\n1772\n31900\nLv.235\nDark Black Land Devourer Greaves\n1453\n19303\nLv.235\nDark Black Nine-tailed Fox Armor[NEW！]\n1878\n34500\nLv.255\nDark Black Nine-tailed Fox Greaves[NEW！]\n1540\n20403\nLv.255\nRandom Bonus\nThe value and type of the Dark Black Series bonus are random.\nExample: Equippable Lv. 255 Dark Black Series\nStatus\nUpper\nLower\nAttack\n30\n30\nDefense\n100\n50\nHP\n2500\n5000\nExample: If three types of defenses are given to Dark Black Nine-tailed Fox Armor, defense will increase by 300 total.\n* Succession cannot be used for the Dark Black Series.\nParticipation Requirements\nClear the 10F Main Quest through the end\nAccept it from the \"Chaos Showdown\" NPC at the \"Blackiron Palace\".\nImportant\n\"Chaos Showdown\" 195, 215, 235, and 255 difficulties are solo only.\nChaos Showdown is a permanent dungeon where the boss changes approximately every two weeks. The rotation will start over again after six weeks.\nYour score reward and challenge reward information will not reset when each dungeon returns.\nCheck the game for details about the rewards of each dungeon.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
