    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(1/22)\nMAINT.\n2025-01-21 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 1/22, 2025, 13:00, was completed on 1/22, 2025, 17:00(JST/UTC+9).\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\nChapter 2 \"Aincrad 96F\"\n\"96F Start Dash Event\" begins\n\"Chaos Showdown\" New Boss and Dark Black Armor Added\n\"Boss Rush VS Nocte\" begins\nAdded \"Wonder Animal Assault 2025\" Event rewards\n\"Ring Production Campaign\" begins\n\"Be Not Defeated by the Bean Order\" begins\n\"Arcana Gem Super Boost Campaign\" begins\n▼Added Features & Feature Adjustments\nAdded a display for Defense to the \"Boss Details\" screen.\nAdded a help display button for \"About the Report Feature\" to the party search, group search, and report screens.\nAdded a help display button for \"About the Blacklist\" to the Blacklist menu.\nAdded emotes to some NPCs.\n▼Fixed Issues\nFixed an issue where, if no Skill Record was set in the first skill slot, activating a Connect Skill and pressing the Switch button would cancel the skill linked to that Connect Skill.\nFixed an issue where the \"Congratulations!!\" display conditions on the Integral Series guidance screen was incorrect.\nFixed the behavior of the camera when facing fences, tables, etc.\nFixed the description of \"[With Great Power] Koharu\". (The poison stack of [Poison/Status Ailments] inaccurately indicated 1 instead of 3.)\nFixed an issue where some guild quests could not be accepted properly.\nFixed the issue in the 81F main quest \"Millennial Friend\", that was causing a download error when moving to the event field.\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼Official Live Stream Rewards\nAs a reward for the correct answers to the quiz portion of the official live stream on 1/17, 2025, 400 Arcana Gems have been sent to all players.\nReceive by: Until 1/29, 2025 23:59(JST/UTC+9)\n▼New Events\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n1/22, 2025 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\nChapter 2 \"Aincrad 96F\"\n\"96F Start Dash Event\" begins\n\"Chaos Showdown\" New Boss and Dark Black Armor Added\n\"Boss Rush VS Nocte\" begins\nAdded \"Wonder Animal Assault 2025\" Event rewards\n\"Ring Production Campaign\" begins\nNew Order begins\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 1/22 Maintenance\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Season 55\n\"Kingly Snake Hunt\"\n\"Squad Jam: Insane Fiend\"\n\"Boss Ingot Increased Drop Rate Campaign\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
