    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(1/8)\nMAINT.\n2025-01-07 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 1/8, 2025, 13:00, was completed on 1/8, 2025, 17:00(JST/UTC+9).\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\nPlayer Level Cap Raised(Lv.250→Lv.260)\n\"Chaos Showdown\" New Boss and Dark Black Armor Added\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Preseason 55 begins\n\"Wonder Animal Assault 2025\" begins\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to \"Kingly Snake Hunt\"\n\"Boss Ingot Increased Drop Rate Campaign\" begins\n\"Nobles at Play Order\" begins\n\"Arcana Gem Super Boost Campaign\" begins\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼Update event\nThe previously undecided end date of the SAOIF x GGO event \"Squad Jam: Insane Fiend\" has been scheduled for Wednesday, January 22, 2025 at maintenance.\nMore \"Squad Jam: Insane Fiend\" Details Here\n▼New Events\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n1/8, 2025 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\nPlayer Level Cap Raised(Lv.250→Lv.260)\n\"Chaos Showdown\" New Boss and Dark Black Armor Added\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Preseason 55 begins\n\"Wonder Animal Assault 2025\" begins\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to \"Kingly Snake Hunt\"\n\"Boss Ingot Increased Drop Rate Campaign\" begins\nNew Order begins\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 1/8 Maintenance\n\"End of the Year Grab Bag 2024 Order\"\n\"Joyful Present Order\"\nThe 3rd \"Squad Jumble\"\n\"2024 New Year's Eve Fishing Competition\"\n[Holiday Campaign] \"Guild Battle Challenge VS Nine-Life Snake\"\n[Holiday Campaign] \"Chaos Showdown: All Open\"\n[Holiday Campaign] \"Increased Core Metal+++ Drop Rate Campaign\"\n[Holiday Campaign] \"Labyrinth Strategy Campaign\"\n\"Ringlings for Christmas\"\n\"Christmas Opus\"\n\"Thoughts on a Holy Night\"\n\"Holy Night Gourmet Banquet\"\n\"Santa Claus in Blue Decline\"\n\"Glass Snow Rabbit & the Last Xmas\"\n\"Happy Christmas\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
