    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(12/25)\nMAINT.\n2024-12-24 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 12/25, 2024, 12:00, was completed on 12/25, 2024, 18:00(JST/UTC+9).\nWe will be sending out token of apology for the maintenance.\n50 Arcana Gems\nAvailable until:1/1/2025(Wed) at 23:59(JST/UTC+9)\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\nThe 3rd \"Squad Jumble\" begins\n\"2024 New Year's Eve Fishing Competition\" begins\n[Holiday Campaign] \"Core Metal+++ Increased Drop Rate Campaign\" begins\n[Holiday Campaign] \"Chaos Showdown: All Open\" begins\nAdded \"Ringlings for Christmas\" Event rewards\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼New Events\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n12/25, 2024 12:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\nThe 3rd \"Squad Jumble\" begins\n\"2024 New Year's Eve Fishing Competition\" begins\n[Holiday Campaign] \"Core Metal+++ Increased Drop Rate Campaign\" begins\n[Holiday Campaign] \"Chaos Showdown: All Open\" begins\nAdded \"Ringlings for Christmas\" Event rewards\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 12/25 Maintenance\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Season 54\n[Holiday Campaign] \"Multiple Rounds: 4x Experience Subquest Campaign\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
