    "full_details": "Notices\n[Episode 12] Celebrating the broadcast of the anime series Sword Art Online Alternative: Gun Gale Online II! LLENN stamp giveaway!\nNOTICES\n2024-12-20 04:00:01\n（JST/GMT+9）\nLLENN is appearing in in-game stamps to celebrate the broadcast of episode 12 of the anime series Sword Art Online Alternative: Gun Gale Online II!\nJust as promised at the 2024 Kitakyushu Pop Culture Festival, we're distributing a\nstamp series full of LLENN's many expressions\n!\nTo commemorate this being the final episode, we're giving out two special stamps!\nStamp Displayed\nItems for Acquisition\nMemory Stamp 308\nMemory Stamp 309\nChat Stamp Distribution Period\nDecember 20, 2024 (Fri) 4:00 - January 31, 2025 (Fri) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n* Chat stamps will automatically be added to your stamp list when they are received from your present box.\nGo to Notice List"
