    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Christmas Selection 2024 Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed per 11 Orders!\nShop\n2024-12-16 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nOne ★4 Skill Record from the Christmas Orders up until 2023 is guaranteed per 11 Orders!\nThe \"\nChristmas Selection 2024 Order\n\" is on now!\n- Duration\nDecember 16, 2024 (Mon) 17:00 - December 25, 2024 (Wed) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Offers\n1 Order for 250 Arcana Gems\n11 Order for 2,500 Arcana Gems\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[A Feast of Meat & Cake] Kirito\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nEarth Turbine Burst\nSkill Name\nEarth Turbine\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n32\nElement\nBlunt/\nEarth\nElement\nBlunt/\nEarth\nActivation Requirements\nEarth\n→\nEarth\n→Blunt→(\nWind\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n42\nSwitch Gauge\n42\nBreak Gauge\n34\nBreak Gauge\n68\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n1360% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Earth Force 4/Buff] Earth element damage +15% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n3810% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Earth Force 5/Buff(PT)] Earth element damage +20% for you and your party for 15 sec.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP32)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[Before the Sun Comes Up] Leafa\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nMoon Smash\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nBlunt/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n40\nBreak Gauge\n40\nSkill Effect\n1820% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Small]/[Gust 4/Buff]When equipping 2 or more of Agil's Skill Records in the same set, attack +45% for 5 sec./[Sky Talisman 4/Buff] Thrust element damage -80% to enemies for 15 sec./[Human Talisman 4/Buff] Slash element damage -80% to enemies for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nFury\n[When Rush Activates] Own max HP 20% recovers.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Beaming Stars & Smiles] Sanya\nSkill Name\nSuper Enhance Heal/Play it by Ear\nAttack\n52\nDefense\n44\nHP\n2575\nSkill Effect\n[Super Enhance Heal] Effect of healing items and field objects +100%./[Play it by Ear 5] Attack +25% when HP is above 50%, and defense +15% when HP is under 50%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Ability\nFor each piece of equipment in the same set, the number of activations in additional Full Burst state increases by 1 (1 activation per skill)\nStock Type: Resets remaining time for Full Burst skill activation, and extends duration of Full Burst state (+10 sec per 1 equipment)\nChain Type: Increases burst skill damage used in Full Burst state (+5% per 1 equipment)\n*Burst activated Sword Skills during Full Burst state will activate normally until Full Burst State ends.\n★4[Under the Winter Sky] Yuuki\nSkill Name\nTraining Results/Bloody Blow\nAttack\n48\nDefense\n40\nHP\n2650\nSkill Effect\n[Training Results 4] Critical damage increases by your own level × 0.14% (max 28%)/[Bloody Blow 4] Attack +24% against bleeding enemies.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Snowy Sky Present] Alice\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nDiamond Thrust\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n84\nBreak Gauge\n22\nSkill Effect\n1190% damage (3x hit/All Foes)[Front/Long/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using water skills./[Bonus] When equipping 1 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +500.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Hasty Winter General] Eugeo\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nHatchet Diamond\nSP Cost\n22\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n44\nBreak Gauge\n99\nSkill Effect\n1320% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using water skills./[Bonus] When equipping 1 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +500.\n* Increase in break gauge amount.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Holy Night with You] Koharu\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nExtreme Gift\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nThrust/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n80\nBreak Gauge\n19\nSkill Effect\n1000% damage (10x hit/All Foes)[Front/Cone/Wide]/▲[Bonus] When increased critical rate buff is effective for yourself, Critical rate +50%./[Bonus] When increased critical damage buff is effective for yourself, Deal 5000 additional damage./[Holy Element Weak 3/Debuff] Holy element damage to monster +15% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nLightning Flash\n[During Rush] Critical rate +20%.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Lovely Custom Cake] Lisbeth\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nNicholas Fissure\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nBlunt/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n13.0\nSwitch Gauge\n70\nBreak Gauge\n22\nSkill Effect\n900% damage (All Foes)[Center/Arc/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Additional damage to enemy of 30% own current HP while your own buff is in effect.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[White Noel] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nSnow Shower\nSP Cost\n22\nElement\nThrust/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n8.0\nSwitch Gauge\n55\nBreak Gauge\n24\nSkill Effect\n800% damage (5x hit/All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Water Element Weak 4/Debuff] Water element damage to monster +25% for 10 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Holy Present] Sinon\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nSnowman Needle\nSP Cost\n22\nElement\nThrust/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n8.0\nSwitch Gauge\n57\nBreak Gauge\n29\nSkill Effect\n800% damage (3x hit/All Foes)[Front/Cone/Wide]/[Frostbite/Status Ailments] It will Frostbite (Stack 3) at specific rate for 30 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Important\nCheck the in-game Order details for more information on the entire lineup and the drop rates.\nPlease be aware that the period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
