    "snippet": "¡Campaña navideña! La \"Gran Orden\" ya está aquí, y ★4 Skill Records son parte de esta alineación, ¡incluidos los Skill Records de cumpleaños!  ¡En el Paso 1, puedes obtener 11 pedidos por 1250 gemas arcanas! ¡En todos los Pasos, la tasa total de obtención de ★4 Registros de Habilidad es del 8,0%! Además, en el Paso 3, se garantiza un Registro de Habilidad ★4...",
    "full_details": "Notices\n[Holiday Campaign] \"Grand Order\" is here! ★4 birthday Skill Records are part of this lineup!\nShop\n2024-12-05 20:00:01\n（JST/GMT+9）\nHoliday Campaign!\nThe \"\nGrand Order\n\" is here, and ★4 Skill Records are part of this lineup, including birthday Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn all Steps, the\ntotal drop rate for ★4 Skill Records is 8.0%\n!\nAdditionally, on Step 3,\none ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed\n!\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Ice Sniper] Sinon\nSkill Name\nIcy Blade/Marksmanship/Encircle Break/Pierce\nAttack\n54\nDefense\n36\nHP\n2725\nSkill Effect\n[Icy Blade 4] Deals +20% Water element's damage to enemy./[Marksmanship 3] When equipping 2 or more of Sinon's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +20%./[Encircle Break 3] Increase in break gauge to enemy by +27.5%.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Pierce 3] Damage done to enemies weak to thrusting +25%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nExtra effect time 7.5 sec.\nLimit Break extends Accele Skill effect time.\n* Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[To the Castle in the Sky] Leafa\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nFlame Scar\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n10.0\nSwitch Gauge\n33\nBreak Gauge\n33\nSkill Effect\n1780% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Flame Pile/Buff] Fire element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Blaze Demon 3/Buff] When equipping 4 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, fire element damage +45% for 8 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nStack Boost\n[When Rush Activates] Raises 10 stacks for all Stack buffs that are on yourself.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[The City Waiting for Us] Koharu\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nHoly Riot Burst\nSkill Name\nHoly Riot\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nThrust/\nHoly\nElement\nThrust/\nHoly\nActivation Requirements\nHoly\n→Thrust→\nHoly\n→\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSwitch Gauge\n48\nSwitch Gauge\n48\nBreak Gauge\n30\nBreak Gauge\n60\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n1760% damage (6x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Weakness Attack 4/Buff] Critical damage +20% for 15 sec./[Peak Descent 3/Buff/Debuff] When hitting with this skill while using switch, own critical rate and critical damage rises 2% per stack for 20 sec (Stack 9).Triggers a debuff that raises the damage you take by 0.5% per stack (Stack 9).\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4850% damage (6x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Bonus] Attack +2000 against enemies with the slash element./[Bonus] While debuff to raise your own damage taken is effective, attack power will increase 100%.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Integrity Knight's Will] Alice\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nFlame Shudder\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n76\nBreak Gauge\n116\nSkill Effect\n1580% damage (Single Foe)[Center/Arc/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using fire skills./[Bonus] When equipping 4 or more of Alice's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1200.\n*Increase in break gauge amount.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Lightning Sword Flash] Yuuki\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nMother's Rosary\nSkill Name\nMother's Rosary\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n35\nElement\nSlash\nElement\nSlash\nActivation Requirements\nDark\n→Slash→Slash→(\nHoly\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n18.0\nSkill Cool Time\n36.0\nSwitch Gauge\n66\nSwitch Gauge\n66\nBreak Gauge\n49\nBreak Gauge\n98\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n2290% damage (11x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Enhance Defense 4/Buff] Defense +15% for 15 sec./[Dyna Pile/Buff] Non-elemental damage +0.5% per stack (Stack 5) for 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n5510% damage (11x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Bonus] Your own attack increases by defense x 2./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Asuna's Skill Records in the same set, non-elemental damage +100%.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP35)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[Death-Destroying Blade] Yui\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nDark Shear Burst\nSkill Name\nDark Shear\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nSlash/\nDark\nElement\nSlash/\nDark\nActivation Requirements\nDark\n→\nDark\n→Slash→(\nEarth\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n45\nSwitch Gauge\n45\nBreak Gauge\n39\nBreak Gauge\n78\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n1920% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Center/Arc/Mid]/[Enhance Defense 4/Buff] Defense +15% for 15 sec./[Dark Element Enhance4/Buff] Dark element damage +9% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4500% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Center/Arc/Mid]/[Bonus] Your own attack increases by defense x 2./[Bonus] Critical damage +100% towards enemies on break.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n- Duration\nAfter the December 5, 2024 (Thu) maintenance - December 14, 2024 (Sat) 16:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n11 Order for 1,250 Arcana Gems\n8.0% total Drop Rate for ★4 Skill Records!\nSTEP2\n11 Order for 2,500 Arcana Gems\n8.0% total Drop Rate for ★4 Skill Records!\nSTEP3\n11 Order for 2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n8.0% total Drop Rate for ★4 Skill Records!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
