    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Arcana Gem Super Boost Campaign\" is here! Get up to 2,000 extra Arcana Gems!\nCampaign\n2024-12-05 20:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\n\"\nArcana Gem Super Boost Campaign\n\" begins!\nDon't pass up this chance to get\ntons of\nextra Arcana Gems!\n-Campaign Duration\nStarts after the December 5, 2024 (Thu) maintenance and ends before the December 11, 2024 (Wed) maintenance.\n-Campaign Contents\nProduct Name\nArcana Gems\nArcana Gem A\nTotal: 60\nArcana Gem B\nTotal: 300\nArcana Gem C\nTotal: 680\nArcana Gem D\nTotal: 1,500\n(1,280\n+220 extra Gems\n)\nArcana Gem E\nTotal: 2,700\nArcana Gem F\nTotal: 5,000\n（4,200\n+800 extra Gems\n）\nArcana Gem G\nTotal: 10,800\n（8,800\n+2,000 extra Gems\n）\n-Important\nExtra Arcana Gems are only available once per bundle.\nGo to Notice List"
