    "full_details": "Notices\n[Holiday Campaign] \"Silica's Heapin' 40M EXP Event\" on now!\nEVENT\n2024-11-29 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nHoliday Campaign!\nYou can earn tons of EXP in the special quest on now!\nAccept the quest, move to the designated map, and clear it by defeating the monsters to claim your rewards.\nPlus, the difficulty increases as you progress through the quest.\nRewards\nGet a total of 40 million EXP from quest rewards!\nAim to clear all the quests!\nHow to Participate\nTalk to the \"Silica\" in the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to accept the quest.\nEvent Period\nStarts after the November 29, 2024 (Fri) maintenance and ends before the December 31, 2024 (Tue) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete Main quest [The Indomitable Fang]\nQuest Rewards\nRelease Dates\nRelease Quest\nRewards\nAmount\nRelease condition\nStarts after the November 29 Maintenance\nHeapin' 40M EXP Event 1\nEXP\n200,000\nー\nRevive Crystal\n10\nRestorative Potion\n30\nCleansing Potion\n30\nNovember 30 14:00 - (JST/UTC+9)\nHeapin' 40M EXP Event 2\nEXP\n400,000\nClear the 2F Main Quest through the end.\nRevive Crystal\n10\nRestorative Potion\n30\nCleansing Potion\n30\nDecember 1 14:00 - (JST/UTC+9)\nHeapin' 40M EXP Event 3\nEXP\n1,000,000\nClear the 3F Main Quest through the end.\nRevive Crystal\n10\nRestorative Potion\n30\nCleansing Potion\n30\nDecember 2 14:00 - (JST/UTC+9)\nHeapin' 40M EXP Event 4\nEXP\n1,600,000\nClear the 4F Main Quest through the end.\nRevive Crystal\n10\nRestorative Potion\n30\nCleansing Potion\n30\nDecember 3 14:00 - (JST/UTC+9)\nHeapin' 40M EXP Event 5\nEXP\n2,400,000\nClear the 5F Main Quest through the end.\nRevive Crystal\n10\nRestorative Potion\n30\nCleansing Potion\n30\nDecember 4 14:00 - (JST/UTC+9)\nHeapin' 40M EXP Event 6\nEXP\n3,600,000\nClear the 6F Main Quest through the end.\nRevive Crystal\n10\nRestorative Potion\n30\nCleansing Potion\n30\nDecember 5 14:00 - (JST/UTC+9)\nHeapin' 40M EXP Event 7\nEXP\n4,800,000\nClear the 7F Main Quest through the end.\nRevive Crystal\n10\nRestorative Potion\n30\nCleansing Potion\n30\nDecember 6 14:00 - (JST/UTC+9)\nHeapin' 40M EXP Event 8\nEXP\n6,000,000\nClear the 8F Main Quest through the end.\nRevive Crystal\n10\nRestorative Potion\n30\nCleansing Potion\n30\nDecember 7 14:00 - (JST/UTC+9)\nHeapin' 40M EXP Event 9\nEXP\n8,000,000\nClear the 9F Main Quest through the end.\nRevive Crystal\n10\nRestorative Potion\n30\nCleansing Potion\n30\nDecember 8 14:00 - (JST/UTC+9)\nHeapin' 40M EXP Event 10\nEXP\n12,000,000\nClear the 10F Main Quest through the end.\nRevive Crystal\n10\nRestorative Potion\n30\nCleansing Potion\n30\nImportant\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
