    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Job Selection Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed per 11 Orders!\nShop\n2024-11-23 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nOne job-themed ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed per 11 Orders!\nThe \"\nJob Selection Order\n\" is here!\n- Duration\nNovember 23, 2024 (Sat) 0:00 - December 2, 2024 (Mon) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Offers\n1 Order for 250 Arcana Gems\n11 Order for 2,500 Arcana Gems\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Messenger of Peace] Yuna\nSkill Name\nEnhance Slash/Enhance Attack/Tailwind\nAttack\n53\nDefense\n42\nHP\n2575\nSkill Effect\n[Enhance Slash 3] Damage done to enemies weak to slashing +15%./[Enhance Attack 3] Attack +12%./[Tailwind 4] Switch gauge amount +15%, when equipping no Yui Skill Records in the same set.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Ability\nFor each piece of equipment in the same set, the number of activations in additional Full Burst state increases by 1 (1 activation per skill)\nStock Type: Resets remaining time for Full Burst skill activation, and extends duration of Full Burst state (+10 sec per 1 equipment)\nChain Type: Increases burst skill damage used in Full Burst state (+5% per 1 equipment)\n*Burst activated Sword Skills during Full Burst state will activate normally until Full Burst State ends.\n★4[Supporter from the Shadows] Sinon\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nVigor Shadow\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n51\nBreak Gauge\n32\nSkill Effect\n- Charging -\n1560% damage (All Foes)[Front/Cone/Wide]/[Hunter's Eye 4/Buff] The lower you HP, critical rate increases for 15 sec./[Adversity 4/Buff] The lower your own HP, critical damage increases for 15 sec.\n- Uncharged -\n970% damage (All Foes)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Risk Taker 4/Buff] The lower your own HP, attack increases for 20 sec. (Stack 3)\n* Gauge value is when charging\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Eliminating Danger] Alice\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nSplash Wave\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n42\nBreak Gauge\n38\nSkill Effect\n1330% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Splashing Water Demon 3/Buff] Water element damage +45% for 8 sec./[Frostbite/Status Ailments] When the target is hit using the Switch, make it Frostbite (Stack 5) for 30 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Uplifting Banner] Agil\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nWater Smash\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n40\nBreak Gauge\n40\nSkill Effect\n1550% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Small]/▲▲[Bonus] Attack + 50% in proportion with your remaining HP (the more remaining HP, the higher)./[Bonus] When equipping 3 or more of Agil's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1200.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Flower Arrangement] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nWater Thrust\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n37\nBreak Gauge\n23\nSkill Effect\n630% damage (All Foes)[Front/Cone/Wide]/▲▲▲[Bonus] Attack +2000 against enemies with the slash element./[Bonus] 90% increase with critical damage.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[The Truth in Her Eyes] Sachi\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nCrag Down\nSP Cost\n22\nElement\nThrust/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n13.0\nSwitch Gauge\n40\nBreak Gauge\n40\nSkill Effect\n1360% damage (All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Bleed Boost 4/Debuff] Lowers enemy's bleed resistance 50% for 30 sec (easier to inflict Bleed) and bleed damage +100%./▲[Bonus] Attack +25% against bleeding enemies.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nPincer Attack\n[During Rush] Damage +15% when using switch.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n- Important\nCheck the in-game Order details for more information on the entire lineup and the drop rates.\nPlease be aware that the period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
