    "full_details": "Notices\n[Aincrad Conquest Anniversary] ★4 Silica Guaranteed Free Once Order is here!\nShop\n2024-11-13 04:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nAincrad Conquest Anniversary!\nSeven days straight of free Once Orders! One ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\nDifferent free Orders will be available daily: Kirito, Klein, Argo, Agil, Asuna, Lisbeth, and Silica!\nEvent period for various Orders\nOrder\nPeriod\n★4 Kirito Guaranteed Free Once Order\nNovember 7, 2024 (Thu) 14:55 - November 8, 2024 (Fri) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n★4 Klein Guaranteed Free Once Order\nNovember 8, 2024 (Fri) 4:00 - November 9, 2024 (Sat) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n★4 Argo Guaranteed Free Once Order\nNovember 9, 2024 (Sat) 4:00 - November 10, 2024 (Sun) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n★4 Agil Guaranteed Free Once Order\nNovember 10, 2024 (Sun) 4:00 - November 11, 2024 (Mon) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n★4 Asuna Guaranteed Free Once Order\nNovember 11, 2024 (Mon) 4:00 - November 12, 2024 (Tue) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n★4 Lisbeth Guaranteed Free Once Order\nNovember 12, 2024 (Tue) 4:00 - November 13, 2024 (Wed) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n★4 Silica Guaranteed Free Once Order\nNovember 13, 2024 (Wed) 4:00 - November 14, 2024 (Thu) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n* Players can take advantage of these offers once per period.\nIntroducing the\n★4 Silica Guaranteed Free Once Order\n!\n- Period\nNovember 13, 2024 (Wed) 4:00 - November 14, 2024 (Thu) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Fresh Idol] Silica\nSkill Name\nPure Voice/ Killer Smile\nAttack\n50\nDefense\n46\nHP\n1600\nSkill Effect\n[Pure Voice] Critical damage +20% when your own HP is above 75%.[Killer Smile] ATK +20% to enemy that has their weakness found.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nStack Boost\n[When Rush Activates] Raises 10 stacks for all Stack buffs that are on yourself.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Whirlwind Girl] Silica\nSkill Name\nSpecial Training Results/Weakness Attack\nAttack\n47\nDefense\n46\nHP\n2500\nSkill Effect\n[Special Training Results 4] Critical rate increases by your own level×0.28%. (max 56%)/[Weakness Attack 3] Critical damage +15%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Solid Growth] Silica\nSkill Name\nEnhance Sleep Res./Power Rise/High Battle Healing\nAttack\n53\nDefense\n38\nHP\n2725\nSkill Effect\n●[Enhance Sleep Res. 4] Sleep resistance +60%./[Power Rise 3] Attack +800./[High Battle Healing 3] Recovers a max of 1.2% HP per 3 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nExtra effect time7.5sec.\nLimit Break extends Accele Skill effect time.\n* Maximum Breakthrough\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nPlease be aware that the period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
