    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(11/13)\nMAINT.\n2024-11-12 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 11/13, 2024, 13:00, was completed on 11/13, 2024, 17:00(JST/UTC+9).\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Season 53 begins\n\"Mother's Rosary\" is back\nAdded \"Fatal Scythe Hunt\" Event rewards\n\"Multiple Rounds: 2x Experience Character Quest Campaign\" begins\n\"Chaos Showdown\" update\n\"Tonight's Storyteller Order\" begins\n\"Arcana Gem Super Boost Campaign\" begins\n▼Added Features & Feature Adjustments\nAdjusted the text of some Records\n▼Fixed Issues\nFixed an issue where the performance during [Battle of Life and Death] Kirito's Full Burst did not display properly\nFixed the mini map for Underground Labyrinth B5F\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼Official Live Stream Rewards\nAs a reward for the correct answers to the quiz portion of the official live stream on 11/6, 2024, 400 Arcana Gems have been sent to all players.\nReceive by: Until 11/20, 2024 23:59(JST/UTC+9)\n▼New Events\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n11/13, 2024 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Season 53 begins\n\"Mother's Rosary\" is back\nAdded \"Fatal Scythe Hunt\" Event rewards\n\"Multiple Rounds: 2x Experience Character Quest Campaign\" begins\n\"Chaos Showdown\" update\nNew Order begins\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 11/13 Maintenance\n\"Illuminating Banner Order\"\n\"Aria of a Starless Night IF\"\n\"IF Halloween Party Trick or Treasure!\"\n\"VS Heathcliff\"\n\"Battle in Edge of Hell's Abyss\"\n\"Ruby Palace Celebration\"\n\"Armament Stone Increased Drop Rate Dungeon\"\n\"Chaos Crystal Increased Drop Rate Dungeon\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
