    "full_details": "Notices\n[Aincrad Conquest Anniversary] The Chaos Crystal Increased Drop Rate Dungeon is on now!\nEVENT\n2024-11-07 14:55:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nAincrad Conquest Anniversary!\nA limited-time special dungeon is here! The \"\nChaos Crystal Increased Drop Rate Dungeon\n\" is on now!\nYou can take on this special dungeon with increased drop rates for materials required to produce the \"Dark Black Series\" up to Equippable Lv.: 155.\n* The number of items that can drop at once has been increased.\nThis is a good opportunity to get any you haven't managed to obtain yet.\nDungeon<\nDifficulty\nBoss Name\nObtainable Chaos Crystals\nConquest Anniversary Chaos Showdown 90\nDark Black King\nDark Black Thunder Bull\nDark Black Spirit Tree\nCrimson Chaos Crystal\nConquest Anniversary Chaos Showdown 95\nDark Black Sea Horse\nDark Black False Statue\nDark Black Beast\nAmber Chaos Crystal\nConquest Anniversary Chaos Showdown 110\nDark Black Colossal\nDark Black Frozen Evil\nDark Black Evil Spirit\nTopaz Chaos Crystal\nConquest Anniversary Chaos Showdown 135\nDark Black Snake Samurai\nDark Black Griffin\nDark Black Sturdy Crab\nEmerald Chaos Crystal\nConquest Anniversary Chaos Showdown 155\nDark Black Blazing\nDark Black Half Beast\nDark Black One-Eyed Beast\nSapphire Chaos Crystal\n* All applicable dungeons can be attempted with a party.\n* Event Dungeons also have an increased drop rate for Crystal Shards.\n* Lind in the Teleport Gate Plaza will also take you to each Dungeon.\nCampaign Duration\nNovember 7, 2024 (Thu) 14:55 - Before the November 13, 2024 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete the 10F Main Quest\nImportant\nThis is an event dungeon, so the way it works and rewards are different from Dungeons of the same level.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
