    "snippet": "¡Aniversario de la Conquista de Aincrad! ¡Lucha en una batalla uno contra uno contra Heathcliff! ¡El \"Aniversario de la Conquista de Aincrad VS Heathcliff\" ya está aquí! ¡Obtén medallas de artes de combate si eres capaz de lograr una victoria contra Heathcliff! Si también puedes ganar en el Serious Match con una potencia total recomendada de 600.000, podrás...",
    "full_details": "Notices\n[Aincrad Conquest Anniversary] Show your skills in a one-on-one battle against Heathcliff! \"Aincrad Conquest Anniversary VS Heathcliff\" is here!\nEVENT\n2024-11-07 14:55:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nAincrad Conquest Anniversary!\nFight a one-on-one battle against Heathcliff! \"\nAincrad Conquest Anniversary VS Heathcliff\n\" is here!\nGet Medals of Combat Arts if you're able to pull off a win against Heathcliff!\nIf you can also win in the Serious Match with a Recommended Total Power of 600,000, you'll receive the \"\nSurpasser of the Holy Sword\n\" record that proves your victory!\nParticipation Requirements\nRegular Dungeon: Complete the 74F Main Quest\nSerious Match: Complete the 75F Main Quest\nHow to Participate\nTalk to \"Heathcliff\" at the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to challenge the dungeon.\nEvent Period\nNovember 7, 2024 (Thu) 14:55 - Before the November 13, 2024 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nRewards\nYou can get a total of up to 20 Medals of Combat Arts during this event, with a total of 10 from the regular dungeon and 10 from your first completion of the Serious Match.\nThe \"Surpasser of the Holy Sword\" record reward can be acquired through the Serious Match's challenge rewards.\nHeathcliff\nImportant\nPlease check all Rewards in the game.\nThe dungeon daily clear will update at 4:00 AM (JST/UTC+9).\nThis event will be a solo dungeon.\nKoharu will not join.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
