    "snippet": "¡The Raising Dungeon está aquí para ayudar a impulsar el crecimiento del personaje! ¡\"Happy Dungeon with Sanya\" ya está aquí! ¡Consigue el sello y las Gemas Arcanas para celebrar el cumpleaños de este personaje!  Recompensas Arcana Gems y sellos Sanya y Rain de edición limitada están disponibles como recompensas. Despeja la mazmorra todos los días durante la e...",
    "full_details": "Notices\n【Raising Dungeon】\"Happy Dungeon with Sanya\" is here! Get Sanya & Rain stamps and Arcana Gems!\nEVENT\n2024-10-25 04:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe Raising Dungeon is here to help boost character growth!\n\"Happy Dungeon with Sanya\" is here! Get the stamp and Arcana Gems in celebration of this character's birthday!\nRewards\nArcana Gems and\nlimited-edition Sanya and Rain stamps\nare available as rewards.\nClear the dungeon every day during the event to get up to 500\n\"Arcana Gems\"\n.\nPeriod\nOctober 25, 2024 (Fri) 4:00 - November 1, 2024 (Fri) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete Main quest [The Indomitable Fang]\nMemory Stamp\nStamp Name\nStamp Displayed\nHave a gift!\nDressing Up Cute\nMonster\nCrabby Mimic/Hard Mimic\nDetails(All ｍimic are common)\nWatch out for its scratches and bites.\nWeakness(All ｍimic are common)\nBlunt Element\nScore Rewards\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n50\nArcana Gem\n50\n100\nMemory Stamp 299\nUse to obtain the \"Dressing Up Cute\" stamp.\n1\n200\nArcana Gem\n50\n300\nArcana Gem\n50\n400\nArcana Gem\n100\n500\nArcana Gem\n50\n600\nArcana Gem\n50\n700\nArcana Gem\n50\nChallenge Rewards\nChallenge Name\nReward\nAmount\nDefeat all enemies\nMemory Stamp 300\nUse to obtain the \"Have a gift!\" stamp.\n1\nCompleted without any tumble\nArcana Gem\n50\nCompleted within 1 minutes\nArcana Gem\n50\nImportant\nCleared dungeons will be reset the following day at 4:00am (JST/UTC+9) and can be re-attempted after that.\nThis is a solo event that you can challenge with Sanya as your partner.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
