    "full_details": "Notices\nAvailable trade limit for \"Medal of Combat Arts Trader\" resets on 11/1, 2024!\nNOTICES\n2024-10-24 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\"\nThe available trade limit for the Medal of Combat Arts Trader will reset on 11/1, 2024 at 4:00 (JST/UTC+9).\nCollect \"Medals of Combat Arts\" and get a variety of items at the Trader!\nWe've prepared \"Core Metals\", \"Armament Stones\", and \"Release Crystals\" that are needed to acquire proficiency skills!\nAbout Medal of Combat Arts.\nParticipate in the events and gather Medal of Combat Arts!\nYou can get some Medals of Combat Arts from different in-game events.\n\"Medal of Combat Arts\" Trader\nFind the Trader by going to Menu → Items → Enhance/Trade → Trade Limited Items and tapping the Trade Medal of Combat Arts banner.\nYou can also check by going to NPC Trader → Trade Limited Items and tapping the Trade Medal of Combat Arts banner.\nMerchant District/NPC\"Trader\"\nMedal of Combat Arts Trader Lineup\n* The trade limit will reset on the 1st of every month at 4:00 (JST/UTC+9).\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nPermanent Lineup\nCore Metal\n100\n2\nSticky Thing Armament Stone\n50\n1\nCrossgigas Armament Stone\n47\n1\nAsura Armament Stone\n44\n1\nOne-Eyed Beast Armament Stone\n36\n1\nHalf Beast Armament Stone\n33\n1\nBlazing Armament Stone\n30\n1\nAmber Chaos Crystal\n40\n1\nCrimson Chaos Crystal\n30\n1\nRelease Crystal (L)\n5\n20\nRelease Crystal (M)×2\n1\n50\nMartial Arts Text×5\n1\n20\nAwakening Star×5\n3\n10\nGreat Red Jewel\n3\n5\nGreat Green Jewel\n3\n5\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n3\n5\nGreat Blue Jewel\n3\n5\nExp Crystal L\n3\n1\nExp Crystal M×5\n2\n1\nMemoria Niter L\n50\n1\nMemoria Niter M×10\n50\n1\nMemoria Niter S×20\n50\n1\nRevive Crystal×3\n1\n20\nLimited-Time Only Lineup\n★4[Humorous Principal] Kibaou\n50\n1\n★4[Goddess of Mayhem] Lisbeth\n47\n1\n★3[Pure Heart?] Kibaou\n26\n1\n★4[Phantom Thief] ???\n44\n1\nPastel Candy Top\n20\n1\nColorful Candy Top\n20\n1\nPastel Candy Bottoms\n9\n1\nColorful Candy Bottoms\n9\n1\nPastel Candy Hat\n1\n1\nColorful Candy Pin\n1\n1\nPastel Candy Cape\n1\n1\nColorful Candy Bow\n1\n1\n★4[Candy Macer] Kirito\n44\n1\nObsidian Appearance\n14\n1\nCrimson Appearance\n14\n1\nObsidian Earring\n1\n1\nCrimson Headdress\n1\n1\nCelest Style\n14\n1\nAqua Marine Style\n14\n1\nCelest Corsage\n1\n1\nAqua Marine Hat\n1\n1\nLucky Magical Top\n26\n1\nHappy Magical Top\n26\n1\nLucky Magical Bottoms\n15\n1\nHappy Magical Bottoms\n15\n1\nLucky Magical Mask (Left)\n7\n1\nLucky Magical Mask (Right)\n7\n1\nHappy Magical Mask (Left)\n7\n1\nHappy Magical Mask (Right)\n7\n1\nLucky Magical Patch\n3\n1\nHappy Magical Patch\n3\n1\n★4[Yellow-green Magic Girl] Leafa\n44\n1\n★4[Shining Magic] Sachi\n44\n1\nAvatar Images\nImportant\nThere are some limited-time items in the Medal of Combat Arts Trader that will update once every 3 months.\nThe next lineup update is planned for 1/1, 2025 (Wed) 4:00 (JST/UTC+9).\nDepending on the event, \"Medals of Combat Arts\" may not be available as a reward.\nThe schedule and lineup may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
