    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Kirito & Asuna's Wedding Anniversary Order\" is here! On Step 5, one new ★4 Kirito or Asuna Skill Record is guaranteed!\nShop\n2024-10-23 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nIn celebration of Kirito and Asuna's wedding anniversary, new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Vow of the Flower Garden] Kirito\n(Accele Skill)\" and \"\n[Blessing of Flowers] Asuna\n(Full Burst Skill)\" are here!\n\"\nKirito & Asuna's Wedding Anniversary Order\n\" is on!\nThis order features ★4 Kirito, Asuna, and Yui Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3,\none ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed!\nOn Step 4 and Step 5, the total drop rate is increased to 2.0% for the featured Skill Records!\nPlus, on Step 5, one new ★4 Kirito or Asuna Skill Record is guaranteed!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Vow of the Flower Garden] Kirito\nSkill Name\nHeat Accumulation/Super Enhance Heal/Golden Opportunity\nAttack\n54\nDefense\n38\nHP\n2650\nSkill Effect\n[Heat Accumulation 4] Fire element's damage rises by the number of Asuna Skill Records in the same set x 12.5%./[Super Enhance Heal] Effect of healing items and field objects +100%.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Golden Opprtunity 4] Critical damage +50%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nExtra effect time7.5sec.\nLimit Break extends Accele Skill effect time.\n* Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Blessing of Flowers] Asuna\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nHeatron Burst\nSkill Name\nHeatron\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nThrust/\nFire\nElement\nThrust/\nFire\nActivation Requirements\nFire\n→\nFire\n→Thrust→(\nFire\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSwitch Gauge\n45\nSwitch Gauge\n45\nBreak Gauge\n54\nBreak Gauge\n108\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n1520% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Fire Element Enhance4/Buff] Fire element damage +9% for 15 sec./[Weakness Attack 3/Buff] Critical damage +10% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4260% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Bonus] Attack +2000 against enemies with the slash element./[Bonus] Critical rate +1000%./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, fire element damage +100%.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n- Duration\nOctober 23, 2024 (Wed) 0:00 - October 31, 2024 (Thu) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne new ★4 Kirito or Asuna Skill Record is guaranteed!! 2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
