    "snippet": "¡The Raising Dungeon está aquí para ayudar a impulsar el crecimiento del personaje! ¡Se llevará a cabo el \"Evento de Entrenamiento Intensivo VS Mito\"!  ¡Completa el entrenamiento intensivo con Mito todos los días y obtén medallas de artes de combate! ¡El extremadamente difícil Serious Match, donde puedes luchar contra Mito con todo, ya está en marcha! Lo recomendado...",
    "full_details": "Notices\n【Raising Dungeon】Get Mito's avatar and Medals of Combat Arts! The \"Intensive Training Event VS Mito\" is here!\nEVENT\n2024-10-18 04:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe Raising Dungeon is here to help boost character growth!\nThe \"\nIntensive Training Event VS Mito\n\" will be held!\nClear the intensive training with Mito every day and get Medals of Combat Arts!\nThe extremely difficult\nSerious Match\n, where you can fight Mito going all out, is on now! The recommended Total Power is 250,000!\nThis event is a Raising Dungeon.\nRewards\n\"Medals of Combat Arts\"\nand\nMito's \"Outfit of Twilight\" costume avatar\nare available as rewards!\nThe \"Outfit of Twilight\" is a returning reward. This is your chance to get it if you don't have it yet!\nClear the regular and extremely difficult Serious Match dungeons once a day to get a total of 15 Medals of Combat Arts!\nAvatar\nAvatar Image\nHow to Participate\nTalk to \"Mito\" at the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to challenge the dungeon.\nEvent Period\nOctober 18, 2024 (Fri) 4:00 - November 1, 2024 (Fri) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete Main quest [The Indomitable Fang]\nScore Rewards\nRegular Dungeon\nScore\nRewards\nAmount\n200\nOutfit of Twilight\n1\n400\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n600\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n800\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n1000\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n1200\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n1400\nGlare Dragon Stone\n50\nSerious Match\nScore\nRewards\nAmount\n200\nMedal of Combat Arts\n2\n400\nMedal of Combat Arts\n2\n600\nMedal of Combat Arts\n2\n800\nMedal of Combat Arts\n2\n1000\nMedal of Combat Arts\n2\n1200\nGlare Dragon Stone\n100\n1400\nRecord Frame L\n100\nImportant\nPlease check all Rewards in the game.\nThe dungeon daily clear will update at 4:00 AM (JST/UTC+9).\nThis event will be a solo dungeon.\nKoharu will not join for Serious Matches.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
