    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(10/9)\nMAINT.\n2024-10-08 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 10/9, 2024, 12:00, was completed on 10/9, 2024, 17:30(JST/UTC+9).\nWe will be sending out token of apology for the maintenance.\n50 Arcana Gems\nAvailable until:10/17/2024(Thu) at 23:59(JST/UTC+9)\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\nThe 1st \"Squad Jumble\" begins\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Preseason 52 begins\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to \"Mist Soul Hunt\"\n\"Guild Support Campaign\" begins\n\"SAO Alternative GGO Order\" begins\n\"Arcana Gem Super Boost Campaign\" begins\n▼Added Features & Feature Adjustments\nThe Guild Room will be re-themed for a limited time for fall\n▼Fixed Issues\nFixed an issue where players sometimes became unable to log in after receiving many items from the present box\nFixed an issue where the costumes of some NPCs on 83F were not displayed properly\nFixed the description of the \"Wormy Puppeteer Ingot\"\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼Official Live Stream Rewards\nAs a reward for the correct answers to the quiz portion of the official live stream on 10/7, 2024, 500 Arcana Gems have been sent to all players.\nReceive by: Until 10/17, 2024 23:59(JST/UTC+9)\n▼New Events\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n10/9, 2024 12:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\nThe 1st \"Squad Jumble\" begins\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Preseason 52 begins\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to \"Mist Soul Hunt\"\n\"Guild Support Campaign\" begins\nNew Order begins\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 10/9 Maintenance\n\"Shadowy Hunter Order\"\n[Worldwide 6.5 Year Anniversary] \"Boss Rush VS Taurus King\"\n[Worldwide 6.5 Year Anniversary]\"Ring Production Campaign\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
