    "news_date": 1727967600,
    "news_category": "Shop",
    "snippet": "Para celebrar el cumpleaños de Silica, ¡los nuevos registros de habilidades ★4 \"[Two Whirlwinds] Silica(Accele Skill)\" y \"[Never Apart] Silica(Full Burst Skill)\" ya están disponibles! ¡El \"Pedido de Cumpleaños de Silica\" ya está aquí! ¡Obtenga una sílice ★4 garantizada en el paso 3!  ¡En el Paso 1, puedes obtener 11 pedidos por 1250 gemas arcanas! En Paso...",
    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Silica's Birthday Order\" is here! Featuring new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3! All ★4 Skill Records are Silica!\nShop\n2024-10-04 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Silica's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Two Whirlwinds] Silica\n(Accele Skill)\" and \"\n[Never Apart] Silica\n(Full Burst Skill)\" are now available!\n\"\nSilica's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Silica guaranteed on Step 3!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3, one ★4 \"Silica\" is guaranteed!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Two Whirlwinds] Silica\nSkill Name\nEnhance HP/Flame Boost/Tailwind/Bisect\nAttack\n44\nDefense\n52\nHP\n2875\nSkill Effect\n[Enhance HP 3] Max HP +10%./[Flame Boost 4] Elemental damage other than fire dealt to enemies -50%, and fire element's damage to enemies +40%./[Tailwind 6] Switch gauge amount +15%, when equipping no Yui Skill Records in the same set.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Bisect 4] Damage done to enemies weak to slashing +25%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nExtra effect time7.5sec.\nLimit Break extends Accele Skill effect time.\n* Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Never Apart] Silica\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nFire Loiter Burst\nSkill Name\nFire Loiter\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nActivation Requirements\nFire\n→Slash→\nFire\n→(\nFire\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSwitch Gauge\n48\nSwitch Gauge\n48\nBreak Gauge\n44\nBreak Gauge\n88\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n1470% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Motion Range]/[Weak Slash 4/Debuff] Slash element's weakness damage +25% for 8 sec./[Fire Element Enhance4/Buff] Fire element damage +9% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4090% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Motion Range]/[Bonus] Attack +1500 against enemies with the blunt element./[Bonus] Attack +100% against enemy with status ailments (Poison, Burn, Bleed, Frostbite).\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n- Duration\nOctober 4, 2024 (Fri) 0:00 - October 13, 2024 (Sun) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1,250 Arcana Gems (50% Off)\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nOne ★4 \"Silica\" guaranteed!\nOn every Step, all ★4 Skill Records are \"Silica\"!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
