    "snippet": "Aviso para aquellos usuarios que inicien sesión en \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\". El mantenimiento estará vigente durante las fechas siguientes.  Fechas de mantenimiento programadas 2 de octubre de 2024 13:00 a 17:00 (provisional) (JST/UTC+9) ▼ Se agregan nuevos eventos y recientemente implementados \"Mist Soul Hunt\" [6.5 años de aniversario mundial...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(10/2)\nMAINT.\n2024-10-01 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 10/2, 2024, 13:00, was completed on 10/2, 2024, 17:00(JST/UTC+9).\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Mist Soul Hunt\" begins\nAdded [Worldwide 6.5 Year Anniversary] \"Boss Rush VS Taurus King\" Event rewards\n\"Heapin' 30M EXP Event\" begins\n\"Chaos Showdown\" update\n▼Added Features & Feature Adjustments\nThe Trial Gym is now available to challenge as a party\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\nWe will be sending out token of apology for the 9/25 maintenance.\n100 Arcana Gems\nAvailable until:10/9/2024 at 23:59(JST/UTC+9)\n▼New Events\n▼Added Event rewards\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n10/2, 2024 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Mist Soul Hunt\" begins\nAdded [Worldwide 6.5 Year Anniversary] \"Boss Rush VS Taurus King\" Event rewards\n\"Heapin' 30M EXP Event\" begins\n\"Chaos Showdown\" update\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 10/2 Maintenance\n\"[Returning] Search for the Phantom Mushroom\"\n[Worldwide 6.5 Year Anniversary] \"Chaos Showdown: All Open\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
