    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Paint Out Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2024-09-18 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nEugeo, Lisbeth, Sinon, and Argo are researchers bringing color to the world, here as new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nPaint Out Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3!\nBoosted rates for the featured new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Seven-Color Shooter] Eugeo\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nHoly V Square Burst\nSkill Name\nHoly V Square\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nSlash/\nHoly\nElement\nSlash/\nHoly\nActivation Requirements\nHoly\n→\nHoly\n→Slash→(\nFire\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n52\nSwitch Gauge\n52\nBreak Gauge\n40\nBreak Gauge\n80\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n1650% damage (4x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Enhance Defense 4/Buff] Defense +15% for 15 sec./[Holy Element Enhance4/Buff] Holy element damage +9% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4680% damage (4x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Bonus] Your own attack increases by defense x 2./[Bonus] Critical rate +300% towards enemies on break.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[Dangerous Scheme] Lisbeth\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Enhance Attack/Crude Tactics\nAttack\n50\nDefense\n38\nHP\n2575\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 4] Attack +900./[Enhance Attack 4] Attack +15%./[Crude Tactics 2] Defense -30% and, when HP is under 50%, non-elemental damage -400%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nFury\n[When Rush Activates] Own max HP 20% recovers.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Handle With Caution] Sinon\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nEarth Volt\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n94\nBreak Gauge\n47\nSkill Effect\n2140% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Wide]/[Earth Pile/Buff] Earth element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Poison/Status Ailments] When equipping 4 or more of Koharu's Skill Records in the same set, Poison (Stack 10) will affect the player for 30 sec./[Earth Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Earth element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Risk Taker 4/Buff] The lower your own HP, attack increases for 20 sec. (Stack 9)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect30sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n★4[Colorful Shot] Argo\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nHoly Hash\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n36\nBreak Gauge\n26\nSkill Effect\n1550% damage (4x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲▲▲[Bonus] Damage +100% to enemies when using holy skills./[Bonus] Attack +1500 against enemies with the blunt element.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n\"[Handle With Caution] Sinon\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nStarts after the September 18, 2024 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the October 17, 2024 (Thu) maintenance.\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
