    "snippet": "¡La misión del panel \"Informe de misión de Argo\" se actualizó después del mantenimiento del 28 de agosto de 2024 (miércoles)! ¡Completa misiones dentro de Panel Mission para obtener muchos elementos que te ayudarán a completar aventuras y fortalecer a tus personajes! La misión del panel se mostrará y será accesible después de completar...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Argo's Mission Report\" Panel Mission has been updated!\nUPDATE\n2024-08-28 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe\n\"Argo's Mission Report\"\nPanel Mission has been updated following the August 28, 2024 (Wed) maintenance!\nClear missions inside the Panel Mission to get lots of items that will help you complete adventures and strengthen your characters!\nThe Panel Mission will be displayed and accessible after completing the 1F Main Quest.\nMission Details\nMission\nRewards\nAmount\nClear Aincrad 5F!\nArcana Gems\n500\nBuy any weapon or armor at the Merchant!\nGlare Dragon Stone\nRecord Frame L\n300\n600\nEnhance either a weapon or an armor!\nRefining Hammer\nSlicing Stone\nPiercing Stone\nStriking Stone\nBlocking Stone\nRefining Hammer+\nSlicing Stone+\nPiercing Stone+\nStriking Stone+\nBlocking Stone+\n200\n100\n100\n100\n100\n200\n100\n100\n100\n100\nEnhance either skill records!\nRecord Kit M\nHigh Blue Jewel\nHigh Red Jewel\nHigh Yellow Jewel\nHigh Green Jewel\n250\n50\n50\n50\n50\nEvolve any Skill Record!\nArcana Gems\n250\nReach Lv50 or higher!\nArcana Gems\n250\nCreate a Party!\nEmergency Crystal\nHealing Crystal\n100\n50\nUse Chat or Stamp!\nCol\n200,000\nRegister for transfer!\nRevive Crystal\nCleansing Potion\nRestorative Potion\n25\n50\n100\nComplete Reward\nAmount\n★4[Wise] Asuna\n1\n* Rewards for missions set as \"Pack\" are automatically obtained when the mission is completed.\nImportant\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
