    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(8/21)\nMAINT.\n2024-08-21 16:59:59\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 8/21, 2024, 13:00, was completed on 8/21, 2024, 17:00(JST/UTC+9).\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Season 50 begins\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to \"LafCof Assault\"\n\"Rabbit Fever\" begins\n\"Multiple Rounds: 2x Experience Subquest Campaign\" begins\n\"Chaos Showdown\" update\n▼Added Features & Feature Adjustments\nYou can now get normal equipment at maximum rarity from production\n* Normal equipment is equipment that is primarily purchased at the Merchant.\n* There will be no changes to materials and costs required for production.\nEx: When producing a \"Centurion Sword\", it will be ★3 when you receive it.\nAdded emotes to some NPCs\n* Further adjustments will be made as needed.\nAdded 4 Chat Stamps.\nList of Added Chat Stamps\n▼Fixed Issues\nFixed an issue where the mini-map did not display the proper destination icons when progressing through part of the main quest\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼New Events\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n8/21, 2024 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Season 50 begins\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to \"LafCof Assault\"\n\"Rabbit Fever\" begins\n\"Multiple Rounds: 2x Experience Subquest Campaign\" begins\n\"Chaos Showdown\" update\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 8/21 Maintenance\n\"SAOIF x GGO Collab Illustration Order\"\n\"Free Once Daily 100% Agil Order\"\n\"Agil Summer Festival 2024\"\n\"Guild Battle Challenge VS Executioner\"\n\"Multiple Rounds: 2x Experience Character Quest Campaign\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
