    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"SAOIF x GGO Collab Illustration Order\" is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2024-07-24 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nLLENN from Sword Art Online Alternative: Gun Gale Online joins the fray!\nLLENN, Kirito, and Koharu take to the skies of Aincrad here as new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nSAOIF x GGO Collab Illustration Order\n\" is here! Get one new ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[A World to Dive Into] Kirito\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nSharpened Frost\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n45\nBreak Gauge\n36\nSkill Effect\n1610% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/▲▲▲[Bonus] Damage +100% to enemies when using water skills./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Asuna's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[To the Skies of Freedom] Koharu\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nHydro Cutter Burst\nSkill Name\nHydro Cutter\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nActivation Requirements\nWater\n→Slash→\nWater\n→(\nWater\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSwitch Gauge\n36\nSwitch Gauge\n36\nBreak Gauge\n37\nBreak Gauge\n74\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n1470% damage (Single Foe)[Motion Range]/[Weak Slash 4/Debuff] Slash element's weakness damage +25% for 8 sec./[Water Element Enhance4/Buff] Water element damage +9% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4090% damage (Single Foe)[Motion Range]/[Bonus] Attack +1500 against enemies with the blunt element./[Bonus] Attack +100% against enemy with status ailments (Poison, Burn, Bleed, Frostbite).\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[Fighting Spirit] LLENN\nSkill Name\nAdvance Trooper/Aqua Conversion/Onslaught\nAttack\n59\nDefense\n28\nHP\n2650\nSkill Effect\n[Advance Trooper 5] Attack +500./[Aqua Conversion 5] Fire element's damage to enemies -15% and water element's damage to enemies +30%.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Onslaught 1] Attack +25%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nExtra effect time7.5sec.\nLimit Break extends Accele Skill effect time.\n* Maximum Breakthrough\n- Duration\nStarts after the July 24, 2024 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the August 21, 2024 (Wed) maintenance.\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nThere is no voice production when ★4 \"LLENN\" Skill Records are drawn.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
