    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Guild Support Campaign\" is coming! You can use limited-time Guild Skills!\nCampaign\n2024-07-17 18:30:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nUse limited-time Guild Skills in the Guild Support Campaign.\nIt's a great opportunity to join a guild or recruit new members.\nLimited-Time Guild Skills\nFor a limited-time, use Guild Skills that add Production's Additional Bonus Up or increase EXP gained when defeating a monster!\nGuild Lv Needed\nSkill Name\nSkill Details\nGuild Points Cost\nGuild Lv.1\nLimited Time Only I: Player Exp Up\nExp +50% when monster is defeated.\nIn effect: 30 min\n2000GP\nGuild Lv.1\nLimited Time Only II: Player Exp Up\nExp +75% when monster is defeated.\nIn effect: 1 hour\n4000GP\nGuild Lv.1\nLimited Time Only III: Player Exp Up\nExp +100% when monster is defeated.\nIn effect: 3 hour\n10000GP\nGuild Lv.1\nLimited Time Only I: Item Drop Rate Up\nItem drop rate +20%.\nIn effect: 30 min\n2000GP\nGuild Lv.1\nLimited Time Only II: Item Drop Rate Up\nItem drop rate +25%.\nIn effect: 1 hour\n4000GP\nGuild Lv.1\nLimited Time Only III: Item Drop Rate Up\nItem drop rate +30%.\nIn effect: 3 hours\n10000GP\nGuild Lv.1\nLimited Time Only I: Col Up\nCol +40% when monster is defeated.\nIn effect: 30 min\n2000GP\nGuild Lv.1\nLimited Time Only II: Col Up\nCol +60% when monster is defeated.\nIn effect: 1 hour\n4000GP\nGuild Lv.1\nLimited Time Only III: Col Up\nCol +80% when monster is defeated.\nIn effect: 3 hours\n10000GP\nGuild Lv.1\nLimited Time Only I: Production add Bonus Up\nIncreases the additional bonus rate by 30% for equipment and ring production.\nIn effect: 30 min\n2000GP\nGuild Lv.1\nLimited Time Only II: Production add Bonus Up\nIncreases the additional bonus rate by 40% for equipment and ring production.\nIn effect: 1 hour\n4000GP\nGuild Lv.1\nLimited Time Only III: Production add Bonus Up\nIncreases the additional bonus rate by 50% for equipment and ring production.\nIn effect: 3 hours\n10000GP\n* Guild Skills with the same effect cannot be equipped at the same time.\nCampaign Duration\nStarts after the July 17, 2024 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the July 31, 2024 (Wed) maintenance.\nGuilds\nGuilds can be created and joined through the \"Guild Counter\" NPC.\nYou can gain the benefits of Guild Skills that will help in your journeys, such as increased item drop rates and increased Weapon Proficiency acquisition by joining a guild and increasing its Guild Level.\nThe Guild Raid buff acquirable from Guild Level 16 is useful for taking on Raid Boss Dungeons, Ranking Events, and other guild events.\nPlayers who do not belong to a guild should use this opportunity to join one!\nPlease see below for more details on guilds.\nCreating a Guild\nGuild Skills\nImportant\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
