    "full_details": "Notices\n[SAO Games 10th Anniversary] The \"Memory Defrag World Order\" is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2024-07-10 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nSword Art Online Game Series 10th Anniversary!\nAsuna, Yuuki, Kirito, and Sinon from SWORD ART ONLINE: Memory Defrag are here as new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nMemory Defrag World Order\n\" is here! Get one new ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Heir to the Sword] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nFlame Riposte\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nThrust/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n33\nBreak Gauge\n33\nSkill Effect\n1540% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Parry4/Buff] When this skill direct hits, the damage you receive decreases at 50%(Effect will disappear after 20 sec if not activated).\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nReduces all skill's cool times by 3 → 6 → 9 sec when hitting with skills.\nReduces all skill's cool times by 2 → 4 → 6 sec when hitting with fire skills.\n★4[Together For Eternity] Yuuki\nSkill Name\nSteel Fang/Prosper/Flame Accumulation\nAttack\n58\nDefense\n42\nHP\n2575\nSkill Effect\n[Steel Fang 4] Attack +500 when attacking with thrust element./[Prosper 4] Attack +20% when HP is above 50%./[Flame Accumulation 3] Fire element's damage rises by the number of Asuna Skill Records in the same set x 10%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Strength to Accept the Past] Kirito\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nStorm V Arc\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nSlash/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n26\nBreak Gauge\n34\nSkill Effect\n1510% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Weak Defense 5/Debuff] Enemy defense -100% for 5 sec./[Gale Demon 3/Buff] Wind element damage +45% for 8 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Strength to Change Oneself] Sinon\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nSpark Volt Burst\nSkill Name\nSpark Volt\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nThrust/\nFire\nElement\nThrust/\nFire\nActivation Requirements\nFire\n→\nFire\n→Thrust→(\nEarth\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n47\nSwitch Gauge\n47\nBreak Gauge\n47\nBreak Gauge\n94\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n1550% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Wide]/[Fire Element Enhance4/Buff] Fire element damage +9% for 15 sec./[Enhance Thrust 1/Buff] Damage done to enemies weak to thrust +15% for 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4260% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Wide]/[Bonus] The lower your own HP, attack increases.(max 200%)/[Bonus] Fire element damage increases x 0.5% the number of burn stacks when the player is inflicted with the burn status ailment.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n- Duration\nStarts after the July 10, 2024 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the August 7, 2024 (Wed) maintenance.\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
