    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Temperature of the Heart Order\" is here! Only ★4 Skill Records of Kirito and Lisbeth! One ★4 Kirito or Lisbeth Skill Record Guaranteed!\nShop\n2024-06-24 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nJune 24, 2024 is the day that Kirito first visits Lisbeth's Smith Shop inside of Aincrad!\nTo commemorate this meeting, we will be holding the \"\nTemperature of the Heart Order\n\"!\nAll ★4 Skill Records are\nKirito\nor\nLisbeth\n!\nAdditionally,\none ★4 Kirito or Lisbeth Skill Record is guaranteed!\nYou can also go inside Lisbeth's Smith Shop in-game now. Stop by if you've completed the 48F Main Quest!\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Revealed Feelings] Lisbeth\nSkill Name\nBattle with Ease/Engrave\nAttack\n50\nDefense\n46\nHP\n3025\nSkill Effect\n[Battle with Ease 4] Attack +25% while the buff that gradually recovers HP depending on the Skill Record is in effect./[Engrave] When equipping 3 or more of Lisbeth's Skill Records in the same set and hitting with switch, adds debuff (Mark).(Invalid when equipped by Partner)The next attack the enemy receives will induce double damage.(Applies to other party member's attacks. Effect will disappear after 10 sec if not activated.)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nPincer Attack\n[During Rush] Damage +15% when using switch.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Driving Blow] Lisbeth\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nCrag Blow Burst\nSkill Name\nCrag Blow\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n32\nElement\nBlunt/\nEarth\nElement\nBlunt/\nEarth\nActivation Requirements\nEarth\n→Blunt→\nEarth\n→(\nWind\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n30\nSwitch Gauge\n30\nBreak Gauge\n30\nBreak Gauge\n60\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n1460% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Small Mark/Debuff] The next attack the enemy receives will induce 1.5x damage.(Applies to other party member's attacks. Effect will disappear after 10 sec if not activated.)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4090% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Bonus] Attack +100% against enemies with debuff status (Mark, Small Mark, Death Mark, Thrust Erosion Mark).\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP32)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[The Man at the Lead] Kirito\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nProminence Punishment Burst\nSkill Name\nProminence Punishment\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n32\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nActivation Requirements\nFire\n→Slash→\nFire\n→(\nDark\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n112\nSwitch Gauge\n112\nBreak Gauge\n59\nBreak Gauge\n118\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n1920% damage (8x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Fire Element Enhance4/Buff] Fire element damage +9% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4500% damage (8x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Bonus] Your own attack increases by defense x 2.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP32)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[Strike of Victory] Kirito\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nStorm Punishment Burst\nSkill Name\nStorm Punishment\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nSlash/\nWind\nElement\nSlash/\nWind\nActivation Requirements\nWind\n→\nWind\n→Slash→\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSkill Cool Time\n28.0\nSwitch Gauge\n112\nSwitch Gauge\n112\nBreak Gauge\n59\nBreak Gauge\n118\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n1480% damage (8x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Enhance Defense 4/Buff] Defense +15% for 15 sec./[Wind Element Enhance4/Buff] Wind element damage +9% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4140% damage (8x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Bonus] Your own attack increases by defense x 2./[Bonus] Wind element damage increases x 0.5% the number of bleed stacks when the player is inflicted with the bleed status ailment.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP28)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Duration\nJune 24, 2024 (Mon) 0:00 - Before the July 3, 2024 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9)\n- Offers\n11 Order for 2,500 Arcana Gems\n- Important\nThere is no single Order.\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nIncludes ★2 to ★4 Skill Records.\nPlease be aware that the period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
