    "news_category": "Shop",
    "snippet": "¡Héroes dentro de la tormenta! ¡Sinon, Asuna, Sachi y Silica están aquí como nuevos récords de habilidades ★4! ¡La \"Orden Tormenta\" ya está aquí! ¡Obtén un nuevo récord de habilidad ★4 garantizado en el paso 5! ¡Tarifas mejoradas para nuevos récords de habilidades ★4!  ¡En el Paso 1, puedes obtener 11 pedidos por 1250 gemas arcanas! Se garantiza un récord de habilidad ★4...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Thunderstorm Order\" is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2024-06-19 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nHeroes within the storm! Sinon, Asuna, Sachi, and Silica are here as new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nThunderstorm Order\n\" is here! Get one new ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Rampaging Cannon] Sinon\nSkill Name\nAdvance Trooper/Earth Boost\nAttack\n49\nDefense\n42\nHP\n2875\nSkill Effect\n[Advance Trooper 5] Attack +500./[Earth Boost 4] Elemental damage other than earth dealt to enemies -50%, and earth element's damage to enemies +40%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Ability\nFor each piece of equipment in the same set, the number of activations in additional Full Burst state increases by 1 (1 activation per skill)\nStock Type: Resets remaining time for Full Burst skill activation, and extends duration of Full Burst state (+10 sec per 1 equipment)\nChain Type: Increases burst skill damage used in Full Burst state (+5% per 1 equipment)\n*Burst activated Sword Skills during Full Burst state will activate normally until Full Burst State ends.\n★4[Commander in the Storm] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nSand Brush\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n60\nBreak Gauge\n24\nSkill Effect\n1800% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Blaze 4/Buff] Attack +20 per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Poison/Status Ailments] When equipping 4 or more of Koharu's Skill Records in the same set, Poison (Stack 10) will affect the player for 30 sec./[Blaze 4/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Attack +20 per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n*More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Bonus] Raises 3 stacks for all Stack buffs that are on yourself.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect30sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n★4[Howl of the Heavens] Sachi\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nTerrible Rock Burst\nSkill Name\nTerrible Rock\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nThrust/\nEarth\nElement\nThrust/\nEarth\nActivation Requirements\nEarth\n→Thrust→\nEarth\n→(\nEarth\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSwitch Gauge\n80\nSwitch Gauge\n80\nBreak Gauge\n39\nBreak Gauge\n78\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n1680% damage (8x hit/All Foes)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Earth Element Weak 4/Debuff] Earth element damage to monster +25% for 10 sec./[Earth Force 4/Buff] Earth element damage +15% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4620% damage (8x hit/All Foes)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Earth Dragon Demon 5/Buff] Earth element damage +65% for 8 sec./[Bonus] Attack +2000 against enemies with debuff status.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[Dashing Through the Storm] Silica\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nLava Serpent\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n51\nBreak Gauge\n37\nSkill Effect\n1520% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Motion Range]/[Parry4/Buff] When this skill direct hits, the damage you receive decreases at 50%(Effect will disappear after 20 sec if not activated).\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nIncrease status ailment stacks by 5 → 10 → 15 on enemies.\nIncrease status ailment stacks by 2 → 4 → 6 on enemies when using fire skills.\n- Duration\nStarts after the June 19, 2024 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the July 17, 2024 (Wed) maintenance.\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
