    "snippet": "¡The Raising Dungeon está aquí para ayudar a impulsar el crecimiento del personaje! ¡\"Happy Dungeon with Argo\" ya está aquí! ¡Obtén el sello Argo y las Gemas Arcanas para celebrar el cumpleaños de este personaje!  Las recompensas \"Arcana Gems\" y un sello \"Argo\" de edición limitada están disponibles como recompensas. Despeja la mazmorra todos los días durante la ev...",
    "full_details": "Notices\n【Raising Dungeon】\"Happy Dungeon with Argo\" is here! Get the Argo stamp and Arcana Gems!\nEVENT\n2024-05-31 04:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe Raising Dungeon is here to help boost character growth!\n\"Happy Dungeon with Argo\" is here! Get the Argo stamp and Arcana Gems in celebration of this character's birthday!\nRewards\n\"Arcana Gems\"\nand a\nlimited-edition \"Argo\" stamp\nare available as rewards.\nClear the dungeon every day during the event to\nget up to 500\n\"Arcana Gems\".\nPeriod\nMay 31, 2024 (Fri) 4:00 - June 7, 2024 (Fri) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete Main quest [The Indomitable Fang]\nMemory Stamp\nStamp Name\nStamp Displayed\nPoolside at the Resort\nMonster\nCrabby Mimic/Hard Mimic\nDetails(All ｍimic are common)\nWatch out for its scratches and bites.\nWeakness(All ｍimic are common)\nBlunt Element\nScore Rewards\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n100\nArcana Gem\n50\n200\nArcana Gem\n50\n300\nArcana Gem\n50\n400\nArcana Gem\n100\n500\nArcana Gem\n50\n600\nArcana Gem\n50\n700\nArcana Gem\n50\nChallenge Rewards\nChallenge Name\nReward\nAmount\nDefeat all enemies\nMemory Stamp 285\nUse to obtain the \"Poolside at the Resort\" stamp.\n1\nCompleted without any tumble\nArcana Gem\n50\nCompleted within 1 minutes\nArcana Gem\n50\nImportant\nCleared dungeons will be reset the following day at 4:00am (JST/UTC+9) and can be re-attempted after that.\nThis is a solo event that you can challenge with Argo as your partner.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
