    "snippet": "¡Campaña navideña! ¡Puedes ganar toneladas de EXP en la misión especial ahora!  Acepta la misión, muévete al mapa designado y límpialo derrotando a los monstruos para reclamar tus recompensas. Además, la dificultad aumenta a medida que avanzas en la misión.  Recompensas Obtén un total de 30 millones de EXP de la misión rew...",
    "full_details": "Notices\n[Holiday Campaign] \"Heapin' 30M EXP Event\" on now!\nEVENT\n2024-05-29 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nHoliday Campaign!\nYou can earn tons of EXP in the special quest on now!\nAccept the quest, move to the designated map, and clear it by defeating the monsters to claim your rewards.\nPlus, the difficulty increases as you progress through the quest.\nRewards\nGet a total of 30 million EXP from quest rewards!\nAim to clear all the quests!\nHow to Participate\nTalk to the \"Silica\" in the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to accept the quest.\nEvent Period\nStarts after the May 29, 2024 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the June 12, 2024 (Wed) maintenance.\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete Main quest [The Indomitable Fang]\nQuest Rewards\nRelease Dates\nRelease Quest\nRewards\nAmount\nRelease condition\nStarts after the May 29 Maintenance\nHeapin' 30M EXP Event 1\nEXP\n150,000\nー\nRevive Crystal\n10\nRestorative Potion\n30\nCleansing Potion\n30\nMay 30 14:00 - (JST/UTC+9)\nHeapin' 30M EXP Event 2\nEXP\n300,000\nClear the 2F Main Quest through the end.\nRevive Crystal\n10\nRestorative Potion\n30\nCleansing Potion\n30\nMay 31 14:00 - (JST/UTC+9)\nHeapin' 30M EXP Event 3\nEXP\n750,000\nClear the 3F Main Quest through the end.\nRevive Crystal\n10\nRestorative Potion\n30\nCleansing Potion\n30\nJune 1 14:00 - (JST/UTC+9)\nHeapin' 30M EXP Event 4\nEXP\n1,200,000\nClear the 4F Main Quest through the end.\nRevive Crystal\n10\nRestorative Potion\n30\nCleansing Potion\n30\nJune 2 14:00 - (JST/UTC+9)\nHeapin' 30M EXP Event 5\nEXP\n1,800,000\nClear the 5F Main Quest through the end.\nRevive Crystal\n10\nRestorative Potion\n30\nCleansing Potion\n30\nJune 3 14:00 - (JST/UTC+9)\nHeapin' 30M EXP Event 6\nEXP\n2,700,000\nClear the 6F Main Quest through the end.\nRevive Crystal\n10\nRestorative Potion\n30\nCleansing Potion\n30\nJune 4 14:00 - (JST/UTC+9)\nHeapin' 30M EXP Event 7\nEXP\n3,600,000\nClear the 7F Main Quest through the end.\nRevive Crystal\n10\nRestorative Potion\n30\nCleansing Potion\n30\nJune 5 14:00 - (JST/UTC+9)\nHeapin' 30M EXP Event 8\nEXP\n4,500,000\nClear the 8F Main Quest through the end.\nRevive Crystal\n10\nRestorative Potion\n30\nCleansing Potion\n30\nJune 6 14:00 - (JST/UTC+9)\nHeapin' 30M EXP Event 9\nEXP\n6,000,000\nClear the 9F Main Quest through the end.\nRevive Crystal\n10\nRestorative Potion\n30\nCleansing Potion\n30\nJune 7 14:00 - (JST/UTC+9)\nHeapin' 30M EXP Event 10\nEXP\n9,000,000\nClear the 10F Main Quest through the end.\nRevive Crystal\n10\nRestorative Potion\n30\nCleansing Potion\n30\nImportant\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
    "startTime": "2024-05-28T19:00:00+00:00",
