    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"MOD Step-Up Order\" is here! One ★4 MOD Skill is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2024-05-27 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nAll ★4 Skill Records are \"MOD Skills\"!\nThe \"\nMOD Step-Up Order\n\" is here!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nAdditionally, on Step 3, one\n★4 MOD Skill is guaranteed!\nMore MOD Skill Details Here\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Shining Beach Goddess] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nSand Thorn\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n48\nBreak Gauge\n50\nSkill Effect\n1320% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/▲▲▲[Bonus] Damage +100% to enemies when using earth skills./[Bonus] Attack +1500 against enemies with the slash element.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Discoverer of Rare Ore] Leafa\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nHoly V Arc\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n26\nBreak Gauge\n68\nSkill Effect\n1420% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using holy skills./[Bonus] When equipping 3 or more of Leafa's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1200.\n*Increase in break gauge amount.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Vague Signs] Lisbeth\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nRock Asterisk\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n57\nBreak Gauge\n48\nSkill Effect\n1430% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Motion Range]/▲▲▲[Bonus] Damage +100% to enemies when using earth skills./[Bonus] When equipping 3 or more of Lisbeth's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1200.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n- Duration\nMay 27, 2024 (Mon) 17:00 - June 5, 2024 (Wed) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\nAll ★4 Skill Records are MOD Skill!\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nAll ★4 Skill Records are MOD Skill!\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nAll ★4 Skill Records are MOD Skill!\nOne ★4 MOD Skill guaranteed!!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
