    "news_date": 1716366600,
    "news_category": "EVENT",
    "snippet": "¡Una batalla de defensa para proteger el cristal de los monstruos que siguen apareciendo y del monstruo jefe, el Jabalí Gigante! Puedes obtener EXP que te ayudará a fortalecerte.  Recompensas Intercambia \"Gi. Boar Medal\" en el comerciante por uno de los 4 avatares accesorios \"Boar Head\" de diferentes colores modelados a partir del Bo...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nGet your hands on the returning Boar Head accessory avatar! The Defense Battle \"Attack of the Giant Boar! 2024\" is here!\nEVENT\n2024-05-22 17:30:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nA defense battle to protect the crystal from the monsters that keep appearing and from the boss monster, Giant Boar!\nYou can get EXP that will help you get stronger.\nRewards\nExchange \"Gi. Boar Medal\" at the Trader for one of the 4 different colored \"Boar Head\" accessory avatars modeled after the Boar.\nGet up to 1000\n\"Arcana Gems\"\n, up to 100\n\"Awakening Stars\"\n, up to 20\n\"Medals of Combat Arts\"\n, and up to 200\n\"Memoria Niter S\"\nfrom the event.\nThere's a chance that the monsters that appear will drop \"Release Crystals (S)\" and \"Star Fragments\".\nGet rare items and lots of EXP by using Boost Mode to increase the Drop Rate and EXP obtained!\nSee here for more details on \"Boost Mode\".\nAvatar\nItem Icon\nItem Name\nType\nBoar Head A\nAccessory Avatar\nBoar Head B\nAccessory Avatar\nBoar Head C\nAccessory Avatar\nBoar Head D\nAccessory Avatar\nTrade \"Gi. Boar Medal\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nArcana Gems×10\n10\n30\nBoar Head A\n300\n2\nBoar Head B\n300\n2\nBoar Head C\n300\n2\nBoar Head D\n300\n2\nMemoria Niter S\n100\n50\nMedal of Combat Arts\n200\n5\nAwakening Star\n40\n40\nGreat Blue Jewel\n50\n10\nGreat Red Jewel\n50\n10\nGreat Green Jewel\n50\n10\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n50\n10\nTrader Period\nStarts after the May 22, 2024 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the June 19, 2024 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nAchievement Rewards\nComplete the conditions and receive event-limited records and items from achievement rewards.\nRecord\nAchievement Requirements\nAchievement Rewards\nCharging Destroyer\nLet's collect a total of 1000 Gi. Boar Medals in the time period.\nRevive Crystal×1\nComing Straight At You\nLet's collect a total of 2000 Gi. Boar Medals in the time period.\nRevive Crystal×1\nWild Raging Boar\nLet's collect a total of 5000 Gi. Boar Medals in the time period.\nRevive Crystal×1\nHow to Participate\nTalk to the \"Defense Battle\" NPC at the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to challenge it.\nEvent Period\nStarts after the May 22, 2024 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the June 12, 2024 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nParticipation Requirements\nNormal:Unlocked after clearing the 5F Main Quest.\nAdvanced:Unlocked after clearing the 9F Main Quest.\nManiac:Unlocked after clearing the 20F Main Quest.\nBoss Monster\nGiant Boar\nDetails\nUses the Chaos Recollection Buff.\nWeakness\nThrust Element\nDark Element\nBuffs used\nBuff \"Increase Attack\" and \"Chaos Recollection\"\nStatus Ailments used\nStatus ailments \"Paralysis\"\n* Chaos Recollection: A powerful aura that surrounds the body and reduces damage. (Awakening is effective.)\nTotal Score Reward\nYou'll earn a certain score by clearing the dungeon.\nScores earned in \"Normal\", \"Advanced\" and \"Maniac\" difficulties all count toward the\n\"Total Score Reward\"\n. Your rewards will be based on your score.\nSpecial items that can be received from Total Score Rewards\nArcana Gems×700\nMemoria Niter S×150\nMedal of Combat Arts×15\nAwakening Star×60\nGreat Yellow Jewel×10\nGreat Green Jewel×10\nGreat Blue Jewel×10\nGreat Red Jewel×10\nScore Rank Rewards\nNormal\nRank\nScore\nRewards\nAmount\nS\n400－99999\nGi. Boar Medal\n5\nRestorative Potion\n2\nEmergency Crystal\n2\nRecord Frame L\n1\nRecord Kit S\n1\nA\n330－399\nGi. Boar Medal\n4\nRestorative Potion\n1\nEmergency Crystal\n1\nRecord Frame M\n1\nB\n260－329\nGi. Boar Medal\n3\nRestorative Potion\n1\nEmergency Crystal\n1\nC\n200－259\nGi. Boar Medal\n2\nRestorative Potion\n1\nD\n120－199\nGi. Boar Medal\n1\nAdvanced\nRank\nScore\nRewards\nAmount\nS\n1850－99999\nGi. Boar Medal\n10\nRestorative Potion\n3\nEmergency Crystal\n3\nRecord Frame L\n2\nRelease Crystal (S)\n1\nA\n1600－1849\nGi. Boar Medal\n7\nRestorative Potion\n2\nEmergency Crystal\n2\nRecord Frame L\n1\nB\n1200－1599\nGi. Boar Medal\n5\nRestorative Potion\n2\nEmergency Crystal\n1\nC\n800－1199\nGi. Boar Medal\n4\nRestorative Potion\n2\nD\n600－799\nGi. Boar Medal\n3\nManiac\nRank\nScore\nRewards\nAmount\nS\n3600－99999\nGi. Boar Medal\n50\nRestorative Potion\n5\nHealing Crystal\n3\nRecord Frame L\n3\nRelease Crystal (S)\n3\nA\n3000－3599\nGi. Boar Medal\n30\nRestorative Potion\n3\nHealing Crystal\n2\nRecord Frame L\n2\nB\n2500－2999\nGi. Boar Medal\n20\nRestorative Potion\n3\nEmergency Crystal\n2\nC\n1800－2499\nGi. Boar Medal\n10\nRestorative Potion\n3\nD\n800－1799\nGi. Boar Medal\n5\nGroups\nDefense Battle allows you to form groups of up to 12 players.\nHow to Join Groups\nYou can create and join a group by talking to the NPC \"Defense Battle\" and selecting the difficulty level and \"Challenge with a group (12)\".\nThe \"12\" on the button indicates the maximum number of group members.\nWhen you create or join a group, you will move to the Standby Map.\nDisplay the Standby Member List by tapping the action button at the bottom right of the Standby Map.\nOnce the group is formed, you will automatically be moved from the Standby Map to the dungeon.\nIf you have a party, only the party leader will be able to create or join a group.\nPlayers who aren't in a party will be automatically joined together to form one when making a group.\nFor players looking to easily jump into a group, we recommend a \"Quick Group\".\n\"Quick Group\" will automatically add you into a group that is in need of members.\nImportant\nPlease check all Rewards in the game.\nWhen the dungeon is finished, you can skip the monster hunt log wait time by tapping the screen.\n\"Gi. Boar Medal\" will be deleted on June 19, 2024 (Wed) at 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
