    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Lisbeth's Birthday Order\" is here! Featuring new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3! All ★4 Skill Records are Lisbeth!\nShop\n2024-05-18 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Lisbeth's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Smith's Masterpiece] Lisbeth\n(Accele Skill)\" and \"\n[Gallant Fighter] Lisbeth\n(Burst Skill)\" are now available!\n\"\nLisbeth's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Lisbeth guaranteed on Step 3!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3, one ★4 \"Lisbeth\" is guaranteed!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Smith's Masterpiece] Lisbeth\nSkill Name\nDark Invitation/More Deban/Encircle Break\nAttack\n51\nDefense\n42\nHP\n2725\nSkill Effect\n[Dark Invitation 4] Deals +20% Dark element's damage to enemy./[More Deban 2] When equipping 1 or more of Silica's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +20%./[Encircle Break 3] Increase in break gauge to enemy by +27.5%\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nExtra effect time7.5sec.\nLimit Break extends Accele Skill effect time.\n* Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Gallant Fighter] Lisbeth\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nDeadly Blow Burst\nSkill Name\nDeadly Blow\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nBlunt/\nDark\nElement\nBlunt/\nDark\nActivation Requirements\nDark\n→\nDark\n→Blunt→\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n30\nSwitch Gauge\n30\nBreak Gauge\n30\nBreak Gauge\n60\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n1610% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Dark Element Enhance4/Buff] Dark element damage +9% for 15 sec./[Small Mark/Debuff] The next attack the enemy receives will induce 1.5x damage.(Applies to other party member's attacks. Effect will disappear after 10 sec if not activated.)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4430% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Bonus] Attack +100% against enemies with debuff status (Mark, Small Mark, Death Mark, Thrust Erosion Mark)./[Bonus] Critical damage +100% towards enemies on break.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Duration\nMay 18, 2024 (Sat) 0:00 - May 27, 2024 (Mon) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1,250 Arcana Gems (50% Off)\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nOne ★4 \"Lisbeth\" guaranteed!\nOn every Step, all ★4 Skill Records are \"Lisbeth\"!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
