    "snippet": "¡Derrota al Heavy Samurai Lord y obtén recompensas!  Recompensas Obtén hasta 1000 \"Arcana Gems\", hasta 200 \"Awakening Stars\", hasta 20 \"Medallas de las artes de combate\" y hasta 200 \"Memoria Niter S\" del evento. Esta vez podrás obtener materiales de mejora y transformación para Skill Records, incluyendo todo tipo de...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nThe Hunting Event \"Heavy Samurai Lord Hunt\" is here! Get tons of Memoria Niter to Limit Break Skill Records, as well as transformation and enhancement materials!\nEVENT\n2024-05-09 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nDefeat the Heavy Samurai Lord and get rewards!\nRewards\nGet up to 1000\n\"Arcana Gems\"\n, up to 200\n\"Awakening Stars\"\n, up to 20\n\"Medals of Combat Arts\"\n, and up to 200\n\"Memoria Niter S\"\nfrom the event.\nThis time you can get enhancement and transformation materials for Skill Records, including all kinds of Great Jewels and High Jewels, Record Frame L, and Record Kit M.\n\"Star Fragments\" may drop on certain difficulty levels!\nTrader Rewards\nExchange the \"Yellow Samurai Plates\" you obtain from the event at the exclusive Trader to get items.\n\"Green Samurai Plates\" will be added as drops, and rewards will be added to the Trader, after the May 15, 2024 (Wed) maintenance.\nTrader rewards will also be added during maintenance on May 22, 2024 (Wed).\nTrade \"Yellow Samurai Plate\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nMemoria Niter S\n100\n30\nMedal of Combat Arts\n200\n3\nAwakening Star\n20\n40\nGreat Blue Jewel\n40\n20\nGreat Red Jewel\n40\n20\nGreat Green Jewel\n40\n20\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n40\n20\nTrade \"Green Samurai Plate\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nArcana Gems×10\n10\n30\nMemoria Niter S\n100\n25\nMedal of Combat Arts\n200\n2\nAwakening Star\n20\n40\nGreat Blue Jewel\n40\n10\nGreat Red Jewel\n40\n10\nGreat Green Jewel\n40\n10\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n40\n10\nTrader Period\nYellow Samurai Plate: Starts after the May 9, 2024 (Thu) maintenance and ends before the June 5, 2024 (Wed) maintenance.\nGreen Samurai Plate: Starts after the May 15, 2024 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the June 5, 2024 (Wed) maintenance.\nTotal Score Reward\nYou'll earn a certain score by clearing the dungeon.\nScores earned in \"Entry\", \"Depth\", \"DANGER\", \"Gaining Ground\", \"Special\", and \"Extreme\" difficulties all count toward the\n\"Total Score Reward\"\n.\nYour rewards will be based on your score.\nDungeon\nScore calculation\nMax Score₍This does not include the Special Bonus₎\nEntry\nBasic Clear Bonus:99P＋Survival Bonus:1P per surviving player\n105\nDepth\nBasic Clear Bonus:299P＋Survival Bonus:1P per surviving player\n305\nDANGER\nBasic Clear Bonus:1185P＋Survival Bonus:5P per surviving player\n1215\nGaining Ground\nBasic Clear Bonus:3585P＋Survival Bonus:5P per surviving player\n3615\nSpecial\nBasic Clear Bonus:2940P＋Survival Bonus:10P per surviving player\n3000\nExtreme\nBasic Clear Bonus:4880P＋Survival Bonus:20P per surviving player\n5000\nThere will be Total Power restrictions for players who join \"Gaining Ground\", \"Special\" and \"Extreme\" difficulty Quick Parties.\nGaining Ground: Quick Party participation requirement - Total Power 40,000 or higher\nSpecial: Quick Party participation requirement - Total Power 60,000 or higher\nExtreme: Quick Party participation requirement - Total Power 80,000 or higher\n\"\nGaining Ground\n\"\nYou can get a high score in the \"\nGaining Ground\n\" difficulty bonus dungeon.\nYou can clear the \"\nGaining Ground\n\" one time per day.\nTake it on every day to get more total rewards!\n\"\nExtreme\n\"\nItem use inside the \"\nExtreme\n\" difficulty dungeon is restricted, and Revive Crystals can only be used once.\nSpecial items that can be received from Total Score Rewards\nArcana Gems×700\nMedal of Combat Arts×13\nMemoria Niter S×120\nAwakening Star×100\nGreat Red Jewel×10\nGreat Green Jewel×10\nGreat Yellow Jewel×10\nGreat Blue Jewel×10\nSpecial Bonus\nA Special Bonus will be in effect for the dungeon in this event.\nIf you clear the dungeon with compatible Skill Records equipped, you'll receive a large additional score bonus!\nList of Special Bonus Compatible Skill Records\nSkill Name\nEquipment Type\nSpecial Bonus\nEntry\nDepth\nDANGER\nGaining Ground\nSpecial\nExtreme\nMin\nMax\nMin\nMax\nMin\nMax\nMin\nMax\nMin\nMax\nMin\nMax\n★4[Proud Heart] Asuna\n1H Rapier\n20\n40\n60\n120\n240\n480\n600\n1200\n600\n1200\n1000\n2000\n★4[Heavenly Dancing Light] Sinon\nBow\n20\n40\n60\n120\n240\n480\n600\n1200\n600\n1200\n1000\n2000\n★4[Breath of Abundance] Leafa\n1H Sword\n20\n40\n60\n120\n240\n480\n600\n1200\n600\n1200\n1000\n2000\n★4[Hammer of Fiery Dust] Lisbeth\n1H Club\n20\n40\n60\n120\n240\n480\n600\n1200\n600\n1200\n1000\n2000\n★4[Raging Storm] Silica\nDagger\n20\n40\n60\n120\n240\n480\n600\n1200\n600\n1200\n1000\n2000\n★4[Resurrecting Clash] Yuuki\nAbility\n20\n40\n60\n120\n240\n480\n600\n1200\n600\n1200\n1000\n2000\n★4[The Way Is Closed] Notte\nAbility\n7\n14\n21\n42\n84\n168\n210\n420\n210\n420\n350\n700\n★4[Something Good May Come] Yui\nAbility\n7\n14\n21\n42\n84\n168\n210\n420\n210\n420\n350\n700\n★3[Black Swordsman Trainee] Kirito\nAbility\n3\n6\n9\n18\n36\n72\n90\n180\n90\n180\n150\n300\n★3[Moon Archer] Silica\nBow\n3\n6\n9\n18\n36\n72\n90\n180\n90\n180\n150\n300\nAchievement Rewards\nComplete the conditions and receive event-limited records and items from achievement rewards.\nRecord\nAchievement Requirements\nAchievement Rewards\nIn the Middle of Nowhere\nLet's collect a total of 2000 Yellow Samurai Plate in the time period\nRevive Crystal×1\nWarrior in the Bamboo\nLet's collect a total of 5000 Yellow Samurai Plate in the time period\nRevive Crystal×1\nHow to Participate\nTalk to the \"Event Dungeon\" NPC at the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to challenge it.\nEvent Period\nStarts after the May 9, 2024 (Thu) maintenance and ends before the May 29, 2024 (Wed) maintenance.\n* The high-difficulty dungeon Abyss will be implemented after the May 15, 2024 (Wed) maintenance.\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete the 1F Main Quest\nBoss Monster\nHeavy Samurai Lord\nDetails\nBreak with Thrust Element.\nOn Abyss difficulty, you can break it with the Blunt Element.\nOn Special, Extreme, and Abyss difficulties, the enemy uses a Seal Items debuff.\nOn DANGER, Gaining Ground, Special, Extreme, and Abyss difficulty levels, it will use the Chaos Recollection buff.\nWeakness\nThrust Element\nHoly Element\nWeakness\n* Only \"Abyss\"difficulty\nBlunt Element\nHoly Element\nResistance\n* Only \"Abyss\"difficulty\nSlash Element\nThrust Element\nFire Element\nWater Element\nWind Element\nEarth Element\nDark Element\nCritical\nBuffs used\nBuff \"Chaos Recollection\"\nStatus Ailments and Debuffs used\nStatus ailments \"Debility\", \"Curse\" and \"Paralysis\"\nDebuff \"Seal item\"\n* Break: Filling the entire Break Gauge will temporarily immobilize the boss and remove all of its buff effects.\n* Chaos Recollection: A powerful aura that surrounds the body and reduces damage. (Awakening is effective.)\n* Debility: Lowers max HP with each hit (up to 99%).\nRecover using items like Cleansing Potions.\nImportant\nPlease check all Rewards in the game.\nAfter you clear a \"Gaining Ground\" difficulty dungeon once, you can't play it again until the limit resets at 4:00 (JST/UTC+9).\nPlates will be deleted on June 5, 2024 (Wed) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nThere are no first or last attack bonuses on any difficulty.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
