    "snippet": "¡Décimo aniversario de la serie de juegos Sword Art Online! ¡Esta es tu oportunidad de concentrarte en ganar liberadores de habilidades! ¡La \"Campaña de Liberación de Habilidades\" ya está aquí!  Monstruos extraños y espantosos aparecen de repente en el Laberinto Subterráneo. Se revela que su verdadera identidad son los monstruos del Inframundo conocidos como \"De...",
    "full_details": "Notices\n[SAO Games 10th Anniversary] Get tons of Skill Releasers! The \"Skill Releaser Campaign\" is here!\nCampaign\n2024-04-30 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nSword Art Online Game Series 10th Anniversary!\nThis is your opportunity to focus on earning Skill Releasers! The\n\"Skill Releaser Campaign\"\nis here!\nStrange and appalling monsters suddenly appear in the\nUnderground Labyrinth\n.\nTheir true identity is revealed to be the Underworld monsters known as\n\"Deathworms\"\n!\nDefeat the Deathworms found in the Underground Labyrinth to have an increased chance to acquire Skill Releasers.\nNo matter how many Deathworms are defeated, the infestation continues. You see this as a perfect opportunity and set off to hunt them...\nCampaign Duration\nStarts after the April 30, 2024 (Tue) maintenance and ends before the May 15, 2024 (Wed) maintenance.\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete the 100F Main Quest\n* You will need to be able to enter the Underground Labyrinth.\nCampaign Contents\nDuring this campaign, Deathworms will appear in unlocked Underground Labyrinth floors.\nDefeat Deathworms to have an increased chance to get Skill Releasers compared to other Underground Labyrinth monsters.\nSkill Releasers acquired from Deathworms will be the same as other Skill Releasers available on that floor.\nExamples of Available Skill Releasers\nFloor\nItem Name\nEffect\nItem Icon\nMax amount\nUnderground Labyrinth B1\nResonate Releaser\nAdds 1000% power to 1H Sword Skills with \"Resonate\" in the name\n300\nUnderground Labyrinth B1\nFissure Releaser\nAdds 400% power to 1H Club Skills with \"Fissure\" in the name\n500\nUnderground Labyrinth B1\nSlice Releaser\nAdds 400% power to Dagger Skills with \"Slice\" in the name\n500\nUnderground Labyrinth B2\nRaid Releaser\nAdds 800% power to 1H Sword Skills with \"Raid\" in the name\n300\nUnderground Labyrinth B2\nConverging Releaser\nAdds 500% power to 2H Spear Skills with \"Converging\" in the name\n500\nUnderground Labyrinth B2\nJudgement Releaser\nAdds 500% power to 2H Axe Skills with \"Judgement\" in the name\n500\nUnderground Labyrinth B3\nBump Releaser\nAdds 800% power to 1H Sword Skills with \"Bump\" in the name\n300\nUnderground Labyrinth B3\nNova Releaser\nAdds 800% power to 1H Rapier Skills with \"Nova\" in the name\n500\nUnderground Labyrinth B3\nVigor Releaser\nAdds 500% power to Bow Skills with \"Vigor\" in the name\n500\nSee here for more details on Skill Releasers.\n・Added \"Skill Releasers\" that increase the damage of sword skills!\n・Underground Labyrinth B2 installed! Introducing the new Integral Series shield! Many new Skill Releasers!\n・Underground Labyrinth B3 installed! Transformation for the Integral Series shield \"Fermat\" has been unlocked! Tons of new Skill Releasers added!\nMonster\nDeathworm Curse\nWeakness\nUnderground Labyrinth B1：\nBlunt Element\nHoly Element\nUnderground Labyrinth B2：\nThrust Element\nHoly Element\nUnderground Labyrinth B3：\nSlash Element\nHoly Element\nResistance\nFire Element\nWater Element\nWind Element\nEarth Element\nDark Element\nImportant\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
    "startTime": "2024-04-29T19:00:00+00:00",
    "endTime": "2024-05-14T19:00:00+00:00"
