    "full_details": "Notices\n【Raising Dungeon】\"Happy Dungeon with Leafa\" is here! Get the Leafa stamp and Arcana Gems!\nEVENT\n2024-04-19 04:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe Raising Dungeon is here to help boost character growth!\n\"Happy Dungeon with Leafa\" is here! Get the Leafa stamp and Arcana Gems in celebration of this character's birthday!\nRewards\n\"Arcana Gems\" and a\nlimited-edition \"Leafa\" stamp\nare available as rewards.\nClear the dungeon every day during the event to get up to 500\n\"Arcana Gems\"\n.\nPeriod\nApril 19, 2024 (Fri) 4:00 - April 26, 2024 (Fri) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete Main quest [The Indomitable Fang]\nMemory Stamp\nStamp Name\nStamp Displayed\nLeafa Getting Ready\nMonster\nCrabby Mimic/Hard Mimic\nDetails(All ｍimic are common)\nWatch out for its scratches and bites.\nWeakness(All ｍimic are common)\nBlunt Element\nScore Rewards\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n100\nArcana Gem\n50\n200\nArcana Gem\n50\n300\nArcana Gem\n50\n400\nArcana Gem\n100\n500\nArcana Gem\n50\n600\nArcana Gem\n50\n700\nArcana Gem\n50\nChallenge Rewards\nChallenge Name\nReward\nAmount\nDefeat all enemies\nMemory Stamp 278\nUse to obtain the \"Leafa Getting Ready\" stamp.\n1\nCompleted without any tumble\nArcana Gem\n50\nCompleted within 1 minutes\nArcana Gem\n50\nImportant\nCleared dungeons will be reset the following day at 4:00am (JST/UTC+9) and can be re-attempted after that.\nThis is a solo event that you can challenge with Leafa as your partner.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
