    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Leafa's Birthday Order\" is here! Featuring new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3! All ★4 Skill Records are Leafa!\nShop\n2024-04-19 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Leafa's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[To the Castle in the Sky] Leafa\n(Awakening Skill)\" and \"\n[The Swing of a Mighty Blade] Leafa\n(Burst Skill)\" are now available!\n\"\nLeafa's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Leafa guaranteed on Step 3!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3, one ★4 \"Leafa\" is guaranteed!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[To the Castle in the Sky] Leafa\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nFlame Scar\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n10.0\nSwitch Gauge\n33\nBreak Gauge\n33\nSkill Effect\n1780% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Flame Pile/Buff] Fire element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Blaze Demon 3/Buff] When equipping 4 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, fire element damage +45% for 8 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nStack Boost\n[When Rush Activates] Raises 10 stacks for all Stack buffs that are on yourself.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[The Swing of a Mighty Blade] Leafa\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nShadow Scrap Burst\nSkill Name\nShadow Scrap\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nBlunt/\nDark\nElement\nBlunt/\nDark\nActivation Requirements\nDark\n→\nDark\n→Blunt→\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n63\nSwitch Gauge\n63\nBreak Gauge\n51\nBreak Gauge\n102\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n2250% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Enhance Attack 4/Buff] Attack +15% for 20 sec./[Dark Element Enhance4/Buff] Dark element damage +9% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n5420% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Bonus] When enemy's HP is 50% or up, attack will increase 250%./[Bonus] Critical damage +100% towards enemies on break.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n\"[To the Castle in the Sky] Leafa\", \"[The Swing of a Mighty Blade] Leafa\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nApril 19, 2024 (Fri) 0:00 - April 28, 2024 (Sun) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1,250 Arcana Gems (50% Off)\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nOne ★4 \"Leafa\" guaranteed!\nOn every Step, all ★4 Skill Records are \"Leafa\"!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
