    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(4/10)\nMAINT.\n2024-04-09 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 4/10, 2024, 13:00, was completed on 4/10, 2024, 17:00(JST/UTC+9).\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Preseason 46 begins\n\"Wild Seahorse Hunt\" begins\n\"Heroine Destruction Rhapsody\" is back\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to \"Fluffy Bunny Panic\"\n▼Added Features & Feature Adjustments\nAdjusting the game balance of 1F floor boss \"Illfang the Kobold Lord\"\n▼Fixed Issues\nAn issue when using all-out attacks where the switch gauge only increased by 1 monster, even when hitting multiple monsters with the attack\nIssue with batch Ring Production, attempting batch Awakenings, and executing batch Limit Breaks, where multiple execution windows are being displayed\nIssue where [Halo 3] skill effect is applied to both the partner and Assisting Character when the player has [A Wonderful Encounter] Sanya equipped\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼New Events\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n4/10, 2024 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Preseason 46 begins\n\"Wild Seahorse Hunt\" begins\n\"Heroine Destruction Rhapsody\" is back\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to \"Fluffy Bunny Panic\"\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 4/10 Maintenance\n[Worldwide 6 Year Anniversary] \"Chaos Crystal Increased Drop Rate Campaign\"\n[Worldwide 6 Year Anniversary] \"Armament Stone Increased Drop Rate Campaign\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
