    "full_details": "Notices\n[Worldwide 6 Year Anniversary] \"Worldwide 6 Year Anniversary! Grand Order\" is here! ★4 birthday Skill Records are part of this lineup!\nShop\n2024-03-25 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nSword Art Online Integral Factor's Worldwide 6 Year Anniversary!\nThe \"\nWorldwide 6 Year Anniversary! Grand Order\n\" is here, and ★4 Skill Records are part of this lineup, including birthday Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn all Steps, the\ntotal drop rate for ★4 Skill Records is 8.0%\n!\nAdditionally, on Step 3,\none ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed\n!\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Strike of Victory] Kirito\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nStorm Punishment Burst\nSkill Name\nStorm Punishment\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nSlash/\nWind\nElement\nSlash/\nWind\nActivation Requirements\nWind\n→\nWind\n→Slash→\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSkill Cool Time\n28.0\nSwitch Gauge\n112\nSwitch Gauge\n112\nBreak Gauge\n59\nBreak Gauge\n118\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n1480% damage (8x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Enhance Defense 4/Buff] Defense +15% for 15 sec./[Wind Element Enhance4/Buff] Wind element damage +9% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4140% damage (8x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Bonus] Your own attack increases by defense x 2./[Bonus] Wind element damage increases x 0.5% the number of bleed stacks when the player is inflicted with the bleed status ailment.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP28)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Inherited Technique] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nMother's Rosary\nSP Cost\n14\nElement\nThrust\nSkill Cool Time\n26.0\nSwitch Gauge\n44\nBreak Gauge\n56\nSkill Effect\n1980% damage (11x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Toukou 5/Buff] -50% damage taken for 4 sec.(Invalid when equipped by Partner)/▲▲[Bonus] Attack rises 200 x the number of Yuuki Skill Records in the same set./[Bonus] Damage +30% to enemies when using a non-elemental skill.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Enchanting Samurai Spirit] Klein\nSkill Name\nBurn Counter/Enhance Burn Immunity/Wild Fire\nAttack\n59\nDefense\n32\nHP\n2500\nSkill Effect\n[Burn Counter 3] When the player is Status Ailments (Burn), Attack +1000./●[Enhance Burn Immunity 2] Burn damage -10%./[Wild Fire 1] Adds Scorch effect on yourself for 30 sec when you hit using Switch (Stack 30). 2.2%＋(number of stacks x 0.2%) damage and 4.4%＋(number of stacks x 0.4%) attack decrese.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Duration\nMarch 25, 2024 (Mon) 17:00 - Before the April 3, 2024 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n11 Order for 1,250 Arcana Gems\n8.0% total Drop Rate for ★4 Skill Records!\nSTEP2\n11 Order for 2,500 Arcana Gems\n8.0% total Drop Rate for ★4 Skill Records!\nSTEP3\n11 Order for 2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n8.0% total Drop Rate for ★4 Skill Records!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
