    "full_details": "Notices\nThe player level cap has been raised! Now you can reach up to level 240!\nUPDATE\n2024-03-21 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nThe player level cap was raised from Lv. 230 to\nLv. 240\nas of the maintenance on March 21, 2024 (Thu).\nThe new Dark Black series equipment has also been added.\nIt can be equipped from Lv.235, so make sure you're at a high enough level!\nThe Lv.235 Dark Black series \"Dark Black Land Devourer\" is here! New boss monster added to the \"Chaos Showdown\"!\nGo to Notice List"
