    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(3/21)\nMAINT.\n2024-03-20 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 3/21, 2024, 13:00, was completed on 3/21, 2024, 17:00(JST/UTC+9).\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\nPlayer Level Cap Raised(Lv.230→Lv.240)\n\"Chaos Showdown\" New Boss and Dark Black Armor Added\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to [Worldwide 6 Year Anniversary] \"Alicization Boss Rush\"\nAdded [Worldwide 6 Year Anniversary] \"White Day Assault 2024\" Event rewards\n\"Exotic Guard Order\" begins\n\"Arcana Gem Super Boost Campaign\" begins\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼New Events\n▼Added rewards and high difficulty\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n3/21, 2024 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\nPlayer Level Cap Raised(Lv.230→Lv.240)\n\"Chaos Showdown\" New Boss and Dark Black Armor Added\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to [Worldwide 6 Year Anniversary] \"Alicization Boss Rush\"\nAdded [Worldwide 6 Year Anniversary] \"White Day Assault 2024\" Event rewards\n\"New Order\" begins\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 3/21 Maintenance\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Season 45\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
