    "snippet": "¡6º aniversario mundial de Sword Art Online Integral Factor! ¡El \"Bono de inicio de sesión del 6º aniversario mundial\" ya está aquí! Inicie sesión durante el período para obtener hasta 1000 gemas arcanas, así como muchos elementos útiles como estrellas del despertar, cristales de liberación (M), monedas de avatar y más como bonificaciones de inicio de sesión especiales....",
    "full_details": "Notices\n[Worldwide 6 Year Anniversary] Receive a total of 1,000 Arcana Gems across 5 days of logins! The \"Worldwide 6 Year Anniversary Login Bonus\" is here!\nCampaign\n2024-03-14 04:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nSword Art Online Integral Factor's Worldwide 6 Year Anniversary!\nThe \"\nWorldwide 6 Year Anniversary Login Bonus\n\" is here!\nLog in during the period to get up to\n1,000 Arcana Gems\n, as well as lots of useful items like Awakening Stars, Release Crystals (M), Avatar Coins, and more as special login bonuses.\nBe sure to log in each day!\nPeriod\nMarch 14, 2024 (Thu) 4:00 - Before the April 3, 2024 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nReward Details\nNumber of Days Logged In\nRewards\nAmount\nDay1\nArcana Gems\n250\nDay2\nArcana Gems\n100\nDay3\nArcana Gems\n150\nDay4\nArcana Gems\n100\nDay5\nArcana Gems\n400\nDay6\nAvatar Coin\n700\nDay7\nRevive Crystal\nRestorative Potion\n200\n1000\nDay8\nFruit Water\n300\nDay9\nExp Crystal L\n10\nDay10\nMartial Arts Text\nRelease Crystal (S)\n100\n250\nDay11\nRecord Frame L\nRecord Kit S\nRecord Kit M\n800\n400\n400\nDay12\nRed Jewel\nGreen Jewel\nYellow Jewel\nBlue Jewel\n200\n200\n200\n400\nDay13\nHigh Red Jewel\nHigh Green Jewel\nHigh Yellow Jewel\nHigh Blue Jewel\n200\n200\n200\n400\nDay14\nGlare Dragon Stone\nRefining Hammer\nRefining Hammer+\n800\n400\n400\nDay15\nSlicing Stone\nPiercing Stone\nStriking Stone\nBlocking Stone\n200\n200\n200\n400\nDay16\nSlicing Stone+\nPiercing Stone+\nStriking Stone+\nBlocking Stone+\n200\n200\n200\n400\nDay17\nAwakening Star\n100\nDay18\nGreat Red Jewel\nGreat Green Jewel\nGreat Yellow Jewel\nGreat Blue Jewel\n20\n20\n20\n40\nDay19\nSaleable Col Bag\nLife Potion\n12\n50\nDay20\nRelease Crystal (M)\n25\n* A Sellable Col Bag can be sold for 100,000 Col at the merchant.\nImportant\nYou can receive the login bonus after completing the quest \"The Indomitable Fang\".\nDaily distribution time will be from 4:00 AM to 3:59 AM of the next day. (JST/UTC+9)\nPlease note that the distribution date does not switch when the date changes.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
