    "snippet": "¡Sexto aniversario mundial de Sword Art Online Integral Factor! ¡En \"Alicization Boss Rush\", derrota a los jefes que aparecen uno tras otro y obtén muchos elementos de recompensas y caídas para aumentar tu competencia con armas y adquirir habilidades de competencia! Esta vez, los NPC en el área de combate...",
    "full_details": "Notices\n[Worldwide 6 Year Anniversary] The \"Alicization Boss Rush\" Great Proficiency Items Event is here!\nEVENT\n2024-03-13 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nSword Art Online Integral Factor's Worldwide 6 Year Anniversary!\nIn \"Alicization Boss Rush\", defeat the boss bosses that appear one after another and get a lot of items from rewards and drops to increase your weapon proficiency and acquire proficiency skills!\nThis time, NPCs in the combat area will boost your attack with chanting buffs!\nRewards\nGet up to 1000\n\"Arcana Gems\"\n, up to 100\n\"Awakening Stars\"\n, up to 20\n\"Medals of Combat Arts\"\n, and up to 300\n\"Memoria Niter S\"\nfrom the event.\nYou can also get lots of items to increase your weapon proficiency and acquire proficiency skills, notably as many as 50\nRelease Crystals (L)\nand 200\nRelease Crystals (M)\n.\nIn addition to Mysterious Discs, there's a chance that bosses will drop Martial Arts Texts and Release Crystals (S).\nGet rare items and lots of EXP by using Boost Mode to increase the Drop Rate and EXP obtained!\nSee here for more details on \"Boost Mode\".\nAdditionally,\nAwakening Medals\ncan also be obtained as Total Score Rewards during this event.\nYou can get as many as 340 of them here!\nAwakening Medals can be exchanged for awakening materials in \"Kibaou and the Secret Deal\", so get out there and collect those medals!\nSee here for more details on Kibaou and the Secret Deal.\nTrader Rewards\nGet your hands on \"Silver Mysterious Discs\" in the event and use them at the Trader to get \"Medals of Combat Arts\", as well as \"Release Crystals\" that you can use to learn proficiency skills!\nYou can also get lots of \"Release Crystals\" from Total Score Rewards.\n\"Gold Mysterious Discs\" will be added as drops, and rewards will be added to the Trader, after the March 21, 2024 (Thu) maintenance.\nTrader rewards will also be added during maintenance on March 27, 2024 (Wed).\nTrade \"Silver Mysterious Disc\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nMemoria Niter S\n100\n50\nMedal of Combat Arts\n200\n3\nAwakening Star\n20\n30\nRelease Crystal (L)\n100\n10\nRelease Crystal (M)\n50\n40\nRelease Crystal (S)\n30\n70\nMartial Arts Text\n30\n30\nGreat Blue Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Red Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Green Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n40\n5\nTrade \"Gold Mysterious Disc\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nArcana Gems×10\n20\n30\nMemoria Niter S\n100\n50\nMedal of Combat Arts\n200\n3\nAwakening Star\n20\n20\nRelease Crystal (L)\n100\n5\nRelease Crystal (M)\n50\n30\nRelease Crystal (S)\n30\n60\nMartial Arts Text\n30\n25\nGreat Blue Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Red Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Green Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n40\n5\nTrader Period\nSilver Mysterious Disc: Starts after the March 13, 2024 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the April 10, 2024 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nGold Mysterious Disc: Starts after the March 21, 2024 (Thu) maintenance and ends before the April 10, 2024 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nTotal Score Reward\nYou'll earn a certain score by clearing the dungeon.\nScores earned in  count toward the\n\"Total Score Reward\"\n. Your rewards will be based on your score.\nClear bonus\nNormal\nAdvanced\nPremium\nBasic Clear Bonus\n199P\n1140P\n3540P\nSurvival Bonus\n1 person 1P\n1 person 10P\n1 person 10P\n\"\nPremium\n\"\nYou can get a high score in this bonus dungeon.\nIt can be cleared up to once per day.\nTake it on every day to get more total rewards!\nNote that the Quick Party participation requirement will be a Total Power of 40,000 or higher.\nSpecial items that can be received from Total Score Rewards\nArcana Gems×700\nAwakening Medal×340\nMedal of Combat Arts×10\nAwakening Star×35\nGreat Red Jewel×5\nGreat Green Jewel×5\nGreat Yellow Jewel×5\nGreat Blue Jewel×5\nMartial Arts Text×130\nRelease Crystal (S)×200\nRelease Crystal (M)×85\nRelease Crystal (L)×20\nMemoria Niter S×100\nSpecial Bonus\nA Special Bonus will be in effect for the dungeon in this event.\nIf you clear the dungeon with compatible Skill Records equipped, you'll receive a large additional score bonus!\nList of Special Bonus Compatible Skill Records\nSkill Name\nEquipment Type\nSpecial Bonus\nNormal\nAdvanced\nPremium\nMin\nMax\nMin\nMax\nMin\nMax\n★4[To the Stage Together] Kirito\n1H Sword\n30\n60\n150\n300\n540\n1080\n★4[Scarlet Star Singer] Asuna\n1H Rapier\n30\n60\n150\n300\n540\n1080\n★4[Jacket Girl] Alice\nAbility\n30\n60\n150\n300\n540\n1080\n★4[Black Ogre Beater] Kirito\n1H Sword\n18\n36\n90\n180\n324\n648\n★4[Eloquence] Eugeo\nAbility\n18\n36\n90\n180\n324\n648\n★4[Top Secret Mission] Alice\nDagger\n18\n36\n90\n180\n324\n648\n★4[Man of the Day] Kirito\n1H Sword\n8\n16\n40\n80\n144\n288\n★3[Black Swordsman Trainee] Kirito\nAbility\n6\n12\n30\n60\n108\n216\n★3[Icy Swordsman] Eugeo\nAbility\n6\n12\n30\n60\n108\n216\n★3[Golden Knight] Alice\nAbility\n6\n12\n30\n60\n108\n216\nAchievement Rewards\nComplete the conditions and receive event-limited records and items from achievement rewards.\nRecord\nAchievement Requirements\nAchievement Rewards\nCrystal Clear Voice\nLet's collect a total of 1000 Silver Mysterious Discs in the time period\nRevive Crystal×1\nWorld of Music\nLet's collect a total of 5000 Silver Mysterious Discs in the time period\nRevive Crystal×1\nHow to Participate\nTalk to \"Alice\" at the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to challenge.\nEvent Period\nStarts after the March 13, 2024 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the April 3, 2024 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\n* The high-difficulty dungeon Maniac will be implemented after the March 21, 2024 (Thu) maintenance.\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete the 1F Main Quest\nBoss\nAlice\nDetails\nShe wields the Osmanthus Blade and sometimes deals wide-range attacks.\nWeakness\nSlash Element\nEarth Element\nWeakness\n* Only \"Maniac\"difficulty\nBlunt Element\nDark Element\nResistance\n* Only \"Maniac\"difficulty\nSlash Element\nThrust Element\nFire Element\nWater Element\nWind Element\nEarth Element\nHoly Element\nMinion\nDetails\nOn Maniac difficulty, the enemy uses a Seal Items debuff.\nWeakness\nSlash Element\nEarth Element\nWeakness\n* Only \"Maniac\"difficulty\nBlunt Element\nDark Element\nResistance\n* Only \"Maniac\"difficulty\nSlash Element\nThrust Element\nFire Element\nWater Element\nWind Element\nEarth Element\nHoly Element\nStatus Ailments and Debuffs used\nStatus ailments \"Fatal Poison\"\nDebuff \"Seal item\"\nWhite Witch\nDetails\nBreaks can be performed.\nOn Maniac difficulty, the enemy uses a Seal Items debuff.\nOn \"Advanced\", \"Premium\" and \"Maniac\" difficulties, the enemy uses a Chaos Recollection buff.\nWeakness\nSlash Element\nEarth Element\nWeakness\n* Only \"Maniac\"difficulty\nBlunt Element\nDark Element\nResistance\n* Only \"Maniac\"difficulty\nSlash Element\nThrust Element\nFire Element\nWater Element\nWind Element\nEarth Element\nHoly Element\nBuffs used\nBuff \"Chaos Recollection\"\nStatus Ailments and Debuffs used\nStatus ailments \"Fatal Poison\" and \"Stun\"\nDebuff \"Seal item\"\n* Break: Filling the entire Break Gauge will temporarily immobilize the boss and remove all of its buff effects.\n* Chaos Recollection: A powerful aura that surrounds the body and reduces damage. (Awakening is effective.)\nImportant\nPlease check all Rewards in the game.\nThis Event cannot be challenged with an Assist Party.\nAfter you clear the \"Premium\" dungeon once, you can't play it again until the limit resets at 4:00 (JST/UTC+9).\nThere are no first or last attack bonuses on any difficulty.\nMysterious Discs will be deleted on April 10, 2024 (Wed) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
