    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Agil's Birthday Order\" is here! Featuring new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3! All ★4 Skill Records are Agil!\nShop\n2024-03-09 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Agil's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Shining Shopkeeper] Agil\n\" and \"\n[Slashing Giant Blade] Agil\n(Burst Skill)\" are now available!\n\"\nAgil's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Agil guaranteed on Step 3!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3, one ★4 \"Agil\" is guaranteed!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Shining Shopkeeper] Agil\nSkill Name\nKing of Axes/Enhance Attack\nAttack\n39\nDefense\n62\nHP\n2875\nSkill Effect\n[King of Axes 3] Attack +1000 when using 2H Axe./[Enhance Attack 4] Attack +15%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Slashing Giant Blade] Agil\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nWind Fan Burst\nSkill Name\nWind Fan\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nBlunt/\nWind\nElement\nBlunt/\nWind\nActivation Requirements\nWind\n→\nWind\n→Blunt→\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n48\nSwitch Gauge\n48\nBreak Gauge\n44\nBreak Gauge\n88\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n1850% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Motion Range]/[Enhance Attack 4/Buff] Attack +15% for 20 sec./[Wind Element Enhance4/Buff] Wind element damage +9% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n5120% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Motion Range]/[Bonus] When enemy's HP is 50% or up, attack will increase 250%./[Bonus] Wind element damage increases x 0.5% the number of bleed stacks when the player is inflicted with the bleed status ailment.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Duration\nMarch 9, 2024 (Sat) 0:00 - March 18, 2024 (Mon) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1,250 Arcana Gems (50% Off)\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nOne ★4 \"Agil\" guaranteed!\nOn every Step, all ★4 Skill Records are \"Agil\"!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nGo to Notice List"
