    "full_details": "Notices\n[Worldwide 6 Year Anniversary] The Awakening Selection Order is here! One ★4 Awakening Skill Record is guaranteed per 11 Orders!\nShop\n2024-03-06 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nSword Art Online Integral Factor's Worldwide 6 Year Anniversary!\nAll ★4 Skill Records are Awakening Skills!\nThe Awakening Selection Order is here!\nOne ★4 Awakening Skill Record is guaranteed per 11 Orders!\n- Duration\nStarts after the March 6, 2024 (Wed) maintenance - March 15, 2024 (Fri) 16:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Offers\n1 Order for 250 Arcana Gems\n11 Order for 2,500 Arcana Gems\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Return of the Full Moon] Yuuki\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nAqua Spinning Dive\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n55\nBreak Gauge\n74\nSkill Effect\n1330% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Aqua Pile/Buff] Water element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./▲▲[Bonus] Increase status ailment stacks by 8 on enemies when hitting poisoned enemies.\n*Increase in break gauge amount.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nStack Boost\n[When Rush Activates] Raises 10 stacks for all Stack buffs that are on yourself.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Together From Here On] Yui\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Aqua Conversion/Tactical Advisor\nAttack\n56\nDefense\n32\nHP\n2350\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 3] Attack +800./[Aqua Conversion 5] Fire element's damage to enemies -15% and water element's damage to enemies +30%./[Tactical Advisor 4] When equipping 2 or more of Yui's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +20%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nStack Boost\n[When Rush Activates] Raises 10 stacks for all Stack buffs that are on yourself.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Roaring Wave Battle Gear] Lisbeth\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nHoly Asterisk\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nBlunt/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n57\nBreak Gauge\n48\nSkill Effect\n1620% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Motion Range]/[Holy Force 5/Buff (PT)] Holy element damage +20% for you and your party for 5 sec./[Thrust Erosion Mark/Debuff] When the target is hit using the Switch, for thrust element enemies, the next attack the enemy receives will induce 2.5x damage. (Applies to other party member's attacks. Effect will disappear after 10 sec if not activated.)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nLightning Flash\n[During Rush] Critical rate +20%.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Holiday Knitting] Sachi\nSkill Name\nCombination/Hold the Front/Tailwind\nAttack\n58\nDefense\n36\nHP\n2425\nSkill Effect\n[Combination 5] Skill's power is added +150% when used in switch./[Hold the Front 4] Recovers a max of 5%+200 HP per 3 sec when HP is under 50%./[Tailwind 1] Switch gauge amount +15%, when equipping no Yui Skill Records in the same set.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nPincer Attack\n[During Rush] Damage +15% when using switch.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Aggressive Dropkick] Leafa\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nHydro Judgement\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n13.0\nSwitch Gauge\n53\nBreak Gauge\n33\nSkill Effect\n1470% damage (All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Qigong 3/Buff] Slowly recovering its own HP for 30 sec. Recover 50/3 sec per stack (Stack 6)./[Tough 4/Buff] Flinch resist +100% for 10 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nStack Boost\n[When Rush Activates] Raises 10 stacks for all Stack buffs that are on yourself.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Freezing Knight] Eugeo\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nSavage Wind Noise\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nSlash/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n13.0\nSwitch Gauge\n45\nBreak Gauge\n37\nSkill Effect\n1360% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Knight's Shield 4/Buff]Own DEF increases (Stack 3) +1% per Stack for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nStack Boost\n[When Rush Activates] Raises 10 stacks for all Stack buffs that are on yourself.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[New Year Games] Silica\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Wind Conversion/More Deban\nAttack\n52\nDefense\n36\nHP\n2500\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 3] Attack +800./[Wind Conversion 4] Earth element's damage to enemies -10% and wind element's damage to enemies +25%./[More Deban 1] When equipping 1 or more of Lisbeth's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +20%\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nPincer Attack\n[During Rush] Damage +15% when using switch.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Supporter from the Shadows] Sinon\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nVigor Shadow\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n51\nBreak Gauge\n32\nSkill Effect\n- Charging -\n1560% damage (All Foes)[Front/Cone/Wide]/[Hunter's Eye 4/Buff] The lower you HP, critical rate increases for 15 sec./[Adversity 4/Buff] The lower your own HP, critical damage increases for 15 sec.\n- Uncharged -\n970% damage (All Foes)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Risk Taker 4/Buff] The lower your own HP, attack increases for 20 sec. (Stack 3)\n* Gauge value is when charging\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\nMore \"Awakening\" Details Here\n- Important\nCheck the in-game Order details for more information on the entire lineup and the drop rates.\nPlease be aware that the period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
