    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Guardians of the Red Robes Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2024-02-07 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nYuuki, Alice, Eugeo, and Silica remain strong even in the world of fairy tales in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nGuardians of the Red Robes Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3!\nBoosted rates for the featured new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Eat or Be Eaten] Yuuki\nSkill Name\nEarth Suction/Enhance Antidote/Everyone Is Different\nAttack\n57\nDefense\n34\nHP\n2575\nSkill Effect\n[Earth Suction 3] When the player is Status Ailments (Poison), Attack +35%./●[Enhance Antidote 3] Poison damage -30%./[Everyone Is Different 3] Adds Fatal Poison effect on yourself for 30 sec when you hit using Switch (Stack 50).2.2%＋(number of stacks x 0.2%) damage\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nExtra effect time7.5sec.\nLimit Break extends Accele Skill effect time.\n* Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Innocent Detour] Alice\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nCrag Bump Burst\nSkill Name\nCrag Bump\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nSlash/\nEarth\nElement\nSlash/\nEarth\nActivation Requirements\nEarth\n→Slash→\nEarth\n→(\nHoly\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n56\nSwitch Gauge\n56\nBreak Gauge\n57\nBreak Gauge\n114\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n1520% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Enhance Defense 4/Buff] Defense +15% for 15 sec./[Earth Element Enhance4/Buff] Earth element damage +9% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4260% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Bonus] Your own attack increases by defense x 2./[Bonus] Earth element damage increases x 0.5% the number of poison stacks when the player is inflicted with the poison status ailment.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[Keeper of the Silent Forest] Eugeo\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nAqua Divide\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n63\nBreak Gauge\n63\nSkill Effect\n1820% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲▲▲[Bonus] Damage +100% to enemies when using water skills./[Bonus] When equipping 3 or more of Eugeo's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1200.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Instant Battle] Silica\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nSpinning Air Dive\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nSlash/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n55\nBreak Gauge\n37\nSkill Effect\n1780% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Death Mark/Debuff] Increases damage to enemy by x1.1 for 12 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nIncrease status ailment stacks by 5 → 10 → 15 on enemies.\nReduces status ailment stacks by 5 → 10 → 15 on yourself when hitting with skills while poisoned (Will not be below 1).\n\"[Instant Battle] Silica\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nStarts after the February 7, 2024 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the March 6, 2024 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
