    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \" Black Attired Ruler Order\" is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2024-01-28 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nWith their will to fight burning brightly, Kirito, Yuuki, Lisbeth, and Silica are here in black outfits in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nBlack Attired Ruler Order\n\" is here! Get one new ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Black Waves] Kirito\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nVorpal Frost\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n43\nBreak Gauge\n43\nSkill Effect\n1550% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using water skills./[Bonus] When equipping 4 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1200.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Bewitching Black Sword] Yuuki\nSkill Name\nBloody Battle Slash/Aqua Conversion\nAttack\n56\nDefense\n38\nHP\n2500\nSkill Effect\n[Bloody Battle Slash 3] Attack +35% when attacking with slash element./[Aqua Conversion 4] Fire element's damage to enemies -10% and water element's damage to enemies +25%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Ability\nFor each piece of equipment in the same set, the number of activations in additional Full Burst state increases by 1 (1 activation per skill)\nStock Type: Resets remaining time for Full Burst skill activation, and extends duration of Full Burst state (+10 sec per 1 equipment)\nChain Type: Increases burst skill damage used in Full Burst state (+5% per 1 equipment)\n*Burst activated Sword Skills during Full Burst state will activate normally until Full Burst State ends.\n★4[Black Smith's Hammer] Lisbeth\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nSand Disorder\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nBlunt/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n77\nBreak Gauge\n44\nSkill Effect\n1530% damage (7x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Parry4/Buff] When this skill direct hits, the damage you receive decreases at 50%(Effect will disappear after 20 sec if not activated).\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nBoost 10 → 20 → 30 to your own switch guage when hitting with skills.\nWhen equipping 2 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, recover +4 → 12 → 20 SP when this skill direct hits.\n★4[Girl in Black] Silica\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nAqua Loiter\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n96\nBreak Gauge\n44\nSkill Effect\n1700% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Motion Range]/[Muscle Atrophy 4/Debuff] Enemy's attack -0.3% per stack (Stack 3) for 20 sec./[Muscle Atrophy 4/Debuff] When the target is hit using the Switch, enemy's attack -0.3% per stack (Stack 9) for 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect30sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n- Duration\nJanuary 28, 2024 (Sun) 17:00 - February 22, 2024 (Thu) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
