    "news_url": "https://saoif.nayu.fun/shop_information/detail/3461.html",
    "news_date": 1704960000,
    "news_category": "Campaign",
    "snippet": "Aviso para aquellos usuarios que inician sesión en \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\". ¡Comienza la \"Campaña Super Boost de Gemas Arcanas\"! ¡No dejes pasar esta oportunidad de obtener toneladas de Gemas Arcanas adicionales! -La duración de la campaña comienza después del mantenimiento del 11 de enero de 2024 (jueves) y finaliza antes del mantenimiento del 17 de enero de 2024 (miércoles) (jueves).",
    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Arcana Gem Super Boost Campaign\" is here! Get up to 2,000 extra Arcana Gems!\nCampaign\n2024-01-11 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\"\n\"\nArcana Gem Super Boost Campaign\n\" begins!\nDon't pass up this chance to get tons of extra Arcana Gems!\n-Campaign Duration\nStarts after the January 11, 2024 (Thu) maintenance and ends before the January 17, 2024 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\n-Campaign Contents\nProduct Name\nArcana Gems\nArcana Gem A\nTotal: 60\nArcana Gem B\nTotal: 300\nArcana Gem C\nTotal: 680\nArcana Gem D\nTotal: 1,500\n(1,280\n+220 extra Gems\n)\nArcana Gem E\nTotal: 2,700\nArcana Gem F\nTotal: 5,000\n（4,200\n+800 extra Gems\n）\nArcana Gem G\nTotal: 10,800\n（8,800\n+2,000 extra Gems\n）\n-Important\nExtra Arcana Gems are only available once per bundle.\nGo to Notice List"
