    "full_details": "Notices\n[Holiday Campaign] \"Holiday Campaign! Login Bonus\" is here!\nCampaign\n2023-12-01 04:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nHoliday Campaign!\nThe Holiday Campaign! Login Bonus is here! Log in during the period and you can get the\n\"★4[Swinging Blade] Kirito\" Full Burst Skill Record\n!\nA special Login Bonus will also be held where you can get up to\n1,500 Arcana Gems\nand tons of other useful items!\nSkill Record\n★4[Swinging Blade] Kirito\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nFire Rush Burst\nSkill Name\nFire Rush\nSP Cost\n26\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nActivation Requirements\nFire\n→\nFire\n→Slash→(\nWind\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSkill Cool Time\n28.0\nSwitch Gauge\n40\nSwitch Gauge\n40\nBreak Gauge\n18\nBreak Gauge\n36\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n680% damage (5x hit/All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Evasion 3/Buff] Evasion rate +11% for 10 sec. (This will not activate with focus attack)\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n1360% damage (5x hit/All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Fire Element Enhance4/Buff] Fire element damage +9% for 15 sec./[Bonus] Attack against burned enemies increases 20%.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\nDetails about the \"Full Burst Skill\" are available here\nPeriod\nDecember 1, 2023 (Fri) 4:00 - December 31, 2023 (Sun) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nReward Details\nNumber of Days Logged In\nRewards\nAmount\nDay1\n[Swinging Blade] Kirito\n1\nDay2\nArcana Gems\n250\nDay3\nArcana Gems\n250\nDay4\nArcana Gems\n250\nDay5\nArcana Gems\n250\nDay6\nArcana Gems\n500\nDay7\nAvatar Coin\n700\nDay8\nRevive Crystal\n200\nDay9\nRestorative Potion\n1000\nDay10\nFruit Water\n300\nDay11\nExp Crystal L\n10\nDay12\nSmall Gift\n10\nDay13\nGolden Bells\n20\nDay14\nMartial Arts Text\n100\nDay15\nRelease Crystal (S)\n250\nDay16\nRecord Frame L\nRecord Kit S\nRecord Kit M\n800\n400\n400\nDay17\nRed Jewel\nGreen Jewel\nYellow Jewel\nBlue Jewel\n200\n200\n200\n400\nDay18\nHigh Red Jewel\nHigh Green Jewel\nHigh Yellow Jewel\nHigh Blue Jewel\n200\n200\n200\n400\nDay19\nGlare Dragon Stone\nRefining Hammer\nRefining Hammer+\n800\n400\n400\nDay20\nSlicing Stone\nPiercing Stone\nStriking Stone\nBlocking Stone\n200\n200\n200\n400\nDay21\nSlicing Stone+\nPiercing Stone+\nStriking Stone+\nBlocking Stone+\n200\n200\n200\n400\nDay22\nAwakening Star\n100\nDay23\nGreat Red Jewel\nGreat Green Jewel\nGreat Yellow Jewel\nGreat Blue Jewel\n20\n20\n20\n40\nDay24\nMOD Remover\n10\nDay25\nRed Hot Ore\n5\nDay26\nSaleable Col Bag\n12\nDay27\nLife Potion\n50\nDay28\nRelease Crystal (M)\n25\n* A Sellable Col Bag can be sold for 100,000 Col at the merchant.\nImportant\nYou can receive the login bonus after completing the quest \"The Indomitable Fang\".\nDaily distribution time will be from 4:00 AM to 3:59 AM of the next day. (JST/UTC+9)\nPlease note that the distribution date does not switch when the date changes.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
