    "snippet": "Aviso para aquellos usuarios que inicien sesión en \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\". El mantenimiento estará vigente durante las fechas siguientes. Fechas de mantenimiento programadas 30/11, 2023 11:00 a 17:00 (tentativo) (JST/UTC+9) ▼ Eventos nuevos y recientemente implementados ¡Enfoca tu potencia de fuego invulnerable para derrotar a tus enemigos! \"B completo...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(11/30)\nMAINT.\n2023-11-29 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\"\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n11/30, 2023 11:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\nFocus your invulnerable firepower to beat down your enemies! \"Full Burst Skill\" are here\nChapter 2 \"Aincrad 51F\"\nPlayer Level Cap Raised(Lv.220→Lv.230)\n[Holiday Campaign] \"Anniversary Festival\" begins\n[Holiday Campaign] \"Heapin' 30M EXP Event\" begins\n[Holiday Campaign] \"Holiday Campaign! Panel Mission\" begins\n\"New Order\" begins\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 11/30 Maintenance\n\"Ring Production Campaign\"\n\"Multiple Rounds: 2x Experience Character Quest Campaign\"\n\"Boss Rush VS Evil Treant\"\n\"Guild Support Campaign\"\n\"Cyber Street Order\"\n\"MOD Step-Up Order\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
