    "snippet": "¡Durante esta campaña, obtén el doble de experiencia en misiones de personajes de rondas múltiples! ¡Esta es tu oportunidad de elevar fácilmente tu nivel de jugador! Inicio del evento Acepta la misión de personaje del tablón de anuncios en el distrito comercial. Requisitos de participación Completa la misión principal 1F hasta el final Duración de la campaña...",
    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Multiple Rounds: 2x Experience Character Quest Campaign\" is here!\nCampaign\n2023-11-21 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nDuring this campaign, get\n2x\nthe experience in Multiple Round Character Quests!\nThis is your chance to easily raise your player level!\nEvent Start\nAccept the Character Quest from the Bulletin Board in the Merchant District.\nParticipation Requirements\nClear the 1F Main Quest through the end\nCampaign Duration\nStarts after the November 21, 2023 (Tue) maintenance and ends before the November 30, 2023 (Thu) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nImportant\nDoes not include first-time Character Quests.\nThe EXP displayed in the Quest Details is the x2 value.\nx2 EXP not included when a monster is defeated.\nIf the event finishes while you are in the middle of the Character Quest, you will gain the normal amount of EXP.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
