    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Jewel Miner Order\" is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2023-11-15 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nAsuna, Leafa, Sachi, and Argo are working hard at the mine in search of valuable ores in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nJewel Miner Order\n\" is here! Get one new ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Sparkle of Precious Stones] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nGaia Cinque\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n90\nBreak Gauge\n20\nSkill Effect\n1720% damage (6x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Earth Pile/Buff] Earth element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Earth Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Earth element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect30sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n★4[Discoverer of Rare Ore] Leafa\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nHoly V Arc\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n26\nBreak Gauge\n68\nSkill Effect\n1420% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using holy skills./[Bonus] When equipping 3 or more of Leafa's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1200.\n* Increase in break gauge amount.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Today's Harvest] Sachi\nSkill Name\nKing of Spears/Bloody Blow\nAttack\n56\nDefense\n38\nHP\n2125\nSkill Effect\n[King of Spears 3] Attack +1000 when using 2H Spear./[Bloody Blow 4] Attack +24% against bleeding enemies.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[To the Unseen Vein] Argo\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nHeat Hash Burst\nSkill Name\nHeat Hash\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nActivation Requirements\nFire\n→\nFire\n→Slash→\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n36\nSwitch Gauge\n36\nBreak Gauge\n26\nBreak Gauge\n52\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n1360% damage (4x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Burn/Status Ailments] Make it burn (Stack 3) for 30 sec./[Fire Element Enhance4/Buff] Fire element damage +9% for 15 sec.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n3810% damage (4x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Bonus] Attack +1500 against enemies with the blunt element./[Bonus] Attack +100% against enemy with status ailments (Poison, Burn, Bleed, Frostbite).\n* Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP28)\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Duration\nStarts after the November 15, 2023 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the December 13, 2023 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
