    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Good Fortune Festival Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2023-11-10 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nReady to rake in the good luck, Agil, Silica, Yuuki, and Lisbeth are enjoying the big festival in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nGood Fortune Festival Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3!\nBoosted rates for the featured new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Grasping for Gains] Agil\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nDark Split Burst\nSkill Name\nDark Split\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nBlunt/\nDark\nElement\nBlunt/\nDark\nActivation Requirements\nDark\n→\nDark\n→Blunt→\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSkill Cool Time\n28.0\nSwitch Gauge\n36\nSwitch Gauge\n36\nBreak Gauge\n37\nBreak Gauge\n74\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n2020% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Enhance Attack 4/Buff] Attack +15% for 20 sec./[Dark Element Enhance4/Buff] Dark element damage +9% for 15 sec.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4760% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Bonus] Attack increases in proportion with your remaining HP x 200%./[Bonus] Critical rate +400% towards enemies on break.\n* Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP28)\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Shouldering Luck] Silica\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nSwift Fire\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n70\nBreak Gauge\n39\nSkill Effect\n1350% damage (7x hit/Single Foe)[Center/Arc/Mid]/[Weak Defense 5/Debuff] Enemy defense -100% for 5 sec./▲[Bonus] When an enemy with Status Ailments (Poison, Burn, Bleed, Frostbite) was hit, increase status ailment stacks by 5 on enemies.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Greedy for Good Luck] Yuuki\nSkill Name\nSpirit Unity/Veteran Sword Technique/Gale Blade\nAttack\n53\nDefense\n36\nHP\n2425\nSkill Effect\n[Spirit Unity 3] + 5 increase to Awakening rate./[Veteran Sword Technique 4] Attack power increase with own level×0.17%. (max 34%)/[Gale Blade 4] Deals +20% Wind element's damage to enemy.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Delivering Happiness] Lisbeth\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nFlame Fissure Burst\nSkill Name\nFlame Fissure\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nBlunt/\nFire\nElement\nBlunt/\nFire\nActivation Requirements\nFire\n→\nFire\n→Blunt→\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSkill Cool Time\n28.0\nSwitch Gauge\n44\nSwitch Gauge\n44\nBreak Gauge\n45\nBreak Gauge\n90\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n1760% damage (Single Foe)[Center/Arc/Mid]/[Fire Element Enhance4/Buff] Fire element damage +9% for 15 sec./[Small Mark/Debuff] The next attack the enemy receives will induce 1.5x damage.(Applies to other party member's attacks. Effect will disappear after 10 sec if not activated.)\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4310% damage (Single Foe)[Center/Arc/Mid]/[Bonus] Attack +100% against enemies with debuff status (Mark, Small Mark, Death Mark, Thrust Erosion Mark)./[Bonus] Fire element damage increases x 0.5% the number of burn stacks when the player is inflicted with the burn status ailment.\n* Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP28)\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n\"[Grasping for Gains] Agil\", \"[Delivering Happiness] Lisbeth\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nNovember 10, 2023 (Fri) 17:00 - December 3, 2023 (Sun) 16:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
