    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Cyber Street Order\" is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2023-11-01 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nLiving life on the edge in a city bathed in neon lights, Sinon, Koharu, Kirito, and Leafa are here as new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nCyber Street Order\n\" is here! Get one new ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Cyber Scope] Sinon\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nPebble Shoot\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nThrust/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n27\nBreak Gauge\n27\nSkill Effect\n1740% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Parry4/Buff] When this skill direct hits, the damage you receive decreases at 50%(Effect will disappear after 20 sec if not activated).\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nAttack +1000 → 3000 → 5000 when using earth skills.\nWhen equipping 2 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, Earth element damage +50% → 100% → 150%.\n★4[Lightning Fast] Koharu\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nLightning Down Burst\nSkill Name\nLightning Down\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nThrust/\nHoly\nElement\nThrust/\nHoly\nActivation Requirements\nHoly\n→\nHoly\n→Thrust→\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n38\nSwitch Gauge\n38\nBreak Gauge\n39\nBreak Gauge\n78\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n1660% damage (All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Holy Element Weak 4/Debuff] Holy element damage to monster +25% for 10 sec./▲[Bonus] When this skill direct hits, reduces all skill's cool times by 2 sec.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4660% damage (All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Holy Light Demon 5/Buff] Holy element damage +65% for 8 sec./[Bonus] Attack +2000 against enemies with debuff status.\n* Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP28)\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[On a Street at Night...] Kirito\nSkill Name\nVital Assention/Icy Blade\nAttack\n48\nDefense\n36\nHP\n2425\nSkill Effect\n[Vital Assention 3] Defense +400./[Icy Blade 4] Deals +20% Water element's damage to enemy.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Melting Into Neon] Leafa\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nSavage Permafrost\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n90\nBreak Gauge\n37\nSkill Effect\n1890% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Jar of Ice 4/Buff] Defense +10 per stack (Stack 3) during 20 sec./[Jar of Ice 4/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, defense +10 per stack (Stack 9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect30sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n\"[Cyber Scope] Sinon\", \"[Melting Into Neon] Leafa\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nNovember 1, 2023 (Wed) 0:00 - Before the November 30, 2023 (Thu) maintenance (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
