    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Sanya's Birthday Order\" is here! Featuring new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3! All ★4 Skill Records are Sanya!\nShop\n2023-10-29 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Sanya's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Thinking of Home] Sanya\n\" and \"\n[Sword Roaring in the Dark] Sanya\n(Awakening Skill)\" are now available!\n\"\nSanya's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Sanya guaranteed on Step 3!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3, one ★4 \"Sanya\" is guaranteed!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Thinking of Home] Sanya\nSkill Name\nAggravated Slash/Foreign Friend/Bloody Blow\nAttack\n51\nDefense\n48\nHP\n2500\nSkill Effect\n[Aggravated Slash 3] Damage to slash element weakness rises by the number of Sanya Skill Records in the same set x 20%./[Foreign Friend 2] Attack rises 250 x the number of Rain Skill Records in the same set./[Bloody Blow 3] Attack +18% against bleeding enemies.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Sword Roaring in the Dark] Sanya\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nRaged Flame\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n39\nBreak Gauge\n33\nSkill Effect\n1410% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Night Erosion 4/Buff] Attack + 0.5% per stack (Stack10) during 25 sec./[Muscle Build Up 4/Buff] When equipping 2 or more of Rain's Skill Records in the same set, attack + 1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./▲[Bonus] Recover 5% of max HP when hitting bleeding enemies.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nStack Boost\n[When Rush Activates] Raises 10 stacks for all Stack buffs that are on yourself.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n- Duration\nOctober 29, 2023 (Sun) 0:00 - November 7, 2023 (Tue) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1,250 Arcana Gems (50% Off)\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nOne ★4 \"Sanya\" guaranteed!\nOn every Step, all ★4 Skill Records are \"Sanya\"!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nGo to Notice List"
