    "full_details": "Notices\n[SAO Games 10th Anniversary] The \"Intensive Training Event VS Mito\" is here! Get tons of Medals of Combat Arts!\nEVENT\n2023-10-22 04:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nSword Art Online Game Series 10th Anniversary!\nClear the intensive training with Mito every day and get a lot of Medals of Combat Arts!\nThe \"\nIntensive Training Event VS Mito\n\" will begin.\nThe extremely difficult\nSerious Match\n, where you can fight Mito going all out, is on now! The recommended Total Power is 250,000!\nThis event is a Raising Dungeon.\nRewards\nClear the regular and extremely difficult Serious Match dungeons once a day to get a total of 30 Medals of Combat Arts!\nHow to Participate\nTalk to \"Mito\" at the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to challenge the dungeon.\nEvent Period\nOctober 22, 2023 (Sun) 4:00 - Before the November 8, 2023 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete Main quest [The Indomitable Fang]\nScore Rewards\nRegular Dungeon\nScore\nRewards\nAmount\n200\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n400\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n600\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n800\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n1000\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n1200\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n1400\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n1600\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n1800\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n2000\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n2200\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n2400\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n2600\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n2800\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n3000\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n3200\nCol\n100,000\n3400\nGlare Dragon Stone\n50\n3600\nRecord Frame L\n50\nSerious Match\nScore\nRewards\nAmount\n200\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n400\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n600\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n800\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n1000\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n1200\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n1400\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n1600\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n1800\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n2000\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n2200\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n2400\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n2600\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n2800\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n3000\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n3200\nCol\n500,000\n3400\nGlare Dragon Stone\n100\n3600\nRecord Frame L\n100\nImportant\nPlease check all Rewards in the game.\nThe dungeon daily clear will update at 4:00 AM (JST/UTC+9).\nThis event will be a solo dungeon.\nKoharu will not join for Serious Matches.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
