    "full_details": "Notices\n[SAO Games 10th Anniversary] The \"Tearing Through Twilight Order\" is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2023-10-18 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nSword Art Online Game Series 10th Anniversary!\nNew ★4 Kirito, Asuna, Argo, and Mito Skill Records from the SWORD ART ONLINE Progressive: Aria of a Starless Night movie and the SWORD ART ONLINE Progressive: Scherzo of Deep Night movie are here!\nThe \"\nTearing Through Twilight Order\n\" is here! Get one new ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Split-Second Hit] Kirito\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nHydro Spike\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n74\nBreak Gauge\n37\nSkill Effect\n1880% damage (Single Foe)[Motion Range]/[Aqua Pile/Buff] Water element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Aqua Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, water element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect30sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n★4[Moment of Determination] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nShining Riposte\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nThrust/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n33\nBreak Gauge\n33\nSkill Effect\n1440% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Parry4/Buff] When this skill direct hits, the damage you receive decreases at 50%(Effect will disappear after 20 sec if not activated)./[Peak Descent 3/Buff/Debuff] When equipping 1 or more of Mito's Skill Records in the same set, Own critical rate and critical damage rises 2% per stack for 20 sec (Stack 3).Triggers a debuff that raises the damage you take by 0.5% per stack (Stack 9).\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nAttack +1000 → 3000 → 5000 when using holy skills.\nWhen equipping 2 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, Holy element damage +50% → 100% → 150%.\n★4[Decisive Blow] Argo\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nWater Hash\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n36\nBreak Gauge\n26\nSkill Effect\n1340% damage (4x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using water skills./[Bonus] Attack +1500 against enemies with the blunt element.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Laying It All on This Hit] Mito\nSkill Name\nSharpened Blade/Enhance Thrust/Inflict Frostbite\nAttack\n53\nDefense\n32\nHP\n2575\nSkill Effect\n[Sharpened Blade 4] Attack rises by 6% x the number of Asuna Skill Records in the same set./[Enhance Thrust 4] Damage done to enemies weak to thrusting +24%./[Inflict Frostbite] When the target is hit using the Switch, make it Frostbite (Stack 5) for 30 sec. (Invalid when equipped by Partner)\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n\"[Split-Second Hit] Kirito\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nAfter the October 18, 2023 (Wed) maintenance - November 23, 2023 (Thu) 11:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
