    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Dream Waitress Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2023-10-14 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nKoharu, Yuuki, Leafa, and Lisbeth are dressed as waitresses with cute bunny ears in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nDream Waitress Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3!\nBoosted rates for the featured new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Please Follow Me!] Koharu\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nWind Volt\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n94\nBreak Gauge\n47\nSkill Effect\n1610% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Wide]/[Wind Pile/Buff] Wind element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Wind Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Wind element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n*More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect30sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n★4[Order Up!] Yuuki\nSkill Name\nAdvance Trooper/Wind Conversion\nAttack\n54\nDefense\n44\nHP\n2800\nSkill Effect\n[Advance Trooper 5] Attack +500./[Wind Conversion 4] Earth element's damage to enemies -10% and wind element's damage to enemies +25%.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nExtra effect time7.5sec.\nLimit Break extends Accele Skill effect time.\n* Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Can I Take Your Order?] Leafa\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nGreedy Break\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nSlash\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n62\nBreak Gauge\n57\nSkill Effect\n870% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲[Bonus] When enemy's HP is 50% or up, attack will increase 100%.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Scrambling for Orders] Lisbeth\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nHydro Disruption\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nBlunt/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n48\nBreak Gauge\n51\nSkill Effect\n1440% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Parry4/Buff] When this skill direct hits, the damage you receive decreases at 50%(Effect will disappear after 20 sec if not activated).\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nRecovers +4 → 12 → 20 SP when this skill direct hits.\n- Duration\nOctober 14, 2023 (Sat) 17:00 - Before the November 15, 2023 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
