    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Halloween Party Selection Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed per 11 Orders!\nShop\n2023-10-11 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nOne Halloween costume party ★4 Skill Record guaranteed per 11 Orders!\nThe \"\nHalloween Party Selection Order\n\" is on now!\n- Duration\nStarts after the October 11, 2023 (Wed) maintenance and ends on October 31, 2023 (Tue) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9).\n- Offers\n1 Order for 250 Arcana Gems\n11 Order for 2,500 Arcana Gems\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Mischievous Smile] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nWind Smash\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n65\nBreak Gauge\n45\nSkill Effect\n1270% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Lisbeth's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000./[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using wind skills.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Devil Charm] Leafa\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nThrust of Flame\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nThrust/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n39\nBreak Gauge\n21\nSkill Effect\n660% damage (3x hit/All Foes)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Blaze Demon 4/Buff] Fire element damage +55% for 8 sec./[Fire Element Weak 4/Debuff] Fire element damage to monster +25% for 10 sec.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nMind's Eye\n[During Rush] Critical damage +7.5%.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Tricky Cat] Koharu\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nWide Shade Fencer\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n28\nBreak Gauge\n14\nSkill Effect\n1200% damage (4x hit/All Foes)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Dark Shadow Demon 3/Buff] Dark element damage +45% for 8 sec./▲▲[Bonus] Attack rises 200 x the number of Koharu Skill Records in the same set./[Bonus] All the Stack Buff effected to the enemy will -2 in numbers of Stacks (Will not be below 1).\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Groovy Night] Yuuki\nSkill Name\nAdvance Trooper/Weakness Attack Boost\nAttack\n49\nDefense\n30\nHP\n2950\nSkill Effect\n[Advance Trooper 4] Attack +400./[Weakness Attack Boost 3] Critical damage +15% while the buff to raise critical damage is in effect.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nMind's Eye\n[During Rush] Critical damage +7.5%.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Coffin Break] Lisbeth\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nPumpkin Crush\nSP Cost\n20\nElement\nBlunt/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n62\nBreak Gauge\n20\nSkill Effect\n700% damage (All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Additional damage to enemy of 20% own current HP.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Tricky Witch] Sachi\nSkill Name\nStatus Ailments Blow\nAttack\n40\nDefense\n60\nHP\n1250\nSkill Effect\n[Status Ailments Blow 4] Attack +18% against enemy with status ailments (Poison, Burn, Bleed, Frostbite).\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Storm of the Great Sea] Sinon\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nProjection Aqua Burst\nSkill Name\nProjection Aqua\nSP Cost\n28\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nThrust/\nWater\nElement\nThrust/\nWater\nActivation Requirements\nWater\n→Thrust→Thrust→\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSkill Cool Time\n28.0\nSwitch Gauge\n28\nSwitch Gauge\n28\nBreak Gauge\n20\nBreak Gauge\n40\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n1020% damage (2x hit/All Foes)[Front/Cone/Wide]/[Poison/Status Ailments] It will Poison (Stack 3) at specific rate for 30 sec./[Adversity 4/Buff] The lower your own HP, critical damage increases for 15 sec.\n* When this skill is used in switch and hits, the Poison (Stack 1) will also affect the player.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n2440% damage (2x hit/All Foes)[Front/Cone/Wide]/[Poison/Status Ailments] Make it Poison (Stack 5) for 30 sec./[Adversity 4/Buff] The lower your own HP, critical damage increases for 30 sec./[Bonus] Attack +30% and critical rate +100% when you have status ailment (Poison).\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Ruler of the Blue Seas] Eugeo\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nHydro Tempest Burst\nSkill Name\nHydro Tempest\nSP Cost\n26\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nActivation Requirements\nWater\n→Slash→Slash→\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSkill Cool Time\n28.0\nSwitch Gauge\n90\nSwitch Gauge\n90\nBreak Gauge\n22\nBreak Gauge\n44\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n1050% damage (10x hit/All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Enhance Defense 4/Buff] Defense +15% for 15 sec./[Frostbite/Status Ailments] Inflict Frostbite (Stack 1) for 30 sec.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n2520% damage (10x hit/All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Enhance Defense 4/Buff] Defense +15% for 30 sec./[Frostbite/Status Ailments] Inflict Frostbite (Stack 5) for 30 sec./[Bonus] Critical rate +50% while defense+ buff is effective.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Important\nCheck the in-game Order details for more information on the entire lineup and the drop rates.\nPlease be aware that the period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
