    "snippet": "Para celebrar el cumpleaños de Kirito, ¡los nuevos récords de habilidades ★4 \"[Sparks in the Neon City] Kirito (Awakening Skill)\" y \"[Strike of Victory] Kirito (Burst Skill)\" ya están disponibles! ¡La orden de cumpleaños de Kirito ya está aquí! ¡Obtén un Kirito ★4 garantizado en el Paso 3! En el Paso 1, puedes obtener 11 pedidos por 1250 Gemas Arcanas...",
    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Kirito's Birthday Order\" is here! Featuring new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3! All ★4 Skill Records are Kirito!\nShop\n2023-10-07 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Kirito's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Sparks in the Neon City] Kirito\n(Awakening Skill)\" and \"\n[Strike of Victory] Kirito\n(Burst Skill)\" are now available!\n\"\nKirito's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Kirito guaranteed on Step 3!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3, one ★4 \"Kirito\" is guaranteed!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Sparks in the Neon City] Kirito\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Wind Conversion/Black Swordsman\nAttack\n51\nDefense\n42\nHP\n2350\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 3] Attack +800./[Wind Conversion 5] Earth element's damage to enemies -15% and wind element's damage to enemies +30%./[Black Swordsman 3] When equipping 2 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +20%.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Strike of Victory] Kirito\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nStorm Punishment Burst\nSkill Name\nStorm Punishment\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nSlash/\nWind\nElement\nSlash/\nWind\nActivation Requirements\nWind\n→\nWind\n→Slash→\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSkill Cool Time\n28.0\nSwitch Gauge\n112\nSwitch Gauge\n112\nBreak Gauge\n59\nBreak Gauge\n118\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n1480% damage (8x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Enhance Defense 4/Buff] Defense +15% for 15 sec./[Wind Element Enhance4/Buff] Wind element damage +9% for 15 sec.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4140% damage (8x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Bonus] Your own attack increases by defense x 2./[Bonus] Wind element damage increases x 0.5% the number of bleed stacks when the player is inflicted with the bleed status ailment.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP28)\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Duration\nOctober 7, 2023 (Sat) 0:00 - October 16, 2023 (Mon) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1,250 Arcana Gems (50% Off)\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nOne ★4 \"Kirito\" guaranteed!\nOn every Step, all ★4 Skill Records are \"Kirito\"!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nGo to Notice List"
