    "full_details": "Notices\n[5.5 Year Anniversary] \"Rabbit Fever\" is here! All rabbit species appear twice as often and stay in the field twice as long!\nEVENT\n2023-09-27 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nSword Art Online Integral Factor's Worldwide 5.5 Year Anniversary!\nThis is your chance to get Red Hot Ores, Scorching Hot Ores, and Intensely Hot Ores.\nDoubled\nappearance rates during the campaign for all rabbit species!\nPlus, they'll stay\ntwice\nas long in the field!\nCampaign Duration\nStarts after the September 27, 2023 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the October 4, 2023 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nRabbits\nRagout Rabbits, Cher Rabbits, and Roi Rabbits appear occasionally on the field and drop Hot Ores, a material used for Equipment Refinement.\nEach rabbit type drops a different kind of Hot Ore.\nMore Equipment Refinement Details Here\nImportant\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
    "startTime": "2023-09-26T19:00:00+00:00",
    "endTime": "2023-10-03T19:00:00+00:00"
