    "full_details": "Notices\n[SAO Games 10th Anniversary] Get up to 1,000 Arcana Gems! The \"TGS 2023 SAO Special Presentation Celebratory Dungeon\" is here!\nEVENT\n2023-09-23 04:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nSword Art Online Game Series 10th Anniversary!\nGet up to 1,000 Arcana Gems\nin the \"TGS 2023 SAO Special Presentation Celebratory Dungeon\"!\nClear it once per day to get Arcana Gems daily!\n* Can be cleared up to ten days total.\n▼Event Period\nSeptember 23, 2023 (Sat) 4:00 - Before the October 4, 2023 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9)\nScore Rewards\nCelebratory Dungeon\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n100\nArcana Gems\n100\n200\nArcana Gems\n100\n300\nArcana Gems\n100\n400\nArcana Gems\n100\n500\nArcana Gems\n100\n600\nArcana Gems\n100\n700\nArcana Gems\n100\n800\nArcana Gems\n100\n900\nArcana Gems\n100\n1000\nArcana Gems\n100\nHow to Participate\nTalk to \"Anniversary Dungeon\" NPC at the \"Celebratory Dungeon\" to challenge the dungeon.\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete the 1F Main Quest\nBoss Monster\nGreat Golden Spirit\nDetails\nIt will bite and charge at you.\nWeakness\nBlunt Element\nImportant\nThe dungeon daily clear will update at 4:00 AM (JST/UTC+9).\nThis event will be a solo dungeon.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
