    "snippet": "En celebración de los 10 años de los juegos Sword Art Online, ¡los nuevos récords de habilidades ★4 \"[Poniendo los sentimientos a pincel] Koharu\" y \"[Cruzando hacia la muerte juntos] Koharu (Accele Skill)\" están aquí! ¡Koharu the Integral Factor Order\" ya está aquí! ¡Obtenga un Koharu ★4 garantizado en el Paso 3! En el Paso 1, puede obtener 11 pedidos para...",
    "full_details": "Notices\n[SAO Games 10th Anniversary] \"Koharu the Integral Factor Order\" is here! All ★4 Skill Records are Koharu! Featuring new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\nShop\n2023-09-20 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nIn celebration of 10 years of Sword Art Online games, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Putting Feelings to Brush] Koharu\n\" and \"\n[Crossing Into Death Together] Koharu\n(Accele Skill)\" are here!\n\"\nKoharu the Integral Factor Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Koharu guaranteed on Step 3!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3, one ★4 \"Koharu\" is guaranteed!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Putting Feelings to Brush] Koharu\nSkill Name\nKing of Rapiers/Frostbite Blow\nAttack\n57\nDefense\n28\nHP\n2425\nSkill Effect\n[King of Rapiers 3] Attack +1000 when using 1H Rapier./[Frostbite Blow 4] Attack against enemies with frostbite increases 24%.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Crossing Into Death Together] Koharu\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nAqua Invasion\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n96\nBreak Gauge\n43\nSkill Effect\n1650% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Aqua Pile/Buff] Water element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Aqua Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, water element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect30sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n- Duration\nAfter the September 20, 2023 (Wed) maintenance - September 29, 2023 (Fri) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1,250 Arcana Gems (50% Off)\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nOne ★4 \"Koharu\" guaranteed!\nOn every Step, all ★4 Skill Records are \"Koharu\"!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nGo to Notice List"
