    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Heroic Symphony Selection Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed per 11 Orders!\nShop\n2023-09-16 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nOne heroic tale- or orchestra-themed ★4 Skill Record guaranteed per 11 Orders!\nThe \"\nHeroic Symphony Selection Order\n\" is on now!\n- Duration\nSeptember 16, 2023 (Sat) 17:00 - Before the September 27, 2023 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9)\n- Offers\n1 Order for 250 Arcana Gems\n11 Order for 2,500 Arcana Gems\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Evangelical Cantata] Kirito\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nFlame Blast\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n26\nBreak Gauge\n17\nSkill Effect\n1310% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using fire skills./[Bonus] When equipping 3 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Thoughtful Toccata] Lisbeth\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nPhoton Fissure\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nBlunt/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n35\nBreak Gauge\n22\nSkill Effect\n1300% damage (All Foes)[Center/Arc/Mid]/[Parry4/Buff] When this skill direct hits, the damage you receive decreases at 50%(Effect will disappear after 20 sec if not activated).\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nRecovers your SP by 8 → 16 → 24 when critical is activated.\n★4[Leader of Warriors] Leafa\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nWater Waltz\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n45\nBreak Gauge\n26\nSkill Effect\n1580% damage (5x hit/All Foes)[Front/Long/Wide]/▲▲[Bonus] Attack + 50% in proportion with your remaining HP (the more remaining HP, the higher)./[Bonus] When equipping 3 or more of Leafa's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1200.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Screening Eyes] Alice\nSkill Name\nEnhance Stun Res./Advance Trooper/Shine Conversion\nAttack\n61\nDefense\n30\nHP\n2425\nSkill Effect\n●[Enhance Stun Res. 4] Stun resistance +70%./[Advance Trooper 5] Attack +500./[Shine Conversion 4] Dark element's damage to enemies -10% and holy element's damage to enemies +25%.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nExtra effect time7.5sec.\nLimit Break extends Accele Skill effect time.\n* Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Flashing Paladin] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nValkyrie Comet\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n11.0\nSwitch Gauge\n156\nBreak Gauge\n40\nSkill Effect\n800% damage (4x hit/Single Foe)[Motion Range]/▲▲[Bonus] Recovers your HP by 10% of Max HP when critical is activated with this skill./[Bonus] Attack+25% when your own HP is above 75%.\n* Greater increase in switch gauge than normally.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Descended Paladin] Yuuki\nSkill Name\nPaladin's Command/Miracle at the Battlefield\nAttack\n59\nDefense\n32\nHP\n1460\nSkill Effect\n[Paladin's Command 4] Attack +10%./[Miracle at the Battlefield 4] Critical damage +20%, while increasing critical rate buff is effective.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Cool Soloist] Sinon\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nFire Flux\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n84\nBreak Gauge\n53\nSkill Effect\n1220% damage (6x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Wide]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using fire skills./[Bonus] When equipping 1 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +500\n* More than regular increase in switch guage.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Energetic Rhythm] Klein\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nRefuge Water\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nBlunt/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSwitch Gauge\n32\nBreak Gauge\n18\nSkill Effect\n1250% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[PT Precise Attack 4/Buff] Party critical rate +30% for 20 sec./[Weakness Attack 3/Buff] Critical damage +10% for 15 sec.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nPincer Attack\n[During Rush] Damage +15% when using switch.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n- Important\nCheck the in-game Order details for more information on the entire lineup and the drop rates.\nPlease be aware that the period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
