    "snippet": "Aviso para aquellos usuarios que inicien sesión en \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\". El mantenimiento estará vigente durante las fechas siguientes. Fechas de mantenimiento programadas 13/9, 2023 13:00 a 17:00 (tentativo) (JST/UTC+9) ▼ Eventos nuevos y recientemente implementados Comienza la temporada 39 de \"Guild of Guilds\" \"[Regreso] Búsqueda del fantasma...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(9/13)\nMAINT.\n2023-09-12 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\"\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n9/13, 2023 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Season 39 begins\n\"[Returning] Search for the Phantom Mushroom\" begins\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to [5.5 Year Anniversary] \"Boss Rush VS Ogre\"\n[5.5 Year Anniversary] \"Multiple Rounds: 5x Experience Character Quest Campaign\" begins\n\"Chaos Showdown\" UPDATE\n\"New Order\" begins\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 9/13 Maintenance\n[5.5 Year Anniversary] \"Heapin' 20M EXP Event\"\n[5.5 Year Anniversary] \"Ring Production Campaign\"\n\"Bright Kingdom Order\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
