    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"MOD Step-Up Order\" is here! One ★4 MOD Skill is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2023-09-08 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nAll ★4 Skill Records are \"MOD Skills\"!\nThe \"\nMOD Step-Up Order\n\" is here!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nAdditionally, on Step 3, one\n★4 MOD Skill is guaranteed!\nMore MOD Skill Details Here\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Altair Crossing the Sky] Yuuki\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nLightning Pierce\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n20\nBreak Gauge\n20\nSkill Effect\n1240% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using holy skills./[Bonus] Damage done to enemies weak to slashing +20%.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Tea Party Host] Alice\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nDominant Ripper\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n29\nBreak Gauge\n18\nSkill Effect\n1250% damage (All Foes)[Center/Arc/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using dark skills./[Bonus] When equipping 1 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +500.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[On Track to the End] Sinon\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nHoly Stitch\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n34\nBreak Gauge\n35\nSkill Effect\n1280% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using holy skills./[Bonus] When equipping 3 or more of Sinon's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n- Duration\nSeptember 8, 2023 (Fri) 17:00 - September 18, 2023 (Mon) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\nAll ★4 Skill Records are MOD Skill!\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nAll ★4 Skill Records are MOD Skill!\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nAll ★4 Skill Records are MOD Skill!\nOne ★4 MOD Skill guaranteed!!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
