    "snippet": "¡5.5 aniversario mundial de Sword Art Online Integral Factor! ¡En \"Boss Rush VS Ogre\", derrota a los monstruos jefes que aparecen uno tras otro y obtén muchos artículos de recompensas y caídas para aumentar tu competencia con armas y adquirir habilidades de competencia! Recompensas Obtén hasta 1000 \"Gemas Arcanas\", hasta...",
    "full_details": "Notices\n[5.5 Year Anniversary] The \"Boss Rush VS Ogre\" Great Proficiency Items Event is here!\nEVENT\n2023-09-06 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nSword Art Online Integral Factor's Worldwide 5.5 Year Anniversary!\nIn \"Boss Rush VS Ogre\", defeat the boss monsters that appear one after another and get a lot of items from rewards and drops to increase your weapon proficiency and acquire proficiency skills!\nRewards\nGet up to 1000\n\"Arcana Gems\"\n, up to 100\n\"Awakening Stars\"\n, up to 20\n\"Medals of Combat Arts\"\n, and up to 200\n\"Memoria Niter S\"\nfrom the event.\nIn addition to Boss Rush Plates, there's a chance that monsters will drop Martial Arts Texts and Release Crystals (S).\nGet rare items and lots of EXP by using Boost Mode to increase the Drop Rate and EXP obtained!\nSee here for more details on \"Boost Mode\".\nTrader Rewards\nGet your hands on \"Black Boss Rush Plates\" in the event and use them at the Trader to get \"Medals of Combat Arts\", as well as \"Release Crystals\" that you can use to learn proficiency skills!\nYou can also get lots of \"Release Crystals\" from Total Score Rewards.\n\"White Boss Rush Plates\" will be added as drops, and rewards will be added to the Trader, after the September 13, 2023 (Wed) maintenance.\nTrader rewards will also be added during maintenance on September 20, 2023 (Wed).\nTrade \"Black Boss Rush Plate\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nMemoria Niter S\n100\n20\nMedal of Combat Arts\n350\n5\nAwakening Star\n20\n25\nRelease Crystal (L)\n350\n1\nRelease Crystal (M)\n125\n3\nMartial Arts Text\n50\n20\nTrade \"White Boss Rush Plate\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nArcana Gems×10\n10\n30\nMemoria Niter S\n100\n20\nMedal of Combat Arts\n350\n5\nAwakening Star\n20\n25\nRelease Crystal (L)\n350\n1\nRelease Crystal (M)\n125\n3\nMartial Arts Text\n50\n20\nTrader Period\nBlack Boss Rush Plate: Starts after the September 6, 2023 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the October 4, 2023 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nWhite Boss Rush Plate: Starts after the September 13, 2023 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the October 4, 2023 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nTotal Score Reward\nYou'll earn a certain score by clearing the dungeon.\nScores earned in  count toward the\n\"Total Score Reward\"\n. Your rewards will be based on your score.\nClear bonus\nNormal\nAdvanced\nPremium\nBasic Clear Bonus\n199P\n1140P\n3540P\nSurvival Bonus\n1 person 1P\n1 person 10P\n1 person 10P\n\"\nPremium\n\"\nYou can get a high score in this bonus dungeon.\nIt can be cleared up to once per day.\nTake it on every day to get more total rewards!\nNote that the Quick Party participation requirement will be a Total Power of 40,000 or higher.\nSpecial items that can be received from Total Score Rewards\nArcana Gems×700\nMedal of Combat Arts×8\nAwakening Star×25\nGreat Red Jewel×5\nGreat Green Jewel×5\nGreat Yellow Jewel×5\nGreat Blue Jewel×5\nMartial Arts Text×50\nRelease Crystal (S)×245\nRelease Crystal (M)×12\nRelease Crystal (L)×7\nMemoria Niter S×125\nSpecial Bonus\nA Special Bonus will be in effect for the dungeon in this event.\nIf you clear the dungeon with compatible Skill Records equipped, you'll receive a large additional score bonus!\nList of Special Bonus Compatible Skill Records\nSkill Name\nEquipment Type\nSpecial Bonus\nNormal\nAdvanced\nPremium\nMinimum\nMaximum\nMinimum\nMaximum\nMinimum\nMaximum\n★4[Priestess Gazing at the Sky] Asuna\n1H Rapier\n30\n60\n150\n300\n540\n1080\n★4[Wishing for A Good Harvest] Lisbeth\n1H Club\n30\n60\n150\n300\n540\n1080\n★4[Drawing In Joy] Koharu\nAbility\n30\n60\n150\n300\n540\n1080\n★4[Oracle from the Halo] Alice\n1H Sword\n30\n60\n150\n300\n540\n1080\n★4[The Road We Walk Together] Kirito\n1H Sword\n18\n36\n90\n180\n324\n648\n★4[Obey Me!] Layla\nDagger\n18\n36\n90\n180\n324\n648\n★4[Moment of Victory] Yuuki\nAbility\n8\n16\n40\n80\n144\n288\n★4[Solemn & Sturdy] Typhon\n1H Sword\n8\n16\n40\n80\n144\n288\n★3[Madder Red] Sanya\nAbility\n6\n12\n30\n60\n108\n216\n★3[Tranquil Forest] Kizmel\nAbility\n6\n12\n30\n60\n108\n216\nAchievement Rewards\nComplete the conditions and receive event-limited records and items from achievement rewards.\nRecord\nAchievement Requirements\nAchievement Rewards\nBuff Macho\nLet's collect a total of 1000 Black Boss Rush Plates in the time period\nRevive Crystal×1\nFull-Body Blow\nLet's collect a total of 5000 Black Boss Rush Plates in the time period\nRevive Crystal×1\nHow to Participate\nTalk to the \"Boss Rush Event\" NPC at the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to challenge it.\nEvent Period\nStarts after the September 6, 2023 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the September 27, 2023 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\n* The high-difficulty dungeon Maniac will be implemented after the September 13, 2023 (Wed) maintenance.\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete the 1F Main Quest\nBoss Monster\nCrimson Ogre\nDoge the Pale Ogre\nDagan the Ogrian Chief\nDetails\nYou can perform a Skill Break on Doge the Pale Ogre with Dagger.\nOn Maniac difficulty, the enemy uses a Seal Items debuff.\nWeakness\nSlash Element\nWind Element\nWeakness\n* Only \"Maniac\"difficulty\nSlash Element\nWater Element\nResistance\n* Only \"Maniac\"difficulty\nThrust Element\nBlunt Element\nFire Element\nWind Element\nEarth Element\nHoly Element\nDark Element\nStatus Ailments and Debuffs used\nStatus ailments \"Bloodshed\" and \"Stun\"\nDebuff \"Seal item\"\n* Skill Break: By completely lowering the Skill Break Gauge, the boss will be temporarily immobilized and all of its buff effects will be removed.\nImportant\nPlease check all Rewards in the game.\nAfter you clear the \"Premium\" dungeon once, you can't play it again until the limit resets at 4:00 (JST/UTC+9).\nThere are no first or last attack bonuses on any difficulty.\nPlates will be deleted on October 4, 2023 (Wed) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
