    "image": "https://saoif-com.akamaized.net/web/shop_login/en/img/group_gacha/f724015b71cb3241c4cdde5070c37353.png",
    "news_url": "https://saoif.nayu.fun/shop_information/detail/3195.html",
    "news_date": 1693008000,
    "news_category": "Shop",
    "snippet": "¡Celebración de apertura de la reunión de estrategia de juegos SAO 2023! ¡La imagen clave del décimo aniversario de la serie de juegos Sword Art Online, dibujada por el ilustrador original abec, ahora está disponible como un nuevo récord de habilidad ★4! ¡La \"Orden de las Crónicas de la Gloria\" ya está aquí! ¡Obtén un nuevo récord de habilidad ★4 garantizado en el paso 5! Boos...",
    "full_details": "Notices\n[SAO Games 10th Anniversary] The \"Chronicles of Glory Order\" is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2023-08-26 09:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nSAO Game Strategy Meeting 2023 Opening Celebration!\nThe key visual for the 10th anniversary of the Sword Art Online game series, drawn by original illustrator abec, is now available as a new ★4 Skill Record!\nThe \"\nChronicles of Glory Order\n\" is here! Get one new ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[The Road We Walk Together] Kirito\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nBetting Deal\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nSlash/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n63\nBreak Gauge\n57\nSkill Effect\n1440% damage (7x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Parry4/Buff] When this skill direct hits, the damage you receive decreases at 50%(Effect will disappear after 20 sec if not activated).\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nAttack +1000 → 3000 → 5000 when using wind skills.\nWhen equipping 2 or more of Asuna's Skill Records in the same set, Wind element damage +50% → 100% → 150%.\n★4[Color Scheme Heroine] Koharu\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nFeint Water\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n76\nBreak Gauge\n35\nSkill Effect\n1620% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Muscle Build Up 4/Buff (PT)] Own and Party's attack + 1% per stack (Stack2) during 20 sec./[Muscle Build Up 4/Buff (PT)] When the target is hit using the Switch, Own and Party's attack + 1% per stack (Stack6) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect30sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n★4[Obey Me!] Layla\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nWind Cutter\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n36\nBreak Gauge\n36\nSkill Effect\n1420% damage (Single Foe)[Motion Range]/▲▲▲[Bonus] Damage +100% to enemies when using wind skills./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Rain & Rainbows] Seven\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nBurrowing Storm\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nThrust/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n56\nBreak Gauge\n33\nSkill Effect\n1980% damage (8x hit/All Foes)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Parry4/Buff] When this skill direct hits, the damage you receive decreases at 50%(Effect will disappear after 20 sec if not activated).\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nAttack +1000 → 3000 → 5000 when using wind skills.\nWhen equipping 2 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, Wind element damage +50% → 100% → 150%.\n★4[Master Gunner] Zeliska\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nAir Squall\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nThrust/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n65\nBreak Gauge\n28\nSkill Effect\n- Charging -\n1600% damage (5x hit/All Foes)[Center/Arc/Wide]/[Wind Pile/Buff] Wind element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Enhance Thrust 3/Buff] Damage done to enemies weak to thrust +25% for 20 sec.\n- Uncharged -\n1000% damage (3x hit/All Foes)[Center/Arc/Mid]/[Evasion 3/Buff] Evasion rate +11% for 10 sec. (This will not activate with focus attack)/[Enhance Thrust 3/Buff] Damage done to enemies weak to thrust +25% for 20 sec.\n*Gauge value is when charging\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Towards the Ideal Form] Premiere\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nRising Volcano\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n80\nBreak Gauge\n40\nSkill Effect\n1690% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Flame Pile/Buff] Fire element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Flame Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Fire element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect30sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n★4[Bearing the Mission] Dorothy\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nSacred Waltz\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n140\nBreak Gauge\n51\nSkill Effect\n1890% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Wide]/[Muscle Build Up 4/Buff] Attack + 1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Muscle Build Up 4/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Attack + 1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect30sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n\"[Rain & Rainbows] Seven\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nAugust 26, 2023 (Sat) 9:00 - Before the October 3, 2023 (Tue) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nThere is no voice production when the MOD Skill \"[Obey Me!] Layla\" is drawn.\nThere is no voice production when the Connect Skill \"[Rain & Rainbows] Seven\" is drawn.\nThere is no voice production when the Accele Skill \"[Towards the Ideal Form] Premiere\" is drawn.\nThere is no voice production when the Accele Skill \"[Bearing the Mission] Dorothy\" is drawn.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
