    "full_details": "Notices\nGet Agil Stamps! \"[Fri-Sun Only] Treasure Hunt with Agil\" is on now!\nEVENT\n2021-11-12 04:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\n\"Agil\" will join as your partner!\nGet special \"\nAgil Stamp\n\".\nRewards\nGet Agil Coins as challenge rewards and exchange them for \"\nAgil Stamps\n\" at the exclusive Trader!\nGet other rewards like enhancement materials and \"Revive Crystals\".\nAmong the \"\nAgil Stamps\n\" available are three stamps created with help from Agil's Japanese voice actor, Hiroki Yasumoto, and 23 stamps taken from the LINE stamp collection \"SAO Integral Factor 100% Agil\".\nLiven up your conversations with cute caricatures of Agil!\nHow to Participate\nTalk to \"Agil\" at the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to take on this challenge.\nPeriod\nEvery Friday 4:00 to Monday 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nTrader\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nAgil Stamp 1\n1\n1\nAgil Stamp 2\n1\n1\nAgil Stamp 3\n1\n1\nAgil Stamp 4\n1\n1\nAgil Stamp 5\n1\n1\nAgil Stamp 6\n1\n1\nAgil Stamp 7\n1\n1\nAgil Stamp 8\n1\n1\nAgil Stamp 9\n1\n1\nAgil Stamp 10\n1\n1\nAgil Stamp 11\n1\n1\nAgil Stamp 12\n1\n1\nAgil Stamp 13\n1\n1\nAgil Stamp 14\n1\n1\nAgil Stamp 15\n1\n1\nAgil Stamp 16\n1\n1\nAgil Stamp 17\n1\n1\nAgil Stamp 18\n1\n1\nAgil Stamp 19\n1\n1\nAgil Stamp 20\n1\n1\nAgil Stamp 21\n1\n1\nAgil Stamp 22\n1\n1\nAgil Stamp 23\n1\n1\nAgil Stamp 24\n1\n1\nAgil Stamp 25\n1\n1\nAgil Stamp 26\n1\n1\nGlare Dragon Stone×3\n1\n999\nRecord Frame L×3\n1\n999\nMemory Stamp\nStamp Name\nStamp Displayed\nAgil Stamp 1\nAgil Stamp 2\nAgil Stamp 3\nAgil Stamp 4\nAgil Stamp 5\nAgil Stamp 6\nAgil Stamp 7\nAgil Stamp 8\nAgil Stamp 9\nAgil Stamp 10\nAgil Stamp 11\nAgil Stamp 12\nAgil Stamp 13\nAgil Stamp 14\nAgil Stamp 15\nAgil Stamp 16\nAgil Stamp 17\nAgil Stamp 18\nAgil Stamp 19\nAgil Stamp 20\nAgil Stamp 21\nAgil Stamp 22\nAgil Stamp 23\nAgil Stamp 24\nAgil Stamp 25\nAgil Stamp 26\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete Main quest [The Indomitable Fang]\n* The dungeon will update every Friday at 4:00 (JST/UTC+9) and can be cleared once until Monday at 3:59 (JST/UTC+9).\n* The challenge rewards will also reset every Friday at 4:00 (JST/UTC+9).\n* This is a solo event that you can challenge with \"Agil\" as your partner.\nScore Rewards\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n100\nRevive Crystal\n1\n200\nRevive Crystal\n1\n300\nRevive Crystal\n1\n400\nRevive Crystal\n1\n500\nRevive Crystal\n1\n600\nRevive Crystal\n1\n700\nRevive Crystal\n1\n800\nRevive Crystal\n1\n900\nRevive Crystal\n1\n1000\nRevive Crystal\n1\nChallenge Rewards\nChallenge Name\nPrimary Reward\nAmount\nDefeat all enemies\nAgil Coin\n1\nCompleted without any tumble\nRestorative Potion\n10\nCompleted within 3 minutes\nRestorative Potion\n10\nGo to Notice List"
