    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Yuna's Birthday Order\" is here! Featuring new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3! All ★4 Skill Records are Yuna!\nShop\n2023-07-29 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Yuna's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Listen Quietly] Yuna\n\" and \"\n[Adult Dress Up] Yuna\n(MOD Skill)\" are now available!\n\"\nYuna's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Yuna guaranteed on Step 3!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3, one ★4 \"Yuna\" is guaranteed!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Listen Quietly] Yuna\nSkill Name\nSpirit Unity/Song of Valor\nAttack\n51\nDefense\n38\nHP\n2500\nSkill Effect\n[Spirit Unity 4] + 8 increase to Awakening rate./[Song of Valor 3] When the target is hit using the Switch, adds a buff attack, critical rate, and critical damage +15% to you and your party for 15 sec.(Invalid when equipped by Partner)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Adult Dress Up] Yuna\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nTerrible Fire\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n80\nBreak Gauge\n39\nSkill Effect\n1680% damage (8x hit/All Foes)[Front/Cone/Mid]/▲▲▲[Bonus] When equipping 1 or more of Sachi's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000./[Bonus] Damage +100% to enemies when using fire skills while the buff to raise fire damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n- Duration\nJuly 29, 2023 (Sat) 0:00 - August 7, 2023 (Mon) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1,250 Arcana Gems (50% Off)\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nOne ★4 \"Yuna\" guaranteed!\nOn every Step, all ★4 Skill Records are \"Yuna\"!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nGo to Notice List"
