    "full_details": "Notices\n\"[Returning] Watermelon Panic!\" is back! Get a Swimsuit Avatar!\nEVENT\n2023-06-28 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe Scenario Event \"[Returning] Watermelon Panic!\" is back!\n[Returning] Watermelon Panic!\nA beautiful beach by the pier with Kirito and Asuna, and...watermelon splitting?!\nFight alongside the SAOIF characters on the beach in the summertime scenario event!\nRewards\nGather \"Marvelous Watermelon\" available as event rewards and drop items, and exchange them at the Trader for previously-appearing swimsuit avatars and exclusive Memory Stamps.\n\"Coco Drink\" is a useful item you can receive from score rewards or as drop items, and recovers party members' HP in the same field by 2000.\nGet up to 300\n\"Arcana Gems\"\n, up to 50\n\"Awakening Stars\"\n, and up to 10\n\"Medals of Combat Arts\"\nfrom the entire event.\nAvatar Images\nMemory Stamp\nLimited-edition Stamps are back.\nStamp Name\nStamp Displayed\nTaking a break\nSUMMER\nWhere?\nHot...\nTrade \"Marvelous Watermelon\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nPassion Bikini Top\n240\n2\nPassion Wrap Skirt Bottoms\n180\n2\nPassion Bikini Bottoms\n180\n2\nCalming Swimsuit Top\n240\n1\nCalming Swimsuit Bottoms\n180\n1\nPassion Elegant Hat\n120\n2\nCalming Straw Hat\n120\n2\nPassion Sunglass\n120\n2\nCalming Sunglass\n120\n2\nMemory Stamp 33\nCan acquire\n\"Taking a break\" when used.\n40\n1\nMemory Stamp 34\nCan acquire\n\"SUMMER\" when used.\n40\n1\nMemory Stamp 35\nCan acquire\n\"Where?\" when used.\n40\n1\nMemory Stamp 36\nCan acquire\n\"Hot...\" when used.\n40\n1\nMedal of Combat Arts\n200\n5\nAwakening Star\n15\n25\nGreat Red Jewel\n30\n5\nGreat Green Jewel\n30\n5\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n30\n5\nGreat Blue Jewel\n30\n5\nTrader\nSee each Trader NPC for more info, or go to Menu > Items > Enhance/Trade > Trade Limited Items and tap the \"Trade Marvelous Watermelon\" banner.\nTrader Period\nStarts after the June 28, 2023 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the September 6, 2023 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nHigh difficulty\n\"Special\"\nYou can clear the\n\"Special\"\n3 times per day.\nIn addition, item use is restricted while inside the dungeon and \"Revive Crystals\" can only be used up to 3 times.\nScore Rewards\nEntry\nInterior\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n100\nMarvelous Watermelon\n5\n150\nMarvelous Watermelon\n10\n200\nHealing Potion\n5\n300\nHealing Potion\n10\n400\nRecord Frame M\n10\n600\nRecord Frame M\n15\n600\nMarvelous Watermelon\n5\n900\nMarvelous Watermelon\n10\n1000\nGlare Rigid Stone\n5\n1500\nGlare Rigid Stone\n10\n1400\nGreen Jewel\n10\n2100\nGreen Jewel\n20\n1800\nMarvelous Watermelon\n5\n2700\nMarvelous Watermelon\n10\n2200\nHealing Potion\n10\n3300\nHealing Potion\n20\n2600\nYellow Jewel\n10\n3900\nYellow Jewel\n20\n3000\nMarvelous Watermelon\n5\n4500\nMarvelous Watermelon\n10\n3400\nRecord Frame M\n20\n5100\nRecord Frame M\n30\n3800\nBlue Jewel\n10\n5700\nBlue Jewel\n20\n4200\nMarvelous Watermelon\n5\n6300\nMarvelous Watermelon\n10\n4800\nRevive Crystal\n1\n7200\nMartial Arts Text\n1\n5400\nRed Jewel\n10\n8100\nRed Jewel\n20\n6000\nMarvelous Watermelon\n10\n9000\nMarvelous Watermelon\n20\nDepth\nDANGER\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n200\nMarvelous Watermelon\n20\n250\nMarvelous Watermelon\n40\n400\nRestorative Potion\n5\n500\nRestorative Potion\n10\n800\nRecord Frame L\n10\n1000\nRecord Frame L\n15\n1200\nMarvelous Watermelon\n20\n1500\nMarvelous Watermelon\n40\n2000\nGlare Dragon Stone\n5\n2500\nGlare Dragon Stone\n10\n2800\nHigh Green Jewel\n10\n3500\nCoco Drink\n3\n3600\nMarvelous Watermelon\n20\n4500\nMarvelous Watermelon\n40\n4400\nRestorative Potion\n10\n5500\nRelease Crystal (S)\n5\n5200\nHigh Yellow Jewel\n10\n6500\nAwakening Star\n5\n6000\nMarvelous Watermelon\n20\n7500\nGreat Green Jewel\n2\n6800\nRecord Frame L\n20\n8500\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n2\n7600\nHigh Blue Jewel\n10\n9500\nGreat Blue Jewel\n2\n8400\nMarvelous Watermelon\n20\n10500\nGreat Red Jewel\n2\n9600\nMartial Arts Text\n3\n12000\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n10800\nHigh Red Jewel\n10\n13500\nAwakening Star\n5\n12000\nArcana Gems\n50\n15000\nArcana Gems\n50\nSpecial\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n400\nCoco Drink\n5\n800\nRestorative Potion\n20\n1600\nRelease Crystal (S)\n5\n2400\nSmall Gift\n3\n4000\nGlare Dragon Stone\n20\n5600\nRelease Crystal (M)\n5\n7200\nAwakening Star\n5\n8800\nMartial Arts Text\n5\n10400\nAwakening Star\n5\n12000\nGreat Green Jewel\n3\n13600\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n3\n15200\nGreat Blue Jewel\n3\n16800\nGreat Red Jewel\n3\n19200\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n21600\nAwakening Star\n5\n24000\nMemoria Niter S\n5\nAchievement Rewards\nComplete the conditions and receive event-limited records and items from achievement rewards.\nRecord\nAchievement Requirements\nAchievement Rewards\nI Love Watermelon!\nLet's collect a total of 1000 Marvelous Watermelons in the time period.\nMedal of Combat Arts×1\nSummer Illusion\nLet's collect a total of 2000 Marvelous Watermelons in the time period.\nMedal of Combat Arts×1\nIntuitively Smashing\nLet's collect a total of 5000 Marvelous Watermelons in the time period.\nMedal of Combat Arts×1\nHow to Participate\nOpen the List of Events from the Menu in the upper left corner of the screen, and tap the [Returning] Watermelon Panic! banner to go to the Day Beach.\nTalk to Asuna at the Day Beach to start the scenario quest.\nThe dungeon will be unlocked once you complete the scenario quest \"Enormous Shadow  Partner['23 Rewind]\".\nEvent Period\nStarts after the June 28, 2023 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the August 30, 2023 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete Main quest [The Indomitable Fang]\nBoss Monster\nMelo Spiritual Jovial\nDetails\nIt jumps around, unleashing its spinning and focus attacks one after another.\nBe careful! Its swaying small face spews out seeds that inflict the player with \"Bleed\" over a fairly long range.\nWeakness\nThrust Element\nWater Element\nStatus Ailments used\nStatus ailments \"Bleed\"\nImportant\nPlease check all Rewards in the game.\nIf you receive a stamp you already own, it will not have any effect when used.\nIf you have previously played the \"[Returning] Watermelon Panic!\" event, your progress will continue from the following points.\nTotal Score and Score Rewards\nChallenge rewards\nAchievements and achievement progress\nAmount traded\nEven if you have completed the scenario quest previously, you will be able to accept the request from the beginning and receive rewards.\n\"Marvelous Watermelons\" and \"Coco Drinks\" will be deleted on September 6, 2023 (Wed) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nAfter you clear a Special difficulty dungeon three times, you can't play it again until the limit resets at 4:00 (JST/UTC+9).\nThis event cannot be attempted with an Assist Party.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
    "startTime": "2023-06-27T19:00:00+00:00",
    "endTime": "2023-08-29T19:00:00+00:00"
