    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Striker Order\" is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2023-06-14 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nLeafa, Sinon, Asuna, and Klein are fighting with nothing but their physical bodies in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nStriker Order\n\" is here! Get one new ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Rising Young Power] Leafa\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nDark Divide\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nBlunt/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n63\nBreak Gauge\n63\nSkill Effect\n2070% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Blaze 4/Buff] Attack +20 per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nAttack +2500 → 5000 → 7500 to enemies when using break.\n★4[Oncoming Challenger] Sinon\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nLightning Shock\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nThrust/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n38\nBreak Gauge\n35\nSkill Effect\n1650% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Holy Light Demon 3/Buff] Holy element damage +45% for 8 sec./[Hunter's Eye 4/Buff] The lower you HP, critical rate increases for 15 sec./▲[Bonus] Additional damage according to your own attack.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Lightning in the Ring] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nDark Comet\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n40\nBreak Gauge\n40\nSkill Effect\n1350% damage (4x hit/Single Foe)[Motion Range]/▲▲▲[Bonus] Damage +100% to enemies when using dark skills./[Bonus] Attack +1500 against enemies with the slash element.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Champion's Road] Klein\nSkill Name\nKing of Axes/Devotion\nAttack\n61\nDefense\n26\nHP\n2575\nSkill Effect\n[King of Axes 3] Attack +1000 when using 2H Axe./[Devotion 4] Attack +20% when HP is above 75%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n\"[Rising Young Power] Leafa\", \"[Oncoming Challenger] Sinon\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nStarts after the June 14, 2023 (Wed) maintenance and ends July 16, 2023 (Sun) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9).\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
