    "full_details": "Notices\n[Holiday Campaign] The Grand Order is here! ★4 birthday Skill Records are part of this lineup!\nShop\n2023-06-10 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nHoliday Campaign!\nThe \"\nHoliday Campaign! Grand Order\n\" is here, and ★4 Skill Records are part of this lineup, including birthday Skill Records!\nOn Steps 1 and 2, the\ndrop rate for ★4 Skill Records is 8%\n!\nOn Step 3, the\ndrop rate for ★4 Skill Records is increased to 15%\nand\none ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed!\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Gazing Into the Future] Koharu\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Dark Boost/Talent Shift\nAttack\n54\nDefense\n34\nHP\n2425\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 3] Attack +800./[Dark Boost 4] Elemental damage other than dark dealt to enemies -50%, and dark element's damage to enemies +40%./[Talent Shift 5] Effect changes depending on the Skill Records in the same set.When equipping 1 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, +success rate for Frostbite.Attack +20% when equipping no Kirito Skill Records in the same set.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Natural Look] Sachi\nSkill Name\nEnhance Attack/RUSH/Fast and Easy\nAttack\n58\nDefense\n42\nHP\n2200\nSkill Effect\n[Enhance Attack 5] Attack +18%./[RUSH4] Recovers SP by 30 when hitting with switch and HIT number exceeds 50./[Fast and Easy] Lowers flinch resistance by 100%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Yell of Encouragement] Agil\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nAir Smash\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n40\nBreak Gauge\n40\nSkill Effect\n1620% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Small]/▲▲[Bonus] Attack + 50% in proportion with your remaining HP (the more remaining HP, the higher)./[Bonus] When equipping 3 or more of Agil's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1200.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Sweeping Blade] Philia\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nSomersault Rock\nSP Cost\n21\nElement\nSlash/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n13.0\nSwitch Gauge\n30\nBreak Gauge\n30\nSkill Effect\n1300% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Mark/Debuff] The next attack the enemy receives will induce double damage.(Applies to other party member's attacks. Effect will disappear after 10 sec if not activated.)/[Earth Dragon Demon 3/Buff] Earth element damage +45% for 8 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nFury\n[When Rush Activates] Own max HP 20% recovers.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n- Duration\nJune 10, 2023 (Sat) 17:00 - June 19, 2023 (Mon) 16:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n2,000 Arcana Gems\n8% total Drop Rate for ★4 Skill Records!\nSTEP2\n2,000 Arcana Gems\n8% total Drop Rate for ★4 Skill Records!\nSTEP3\n4,000 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed! 15% total Drop Rate for ★4 Skill Records!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
