    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Argo's Birthday Order\" is here! Featuring new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3! All ★4 Skill Records are Argo!\nShop\n2023-06-05 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Argo's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Poolside at the Resort] Argo\n\" and \"\n[Cheers to Victory] Argo\n(Burst Skill)\" are now available!\n\"\nArgo's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Argo guaranteed on Step 3!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3, one ★4 \"Argo\" is guaranteed!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Poolside at the Resort] Argo\nSkill Name\nKing of Daggers/Poisonous Blow\nAttack\n54\nDefense\n42\nHP\n2500\nSkill Effect\n[King of Daggers 3] Attack +1000 when using daggers./[Poisonous Blow 4] Attack +24% against poisoned enemies.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Cheers to Victory] Argo\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nStone Hash Burst\nSkill Name\nStone Hash\nSP Cost\n28\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nSlash/\nEarth\nElement\nSlash/\nEarth\nActivation Requirements\nEarth\n→Slash→\nEarth\n→\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n36\nSwitch Gauge\n36\nBreak Gauge\n26\nBreak Gauge\n52\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n1700% damage (4x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Poison/Status Ailments] Make it Poison (Stack 3) for 30 sec./[Earth Element Enhance4/Buff] Earth element damage +9% for 15 sec.\n*Less likely to attract aggro from enemies.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4080% damage (4x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Bonus] Attack +100% against enemy with status ailments (Poison, Burn, Bleed, Frostbite)./[Bonus] Damage +50% towards the monsters not targetted to the player.\n* Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP28)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n[Cheers to Victory] Argo is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nJune 5, 2023 (Mon) 0:00 - June 14, 2023 (Wed) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1,250 Arcana Gems (50% Off)\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nOne ★4 \"Argo\" guaranteed!\nOn every Step, all ★4 Skill Records are \"Argo\"!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nGo to Notice List"
