    "snippet": "Aviso para aquellos usuarios que inician sesión en \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\". El límite comercial disponible para el comerciante de medallas de artes de combate se restablecerá el 1 de junio de 2023 a las 4:00 (JST/UTC+9).  ¡Recoge \"Medallas de artes de combate\" y obtén una variedad de artículos en Trader! Hemos preparado \"Metales centrales\", \"Piedra de armamento...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nAvailable trade limit for \"Medal of Combat Arts Trader\" resets on 6/1, 2023!\nNOTICES\n2023-05-31 12:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\"\nThe available trade limit for the Medal of Combat Arts Trader will reset on 6/1, 2023 at 4:00 (JST/UTC+9).\nCollect \"Medals of Combat Arts\" and get a variety of items at the Trader!\nWe've prepared \"Core Metals\", \"Armament Stones\", \"Chaos Crystals\" and \"Release Crystals\" that are needed to acquire proficiency skills!\nAbout Medal of Combat Arts.\nParticipate in the events and gather Medal of Combat Arts!\nYou can get some Medals of Combat Arts from different in-game events.\n\"Medal of Combat Arts\" Trader\nFind the Trader by going to Menu → Items → Enhance/Trade → Trade Limited Items and tapping the Trade Medal of Combat Arts banner.\nYou can also check by going to NPC Trader → Trade Limited Items and tapping the Trade Medal of Combat Arts banner.\nMerchant District/NPC\"Trader\"\nMedal of Combat Arts Trader Lineup\n* The trade limit will reset on the 1st of every month at 4:00 (JST/UTC+9).\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nPermanent Lineup\nCore Metal\n100\n2\nSticky Thing Armament Stone\n50\n1\nCrossgigas Armament Stone\n47\n1\nAsura Armament Stone\n44\n1\nOne-Eyed Beast Armament Stone\n36\n1\nHalf Beast Armament Stone\n33\n1\nBlazing Armament Stone\n30\n1\nAmber Chaos Crystal\n40\n1\nCrimson Chaos Crystal\n30\n1\nRelease Crystal (L)\n5\n5\nRelease Crystal (M)×2\n1\n10\nMartial Arts Text×5\n1\n5\nAwakening Star×5\n3\n10\nGreat Red Jewel\n3\n5\nGreat Green Jewel\n3\n5\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n3\n5\nGreat Blue Jewel\n3\n5\nExp Crystal L\n3\n1\nExp Crystal M×5\n2\n1\nMemoria Niter L\n50\n1\nMemoria Niter M×10\n50\n1\nMemoria Niter S×20\n50\n1\nRevive Crystal×3\n1\n20\nLimited-Time Only Lineup\n★3[Girl on the Run] Yuuki\n29\n1\n★4[Man of the Day] Kirito\n47\n1\n★4[Scarlet Loyalty] Asuna\n47\n1\nTrick-or-Pump A\n10\n1\nTrick-or-Pump B\n10\n1\nTrick-or-Pump C\n10\n1\nWitch Pump Mask A\n10\n1\nWitch Pump Mask B\n10\n1\nWitch Pump Mask C\n10\n1\n★4[Black Pioneer] Kirito\n44\n1\n★3[Peaceful Smile] Yui\n50\n1\nBear Suit Top and Bottom White\n35\n1\nBear Suit Head A White\n4\n1\nBear Suit Head B White\n4\n1\nBear Paw Badge A White\n1\n1\nBear Paw Badge B White\n1\n1\nBear Suit Top and Bottom Brown\n35\n1\nBear Suit Head A Brown\n4\n1\nBear Suit Head B Brown\n4\n1\nBear Paw Badge A Brown\n1\n1\nBear Paw Badge B Brown\n1\n1\nBear Suit Top and Bottom Peach\n35\n1\nBear Suit Head A Peach\n4\n1\nBear Suit Head B Peach\n4\n1\nBear Paw Badge A Peach\n1\n1\nBear Paw Badge B Peach\n1\n1\nBear Suit Top and Bottom\n35\n1\nBear Suit Head A\n4\n1\nBear Suit Head B\n4\n1\nBear Paw Badge A\n1\n1\nBear Paw Badge B\n1\n1\nRare Mush Bow\n7\n1\nRare Mush Bow Bright\n24\n1\nAvatar\nItem Icon\nItem Name\nType\nWitch Pump Mask A\nAccessory Avatar\nWitch Pump Mask B\nAccessory Avatar\nWitch Pump Mask C\nAccessory Avatar\nTrick-or-Pump A\nAccessory Avatar\nTrick-or-Pump B\nAccessory Avatar\nTrick-or-Pump C\nAccessory Avatar\nBear Avatar\nRare Mush Bow Bright\nImportant\nThere are some limited-time items in the Medal of Combat Arts Trader that will update once every 3 months.\nThe next lineup update is planned for 7/1, 2023 (Sat) 4:00 (JST/UTC+9).\nDepending on the event, \"Medals of Combat Arts\" may not be available as a reward.\nThe schedule and lineup may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
