    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Lisbeth's Birthday Order\" is here! Featuring new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3! All ★4 Skill Records are Lisbeth!\nShop\n2023-05-18 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Lisbeth's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Revealed Feelings] Lisbeth\n(Awakening Skill)\" and \"\n[Catching My Breath] Lisbeth\n(Accele Skill)\" are now available!\n\"\nLisbeth's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Lisbeth guaranteed on Step 3!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3, one ★4 \"Lisbeth\" is guaranteed!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Revealed Feelings] Lisbeth\nSkill Name\nBattle with Ease/Engrave\nAttack\n50\nDefense\n46\nHP\n3025\nSkill Effect\n[Battle with Ease 4] Attack +25% while the buff that gradually recovers HP depending on the Skill Record is in effect./[Engrave] When equipping 3 or more of Lisbeth's Skill Records in the same set and hitting with switch, adds debuff (Mark).(Invalid when equipped by Partner)The next attack the enemy receives will induce double damage.(Applies to other party member's attacks. Effect will disappear after 10 sec if not activated.)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nPincer Attack\n[During Rush] Damage +15% when using switch.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Catching My Breath] Lisbeth\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nWind Fall\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n80\nBreak Gauge\n40\nSkill Effect\n1600% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Wind Pile/Buff] Wind element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Wind Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Wind element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect30sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n- Duration\nMay 18, 2023 (Thu) 0:00 - May 27, 2023 (Sat) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1,250 Arcana Gems (50% Off)\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nOne ★4 \"Lisbeth\" guaranteed!\nOn every Step, all ★4 Skill Records are \"Lisbeth\"!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nGo to Notice List"
