    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Gold Grab Bag Order\" is here! Two ★4 Skill Records guaranteed! 20% ★4 Skill Record Rate!\nShop\n2023-04-27 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nFifth times per player!\nGet\ntwo ★4 Skill Records guaranteed\nat the \"Gold Grab Bag Order\"!\nThe\n20% total drop rate\ndoes not include the guaranteed ★4 Skill Record!\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Light that Purifies Chaos] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nHydro Shower\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n105\nBreak Gauge\n48\nSkill Effect\n1650% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Ultimate Light 4/Buff] Own critical rate raises, and reduces the next damage taken (Stack 5) during 20 sec.Critical rate +1% per stack, and reduces the next damage taken by -1% per stack.Each effects will be removed by taking damage./[Ultimate Light 4/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Own critical rate raises, and reduces the next damage taken (Stack 15) during 20 sec.Critical rate +1% per stack, and reduces the next damage taken by -1% per stack.Each effects will be removed by taking damage.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect30sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n★4[Air Crosser] Kirito\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nShadow Slant\nSP Cost\n20\nElement\nSlash/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n30\nBreak Gauge\n27\nSkill Effect\n1280% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Small Mark/Debuff] When the target is hit using the Switch, The next attack the enemy receives will induce 1.5x damage.(Applies to other party member's attacks. Effect will disappear after 10 sec if not activated.)/▲[Bonus] Critical rate +100% against enemies with the blunt element.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nMind's Eye\n[During Rush] Critical damage +7.5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Fairy Maid] Leafa\nWeapon Type\nShield\nSkill Name\nAir Strike\nSP Cost\n20\nElement\nBlunt/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n35\nBreak Gauge\n36\nSkill Effect\n440% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Weak Blunt 4/Debuff] Blunt element's weakness damage +25% for 15 sec./▲[Bonus]Raises 2 stacks for all Stack buffs that are on yourself.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Duration\nApril 27, 2023 (Thu) 17:00 - May 8, 2023 (Mon) 16:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Offers\n11 Order for 5,000 Arcana Gems\n- Important\nThis can only be purchased fifth times per account.\nThere is no single Order.\nCheck the in-game Order details for more information on the entire lineup and the drop rates.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
