    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Arcana Gem Super Boost Campaign\" is here! Get up to 2,000 extra Arcana Gems!\nCampaign\n2023-04-27 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\"\n\"\nArcana Gem Super Boost Campaign\n\" begins!\nDon't pass up this chance to get tons of extra Arcana Gems!\n-Campaign Duration\nStarts after the 4/27, 2023 17:00 - 4/30, 2023 23:59(JST/UTC+9)\n-Campaign Contents\nProduct Name\nArcana Gems\nArcana Gem A\nTotal: 60\nArcana Gem B\nTotal: 300\nArcana Gem C\nTotal: 680\nArcana Gem D\nTotal: 1,500\n(1,280\n+220 extra Gems\n)\nArcana Gem E\nTotal: 2,700\nArcana Gem F\nTotal: 5,000\n（4,200\n+800 extra Gems\n）\nArcana Gem G\nTotal: 10,800\n（8,800\n+2,000 extra Gems\n）\n-Important\nExtra Arcana Gems are only available once per bundle.\nGo to Notice List"
