    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Nostalgic Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2023-04-23 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nSinon, Argo, Klein, and Koharu are decked out in rockabilly outfits in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nNostalgic Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Classical Coordinate] Sinon\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nAqua Shoot\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n48\nBreak Gauge\n36\nSkill Effect\n1300% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using water skills./[Bonus] When equipping 3 or more of Sinon's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Cheerful Rockabilly] Argo\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nHydro Swing\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n34\nBreak Gauge\n29\nSkill Effect\n1340% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using water skills./[Bonus] When equipping 1 or more of Lisbeth's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Pop Rocker] Klein\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nFire Brandish\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nThrust/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n80\nBreak Gauge\n61\nSkill Effect\n1600% damage (4x hit/All Foes)[Center/Arc/Wide]/[Fire Element Weak 4/Debuff] Fire element damage to monster +25% for 10 sec./[Duel 4/Buff] Adds a buff to self and enemy you hit.Self: Attack +35% for 15 sec.Enemy: Enemy's attack +1% per stack (Stack5) for 30 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Refreshing Grape Soda] Koharu\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Aqua Boost/Stagehand\nAttack\n55\nDefense\n30\nHP\n2500\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 3] Attack +800./[Aqua Boost 4] Elemental damage other than water dealt to enemies -50%, and water element's damage to enemies +40%./[Stagehand 4] When equipping 2 or more of Koharu's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +20%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Duration\nApril 23, 2023 (Sun) 17:00 - May 14, 2023 (Sun) 16:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
