    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Eugeo's Birthday Order\" is here! Featuring new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3! All ★4 Skill Records are Eugeo!\nShop\n2023-04-10 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Eugeo's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Fragrant Rose] Eugeo\n\" and \"\n[Freezing Knight] Eugeo\n(Awakening Skill)\" are now available!\n\"\nEugeo's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Eugeo guaranteed on Step 3!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3, one ★4 \"Eugeo\" is guaranteed!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Fragrant Rose] Eugeo\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Wind Boost/Ice Flower\nAttack\n54\nDefense\n34\nHP\n2425\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 3] Attack +800./[Wind Boost 4] Elemental damage other than wind dealt to enemies -50%, and wind element's damage to enemies +40%./[Ice Flower 4] When equipping 2 or more of Eugeo's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +20%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Freezing Knight] Eugeo\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nSavage Wind Noise\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nSlash/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n13.0\nSwitch Gauge\n45\nBreak Gauge\n37\nSkill Effect\n1360% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Knight's Shield 4/Buff]Own DEF increases (Stack 3) +1% per Stack for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nStack Boost\n[When Rush Activates] Raises 10 stacks for all Stack buffs that are on yourself.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n- Duration\nApril 10, 2023 (Mon) 0:00 - April 19, 2023 (Wed) 23:59\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1,250 Arcana Gems (50% Off)\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nOne ★4 \"Eugeo\" guaranteed!\nOn every Step, all ★4 Skill Records are \"Eugeo\"!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nGo to Notice List"
