    "snippet": "Para celebrar el cumpleaños de Philia, ¡los nuevos registros de habilidades ★4 \"[Cofre del tesoro de celebración] Philia\" y \"[Sweeping Blade] Philia (habilidad del despertar)\" ya están disponibles! ¡La \"Orden de Cumpleaños de Philia\" ya está aquí! ¡Obtén una Philia ★4 garantizada en el Paso 3!  ¡En el Paso 1, puedes obtener 11 pedidos por 1250 gemas arcanas! En Ste...",
    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Philia's Birthday Order\" is here! Featuring new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3! All ★4 Skill Records are Philia!\nShop\n2023-03-31 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Philia's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Celebratory Treasure Chest] Philia\n\" and \"\n[Sweeping Blade] Philia\n(Awakening Skill)\" are now available!\n\"\nPhilia's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Philia guaranteed on Step 3!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3, one ★4 \"Philia\" is guaranteed!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Celebratory Treasure Chest] Philia\nSkill Name\nKing of Daggers/Enhance Attack\nAttack\n55\nDefense\n40\nHP\n2500\nSkill Effect\n[King of Daggers 3] Attack +1000 when using daggers./[Enhance Attack 4] Attack +15%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Sweeping Blade] Philia\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nSomersault Rock\nSP Cost\n21\nElement\nSlash/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n13.0\nSwitch Gauge\n30\nBreak Gauge\n30\nSkill Effect\n1300% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Mark/Debuff] The next attack the enemy receives will induce double damage.(Applies to other party member's attacks. Effect will disappear after 10 sec if not activated.)/[Earth Dragon Demon 3/Buff] Earth element damage +45% for 8 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nFury\n[When Rush Activates] Own max HP 20% recovers.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n- Duration\nMarch 31, 2023 (Fri) 0:00 - April 9, 2023 (Sun) 23:59\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1,250 Arcana Gems (50% Off)\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nOne ★4 \"Philia\" guaranteed!\nOn every Step, all ★4 Skill Records are \"Philia\"!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nGo to Notice List"
