    "full_details": "Notices\nAbout modifications to some skill names\nNOTICES\n2023-03-22 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\"\nDuring March 22, 2023 (Wed) maintenance, the names of some skills were modified.\nModified content\nAlong with the addition of the new \"Skill Releaser\" feature, we have modified the names of some skills, as they were different from what was intended.\nNo changes have been made to the effects of modified skills.\nRelevant Skill Records\nSkill name before modification\nSkill name after modification\n[Vivid Strike] Kirito\nVorpal Beat\nRushing Beat\n[Black Knight] Kirito\nValiant Savage\nValiant Shade\n[Total Victory] Yuuki\nScatter Slash\nScatter Ripper\n[Fragrant Olive Knight] Alice\nHoly Slash\nHoly Ripper\n[Fresh Green] Leafa\nAir Slash\nAir Ripper\n[Enchanting Dancer] Yuuki\nSimoom Slash\nSimoom Ripper\n[Jet Black Rose] Eugeo\nDark Rose Slash\nDark Rose Ripper\n[Jet Black Rose] Eugeo\nDark Rose Slash Burst\nDark Rose Ripper Burst\n[Tea Party Host] Alice\nDominant Slash\nDominant Ripper\n[Slashing Darkness] Leafa\nWater Slash\nWater Ripper\n[Sweet Present] Alice\nClod of Earth Slash\nClod of Earth Ripper\n[Ice-cold Glare] Mater\nBlue Star\nBlue Pulsar\n[Flash Seeker] Asuna\nGreen Star\nGreen Pulsar\n[White Future] Asuna\nChestnut Star\nChestnut Pulsar\n[Lady Style] Lisbeth\nFeint Crush\nFeint Earth\n[Secret Truth] Mater\nRumble Whirl\nRumbling Frost\n[Majestic] Klein\nAssault Dive\nSamurai Dive\n[Navy Pursuit] Sachi\nVolcano Fall\nVolcano Down\n[Enchanting Shipbuilder] Leafa\nDarkness Fall\nDarkness Down\n[Enchanting Shipbuilder] Leafa\nDarkness Fall Burst\nDarkness Down Burst\n[The Truth in Her Eyes] Sachi\nCrag Fall\nCrag Down\n[Mesmerizing Archery] Sinon\nSnowman Shot\nSnowman Needle\n[Hawk Eye] Sinon\nHawk Shot\nHawk Needle\n[Cute Vampire] Sinon\nCandy Rain\nCandy Squall\n[Emerald Moon] Sachi\nStone Rain\nStone Squall\n[Inseparable Bond] Koharu\nStardust Rain\nStardust Squall\n[Two Precise Arrows] Sinon\nBurning Rain\nBurning Squall\n[Spirited Roar] Sinon\nPhoton Rain\nPhoton Squall\n[Piercing Gaze] Sinon\nBlaze Storm\nRapid Fire\nWe will continue to  make modifications while considering the circumstances of our customers.\nWe hope you continue to enjoy \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nGo to Notice List"
