    "full_details": "Notices\n【5 Year Anniversary】\"The Way of the Swordsmen Panel Mission\" is here! Play the scenario event \"The Way of the Swordsmen\" to get a ★4 Sinon Skill Record and other items!\nEVENT\n2023-03-15 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nSword Art Online Integral Factor's Worldwide 5 Year Anniversary!\nPlay the scenario event \"The Way of the Swordsmen\" and get rewards from the special\n\"The Way of the Swordsmen Panel Mission\"\non now!\nRewards\nYou can get the ★4[This Is for You] Sinon Skill Record by equipping the \"???\" Weapon Avatar from the scenario event \"The Way of the Swordsmen\".\nClear quests and dungeons to get useful items like Revive Crystals, Life Potions, Record Frame L, and Glare Dragon Stones.\nGet ★4[This Is for You] Sinon as a completion reward by clearing all the missions listed on a panel.\n▼Skill Record\n★4[This Is for You] Sinon\nSkill Name\nAdvance Trooper/Crisis Heal\nAttack\n58\nDefense\n30\nHP\n2275\nSkill Effect\n●[Advance Trooper 2] Attack +200./●[Crisis Heal 4] Recovers HP 200 every 3 sec when HP is under 20%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nPeriod\nStarts after the March 15, 2023 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the April 12, 2023 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\n* This Panel Mission Reward is available until April 19, 2023 (Wed) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nMission Details\nMission\nRewards\nAmount\nClear the 1st quest of this event\nRevive Crystal\n20\nClear the 2nd quest of this event\nLife Potion\n20\nClear the 3rd quest of this event\nRecord Frame L\n30\nClear the 4th quest of this event\nGlare Dragon Stone\n30\nEquip the ???.\n★4[This Is for You] Sinon\n1\nEquip [This Is for You] Sinon.\nFruit Water\n30\nClear the Phosphorescent Cave 1 time\nSaleable Col Bag\n* You will be able to sell it at the Merchant for 100,000 Col.\n1\nClear the Phosphorescent Cave 5 times\nMartial Arts Text\n3\nClear the Phosphorescent Cave 10 times\nRelease Crystal (S)\n10\nComplete Reward\nAmount\n★4[This Is for You] Sinon\n1\nImportant\nPlease check the name of the \"???\" Weapon Avatar in the game.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
