    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Doll Festival Order\" is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2023-02-28 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nAlice, Yuuki, Sinon, and Leafa are elegantly dressed in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nDoll Festival Order\n\" is here! Get one new ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[It Feels a Bit Heavy...] Yuuki\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nHydro Cinque\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n30\nBreak Gauge\n20\nSkill Effect\n1350% damage (6x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using water skills./[Bonus] Attack +1500 against enemies with the slash element.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Court Officer Girl] Alice\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nPhoton Slash\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n42\nBreak Gauge\n35\nSkill Effect\n1380% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using holy skills./[Bonus] When equipping 3 or more of Alice's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Happy Beat] Leafa\nSkill Name\nEnhance Thrust/Icy Blade/Prosper\nAttack\n57\nDefense\n34\nHP\n2950\nSkill Effect\n[Enhance Thrust 4] Damage done to enemies weak to thrusting +24%./[Icy Blade 4] Deals +20% Water element's damage to enemy./[Prosper 4] Attack +20% when HP is above 50%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Mesmerizing Archery] Sinon\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nAqua Needle\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n102\nBreak Gauge\n58\nSkill Effect\n1550% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Wide]/[Aqua Pile/Buff] Water element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Aqua Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, water element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect30sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n- Duration\nStarts after the February 28, 2023 (Tue) maintenance and ends on March 31, 2023 (Fri) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9).\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
