    "full_details": "Notices\nWeapon proficiency level cap raised and weapon proficiency skills added\nUPDATE\n2023-02-22 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\"\nThe weapon proficiency level cap has been raised and weapon proficiency skills have been added as of the maintenance on February 22, 2023 (Wed).\n《Weapon Proficiency Level Cap Raised》\nThe weapon proficiency level cap has been raised from\nlevel 90\nto\nlevel 95\n.\n《Weapon Proficiency Skills Added》\nNew weapon proficiency skills have been added.\nFor more details about the added skills, consult the information below.\nSkill Name\nMaximumLv\nEffect\nRelease condition\n1H Sword\nSurvival Expertise (1H Sword)\nLv.10\nHP +1000 when 1H Sword is equipped\nProficiency（1H Sword）Lv.55 and up\nSword Skill Mastery (1H Sword)Lv.5 and up\nStrong Defense Expertise (1H Sword)\nLv.10\nDefense +25 when 1H Sword is equipped\nProficiency（1H Sword）Lv.65 and up\nSurvival Expertise (1H Sword)Lv.5 and up\nFierce Attack Expertise (1H Sword)\nLv.10\nAttack +50 when 1H Sword is equipped\nProficiency（1H Sword）Lv.75 and up\nStrong Defense Expertise (1H Sword)Lv.5 and up\nSingle Sword Skill Mastery (1H Sword)\nLv.10\nSword skill power (Single) +25% when 1H Sword is equipped\nProficiency（1H Sword）Lv.85 and up\nFierce Attack Expertise (1H Sword)Lv.5 and up\nSword Skill Proficiency (1H Sword)\nLv.10\nSword skill power +10% (Effective with all weapons)\nProficiency（1H Sword）Lv.95 and up\nSingle Sword Skill Mastery (1H Sword)Lv.5 and up\n1H Rapier\nSurvival Expertise (1H Rapier)\nLv.10\nHP +1000 when 1H Rapier is equipped\nProficiency（1H Rapier）Lv.55 and up\nSword Skill Mastery (1H Rapier)Lv.5 and up\nStrong Defense Expertise (1H Rapier)\nLv.10\nDefense +25 when 1H Rapier is equipped\nProficiency（1H Rapier）Lv.65 and up\nSurvival Expertise (1H Rapier)Lv.5 and up\nFierce Attack Expertise (1H Rapier)\nLv.10\nAttack +50 when 1H Rapier is equipped\nProficiency（1H Rapier）Lv.75 and up\nStrong Defense Expertise (1H Rapier)Lv.5 and up\nPrecise Strike\nLv.10\nWhen 1H Rapier is equipped, critical rate +15% with sword skills\nProficiency（1H Rapier）Lv.85 and up\nFierce Attack Expertise (1H Rapier)Lv.5 and up\nElaborate Strike\nLv.10\nAdds a buff when 1H Rapier is equipped, critical damage +10% for 8 sec right after hitting with switch.\nProficiency（1H Rapier）Lv.95 and up\nPrecise Strike Lv.5 and up\n1H Club\nSurvival Expertise (1H Club)\nLv.10\nHP +1000 when 1H Club is equipped\nProficiency（1H Club）Lv.55 and up\nSword Skill Mastery (1H Club)Lv.5 and up\nStrong Defense Expertise (1H Club)\nLv.10\nDefense +25 when 1H Club is equipped\nProficiency（1H Club）Lv.65 and up\nSurvival Expertise (1H Club)Lv.5 and up\nFierce Attack Expertise (1H Club)\nLv.10\nAttack +50 when 1H Club is equipped\nProficiency（1H Club）Lv.75 and up\nStrong Defense Expertise (1H Club)Lv.5 and up\nHigh Defense\nLv.10\nWhen 1H Club is equipped, defense +5% while receiving a buff on yourself\nProficiency（1H Club）Lv.85 and up\nFierce Attack Expertise (1H Club)Lv.5 and up\nEncouragement\nLv.10\nAdds a buff when 1H Club is equipped attack +2% for you and party members for 4 sec right after hitting with switch.\nProficiency（1H Club）Lv.95 and up\nHigh Defense Lv.5 and up\nDagger\nSurvival Expertise (Dagger)\nLv.10\nHP +1000 when Dagger is equipped\nProficiency（Dagger）Lv.55 and up\nSword Skill Mastery (Dagger)Lv.5 and up\nStrong Defense Expertise (Dagger)\nLv.10\nDefense +25 when Dagger is equipped\nProficiency（Dagger）Lv.65 and up\nSurvival Expertise (Dagger)Lv.5 and up\nFierce Attack Expertise (Dagger)\nLv.10\nAttack +50 when Dagger is equipped\nProficiency（Dagger）Lv.75 and up\nStrong Defense Expertise (Dagger)Lv.5 and up\nStatus Ailment Bonus\nLv.10\nWhen Dagger is equipped, attack power +100 against enemies with status ailments(Paralysisb, Stun, Sleep, Curse, Poison, Burn, Bleed, Frostbite)\nProficiency（Dagger）Lv.85 and up\nFierce Attack Expertise (Dagger)Lv.5 and up\nPolished Strike\nLv.10\nWhen Dagger is equipped, attack power is increased against enemies with status ailments (Poison, Burn, Bleed, Frostbite). +0.1% per stack\nProficiency（Dagger）Lv.95 and up\nStatus Ailment Bonus Lv.5 and up\n2H Axe\nSurvival Expertise (2H Axe)\nLv.10\nHP +1000 when 2H Axe is equipped\nProficiency（2H Axe）Lv.55 and up\nSword Skill Mastery (2H Axe)Lv.5 and up\nStrong Defense Expertise (2H Axe)\nLv.10\nDefense +25 when 2H Axe is equipped\nProficiency（2H Axe）Lv.65 and up\nSurvival Expertise (2H Axe)Lv.5 and up\nFierce Attack Expertise (2H Axe)\nLv.10\nAttack +50 when 2H Axe is equipped\nProficiency（2H Axe）Lv.75 and up\nStrong Defense Expertise (2H Axe)Lv.5 and up\nDynamic Assault\nLv.10\nWhen 2H Axe is equipped, attack +2.5% when using break.\nProficiency（2H Axe）Lv.85 and up\nFierce Attack Expertise (2H Axe)Lv.5 and up\nSingle Sword Skill Mastery (2H Axe)\nLv.10\nSword skill power (Single) +25% when 2H Axe is equipped\nProficiency（2H Axe）Lv.95 and up\nDynamic Assault Lv.5 and up\n2H Spear\nSurvival Expertise (2H Spear)\nLv.10\nHP +1000 when 2H Spear is equipped\nProficiency（2H Spear）Lv.55 and up\nSword Skill Mastery (2H Spear)Lv.5 and up\nStrong Defense Expertise (2H Spear)\nLv.10\nDefense +25 when 2H Spear is equipped\nProficiency（2H Spear）Lv.65 and up\nSurvival Expertise (2H Spear)Lv.5 and up\nFierce Attack Expertise (2H Spear)\nLv.10\nAttack +50 when 2H Spear is equipped\nProficiency（2H Spear）Lv.75 and up\nStrong Defense Expertise (2H Spear)Lv.5 and up\nOverall Sword Skill Mastery (2H Spear)\nLv.10\nWhen 2H Spear is equipped, sword skill power (Overall) +25%\nProficiency（2H Spear）Lv.85 and up\nFierce Attack Expertise (2H Spear)Lv.5 and up\nDestruction Art\nLv.10\nWhen 2H Spear is equipped, increase in break gauge to enemy by +10%\nProficiency（2H Spear）Lv.95 and up\nOverall Sword Skill Mastery (2H Spear)Lv.5 and up\nBow\nSurvival Expertise (Bow)\nLv.10\nHP +1000 when Bow is equipped\nProficiency（Bow）Lv.55 and up\nSword Skill Mastery (Bow)Lv.5 and up\nStrong Defense Expertise (Bow)\nLv.10\nDefense +25 when Bow is equipped\nProficiency（Bow）Lv.65 and up\nSurvival Expertise (Bow)Lv.5 and up\nFierce Attack Expertise (Bow)\nLv.10\nAttack +50 when Bow is equipped\nProficiency（Bow）Lv.75 and up\nStrong Defense Expertise (Bow)Lv.5 and up\nReverse Strike\nLv.10\nWhen Bow is equipped, attack +(100×(1-percent of HP)) the lower your HP\nProficiency（Bow）Lv.85 and up\nFierce Attack Expertise (Bow)Lv.5 and up\nSingle Sword Skill Mastery (Bow)\nLv.10\nSword skill power (Single) +25% when Bow is equipped\nProficiency（Bow）Lv.95 and up\nReverse Strike Lv.5 and up\nShield\nShield Healing\nLv.10\nWhen Shield is equipped, recovers HP for 50 per 3 sec\nProficiency（Shield）Lv.55 and up\nSword Skill Mastery (Shield)Lv.5 and up\nBody Enhancement (Shield)\nLv.10\nHP +500 (All Weapons)\nProficiency（Shield）Lv.65 and up\nShield Healing Lv.5 and up\nPowerful Blow\nLv.10\nWhen Shield is equipped, damage done to enemies weak to blunt element +10%\nProficiency（Shield）Lv.75 and up\nBody Enhancement (Shield)Lv.5 and up\n* At Max Level\n* There are no additional Assisting Character proficiency skills.\nGo to Notice List"
