    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Ordinal Scale Selection Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\nShop\n2023-02-18 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nOne ★4 Yuna or Nautilus (Eiji) Skill Record\nguaranteed\n!\nThe \"\nOrdinal Scale Selection Order\n\" is on!\n- Duration\nFebruary 18, 2023 (Sat) 0:00 - Before the February 28, 2023 (Tue) Maintenance (JST/UTC+9)\n- Offers\n11 Order for 2,500 Arcana Gems\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Rising Highest Tide] Yuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nFeint Fire\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nBlunt/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n38\nBreak Gauge\n35\nSkill Effect\n1300% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Parry4/Buff] When this skill direct hits, the damage you receive decreases at 50%(Effect will disappear after 20 sec if not activated).\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nBoost 10 → 20 → 30 to your own switch guage when hitting with skills.\n★4[Brilliant Combat] Eiji\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nWind Slash\nSP Cost\n20\nElement\nSlash/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n42\nBreak Gauge\n17\nSkill Effect\n1080% damage (3x hit/All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Wind Element Weak 4/Debuff] Wind element damage to monster +25% for 10 sec./▲▲[Bonus] When equipping 1 or more of Yuna's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000./[Bonus] Deal 1000 x the number of Yuna Skill Records in the same set in additional damage.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nLightning Flash\n[During Rush] Critical rate +20%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Supporting Tone] Yuna\nWeapon Type\nShield\nSkill Name\nHoly Strike\nSP Cost\n20\nElement\nBlunt/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n35\nBreak Gauge\n36\nSkill Effect\n430% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Enhance Thrust 4/Buff] Damage done to enemies weak to thrust +30% for 20 sec./▲[Bonus] Damage done to enemies weak to blunt +25%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Kind Decision] Nautilus\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nCross Current\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n46\nBreak Gauge\n43\nSkill Effect\n860% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Weak Defense 3/Debuff] Chance to decrease enemy's Defense for 15% for 10 sec./[Weak Attack 3/Debuff] Chance to decrease enemy's Attack for 15% for 10 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Important\nThere is no single Order.\nCheck the in-game Order details for more information on the entire lineup and the drop rates.\nPlease be aware that the period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
