    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Magic Academy Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2023-02-15 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nAsuna, Yuuki, Lisbeth, and Koharu are students at a magic school in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nMagic Academy Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Everyone's Mediator] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nHydron\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n90\nBreak Gauge\n54\nSkill Effect\n1650% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Aqua Pile/Buff] Water element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Aqua Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, water element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect30sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n★4[No Fear of Failure] Lisbeth\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nDemolishing Rock\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nBlunt/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n48\nBreak Gauge\n37\nSkill Effect\n1300% damage (4x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Muscle Build Up 4/Buff] Attack + 1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nBoost 10 → 20 → 30 to your own switch guage when hitting with skills.\n★4[A Little Trial and Error] Yuuki\nSkill Name\nEnhance Petrify Res./The Legendary Sword's Rule/Encircle Break\nAttack\n51\nDefense\n42\nHP\n2725\nSkill Effect\n●[Enhance Petrify Res. 5] Petrify resistance +70%./[The Legendary Sword's Rule] Attack +20% when not equipping any Kirito's Skill Records in the same set./[Encircle Break 3] Increase in break gauge to enemy by +27.5%\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nExtra effect time7.5sec.\nLimit Break extends Accele Skill effect time.\n*Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Carefully Acquired Knowledge] Koharu\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nBurn Swatter\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nBlunt/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n42\nBreak Gauge\n38\nSkill Effect\n1580% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Small]/[Gust 4/Buff]When equipping 2 or more of Agil's Skill Records in the same set, attack +45% for 5 sec./[Sky Talisman 4/Buff] Thrust element damage -80% to enemies for 15 sec./[Human Talisman 4/Buff] Slash element damage -80% to enemies for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nFury\n[When Rush Activates] Own max HP 20% recovers.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n- Duration\nStarts after the February 15, 2023 (Wed) maintenance and ends on March 18, 2023 (Sat) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9).\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
