    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Sachi's Birthday Order\" is here! Featuring new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3! All ★4 Skill Records are Sachi!\nShop\n2023-02-11 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Sachi's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Natural Look] Sachi\n(Awakening Skill)\" and \"\n[Figure of the Forest] Sachi\n(MOD Skill)\" are now available!\n\"\nSachi's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Sachi guaranteed on Step 3!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3, one ★4 \"Sachi\" is guaranteed!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Natural Look] Sachi\nSkill Name\nEnhance Attack/RUSH/Fast and Easy\nAttack\n58\nDefense\n42\nHP\n2200\nSkill Effect\n[Enhance Attack 5] Attack +18%./[RUSH4] Recovers SP by 30 when hitting with switch and HIT number exceeds 50./[Fast and Easy] Lowers flinch resistance by 100%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Figure of the Forest] Sachi\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nBurning Wheel\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n42\nBreak Gauge\n42\nSkill Effect\n1500% damage (3x hit/All Foes)[Center/Arc/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] When equipping 3 or more of Sachi's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1200./[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using fire skills while the buff to raise fire damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n- Duration\nFebruary 11, 2023 (Sat) 0:00 - February 20, 2023 (Mon) 23:59\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1,250 Arcana Gems (50% Off)\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n★4 \"Sachi\" guaranteed!\nOn every Step, all ★4 Skill Records are \"Sachi\"!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nGo to Notice List"
