    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Good Fortune Order\" is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2023-01-18 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nAsuna, Yuuki, Leafa, and Agil are carrying good luck charms in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nGood Fortune Order\n\" is here! Get one new ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[New Year's Fortune] Yuuki\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nConverging Shadow\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n52\nBreak Gauge\n53\nSkill Effect\n1480% damage (All Foes)[Front/Long/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Attack rises 500 x the number of Yuuki Skill Records in the same set./[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using Dark skills while the buff to raise Dark element's damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Lucky Cat Girl] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nDark Torrent\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n108\nBreak Gauge\n46\nSkill Effect\n1650% damage (6x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Dark Pile/Buff] Dark element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Dark Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, dark element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect30sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n★4[Big Golden Catch] Agil\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nHatchet Shadow\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n44\nBreak Gauge\n44\nSkill Effect\n1600% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Attack + 50% in proportion with your remaining HP (the more remaining HP, the higher)./[Bonus] When equipping 3 or more of Agil's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1200.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Lucky Talisman Scroll] Leafa\nSkill Name\nEnhance Defense/Offense and Defense\nAttack\n53\nDefense\n40\nHP\n2650\nSkill Effect\n[Enhance Defense 4] Defense +15%./[Offense and Defense 4] Adds a buff that raises additional damage rises for 15 sec depending on defense, when hitting using switch. (Invalid when equipped by Partner)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nPincer Attack\n[During Rush] Damage +15% when using switch.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n- Duration\nStarts after the January 18, 2023 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the February 15, 2023 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
