    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Holy Eve Order\" is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2022-12-14 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nAsuna, Yuuki, Lisbeth, and Koharu are dressed up for Christmas in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nHoly Eve Order\n\" is here! Get one new ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Dashing Over Town] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nNight Thorn\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n96\nBreak Gauge\n50\nSkill Effect\n1650% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Ultimate Light 4/Buff] Own critical rate raises, and reduces the next damage taken (Stack 5) during 20 sec.Critical rate +1% per stack, and reduces the next damage taken by -1% per stack.Each effects will be removed by taking damage./[Ultimate Light 4/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Own critical rate raises, and reduces the next damage taken (Stack 15) during 20 sec.Critical rate +1% per stack, and reduces the next damage taken by -1% per stack.Each effects will be removed by taking damage.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect30sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n★4[Secret Present] Lisbeth\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nChristmas Impulse\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nBlunt/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n59\nBreak Gauge\n60\nSkill Effect\n1270% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Holy Force 5/Buff (PT)] Holy element damage +20% ｆor you and your party for 5 sec./[PT Weakness Attack 4/Buff] When equipping 8 of Lisbeth's Skill Records in the same set, critical damage +20% for you and your party for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nStack Boost\n[When Rush Activates] Raises 10 stacks for all Stack buffs that are on yourself.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Under the Winter Sky] Yuuki\nSkill Name\nTraining Results/Bloody Blow\nAttack\n48\nDefense\n40\nHP\n2650\nSkill Effect\n[Training Results 4] Critical damage increases by your own level × 0.14% (max 28%)/[Bloody Blow 4] Attack +24% against bleeding enemies.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Carefully Down the Chimney] Koharu\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nNight Invasion\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n96\nBreak Gauge\n43\nSkill Effect\n1600% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Dark Pile/Buff] Dark element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Dark Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, dark element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect30sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n- Duration\nAfter the December 14, 2022 (Wed) maintenance - December 29, 2022 (Thu) 16:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
