    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Valkyrie Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2022-12-07 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nAlice, Sinon, Leafa, and Sachi are Valkyries in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nValkyrie Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Screening Eyes] Alice\nSkill Name\nEnhance Stun Res./Advance Trooper/Shine Conversion\nAttack\n61\nDefense\n30\nHP\n2425\nSkill Effect\n●[Enhance Stun Res. 4] Stun resistance +70%./[Advance Trooper 5] Attack +500./[Shine Conversion 4] Dark element's damage to enemies -10% and holy element's damage to enemies +25%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nExtra effect time7.5sec.\nLimit Break extends Accele Skill effect time.\n*Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[On Track to the End] Sinon\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nHoly Stitch\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n34\nBreak Gauge\n35\nSkill Effect\n1280% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using holy skills./[Bonus] When equipping 3 or more of Sinon's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Leader of Warriors] Leafa\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nWater Waltz\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n45\nBreak Gauge\n26\nSkill Effect\n1580% damage (5x hit/All Foes)[Front/Long/Wide]/▲▲[Bonus] Attack + 50% in proportion with your remaining HP (the more remaining HP, the higher)./[Bonus] When equipping 3 or more of Leafa's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1200.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Messenger of Valhalla] Sachi\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nWide God Fencer\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nThrust/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n28\nBreak Gauge\n14\nSkill Effect\n990% damage (4x hit/All Foes)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Holy Element Enhance4/Buff] Holy element damage +9% for 30 sec./[Holy Element Weak 3/Debuff] Holy element damage to monster +15% for 10 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n- Duration\nAfter the December 7, 2022 (Wed) maintenance - December 31, 2022 (Sat) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
