    "news_date": 1670400000,
    "news_category": "EVENT",
    "snippet": "¡Vuelve el evento de escenario \"Feliz Navidad\"!  El escenario del evento \"Feliz Navidad\" Koharu y Kirito conversan en Teleport Gate Plaza. Durante esta conversación, Koharu le pide un favor a Kirito. Quiere organizarte una fiesta sorpresa de Navidad.  Recompensas Derrota a Nicolás el Renegado y o...",
    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Happy Christmas\" is back! Get Christmas Avatars, stamps, and useful items!\nEVENT\n2022-12-07 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe Scenario Event \"Happy Christmas\" is back!\nThe Scenario Event \"Happy Christmas\"\nKoharu and Kirito have a chat at the Teleport Gate Plaza.\nDuring this conversation, Koharu asks Kirito for a favor.\nShe wants to organize a surprise Christmas party for you.\nRewards\nDefeatNicholas the Renegade and other enemies in the dungeon to get tradable Tree Charms!\nYou can trade the Tree Charms that you collect for returning Christmas Avatars, stamps, and other useful items!\nLimited Items\nIcon\nItem Name\nEffect\nRoast Turkey\nRecovers from Status Ailments \"Curse\", \"Frostbite\" and \"Poison\"\nAvatars\n-Avatars\nItem Name\nType\nHoly Suit Top\nTop Avatar/Male Only\nHoly Suit Bottoms\nBottom Avatar/Male Only\nHoly Costume\nMale Only/Female Only\nHoly Red Nose\nAccessory Avatar\nNoel Reindeer Top A\nTop Avatar/Male Only\nNoel Reindeer Bottoms A\nBottom Avatar/Male Only\nNoel Santa Top A\nTop Avatar/Female Only\nNoel Santa Bottoms A\nBottom Avatar/Female Only\nNoel Santa Hat A\nAccessory Avatar\nNoel Long Scarf A\nAccessory Avatar\nNoel Reindeer Hood A\nAccessory Avatar\nNoel Cowbell A\nAccessory Avatar\nMemory Stamp\nStamp Name\nStamp Displayed\nGetting ready\nLovely Santa\nRed nose Agil\nWe are Santa\nTrade \"Tree Charm\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nHoly Suit Top\n500\n1\nHoly Suit Bottoms\n300\n1\nHoly Costume\n800\n2\nHoly Red Nose\n200\n2\nNoel Reindeer Top A\n450\n1\nNoel Reindeer Bottoms A\n250\n1\nNoel Santa Top A\n450\n2\nNoel Santa Bottoms A\n250\n2\nNoel Santa Hat A\n150\n2\nNoel Long Scarf A\n150\n2\nNoel Reindeer Hood A\n150\n2\nNoel Cowbell A\n150\n2\nMemory Stamp 53\nUse to obtain the \"Getting ready\" stamp.\n100\n1\nMemory Stamp 54\nUse to obtain the \"Lovely Santa\" stamp.\n100\n1\nMemory Stamp 55\nUse to obtain the \"Red nose Agil\" stamp.\n100\n1\nMemory Stamp 56\nUse to obtain the \"We are Santa\" stamp.\n100\n1\nTrader\nSee each Trader NPC for more info, or go to Menu > Items > Enhance:Trade > Trade Limited Items and tap the \"Trade Tree Charm\" banner.\n\"\nRequiem for Holy Night\n\"\nYou can clear the \"\nRequiem for Holy Night\n\" one time per day.\nTrader Period\nStarts after the December 7, 2022 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the January 18, 2023 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nScore Rewards\nEntry\nInterior\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n150\nTree Charm\n5\n200\nTree Charm\n10\n300\nHealing Potion\n10\n400\nHealing Potion\n10\n600\nRecord Frame M\n10\n800\nRecord Frame M\n15\n1200\nTree Charm\n10\n1600\nTree Charm\n15\n2100\nHealing Potion\n10\n2800\nHealing Potion\n10\n3000\nRoast Turkey\n5\n4000\nRoast Turkey\n10\n4200\nHealing Potion\n10\n5600\nCleansing Potion\n10\n5400\nRecord Frame M\n20\n7200\nRecord Frame M\n30\n6600\nTree Charm\n30\n8800\nTree Charm\n35\n7800\nArcana Gem\n50\n10400\nArcana Gem\n50\n9000\nRevive Crystal\n1\n12000\nRevive Crystal\n2\nDepth\nDANGER\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n250\nTree Charm\n15\n300\nTree Charm\n20\n500\nRestorative Potion\n5\n600\nRestorative Potion\n10\n1000\nRecord Frame L\n10\n1200\nRecord Frame L\n15\n2000\nTree Charm\n20\n2400\nTree Charm\n30\n3500\nRestorative Potion\n10\n4200\nRelease Crystal (S)\n3\n5000\nRoast Turkey\n15\n6000\nRoast Turkey\n20\n7000\nRelease Crystal (S)\n1\n8400\nRestorative Potion\n20\n9000\nRecord Frame L\n20\n10800\nRecord Frame L\n30\n11000\nTree Charm\n40\n13200\nTree Charm\n50\n13000\nArcana Gem\n50\n15600\nArcana Gem\n50\n15000\nRelease Crystal (S)\n5\n18000\nRelease Crystal (S)\n10\nRequiem for Holy Night\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n1000\nMemoria Niter S\n5\n2000\nMemoria Niter S\n5\n3000\nMemoria Niter S\n10\nHow to Participate\nTalk to the \"Kirito\" at the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to start the scenario quest.\nThere are 4 scenario quests. Clear them all to unlock the dungeon.\nEvent Period\nStarts after the December 7, 2022 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the January 11, 2023 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete Main quest [The Indomitable Fang]\nBoss Monster\nNicholas the Renegade\nDetails\nHis attacks inflict various status ailments!\nMake sure that you have Cleansing Potions and other items that can cure status ailments before taking him on!\nWeakness\nThrust Element\nWater Element\nHoly Element\nBuffs used\n* Only \"Requiem for Holy Night\"difficulty\nStack buff \"Reduces damage\"\nStatus Ailments used\nStatus ailments \"Curse\", \"Frostbite\" and \"Poison\"\nImportant\nPlease check all Rewards in the game.\nIf you receive a stamp you already own, it will not have any effect when used.\nIf you have previously played the \"Happy Christmas\" event, your progress will continue from the following points.\nTotal Score and Score Rewards\nChallenge rewards\nAmount traded\nEven if you have completed the scenario quest previously, you will be able to accept the request from the beginning and receive rewards.\nOnce you clear the dungeon one times, you can't play it again until the limit resets at 4:00 (JST/UTC+9).\nItem use inside the \"Requiem for Holy Night\" difficulty dungeon is restricted, and Revive Crystals can only be used three.\n\"Tree Charms\" and \"Roast Turkeys\" will be deleted on January 18, 2023 (Wed) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nThe \"Requiem for Holy Night\" difficulty and scenario quests cannot be attempted with an Assist Party.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
    "startTime": "2022-12-06T19:00:00+00:00",
    "endTime": "2023-01-10T19:00:00+00:00"
