    "snippet": "Aviso para aquellos usuarios que inician sesión en \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".  El mantenimiento que hemos implementado desde el 7/12 de 2022 a las 13:00 se completó el 7/12 de 2022 a las 17:00 (JST/UTC+9). Las siguientes son nuevas actualizaciones.  ▼Eventos nuevos y recientemente implementados Comienza el evento de caza \"Nicholas Hunt\" 【Campaña navideña】\"Mult...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(12/7)\nMAINT.\n2022-12-06 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\"\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n12/7, 2022 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\nHunting Event \"Nicholas Hunt\" begins\n【Holiday Campaign】\"Multiple Rounds: 2x Experience Subquest Campaign\" begins\nThe Scenario Event \"Happy Christmas\" is back\nThe Scenario Event \"Glass Snow Rabbit\" is back\nThe Scenario Event \"Santa Claus in Blue Decline\" is back\nThe Scenario Event \"Holy Night Gourmet\" is back\nYour progression will be carried over from the last time this event was held.\nTotal Score and Score Rewards\nChallenge rewards\nAchievements and achievement progress\nAmount traded\nEven if you have completed the scenario quest previously, you will be able to accept the request from the beginning and receive rewards.\n\"New Order\" begins\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 12/7 Maintenance\nTons of EXP Event \"Gibbon Assault [Returning]\"\n【Holiday Campaign】\"Multiple Rounds: 5x Experience Character Quest Campaign\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
