    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(11/9)\nMAINT.\n2022-11-08 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\"\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n11/9, 2022 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Preseason 29 begins\n\"Intensive Training Event  VS Kirito\" begins\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to the \"Theatrical Release Celebration Hippocampus Hunt\"\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 11/9 Maintenance\nDefense Battle ver. 2: \"Halloween Attack!\"\n\"Rabbit Fever\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
