    "snippet": "Para celebrar el cumpleaños de Strea, ¡los nuevos récords de habilidades ★4 \"[Happy Wink] Strea\" y \"[The Will to Step Forward] Strea\" ya están disponibles! ¡El \"Pedido de cumpleaños de Strea\" ya está aquí! ¡Con ★4 récords de habilidades de Strea!  ¡En el Paso 1, puedes obtener 11 pedidos por 1250 gemas arcanas! ¡En el Paso 3, se garantiza una racha de ★4! Un...",
    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Strea's Birthday Order\" is here! On Step 3, one ★4 \"Strea\" is guaranteed!\nShop\n2022-11-06 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Strea's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Happy Wink] Strea\n\" and \"\n[The Will to Step Forward] Strea\n\" are now available!\n\"\nStrea's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Featuring ★4 Strea Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3,\none ★4 Strea is guaranteed! Additionally, all ★4 characters are Strea!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Happy Wink] Strea\nSkill Name\nLight Magic/Wipe out your fear\nAttack\n52\nDefense\n38\nHP\n2425\nSkill Effect\n[Light Magic 4] DEF increase with own level ×0.17%. (max 34%)/[Wipe out your fear 3] While defense+ buff is effective, attack power will increase 15%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[The Will to Step Forward] Strea\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nHydro Swipe\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nSkill Effect\n680% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Your own attack increases by defense x 1./[Bonus] Damage done to enemies weak to slashing +15%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Duration\nNovember 6, 2022 (Sun) 0:00 - November 15, 2022 (Tue) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n4.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nAll ★4 Skill Records are Strea!　One ★4 Strea guaranteed!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nGo to Notice List"
