    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"School Festival Order\" is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2022-11-01 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nAsuna, Alice, Leafa, and Sinon are enjoying the school festival in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nSchool Festival Order\n\" is here! Get one new ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[School Madonna] Asuna\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Flame Boost/Rat's Information\nAttack\n55\nDefense\n34\nHP\n2350\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 3] Attack +800./[Flame Boost 4] Elemental damage other than fire dealt to enemies -50%, and fire element's damage to enemies +40%.［Rat's Information 4］ When equipping 1 or more of Argo's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +20%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Missing Stock] Leafa\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nSurging Flash\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nBlunt/\nHoly\nSkill Effect\n1670% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Wide]/[Muscle Build Up 4/Buff] Attack + 1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nAttack +2500 → 5000 → 7500 to enemies when using break.\n★4[School Ghost] Alice\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nLightning Edge\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nSlash/\nHoly\nSkill Effect\n1080% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/▲[Bonus] Increases attack against enemies with status ailments (Poison, Burn, Bleed, Frostbite). +0.3% for every Stack 1.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Gunner's Song] Sinon\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nGround Shot\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nEarth\nSkill Effect\n1270% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using earth skills./[Bonus] When equipping 3 or more of Sinon's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n- Duration\nNovember 1, 2022 (Tue) 0:00 - Before the November 24, 2022 (Thu) maintenance (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
