    "snippet": "¡\"Happy Dungeon with Sanya\" ya está aquí! ¡Obtén el sello de Sanya y las gemas Arcana para celebrar el cumpleaños de este personaje!  Las recompensas \"Arcana Gems\" y un sello \"Sanya\" de edición limitada están disponibles como recompensas. Completa la mazmorra todos los días durante el evento para obtener hasta 500 \"Gemas Arcanas\".  Período 28 de octubre del 2...",
    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Happy Dungeon with Sanya\" is here! Get the Sanya stamp and Arcana Gems!\nEVENT\n2022-10-28 04:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\n\"Happy Dungeon with Sanya\" is here! Get the Sanya stamp and Arcana Gems in celebration of this character's birthday!\nRewards\n\"Arcana Gems\" and a\nlimited-edition \"Sanya\" stamp\nare available as rewards.\nClear the dungeon every day during the event to get up to 500\n\"Arcana Gems\"\n.\nPeriod\nOctober 28, 2022 (Fri) 4:00 - November 4, 2022 (Fri) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete Main quest [The Indomitable Fang]\nMemory Stamp\nStamp Name\nStamp Displayed\nSanya Plushie\nMonster\nCrabby Mimic/Hard Mimic\nDetails(All ｍimic are common)\nWatch out for its scratches and bites.\nWeakness(All ｍimic are common)\nBlunt Element\nScore Rewards\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n100\nArcana Gem\n50\n200\nArcana Gem\n50\n300\nArcana Gem\n50\n400\nArcana Gem\n100\n500\nArcana Gem\n50\n600\nArcana Gem\n50\n700\nArcana Gem\n50\nChallenge Rewards\nChallenge Name\nReward\nAmount\nDefeat all enemies\nMemory Stamp 213\nUse to obtain the \"Sanya Plushie\" stamp.\n1\nCompleted without any tumble\nArcana Gem\n50\nCompleted within 1 minutes\nArcana Gem\n50\nImportant\nCleared dungeons will be reset the following day at 4:00am (JST/UTC+9) and can be re-attempted after that.\nThis is a solo event that you can challenge with Sanya as your partner.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
