    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Kirito & Asuna's Wedding Anniversary Order\" is here! On Step 5, one new ★4 Kirito or Asuna Skill Record is guaranteed!\nShop\n2022-10-23 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nIn celebration of Kirito and Asuna's wedding anniversary, new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Carrying the Future] Kirito\n(Awakening Skill)\" and \"\n[Growing Happiness] Asuna\n(MOD Skill)\" are here!\n\"\nKirito & Asuna's Wedding Anniversary Order\n\" is on!\nFeaturing ★4 Kirito, Asuna, and Yui Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3,\none ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed!\nOn Step 4 and Step 5, the total drop rate is increased to 2.0% for the featured Skill Records!\nPlus, on Step 5, one new ★4 Kirito or Asuna Skill Record is guaranteed!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Carrying the Future] Kirito\nSkill Name\nSix Paths\nAttack\n62\nDefense\n36\nHP\n2500\nSkill Effect\n[Six Paths 4] Effect changes depending on the Skill Records in the same set.When equipping 2 of Kirito's Skill Records: Deals +40% Earth element's damage to enemy.When equipping 3 of Kirito's Skill Records: Deals +40% Wind element's damage to enemy.When equipping 4 of Kirito's Skill Records: Deals +40% Fire element's damage to enemy.When equipping 5 of Kirito's Skill Records: Deals +40% Water element's damage to enemy.When equipping 6 of Kirito's Skill Records: Deals +50% Holy element's damage to enemy.When equipping 7 of Kirito's Skill Records: Deals +50% Dark element's damage to enemy.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Growing Happiness] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nFlame Nova\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nFire\nSkill Effect\n1300% damage (8x hit/All Foes)[Front/Cone/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Attack +1500 against enemies with the slash element./[Bonus] Attack against enemies with Frostbite increases 30%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n- Duration\nOctober 23, 2022 (Sun) 0:00 - November 5, 2022 (Sat) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne new ★4 Kirito or Asuna Skill Record is guaranteed!! 2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
