    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Halloween Selection Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\nShop\n2022-10-15 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nGet at least 1 ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\nWe will be holding a \"\nHalloween Selection Order\n\" featuring Skill Records with Halloween costumes!\n- Duration\nOctober 15, 2022 (Sat) 17:00 - October 31, 2022 (Mon) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Offers\n11 Order for 2,500 Arcana Gems\n【★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Tricky Cat] Koharu\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nWide Shade Fencer\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nSkill Effect\n1200% damage (4x hit/All Foes)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Dark Shadow Demon 3/Buff] Dark element damage +45% for 8 sec./▲▲[Bonus] Attack rises 200 x the number of Koharu Skill Records in the same set./[Bonus] All the Stack Buff effected to the enemy will -2 in numbers of Stacks (Will not be below 1).\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Groovy Night] Yuuki\nSkill Name\nAdvance Trooper/Weakness Attack Boost\nAttack\n49\nDefense\n30\nHP\n2950\nSkill Effect\n[Advance Trooper 4] Attack +400./[Weakness Attack Boost 3] Critical damage +15% while the buff to raise critical damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nMind's Eye\n[During Rush] Critical damage +7.5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Cheerful Wolf Girl] Argo\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nShadow Split\nSP Cost\n32\nElement\nBlunt/\nDark\nSkill Effect\n1200% damage (All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲▲▲[Bonus] Attack increases in proportion with your remaining HP (the more remaining HP, the higher)./[Bonus] Critical damage +20% against enemies with the thrust element.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Cute Wolf Girl] Asuna\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Aqua Conversion/Talent Shift\nAttack\n41\nDefense\n50\nHP\n2800\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 3] Attack +800./[Aqua Conversion 4] Fire element's damage to enemies -10% and water element's damage to enemies +25%./[Talent Shift 3] Effect changes depending on the Skill Records in the same set.Amount healed by plants +10% when equipping 1 or more of Alice's Skill Records in the same set.Attack +20% when equipping no Alice Skill Records in the same set.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Coffin Break] Lisbeth\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nPumpkin Crush\nSP Cost\n20\nElement\nBlunt/\nEarth\nSkill Effect\n700% damage (All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Additional damage to enemy of 20% own current HP.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Tricky Witch] Sachi\nSkill Name\nStatus Ailments Blow\nAttack\n40\nDefense\n60\nHP\n1250\nSkill Effect\n[Status Ailments Blow 4] Attack +18% against enemy with status ailments (Poison, Burn, Bleed, Frostbite).\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Halloween Cat] Leafa\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nRumbling Grief\nSP Cost\n25\nElement\nBlunt/\nDark\nSkill Effect\n800% damage (All Foes)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Muscle Build Up 4/Buff] Attack + 1% per stack (Stack3) during 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Cute Vampire] Sinon\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nCandy Rain\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nHoly\nSkill Effect\n- Charging -\n850% damage (All Foes)[Center/Arc/Mid]/[Bonus Attack 4/Buff] Additional damage according to own Attack for 10 sec.\n- Uncharged -\n650% damage (All Foes)[Center/Arc/Mid]/[Bonus Attack 4/Buff] Additional damage according to own Attack for 10 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Devilish Smile] Yuuki\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nPiercing Bat\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nSkill Effect\n800% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Poison/Status Ailments] It will Poison (Stack 3) at low rate for 30 sec./[Burn/Status Ailments] It will Burn (Stack 3) at low rate for 30 sec./[Bleed/Status Ailments] It will Bleed (Stack 3) at low rate for 30 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Happy Halloween] Asuna\nSkill Name\nAcceleration/Precise Attack\nAttack\n67\nDefense\n42\nHP\n850\nSkill Effect\n[Acceleration 4] Critical damage +30% when HP is under 50%./[Precise Attack 3] Critical rate +10%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Important\nThere is no single Order.\nCheck the in-game Order details for more information on the entire lineup and the drop rates.\nPlease be aware that the period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
