    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Raising Assisting Character Campaign for Kirito, Asuna, and Silica\" is here! Build up your Assisting Characters with the dungeon and rewards!\nCampaign\n2022-09-28 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nCelebrate Kirito's, Asuna's, and Silica's birthdays with the\nRaising Assisting Character Campaign for Kirito, Asuna, and Silica\n, on now!\nTake on the \"Raising Assisting Character Campaign\", where you and your Assisting Characters can earn more EXP than in normal dungeons.\nRewards\nPlayers can acquire present items and items to recover stamina for the assist function from Score and Challenge Rewards.\nAlso available are limited items including Memory Stamps and Special Gift present items that increase Friendship EXP for Kirito, Asuna, and Silica.\nThe Special Gift can be obtained even if the target character has not yet been unlocked. Please use it once you've unlocked the character.\nMemory Stamp\nStamp Name\nStamp Displayed\nPeace Sign\nPrincess for a Day\nCute Idol\nLimited Items\nEffect\nSpecial Gift for Kirito\nA gift for Kirito, to maybe get along better.\nSpecial Gift for Asuna\nA gift for Asuna, to maybe get along better.\nSpecial Gift for Silica\nA gift for Silica, to maybe get along better.\nHow to Participate\nTalk to the \"Raising Assisting Character Campaign\" NPC at the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to take on the \"Raising Assisting Character Dungeon\".\nEvent Period\nStarts after the September 28, 2022 (Wed) maintenance and ends October 14, 2022 (Fri) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nParticipation Requirements\nClear the 1F Main Quest through the end\nScore Rewards\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n100\nMemory Stamp 207\nUse to obtain the \"Princess for a Day\" stamp.\n1\n200\nSpecial Gift for Asuna\n1\n300\nEnergy Fruit\n1\n400\nMemory Stamp 208\nUse to obtain the \"Cute Idol\" stamp.\n1\n500\nSpecial Gift for Silica\n1\n600\nEnergy Fruit\n1\n700\nMemory Stamp 209\nUse to obtain the \"Peace Sign\" stamp.\n1\n800\nSpecial Gift for Kirito\n1\n900\nEnergy Fruit\n1\n1000\nSmall Gift\n1\n1100\nSpecial Gift for Asuna\n2\n1200\nEnergy Fruit\n1\n1300\nSmall Gift\n1\n1400\nSpecial Gift for Silica\n2\n1500\nEnergy Fruit\n1\n1600\nSmall Gift\n1\n1700\nSpecial Gift for Kirito\n2\n1800\nEnergy Fruit\n1\n1900\nSmall Gift\n1\n2000\nEnergy Fruit\n1\nChallenge Rewards\nChallenge Name\nPrimary Reward\nAmount\nDefeat all enemies\nRecord Kit M\n30\nCompleted without any tumble\nRecord Frame L\n30\nComplete within the targeted time (Able to achieve repeatedly)\nGolden Bells\n1\nImportant\nThe Assisting Character \"Silica\" will be unlocked when you complete the 8F Main Quest.\nThe Special Gifts do not expire.\nThis \"Raising Assisting Character Dungeon\" can be cleared once per day.\nThis \"Raising Assisting Character Dungeon\" is updated daily at 4:00 am (JST/UTC+9). After this, the previous day's dungeon cannot be attempted.\nIt is possible to take characters other than Kirito, Asuna, and Silica as Assisting Characters into the Raising Assisting Character Dungeon.\nThis Raising Assisting Character Dungeon is a solo and Assist Party-only dungeon.\nNote: Players who challenge this \"Raising Assisting Character Dungeon\" solo will not earn any EXP for their Assisting Characters.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
