    "snippet": "¡Cuarto aniversario mundial de Sword Art Online Integral Factor! ¡La \"Orden incremental de MOD de aniversario\" con ★4 habilidades MOD ya está aquí!  ¡En el Paso 1, puedes obtener 11 pedidos por 1250 gemas arcanas! ¡En el paso 3, se garantiza un récord de habilidad ★4! En los pasos 4 y 5, la tasa de caída total de ★4 MOD Skills es...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nWorldwide 4.5 Year Anniversary! The \"Anniversary MOD Step-Up Order\" is here! One ★4 MOD Skill is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2022-09-18 00:30:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nSword Art Online Integral Factor's Worldwide 4.5 Year Anniversary!\nThe \"\nAnniversary MOD Step-Up Order\n\" featuring ★4 MOD Skills is here!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3,\none ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed!\nOn Step 4 and Step 5, the total drop rate for ★4 MOD Skills increases to 2.0%!\nAdditionally, on Step 5, one of the ★4 MOD Skills is guaranteed!\nMore MOD Skill Details Here\n【Some Featured ★4 MOD Skills】\n★4[Little Weasel] Silica\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nDead Blaze\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nSkill Effect\n1250% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using fire skills./[Bonus] When equipping 1 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +500.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Daily Colors] Yuuki\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nHydro Slash\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nSkill Effect\n1290% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using water skills./[Bonus] When equipping 3 or more of Yuuki's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Civilta Ascia] Leafa\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nHatchet Lightning\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nHoly\nSkill Effect\n1550% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Attack + 50% in proportion with your remaining HP (the more remaining HP, the higher)./[Bonus] When equipping 3 or more of Leafa's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1200.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Uplifting Banner] Agil\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nWater Smash\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nWater\nSkill Effect\n1550% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Small]/▲▲[Bonus] Attack + 50% in proportion with your remaining HP (the more remaining HP, the higher)./[Bonus] When equipping 3 or more of Agil's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1200.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n- Duration\nSeptember 18, 2022 (Sun) 0:30 - September 25, 2022 (Sun) 0:29 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% Total Drop Rate for ★4 MOD Skills\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% Total Drop Rate for ★4 MOD Skills\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% Total Drop Rate for ★4 MOD Skills\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% Total Drop Rate for ★4 MOD Skills\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 MOD Skill guaranteed! 2.0% Total Drop Rate for ★4 MOD Skills\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
