    "full_details": "Notices\nThe Tales of Series Collab Happy Dungeon is here! Get Tales of series collab Memory Stamps and up to 1,000 Arcana Gems!\nEVENT\n2022-08-22 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe solo event\n\"Tales of Series Collab Happy Dungeon\"\nis here! Attempt the dungeon with the Tales of characters and Koharu!\nThe dungeon has three maps. You can fight alongside Lloyd on map one, alongside Milla on map two, and alongside Yuri on map three.\nRewards\nClear the dungeon to get three kinds of\nTales of series collab Memory Stamps\n, and up to 1,000\nArcana Gems\n!\nMemory Stamp\nStamp Name\nStamp Displayed\nHootle 3\nDohalim\nBarbatos\nEvent-limited item\nIcon\nItem Name\nEffect\nLemon Gel\nRefreshing and sour flavor!\nInstantly recovers 4000 HP!\nHow to Participate\nTalk to \"Lloyd\" at the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to challenge the dungeon.\nPeriod\nStarts after the August 22, 2022 (Mon) maintenance and ends on September 9, 2022 (Fri) 17:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete Main quest [The Indomitable Fang]\nMonster\nCrabby Mimic/Hard Mimic\nDetails(All ｍimic are common)\nWatch out for its scratches and bites.\nWeakness(All ｍimic are common)\nSlash Element\nScore Rewards\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n100\nTales of Series Stamp 3\nUse to obtain the \"Hootle 3\" stamp.\n1\n200\nArcana Gem\n50\n300\nArcana Gem\n50\n400\nTales of Series Stamp 10\nUse to obtain the \"Dohalim\" stamp.\n1\n500\nArcana Gem\n50\n600\nArcana Gem\n50\n700\nTales of Series Stamp 17\nUse to obtain the \"Barbatos\" stamp.\n1\n800\nArcana Gem\n50\n900\nArcana Gem\n50\n1000\nArcana Gem\n100\n1100\nArcana Gem\n50\n1200\nArcana Gem\n50\n1300\nArcana Gem\n100\n1400\nArcana Gem\n50\n1500\nArcana Gem\n50\n1600\nArcana Gem\n50\n1700\nArcana Gem\n50\n1800\nArcana Gem\n50\n1900\nArcana Gem\n50\nChallenge Rewards\nChallenge Name\nReward\nAmount\nDefeat all enemies (Able to achieve repeatedly)\nLemon Gel\n1\nCompleted without any tumble\nArcana Gem\n50\nCompleted within 3 minutes\nArcana Gem\n50\nImportant\nCleared dungeons will be reset the following day at 4:00am (JST/UTC+9) and can be re-attempted after that.\n\"Lemon Gel\" will be deleted on September 9, 2022 (Fri) at 17:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
