    "full_details": "Notices\nTales of Series Collab Panel Missions are here! There are two Panel Missions! Get Tales of series collab Skill Records and Memory Stamps!\nEVENT\n2022-08-22 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTales of Series Collab Panel Missions\nare here!\nRewards\nThere are two Panel Missions, No. 1 and No. 2!\nBy clearing the missions on the panels, you can get the Tales of series collab Skill Record ★4[Blazing Sword] Alphen and two kinds of Memory Stamps.\nYou can also get useful items like Revive Crystals, Glare Dragon Stones, Record Frame L, Exp Crystal M, and Restorative Potions.\nGet a completion reward for clearing all the missions listed on a panel.\nGet the ★4[Blazing Sword] Alphen Skill Record from completion reward No. 1, and the Memory Stamp Judas from No. 2.\nSkill Record\n★4[Blazing Sword] Alphen\nSkill Name\nReduced Battle Wounds/Purifying Flame\nAttack\n65\nDefense\n22\nHP\n2050\nSkill Effect\n●[Reduced Battle Wounds 3] Reduces damage from slash, thrust, and blunt element monsters and status ailment damage by 3%./[Purifying Flame 3] Deals +15% Fire element's damage to enemy.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMemory Stamp\nStamp Name\nStamp Displayed\nHootle 4\nJudas\nPeriod\nStarts after the August 22, 2022 (Mon) maintenance and ends on September 9, 2022 (Fri) 17:59 (JST/UTC+9).\n* This Panel Mission Reward is available until September 9, 2022 (Fri) 17:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nMission Details\nTales of Series Collab No.1\nMission\nRewards\nAmount\nLog in\n★4[Blazing Sword] Alphen\n1\nClear all collab quests\n★4[Blazing Sword] Alphen\n1\nClear the Collab All Out Battle 1 time\n★4[Blazing Sword] Alphen\n1\nClear the Collab Happy Dungeon 1 time\n★4[Blazing Sword] Alphen\n1\nEquip a Collab Skill Record\n★4[Blazing Sword] Alphen\n1\nEnhance a Skill Record 1 time\n★4[Blazing Sword] Alphen\n1\nClear the Daily Dungeon 1 time\n★4[Blazing Sword] Alphen\n1\nUse Chat or Stamp\n★4[Blazing Sword] Alphen\n1\nClear Aincrad 1F\n★4[Blazing Sword] Alphen\n1\nComplete Reward\nAmount\n★4[Blazing Sword] Alphen\n1\nTales of Series Collab No.2\nMission\nRewards\nAmount\nClear the Collab All Out Battle 5 times\nTales of Series Stamp 4\nUse to obtain the \"Hootle 4\" stamp.\n1\nClear the Collab Happy Dungeon 2 times\nRestorative Potion\n300\nClear Character Quest\nSaleable Col Bag\n* You will be able to sell it at the Merchant for 100,000 Col.\n20\nClear Subquest\nExp Crystal M\n3\nDo an Assisting Character interaction quest 3 times\nSmall Gift\n5\nEnhance equipment 1 time\nRevive Crystal\n30\nChange your equipment\nCleansing Potion\n50\nClear Aincrad 2F\nGlare Dragon Stone\n50\nClear Aincrad 5F\nRecord Frame L\n50\nComplete Reward\nAmount\nTales of Series Stamp 16\nUse to obtain the \"Judas\" stamp.\n1\nImportant\nTales of Series Collab Panel Missions No. 1 and No. 2 are independent of each other and can be progressed simultaneously.\nIf you acquire a ★4[Blazing Sword] Alphen after the Skill Record has reached its Limit Break max, it will be exchanged for Record Kit M.\nCleared floors' Missions will become completed Panel Missions.\nThe count for Missions will start when Panel Missions open.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
