    "full_details": "Notices\nThe Tales of Series Collab Login Bonus is here!\nEVENT\n2022-08-23 04:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nWe're celebrating the Tales of series collab with a Tales of Series Collab Login Bonus, starting August 23, 2022 (Tue) 4:00 (JST/UTC+9).\nLog in during the event and get your hands on the Tales of series collab Skill Record ★4[Blazing Sword] Alphen, two kinds of Memory Stamps, each kind of gel, and more.\nPeriod\nAugust 23, 2022 (Tue) 4:00 - September 9, 2022 (Fri) 17:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nReward Details\nNumber of Days Logged In\nReward\nType\nItem Icon\nDay1\nTales of Series Stamp 2\nUse to obtain the \"Hootle 2\" stamp.\n1\nDay2\n★4[Blazing Sword] Alphen\n1\nDay3\nApple Gel\n30\nLemon Gel\n10\nGrape Gel\n5\nDay4\nTales of Series Stamp 6\nUse to obtain the \"Shionne\" stamp.\n1\nDay5\nRevive Crystal\n30\nDay6\nGlare Rigid Stone\n100\nRecord Frame M\n100\nDay7\nFruit Water\n50\nSkill Record\n★4[Blazing Sword] Alphen\nSkill Name\nReduced Battle Wounds/Purifying Flame\nAttack\n65\nDefense\n22\nHP\n2050\nSkill Effect\n●[Reduced Battle Wounds 3] Reduces damage from slash, thrust, and blunt element monsters and status ailment damage by 3%./[Purifying Flame 3] Deals +15% Fire element's damage to enemy.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMemory Stamp\nStamp Name\nStamp Displayed\nHootle 2\nShionne\nEvent-limited item\nIcon\nItem Name\nEffect\nApple Gel\nThe sweet smell is enticing!\nInstantly recovers 2000 HP!\nLemon Gel\nRefreshing and sour flavor!\nInstantly recovers 4000 HP!\nGrape Gel\nBeautiful, harmonious taste!\nInstantly recovers 6000 HP!\nImportant\nYou can receive the login bonus after completing the quest \"Another Reality\".\nIf you acquire a ★4[Blazing Sword] Alphen after the Skill Record has reached its Limit Break max, it will be exchanged for Record Kit M.\nDaily distribution time will be from 4:00 AM to 3:59 AM of the next day. (JST/UTC+9)\nPlease note that the distribution date does not switch when the date changes.\n\"Apple Gel\", \"Lemon Gel\" and \"Grape Gel\" will be deleted on September 9, 2022 (Fri) at 17:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
