    "full_details": "Notices\nGet skill Record enhancement and transformation materials in \"Build Up Skills with Sinon\"\nEVENT\n2022-08-26 04:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nJoin Sinon and take on a dungeon filled with Skill Record enhancement and transformation materials!\nGather lots of materials to power up your skill Record.\nRewards\nYou can get\n\"Record Frame L\"\nfor Skill Record enhancement, as well as\n\"Record Kit M\", all kinds of \"High Jewels\", and all kinds of \"Jewels\"\nfor transformation from dungeon rewards.\nYou can also get the awakening items\n\"Awakening Star\"\nand\nall kinds of \"Great Jewels\"\nfrom score rewards.\nMonster Drop Items\nRed Jewel,High Red Jewel,Green Jewel,High Green Jewel,Yellow Jewel,High Yellow Jewel,Blue Jewel,High Blue Jewel\nRecord Kit S,Record Frame M\nHow to Participate\nTalk to \"Sinon\" at the Teleport Gate Plaza to challenge the dungeon.\nEvent Period\nStarts after the August 26, 2022 4:00 - September 2, 2022 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete Main quest [The Indomitable Fang]\nScore Rewards\nBuild Up Skills with Sinon\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n25\nAwakening Star\n5\n50\nHigh Red Jewel\n5\n75\nHigh Green Jewel\n5\n100\nHigh Yellow Jewel\n5\n125\nHigh Blue Jewel\n5\n150\nGreat Blue Jewel\n1\n175\nGreat Red Jewel\n1\n200\nGreat Green Jewel\n1\n225\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n1\n250\nAwakening Star\n5\n275\nHigh Red Jewel\n5\n300\nHigh Green Jewel\n5\n325\nHigh Yellow Jewel\n5\n350\nHigh Blue Jewel\n5\n375\nGreat Blue Jewel\n2\n400\nGreat Red Jewel\n2\n425\nGreat Green Jewel\n2\n450\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n2\n475\nAwakening Star\n5\n500\nHigh Red Jewel\n5\n525\nHigh Green Jewel\n5\n550\nHigh Yellow Jewel\n5\n575\nHigh Blue Jewel\n5\n600\nGreat Blue Jewel\n2\n625\nGreat Red Jewel\n2\n650\nGreat Green Jewel\n2\n675\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n2\n700\nAwakening Star\n10\nChallenge Rewards\nChallenge Name\nRewards\nAmount\nDefeat boss (Able to achieve repeatedly)\nCol\n20000\nCompleted without any tumble (Able to achieve repeatedly)\nRecord Kit M\n2\nCompleted within 3 minutes (Able to achieve repeatedly)\nRecord Frame L\n10\nImportant\nThe dungeon daily clear will update at 4:00 AM (JST/UTC+9).\nThis is a solo event that you can challenge with Sinon as your partner.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
