    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Festival Avatar Order\" is out now! ★4 avatar guaranteed with \"Order 11\"!\nShop\n2022-08-10 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nGallant and glamorous!\nThe \"\nFestival Avatar Order\n\" is out now!\n★4 avatar guaranteed\nwith \"Order 11\"!\nGet avatars in 4 stylish colors!\n[Avatar Images]\n[Appearing Avatar]\nItem Icon\nItem Name\nType\n★4\nSummer Fest Star Top A\nTop Avatar/Male Only\n★4\nSummer Fest Star Top B\nTop Avatar/Male Only\n★4\nSummer Fest Star Top C\nTop Avatar/Male Only\n★4\nSummer Fest Star Top D\nTop Avatar/Male Only\n★4\nSummer Fest Idol Top A\nTop Avatar/Female Only\n★4\nSummer Fest Idol Top B\nTop Avatar/Female Only\n★4\nSummer Fest Idol Top C\nTop Avatar/Female Only\n★4\nSummer Fest Idol Top D\nTop Avatar/Female Only\nSummer Fest Star Bottoms A\nBottom Avatar/Male Only\nSummer Fest Star Bottoms B\nBottom Avatar/Male Only\nSummer Fest Star Bottoms C\nBottom Avatar/Male Only\nSummer Fest Star Bottoms D\nBottom Avatar/Male Only\nSummer Fest Idol Bottoms A\nBottom Avatar/Female Only\nSummer Fest Idol Bottoms B\nBottom Avatar/Female Only\nSummer Fest Idol Bottoms C\nBottom Avatar/Female Only\nSummer Fest Idol Bottoms D\nBottom Avatar/Female Only\nSummer Festival Hachimaki A\nAccessory Avatar\nSummer Festival Hachimaki B\nAccessory Avatar\nSummer Festival Hachimaki C\nAccessory Avatar\nSummer Festival Hachimaki D\nAccessory Avatar\nSummer Festival Fan A\nAccessory Avatar\nSummer Festival Fan B\nAccessory Avatar\nSummer Festival Fan C\nAccessory Avatar\nSummer Festival Fan D\nAccessory Avatar\nFierce Festival Hairpin A\nAccessory Avatar\nFierce Festival Hairpin B\nAccessory Avatar\nBeautiful Festival Hairpin A\nAccessory Avatar\nBeautiful Festival Hairpin B\nAccessory Avatar\nPretty Festival Hairpin A\nAccessory Avatar\nPretty Festival Hairpin B\nAccessory Avatar\nSummer Festival Headband A\nAccessory Avatar\nSummer Festival Headband B\nAccessory Avatar\n- Duration\nStarts after the August 10, 2022 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the August 31, 2022 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\n- Offers\n1 Order for 150 Arcana Gems\n11 Order for 1,500 Arcana Gems\n- Important\nKoharu can also equip female avatars and accessories.\nSome of the avatars available in this Order have equip conditions that depend on the equipped character's gender.\nKirito's, Yuna's, Silica's, Yuuki's, and Koharu's faces and hairstyles are not included in this Order.\nAll avatars, both female and male, are available in the Order regardless of your own character's gender.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
