    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Cool Evening Selection Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\nShop\n2022-07-25 12:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nGet at least 1 ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\nWe will be holding a \"\nCool Evening Selection Order\n\" featuring yukata Skill Records!\n- Duration\nJuly 25, 2022 (Mon) 12:00 - August 15, 2022 (Mon) 16:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Offers\n11 Order for 2,500 Arcana Gems\n【★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Summer Festival Night] Alice\nSkill Name\nEnhance Blunt/Thrust Protect/Gale Blade\nAttack\n63\nDefense\n28\nHP\n2350\nSkill Effect\n[Enhance Blunt 4] Damage done to enemies weak to blunt +24%./[Thrust protect 4] Reduce damage from 15% thrust element monster./[Gale Blade 4] Deals +20% Wind element's damage to enemy.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Festival Stroll] Eugeo\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nCross Blaze\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nSkill Effect\n1240% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Attack against burned enemies increases 20%./[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using fire skills.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Hands Full of Snacks] Lisbeth\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nStorm Blow\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nBlunt/\nWind\nSkill Effect\n1150% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Stigma/Debuff] Increases damage taken by enemies for 15 sec (Stack 5) +0.5% for every Stack 1./[Bleed Boost 4/Debuff] Lowers enemy's bleed resistance 50% for 30 sec (easier to inflict Bleed) and bleed damage +100%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nFury\n[When Rush Activates] Own max HP 20% recovers.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Sparkle of Life] Yui\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nDark Riposte\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nSkill Effect\n1270% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using dark skills./[Bonus] Attack +1500 against enemies with the slash element.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Summer Smile] Leafa\nSkill Name\nEnhance Attack/ Element Added\nAttack\n45\nDefense\n60\nHP\n1650\nSkill Effect\n[Enhance Attack 4] Attack +8%./[Element Added] Adds Dark Element to normal attack's.(The effect of the Element Added do not overlap, and will be prioritized in the order of Dark, Holy, Earth, Wind, Water, and Fire)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Festive Feeling] Sachi\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nDark Orbit\nSP Cost\n25\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nSkill Effect\n800% damage (3x hit/All Foes)[Center/Arc/Mid]/▲[Bonus] Damage +25% to the enemies that have a buff effect./[Bonus] All the Stack Buff effected to the enemy will -2 in numbers of Stacks (Will not be below 1).\n* More than regular increase in switch guage.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Colossal Fireworks] Silica\nSkill Name\nGiant's Gauntlet\nAttack\n35\nDefense\n50\nHP\n2700\nSkill Effect\n[Giant's Gauntlet 4] While the buff of your own additional damage is in effect, attack becomes +25%\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Window of Bloom] Kirito\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nGrinder Waltz\nSP Cost\n29\nElement\nBlunt/\nEarth\nSkill Effect\n950% damage (5x hit/All Foes)[Front/Long/Wide]/[Poison/Status Ailments] It will Poison (Stack 3) at specific rate for 30 sec./[Giant Power 3/Buff] Additional damage based on Max HP for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Innocent Smile] Asuna\nSkill Name\nEnhance Berserk/Enhance Clotting\nAttack\n42\nDefense\n66\nHP\n1000\nSkill Effect\n[Enhance Berserk 4] When the player is Status Ailments (Poison, Burn, Bleed, Frostbite, Curse, Debility), Attack +25%./●[Enhance Clotting 4] Bleed damage -50%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Night Blooming Flower] Yuuki\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nTearing Fang\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nDark\nSkill Effect\n820% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Bleed/Status Ailments] Will Bleed (Stack 3) at specific rate for 30 sec./▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using dark skills./[Bonus] Damage done to enemies weak to slashing +30%.\n* When this skill is used in switch and hits, the Bleed (Stack 1) will also affect the player.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Sniper Eye] Sinon\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nCross Fire\nSP Cost\n18\nElement\nThrust/\nFire\nSkill Effect\n700% damage (2x hit/All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Burn/Status Ailments] It will Burn (Stack 3) at a specific rate for 30 sec./▲▲[Bonus] Damage +25% to the enemies that have a buff effect.\n* More than regular increase in switch guage.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Summer Memory] Koharu\nSkill Name\nEnhance Burn Hit/Burn Precision Attack\nAttack\n44\nDefense\n53\nHP\n1225\nSkill Effect\n●[Enhance Burn Hit 4] +success rate for Burn./[Burn Precision Attack4] Critical rate +24% towards opponents with burn.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Important\nThere is no single Order.\nCheck the in-game Order details for more information on the entire lineup and the drop rates.\nPlease be aware that the period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
