    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Summer Dress Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2022-07-01 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nYuuki, Leafa, Sachi, and Koharu show off their dresses on the beach under the blue sky in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nSummer Dress Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Sunshine by the Beach] Leafa\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nRumbling Storm\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nBlunt/\nWind\nSkill Effect\n1670% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Parry4/Buff] When this skill direct hits, the damage you receive decreases at 50%(Effect will disappear after 20 sec if not activated).\n* Easily draw enemy aggro.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nAttack +2500 → 5000 → 7500 to enemies when using break.\n★4[Sunlight on the Beach] Yuuki\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nCross Splash\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nSkill Effect\n1330% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using water skills./[Bonus] When equipping 3 or more of Yuuki's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Summer Traveler] Sachi\nSkill Name\nCrushing Impact/Break Attack\nAttack\n46\nDefense\n60\nHP\n2800\nSkill Effect\n[Crushing Impact 3] Attack +800 when attacking with blunt element./[Break Attack 4] Attack +35% to enemies when using break.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Summer Shot by the Shore] Koharu\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nSplash Fall\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nWater\nSkill Effect\n1240% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Hands down 4/Buff] 30 sec, the critical rate will increase a little, the higher the Max HP is.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nMind's Eye\n[During Rush] Critical damage +7.5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n- Duration\nJuly 1, 2022 (Fri) 0:00 - Before the July 21, 2022 (Thu) maintenance (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
