    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Phantom Order\" is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2022-06-11 12:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNew ★4 Skill Records have arrived, featuring Kirito, Leafa, Sinon, and Lisbeth dressed as Jiangshi jumping zombies!\nThe \"\nPhantom Order\n\" is here! Get one new ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Undead Prince] Kirito\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nSavage God Bless\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nHoly\nSkill Effect\n1360% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Weak Attack 3/Debuff] Chance to decrease enemy's Attack for 15% for 10 sec./[Enhance Defense 3/Buff] Defense +12% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nMind's Eye\n[During Rush] Critical damage +7.5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Bloodthirsty Hunter] Sinon\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nSacred Shot\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nThrust/\nHoly\nSkill Effect\n1410% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Muscle Build Up 4/Buff] Attack + 1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nRaises 3 → 6 → 9 stacks for all Stack buffs that are on yourself when hitting with skills.\n★4[Messenger of the Dark] Lisbeth\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nBurn Impulse\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nBlunt/\nFire\nSkill Effect\n640% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲[Bonus] Attack +50% against enemies with debuff status (Mark, Small Mark, Death Mark)./[Bonus] Damage done to enemies weak to blunt +50%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Undead Sister] Leafa\nSkill Name\nFlame Indemnity/Enhance Burn Immunity/Enhance Berserk\nAttack\n53\nDefense\n38\nHP\n2725\nSkill Effect\n[Flame Indemnity 3] When you are burnt, fire element damage + 40%./[Enhance Burn Immunity 3] Burn damage -30%./[Enhance Berserk 3] When the player is Status Ailments (Poison, Burn, Bleed, Frostbite, Curse, Debility), Attack +20%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nStack Boost\n[When Rush Activates] Raises 10 stacks for all Stack buffs that are on yourself.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n- Duration\nStarts June 11, 2022 (Sat) 12:00 and ends before the June 29, 2022 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
