    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Argo's Birthday Order\" is here! On Step 3, one ★4 \"Argo\" is guaranteed!\nShop\n2022-06-05 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Argo's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Street Corner Informant] Argo\n\" and \"\n[A Sense for Secrets] Argo\n\" are now available!\n\"\nArgo's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Featuring ★4 Argo Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3,\none ★4 Argo is guaranteed! Additionally, all ★4 characters are Argo!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Street Corner Informant] Argo\nSkill Name\nAdvance Trooper/Inflict Frostbite/Auto Analysis\nAttack\n54\nDefense\n54\nHP\n2425\nSkill Effect\n[Advance Trooper 4] Attack +400./[Inflict Frostbite] When the target is hit using the Switch, make it Frostbite (Stack 5) for 30 sec. (Invalid when equipped by Partner)/[Auto Analysis 4] Slight chance to add a debuff (Analyze) that raises critical damage to enemies by 20% for 15 sec, when hitting with switch. (Invalid when equipped by partner)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[A Sense for Secrets] Argo\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nPhoton Curve\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nSlash/\nHoly\nSkill Effect\n1080% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Small]/▲[Bonus] Attack +30% against poisoned enemies./[Bonus] Damage done to enemies weak to slashing +30%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Duration\nJune 5, 2022 (Sun) 0:00 - June 14, 2022 (Tue) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n4.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nAll ★4 Skill Records are Argo!　One ★4 Argo guaranteed!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nGo to Notice List"
