    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Roaring Business Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2022-05-25 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nChefs Kirito and Yuuki and waitstaff Sinon and Sanya are dressed in Chinese-themed outfits in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nRoaring Business Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Warrior of the Wok] Kirito\nSkill Name\nSteel Fang/Encircle Break\nAttack\n52\nDefense\n42\nHP\n2650\nSkill Effect\n[Steel Fang 4] Attack +500 when attacking with thrust element./[Encircle Break 3] Increase in break gauge to enemy by +27.5%\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Speedy Slicing & Dicing] Yuuki\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nDead Ground\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nEarth\nSkill Effect\n1280% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using earth skills./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Yuuki's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Inviting Advertisement Girl] Sinon\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nFire Stitch\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nFire\nSkill Effect\n1260% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using fire skills./[Bonus] When equipping 3 or more of Sinon's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Delicious Temptation] Sanya\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nWater Flow\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nSkill Effect\n630% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using water skills./[Bonus] Increases additional damage by your own level ×150 (max 30000)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Duration\nStarts after the May 25, 2022 (Wed) maintenance and ends on June 11, 2022 (Sat) 11:59 (JST/UTC+9).\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
