    "snippet": "Aviso para aquellos usuarios que inicien sesión en \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".  A partir de nuestro mantenimiento del 25 de mayo de 2022 (miércoles), relajaremos las tasas de obtención de materiales de producción de la Serie Integral y la Serie Integral Nox en los Laberintos. Esta es una buena oportunidad para conseguir alguno que no hayas logrado ob...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nRelaxing the drop rate for Integral Series and Nox Integral Series production materials (Notice)\nNOTICES\n2022-05-18 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nAs of our maintenance on May 25 2022 (Wed), we will be relaxing the drop rates for Integral Series and Nox Integral Series production materials in the Labyrinths.\nThis is a good opportunity to get any you haven't managed to obtain yet.\nLocations of Drop Rate Improvements\nProduction materials\n13F Labyrinth – Entry\nBlazing Armament Stone\nBlazing Flame Arms\n13F Labyrinth – Interior\n14F Labyrinth – Entry\nHalf Beast Armament Stone\nHalf Beast's Horn\n14F Labyrinth – Interior\n20F Labyrinth – Entry\nOne-Eyed Beast Armament Stone\nOne-Eyed Beast Fang\n20F Labyrinth – Interior\n25F Labyrinth – Entry\nAsura Armament Stone\nAsura Iron Ball\n25F Labyrinth – Interior\n27F Labyrinth – Entry\nCrossgigas Armament Stone\nCrossgigas Iron Chain\n27F Labyrinth – Interior\n35F Labyrinth – Entry\nSticky Thing Armament Stone\nSticky Thing Fluid\n35F Labyrinth – Interior\nFor whichever floor, the drop rate in the Labyrinth - Interior will be set much higher.\nSo work with a party to collect production materials from the boss and get the Integral Series and Nox Integral Series!\nIntegral Series and Nox Integral Series\nItem Icon\nItem Name\nType\nCapabilities of ★5\nItem Icon\nItem Name\nType\nCapabilities of ★5\nGusion\n1H Sword\nAttack 1220\nNox Gusion\n1H Sword\nAttack 1434\nArc Angel\n1H Rapier\nAttack 1197\nNox Arc Angel\n1H Rapier\nAttack 1407\nStingray\n1H Club\nAttack 1220\nNox Stingray\n1H Club\nAttack 1434\nAfter Glow\n2H Axe\nAttack 1382\nNox After Glow\n2H Axe\nAttack 1644\nGluttony\n2H Spear\nAttack 1357\nNox Gluttony\n2H Spear\nAttack 1614\nRadgrid\nBow\nAttack 1331\nNox Radgrid\nBow\nAttack 1583\nNocturne\nDagger\nAttack 1197\nNox Nocturne\nDagger\nAttack 1407\n* The required level for equipping the Integral Series is 101, and the required level for equipping the Nox Integral Series is 121.\n* Values are based on maximum enhancement at ★5 rarity, Lv. 100.\nOn higher floors, the Lux Integral Series (Required Level 141), Rosso Integral Series (Required Level 161), and other higher level weapons will appear.\nClear the floors of Aincrad, and try to get the series that best suits your level!\nWe hope you continue to enjoy \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nGo to Notice List"
