    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Rabbit Hunt\" on now! Train for the Ragout Rabbit hunt!\nCampaign\n2022-04-20 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe\n\"Ragout Rabbit\"\nis a monster that occasionally appears on the field and drops Red Hot Ore.\nIn this campaign, you can practice hunting it by taking on dungeons where \"Ragout Rabbit\" appears.\nStarting with this event, you can also obtain more Red Hot Ore and Metal Scrap rewards in addition to a greater variety of rewards.\nRewards\nGet up to five Red Hot Ore items that can be used to forge equipment.\nYou can also get up to 30 Superior Metal Scraps and up to 50 Common Metal Scraps to produce Ingots.\nRefining Hammers+, Release Crystals (S), and more are also available.\nHow to Participate\nTalk to the \"Rabbit Hunt\" NPC at the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to challenge it.\nEvent Period\nStarts after the April 20, 2022 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the April 27, 2022 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete Main quest [The Indomitable Fang]\nMonster\nRagout Rabbit\nDetails\nIt moves quickly and runs away from the player.\nWeakness\nSlash Element\nThrust Element\nBlunt Element\n* Weapon elemental weaknesses differ depending on the Ragout Rabbit.\nResistance\nPoison\nBurn\nBleed\nFrostbite\nScore Rewards\nScore\nRewards\nAmount\n100\nCommon Metal Scrap\n5\n200\nCol\n20000\n300\nCommon Metal Scrap\n5\n400\nGlare Dragon Stone\n10\n500\nCommon Metal Scrap\n5\n600\nCol\n20000\n700\nRed Hot Ore\n1\n800\nCommon Metal Scrap\n5\n900\nCol\n20000\n1000\nCommon Metal Scrap\n5\n1100\nRefining Hammer\n20\n1200\nCommon Metal Scrap\n5\n1300\nCol\n20000\n1400\nRed Hot Ore\n1\n1500\nMartial Arts Text\n1\n1600\nCommon Metal Scrap\n5\n1700\nCol\n30000\n1800\nCommon Metal Scrap\n10\n1900\nRefining Hammer+\n20\n2000\nSuperior Metal Scrap\n5\n2200\nCol\n30000\n2400\nRed Hot Ore\n1\n2600\nSuperior Metal Scrap\n5\n2800\nCol\n30000\n3000\nSuperior Metal Scrap\n5\n3200\nRelease Crystal (S)\n10\n3400\nSuperior Metal Scrap\n5\n3600\nCol\n30000\n3800\nSuperior Metal Scrap\n5\n4000\nRed Hot Ore\n1\nChallenge Rewards\nChallenge Name\nRewards\nAmount\nDefeat all enemies\nCommon Metal Scrap\n5\nCompleted without any tumble\nSuperior Metal Scrap\n5\nCompleted within 3 minutes\nRed Hot Ore\n1\nImportant\nThe Ragout Rabbits in this dungeon do not drop the items Red Hot Ore or Ragout Rabbit Meat.\nThe Ragout Rabbits in this dungeon will not disappear after a certain amount of time.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
