    "full_details": "Notices\nAssisting Character \"Eugeo\" is here!\nUPDATE\n2022-04-06 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nEugeo\nis now available as an Assisting Character.\nInteract with\nEugeo\nand give he presents to increase your affinity with he!\nObtain Blue Rose Badges to unlock the Assisting Character Eugeo from the achievement rewards.\nBlue Rose Badges are available from the Scenario Event \"Heroine Destruction Rhapsody\" Trader up until the May 11, 2022 (Wed) maintenance begins.\nSee here for more details on the Scenario Event \"Heroine Destruction Rhapsody\".\nImportant\nThe Assist Function is unlocked when you clear the 1F of Aincrad.\nAfter the Blue Rose Badge exchange period ends, we plan to offer another opportunity to unlock the Assisting Character Eugeo.\nGo to Notice List"
