    "full_details": "Notices\nLineup Updated! One ★4 1H Club Skill Record guaranteed in the \"★4 1H Club Guaranteed Order\"!\nShop\n2022-04-02 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nAvailable four Per Player!\nA new lineup is here for the \"★4 1H Club Guaranteed Order\" where you are\nguaranteed\none 1H Club★4 Skill Record!\nAll ★4 Skill Records are \"1H Clubs\"!\nIncludes\n\"MOD Skills\"\n,\n\"Awakening Skills\"\n, and\n\"Burst Skills\"\n!\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Enthusiastic Club User] Lisbeth\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nRock Fall\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nBlunt/\nEarth\nSkill Effect\n1030% damage (All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Attack +50% against enemies with debuff status (Mark, Small Mark, Death Mark)./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Lisbeth's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Fancy Bear] Yuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nWild Disruption\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nWind\nSkill Effect\n1000% damage (3x hit/All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Bear Lover/Buff] Adds a buff that makes enemies like bears (no particular effect) for 30 sec./▲[Bonus] Critical rate +25% against enemies who like bears./[Bonus] Recover 5% of max HP when defeating monsters with this skill.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[White Tiger] Lisbeth\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nPit Fall Burst\nSkill Name\nPit Fall\nSP Cost\n28\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nBlunt/\nDark\nElement\nBlunt/\nDark\nActivation Requirements\nDark\n→Blunt→Blunt\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n800% damage (All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Muscle Build Up 4/Buff] Attack + 1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n1600% damage (All Foes)[Front/Arc/Wide]/[Muscle Build Up 4/Buff] Attack + 1% per stack (Stack5) during 20 sec./[PT Order to Attack 4/Buff]Additional damage to self and party +1500 for 30 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Duration\nStarts after the April 2, 2022 17:00 - April 9, 2022 16:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Offers\n11 Order for 2,500 Arcana Gems\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nThere is no single Order.\nThis 11 Order can only be used 4 times per player.\nThe previously bought \"★4 1H Club Guaranteed Order\" is available for purchase again if you have already purchased it 4 times.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
