    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Karasu Tengu Order\" is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2022-03-23 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nSinon, Leafa, Lisbeth, and Koharu are dressed as karasu tengu and are here as new ★4 Skill Records! These yokai take the form of crows!\nThe \"\nKarasu Tengu Order\n\" is here! Get one new ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Black-Winged Sniper] Sinon\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nShine Blast Shot\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nThrust/\nHoly\nSkill Effect\n670% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲▲▲[Bonus] The lower your own HP, damage increases against monsters not targeting you. (max 250%)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Demon Rulekeeper] Lisbeth\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nVolcano Blow\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nBlunt/\nFire\nSkill Effect\n1230% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[PT Enhance Blunt 4/Buff] Damage done to enemies weak to blunt +30% for your party for 20 sec./[Thrust Attack Down 3/Debuff] Enemy thrust attack -15% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nPincer Attack\n[During Rush] Damage +15% when using switch.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Dazzling Divine Power] Koharu\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nWind Splash\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nThrust/\nWind\nSkill Effect\n1420% damage (8x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Wide]/[Parry4/Buff] When this skill direct hits, the damage you receive decreases at 50%(Effect will disappear after 20 sec if not activated).\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nReduces all skill's cool times by 3 → 6 → 9 sec when hitting with skills.\n★4[Black Demon Shugenja] Leafa\nSkill Name\nFive Sharp Weapons/Bloody Blow/Hold the Front\nAttack\n57\nDefense\n38\nHP\n2800\nSkill Effect\n[Five Sharp Weapons 3] Attack +800 when attacking with thrust element./[Bloody Blow 3] Attack +18% against bleeding enemies./[Hold the Front 4] Recovers a max of 5%+200 HP per 3 sec when HP is under 50%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Duration\nStarts after the March 23, 2022 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the April 13, 2022 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
