    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(3/23)\nMAINT.\n2022-03-22 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\"\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n3/23, 2022 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\nWorldwide 4 Year Anniversary! \"Guild Support Campaign\" begins\nWorldwide 4 Year Anniversary! \"Armament Stone Increased Drop Rate Campaign\" begins\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to the Worldwide 4 Year Anniversary! Hunting Event \"Lovely Shrewman Hunt\"\n\"Chaos Showdown\" UPDATE\n\"New Order\" begins\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 3/23 Maintenance\n\"Flower Order\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
