    "full_details": "Notices\nLineup Updated! One ★4 2H Spear Skill Record guaranteed in the \"★4 2H Spear Guaranteed Order\"!\nShop\n2022-02-26 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nAvailable four Per Player!\nA new lineup is here for the ★4 2H Spear Guaranteed Order where you are\nguaranteed\none 2H Spear★4 Skill Record!\nAll ★4 Skill Records are \"2H Spears\"!\nIn addition to\n\"Burst Skills\"\nwith minimized skill cool times which were introduced in the June 30, 2021 (Wed) maintenance,\n\"MOD Skills\"\n, and\n\"Awakening Skills\"\nare also included!\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Black Attired Lancer] Sachi\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nPrism Bouncer Burst\nSkill Name\nPrism Bouncer\nSP Cost\n24\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nSlash/\nHoly\nElement\nSlash/\nHoly\nActivation Requirements\nThrust→Thrust→Slash\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n800% damage (2x hit/All Foes)[Front/Cone/Mid]/▲[Bonus] Recover 5% of max HP when defeating monsters with this skill./[Bonus] +20% damage towards enemy on break.\n* Increase in break gauge amount.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n1600% damage (2x hit/All Foes)[Front/Cone/Wide]/[Bonus] Recovers 10% of your own Max HP when this skill is used and when you hit./[Bonus] +40% damage towards enemy on break.\n* Increase in break gauge amount.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Piercing Shot] Yuuki\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nDarkness Dive\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nSkill Effect\n850% damage (All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Weakness Attack 4/Buff] Critical damage +20% for 15 sec./[Gale Rage 4/Buff] Own level ×12 additional damage increased for 15 sec. but the effect will be canceled when taking damage.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nMind's Eye\n[During Rush] Critical damage +7.5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Resolute Strike] Sachi\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nStorm Bouncer\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nThrust/\nWind\nSkill Effect\n1280% damage (2x hit/All Foes)[Front/Cone/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Attack +30% against bleeding enemies./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Sachi's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n- Duration\nStarts after the February 26, 2022 17:00 - March 5, 2022 16:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Offers\n11 Order for 2,500 Arcana Gems\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nThere is no single Order.\nThis 11 Order can only be used 4 times per player.\nThe previously bought \"★4 2H Spear Guaranteed Order\" is available for purchase again if you have already purchased it 4 times.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
