    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Flower Order\" is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2022-02-26 12:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nAsuna, Yuuki, Lisbeth, and Koharu are florists and are here as new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nFlower Order\n\" is here! Get one new ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\r\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Flower Arrangement] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nWater Thrust\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nSkill Effect\n630% damage (All Foes)[Front/Cone/Wide]/▲▲▲[Bonus] Attack +2000 against enemies with the slash element./[Bonus] 90% increase with critical damage.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Daily Colors] Yuuki\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nHydro Slash\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nSkill Effect\n1290% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using water skills./[Bonus] When equipping 3 or more of Yuuki's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Complete Set] Lisbeth\nSkill Name\nEnhance Poison Aim/Step-in/More Deban\nAttack\n50\nDefense\n46\nHP\n2650\nSkill Effect\n[Enhance Poison Aim 5] Increase the target success rate for Poison./[Step-in 5] Increases the critical rate as number of HITS increase./[More Deban 2] When equipping 1 or more of Silica's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +20%\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Source of Life] Koharu\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nCross Hydra\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nWater\nSkill Effect\n1250% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Attack +25% to the enemies that have a buff effect./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Koharu's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n- Duration\nFebruary 26, 2022 (Sat) 12:00 - Before the March 23, 2022 (Wed) Maintenance (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
