    "full_details": "Notices\nSachi's Birthday Order is here! On Step 3, one ★4 \"Sachi\" is guaranteed!\nShop\n2022-02-11 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Sachi's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Small Great Harvest] Sachi\n\" and \"\n[With All My Heart] Sachi\n(MOD Skill)\" are now available!\n\"\nSachi's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Featuring ★4 Sachi Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3,\none ★4 Sachi is guaranteed! Additionally, all ★4 characters are Sachi!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Small Great Harvest] Sachi\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nSpreading Rock\nSP Cost\n45\nElement\nThrust/\nEarth\nSkill Effect\n520% damage (8x hit/All Foes)[Front/Cone/Wide]/[Earth Element Enhance4/Buff] Earth element damage +9% for 15 sec./▲▲▲[Bonus] Damage +200% to enemies when using earth skills while the buff to raise Earth element's damage is in effect./[Bonus] Deal 2000 additional damage to enemies that have a buff effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[With All My Heart] Sachi\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nStone Shaft\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nEarth\nSkill Effect\n1410% damage (All Foes)[Front/Long/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Attack rises 500 x the number of Kirito Skill Records in the same set./[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using earth skills while the buff to raise Earth element's damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n- Duration\nFebruary 11, 2022 (Fri) 0:00 - February 20, 2022 (Sun) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n4.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nAll ★4 Skill Records are Sachi!　One ★4 Sachi guaranteed!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nGo to Notice List"
