    "full_details": "Notices\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3! Get ★4 Skill Records with backgrounds! The Brilliant Order is here!\nShop\n2022-02-03 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe \"\nBrilliant Order\n\" is here, featuring ★4 Skill Records with seasonal backgrounds!\nOn Steps 1 and 2, the\ndrop rate for ★4 Skill Records is 8%\n!\nOn Step 3, the\ndrop rate for ★4 Skill Records is increased to 15%\nand\none ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed!\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Maiden's Metal Club] Sachi\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nSpreading Shade\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nSkill Effect\n1300% damage (8x hit/All Foes)[Front/Cone/Wide]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using dark skills./[Bonus] When equipping 1 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +500.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Sparkle of Life] Yui\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nDark Riposte\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nSkill Effect\n1270% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using dark skills./[Bonus] Attack +1500 against enemies with the slash element.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Sea God's Game] Sinon\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Wind Conversion/God of Sea\nAttack\n60\nDefense\n26\nHP\n2275\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 3] Attack +800./[Wind Conversion 4] Earth element's damage to enemies -10% and wind element's damage to enemies +25%./[God of Sea 4] When equipping 3 or more of Sinon's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +20%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nFury\n[When Rush Activates] Own max HP 20% recovers.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n- Duration\nFebruary 3, 2022 (Thu) 17:00  -  February 17, 2022 (Thu) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n2,000 Arcana Gems\n8% total Drop Rate for ★4 Skill Records!\nSTEP2\n2,000 Arcana Gems\n8% total Drop Rate for ★4 Skill Records!\nSTEP3\n4,000 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed! 15% total Drop Rate for ★4 Skill Records!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
