    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(1/26)\nMAINT.\n2022-01-25 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\"\nMaintenance we have implemented from 1/26, 2022, 14:00, was completed on 1/26, 2022,17:00(JST/UTC+9).\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Chaos Showdown\" UPDATE\nNew Boss and Dark Black Armor Added\nAdded Hunting Event \"Warder Chief Hunt\" Event rewards\nPlayer Level Cap Raised(Lv.170→Lv.180)\n\"Rabbit Hunt\" begins\n\"Firefighter Order\" begins\n\"Arcana Gem Super Boost Campaign\" begins\n▼Added Features & Feature Adjustments\nChanged skill effects which are linked to player level\nExpanded the Break feature and added a new section about it in Help.\nAdded \"About Breaks\" under the About Action section of Help in the System portion of the Menu.\nAdded shortcuts to subquest NPCs.\nA \"Move\" button was added to the quest details of Unaccepted Quests to allow players to move directly to the NPCs.\nThe Move option for the subquest NPC appears when you have completed the main quest of the floor they are located on.\nA \"Report\" button that allows you to move to the relevant NPC was added to the quest details in the Accepted Quests section.\nThe Report button will appear when you have progressed through the quest enough to report back to the NPC.\nCurrently, after a Multiple Rounds subquest is completed once, it will disappear from the list, and the Move button will not be usable.\nWe plan to fix this in a future update so that the Move button can be used repeatedly.\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼Upcoming Update\n\"Build Up Skills with Sinon\"\nPlanned to start 1/28, 2022 4:00 (JST/UTC +9)\n-New Events\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n1/26, 2022 14:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Chaos Showdown\" UPDATE\nNew Boss and Dark Black Armor Added\nAdded Hunting Event \"Warder Chief Hunt\" Event rewards\nPlayer Level Cap Raised(Lv.170→Lv.180)\n\"Rabbit Hunt\" begins\n\"New Order\" begins\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
