    "full_details": "Notices\nThe Silky Sweet Red Bean Order is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2022-01-19 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nAlice, Sinon, Yui, and Argo are here as new ★4 Skill Records! They're dressed as raccoons and the red bean-washing Azukiarai yokai!\nThe \"\nSilky Sweet Red Bean Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Master Stewing Technique] Argo\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nPenetrating Shadow\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nSkill Effect\n1560% damage (2x hit/All Foes)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Muscle Build Up 4/Buff] Attack + 1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nRecovers 4% → 8% → 12% of your own max HP when hitting with skills.\n★4[A Tune of Red Beans] Sinon\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nDark Stitch\nSP Cost\n22\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nSkill Effect\n1300% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Bear Lover/Buff] Adds a buff that makes enemies like bears (no particular effect) for 30 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[A Red Bean Delivery] Alice\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nStorm Edge\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nWind\nSkill Effect\n1260% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using wind skills./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Alice's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +500.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Sweet Delight] Yui\nSkill Name\nVital Assention/Autosave/Wild Fire\nAttack\n63\nDefense\n24\nHP\n2500\nSkill Effect\n[Vital Assention 3] Defense +400./[Autosave 2] Defense +15% when Status Ailments with Paralysis, Stun, Sleep, Curse, Debility, Petrify, Poison, Burn, Bleed, Frostbite./[Wild Fire 3] Adds Scorch effect on yourself for 30 sec when you hit using Switch (Stack 50). 2.2%＋(number of stacks x 0.2%) damage and 4.4%＋(number of stacks x 0.4%) attack decrese.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Duration\nStarts after the January 19, 2022 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the February 9, 2022 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\n·Please see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\n·All Steps are 11 Orders.\n·The Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\n·After Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\n·Please be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
