    "full_details": "Notices\nLineup Updated! One ★4 Dagger Skill Record guaranteed in the ★4 Dagger Guaranteed Order!\nShop\n2022-01-15 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nAvailable four Per Player!\nA new lineup is here for the ★4 Dagger Guaranteed Order where you are\nguaranteed\none Dagger★4 Skill Record!\nAll ★4 Skill Records are \"Daggers\"!\nIn addition to\n\"Burst Skills\"\nwith minimized skill cool times which were introduced in the June 30, 2021 (Wed) maintenance,\n\"MOD Skills\"\n, and\n\"Awakening Skills\"\nare also included!\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Skilled Captor] Koharu\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nStorm Invasion Burst\nSkill Name\nStorm Invasion\nSP Cost\n26\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nWind\nElement\nSlash/\nWind\nActivation Requirements\nWind\n→Slash→Slash→\nWind\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n1220% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Bleed/Status Ailments] Will Bleed (Stack 1) at specific rate for 30 sec./▲[Bonus] Damage done to enemies weak to slashing +50%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n3410% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Bleed/Status Ailments] Make it Bleed (Stack 5) for 30 sec./[Bonus] Attack +20% against enemy with status ailments (Poison, Burn, Bleed, Frostbite)./[Bonus] Damage done to enemies weak to slashing +80%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Black Attired Dragon Tamer] Silica\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nBlaze Slice Burst\nSkill Name\nBlaze Slice\nSP Cost\n22\nSP Cost\n22\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nActivation Requirements\nSlash→Slash→\nFire\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n800% damage (3x hit/All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Burn/Status Ailments] It will Burn (Stack 3) at a specific rate for 30 sec.\n* When this skill is used in switch and hits, the Burn (Stack 1) will also affect the player.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n1600% damage (3x hit/All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Burn/Status Ailments] Make it burn (Stack 5) for 30 sec./[Bonus] When the Status Ailment (Burn) is on yourself, the attack +20% and critical rate +300%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Greatest Informant] Argo\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nDead Temptation\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nDark\nSkill Effect\n840% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲[Bonus] Damage +25% to enemies with (Poison, Burn, Bleed, Frostbite) Status Ailment./[Bonus] Increase status ailment stacks by 3 on enemies when an enemy with Status Ailments (Poison, Burn, Bleed, Frostbite) was hit. Increase status ailment stacks by 5 on enemies when hitting using switch.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n- Duration\nStarts after the January 15, 2022 17:00 - January 22, 2022 16:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Offers\n11 Order for 2,500 Arcana Gems\n- Important\n·Please see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\n·There is no single Order.\n·This 11 Order can only be used 4 times per player.\n·The previously bought \"★4 Dagger Guaranteed Order\" is available for purchase again if you have already purchased it 4 times.\n·Please be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
