    "full_details": "Notices\nThe Dawn of the New Year Order is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2022-01-01 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nYuuki, Leafa, Yui, and Koharu are dressed for the new year and here as new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nDawn of the New Year Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[108 Tolls of the Bells] Leafa\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nVolcano Judgement\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nBlunt/\nFire\nSkill Effect\n1670% damage (All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Muscle Build Up 4/Buff] Attack + 1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nAttack +2500 → 5000 → 7500 to enemies when using break.\n★4[Gorgeous Osechi] Yuuki\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nVertical Wind\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nWind\nSkill Effect\n1290% damage (4x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using wind skills./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Yuuki's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +500.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Wishing Upon A Daruma] Yui\nSkill Name\nSpirit Unity/Power Rise/Flame Conversion/Rebel Against the System\nAttack\n46\nDefense\n46\nHP\n2575\nSkill Effect\n[Spirit Unity 3] + 5 increase to Awakening rate./[Power Rise 3] Attack +800./[Flame Conversion 4]\nWater element's damage to enemies -10%\nand fire element's damage to enemies +25%./[Rebel Against the System 4] When equipping 1 or more of Asuna's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +20%\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Roll for Victory] Koharu\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nFeint Shadow\nSP Cost\n35\nElement\nBlunt/\nDark\nSkill Effect\n1230% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[PT Weakness Attack 4/Buff] Critical damage +20% for you and your party for 15 sec./[PT Precise Attack 4/Buff] When equipping 8 of Koharu's Skill Records in the same set, party critical rate +30% for 30 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n- Duration\nJanuary 1, 2022 (Sat) 0:00 - January 31, 2022 (Mon) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\n·Please see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\n·All Steps are 11 Orders.\n·The Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\n·After Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\n·Please be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
