    "full_details": "Notices\nThe Holy Carol Order is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2021-12-15 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nKirito, Asuna, Yui, and Yuna are all dressed up for Christmas, and are here as new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nHoly Carol Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Decoration-In-Progress] Asuna\nSkill Name\nEnhance Blunt/Thrust protect\nAttack\n53\nDefense\n42\nHP\n2575\nSkill effect\n[Enhance Blunt 4] Damage done to enemies weak to blunt +24%./[Thrust protect 4] Reduce damage from 15% thrust element monster.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nDodge\n[During Rush] Evasion rate +4%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Smiling Winter General] Kirito\nweapon type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nExtreme Frost\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nThrust/\nWater\nSkill effect\n1400% damage (10x hit/All Foes)[Front/Cone/Wide]/[Duel 4/Buff] Adds a buff to self and enemy you hit.Self: Attack +35% for 15 sec.\nEnemy: Enemy's attack +1% per stack (Stack5) for 30 sec.\n/[Weak Defense 4/Debuff] Enemy defense -30% for 10 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nPincer Attack\n[During Rush] Damage +15% when using switch.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[The Final Touch] Yuna\nweapon type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nSnow Disruption\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nBlunt/\nWater\nSkill effect\n1300% damage (3x hit/All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Muscle Build Up 4/Buff] Attack + 1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nRecovers your SP by 8 → 16 → 24 when critical is activated.\n★4[Holy Night Banquet] Yui\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nweapon type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nGod Fang Burst\nSkill Name\nGod Fang\nSP Cost\n30\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nSlash/\nHoly\nElement\nSlash/\nHoly\nActivation Requirements\nSlash→\nHoly\n→Slash→\nHoly\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skills Effect\n1250% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Poison/Status Ailments] It will Poison (Stack 3) at specific rate for 30 sec./\n▲[Bonus] When the player is Status Ailments (Poison, Burn, Bleed, Frostbite, Curse, Debility), Attack +25%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n3500% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Poison/Status Ailments] Inflict Poison (Stack 5) for 30 sec./[Bonus] When the player is Status Ailments (Poison, Burn, Bleed, Frostbite, Curse, Debility), Attack +50%.\n* Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Duration\nAfter the December 15, 2021 (Wed) maintenance - January 3, 2022 (Mon) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\n·Please see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\n·All Steps are 11 Orders.\n·The Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\n·After Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\n·Please be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
