    "full_details": "Notices\nGet even more with the Holiday Campaign! Get up to 6,000 extra Arcana Gems! Arcana Gem Super Boost Campaign is here!\nCampaign\n2021-12-01 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nHoliday Campaign!\nArcana Gems are\nbeing boosted more than ever before!\nThe\nArcana Gem Super Boost Campaign\nis here.\nAs part of the Holiday Campaign, Arcana Gem F features\n1200\nmore gems than usual, and Arcana Gem G features\n4000\nmore.\nDon't miss out on this chance to get Arcana Gems at a discount!\n-Campaign Duration\nStarts after the 12/1, 2021 0:00 - 12/3, 2021 16:59(JST/UTC+9)\n-Campaign Contents\nProduct Name\nArcana Gems\nArcana Gem A\nTotal: 60\nArcana Gem B\nTotal: 300\nArcana Gem C\nTotal: 680\nArcana Gem D\nTotal: 1,500\n(1,280\n+220 extra Gems\n)\nArcana Gem E\nTotal: 2,700\nArcana Gem F\nTotal: 6,200\n（4,200\n+2000 extra Gems\n）\nArcana Gem G\nTotal: 14,800\n（8,800\n+6,000 extra Gems\n）\n* Extra Arcana Gems are only available once per bundle.\nGo to Notice List"
