    "full_details": "Notices\nSanya's Birthday Order is here! On Step 3, one ★4 \"Sanya\" is guaranteed!\nShop\n2021-10-29 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Sanya's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Omen of Chaos] Sanya\n(Awakening Skill)\" and \"\n[Dark Hunter] Sanya\n\" are now available!\n\"\nSanya's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Featuring ★4 Sanya Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3,\none ★4 Sanya is guaranteed! Additionally, all ★4 characters are Sanya!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Omen of Chaos] Sanya\nweapon type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nRock Slash\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nSlash/\nEarth\nSkill effect\n1310% damage (3x hit/All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Night Erosion 4/Buff] Attack + 0.5% per stack (Stack10) during 25 sec./\n▲▲[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Rain's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000./[Bonus] Recover 5% of max HP when hitting bleeding enemies.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nLightning Flash\n［During Rush］ Critical rate +20%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Dark Hunter] Sanya\nSkill Name\nSpirit Unity/Inflict Bleed\nAttack\n45\nDefense\n52\nHP\n2800\nSkill effect\n[Spirit Unity 4] + 8 increase to Awakening rate./[Inflict Bleed] When the target is hit using the Switch, make it Bleed (Stack 5) for 30 sec. (Invalid when equipped by Partner)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Duration\nOctober 29, 2021 (Fri) 0:00 - November 7, 2021 (Sun) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n4.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nAll ★4 Skill Records are Sanya!　One ★4 Sanya guaranteed!\n- Important\n‧Please see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\n‧All Steps are 11 Orders.\n‧After Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\n‧Please be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\n‧The Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nGo to Notice List"
