    "full_details": "Notices\nGet items to increase drop rates and boost EXP from the Great Enhancement Event  VS Yuuki on now!\nEVENT\n2021-10-22 04:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTake down Yuuki and get useful items for battle!\nThe \"\nGreat Enhancement Event  VS Yuuki\n\" will begin.\nThe extremely difficult\n\"Serious Match\"\n, where you can fight Yuuki going all out, is on now! The recommended total power is 250,000!\nRewards\nThe challenge rewards for the\nGreat Enhancement Event  VS Yuuki\ninclude Incense, an item that doubles the drop rate and amount of EXP earned.\nUse Incense to get double the drop rate and EXP for 10 minutes!\nUse more than one to increase the effect's duration.\nDoing so will help you out in a variety of situations\n.\nOnly one\nGreat Enhancement Event  VS Yuuki\ndungeon with Incense can be selected and cleared per day.\nThe extremely difficult\n\"Serious Match\"\ncan also only be cleared once per day, and you can select one of the two items.\nItem Expiration\nThere is an expiration date on the Incense to Increase Exp S and Incense to Increase Luck S.\nThe items will disappear once the time limit has passed.\nItem Name\nItem Expiration\nIncense to increase Exp S\nUntil 2021/10/30 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nItem Name\nItem Expiration\nIncense to increase Luck S\nUntil 2021/10/30 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nEffects\n\"Incense to increase Exp S\" and \"Incense to increase Luck S\" effects will activate once a monster is defeated.\n* EXP gained during quests will not be boosted.\nIf you use Guild Skills with the same effect at the same time, the effect rates will be added together.\nExample:\nOnly \"Incense to increase Exp S\"\nEXP earned:\n100%\nincrease (\n2x\nincrease)\n\"Incense to increase Exp S\" + Guild Skill (Player EXP UP I)\nEXP earned: 100% + 10% =\n110%\nincrease (\n2.1x\nincrease)\nBoost Mode\n+ \"Incense to increase Exp S\"\nEXP earned: 300% + 100% =\n400%\nincrease (\n5x increase\n)\nSee here for more details on Boost Mode.\nHow to Participate\nTalk to \"Yuuki\" at the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to challenge the dungeon.\nEvent Period\nStarts after the October 22, 2021 4:00 - October 29, 2021 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete Main quest [The Indomitable Fang]\nScore Rewards\nIncrease Exp\nIncrease Drop Rate\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n100\nEmergency Crystal\n1\n100\nEmergency Crystal\n1\n200\nEmergency Crystal\n1\n200\nEmergency Crystal\n1\n300\nEmergency Crystal\n1\n300\nEmergency Crystal\n1\n400\nEmergency Crystal\n1\n400\nEmergency Crystal\n1\n500\nEmergency Crystal\n1\n500\nEmergency Crystal\n1\n600\nEmergency Crystal\n1\n600\nEmergency Crystal\n1\n700\nEmergency Crystal\n1\n700\nEmergency Crystal\n1\n800\nEmergency Crystal\n1\n800\nEmergency Crystal\n1\nChallenge Rewards\nIncrease Exp\nChallenge Name\nReward\nAmount\nDefeat boss(Able to achieve repeatedly)\nIncense to increase Exp S\n3\nCompleted without any tumble(Able to achieve repeatedly)\nRecord Frame M\n5\nCompleted within 3 minutes(Able to achieve repeatedly)\nRestorative Potion\n1\nIncrease Drop Rate\nChallenge Name\nReward\nAmount\nDefeat boss(Able to achieve repeatedly)\nIncense to increase Luck S\n3\nCompleted without any tumble(Able to achieve repeatedly)\nRecord Frame M\n5\nCompleted within 3 minutes(Able to achieve repeatedly)\nRestorative Potion\n1\nExtremely difficult \"Serious Matches\"\nScore Rewards [Serious Matches]\nIncrease Exp\nIncrease Drop Rate\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n100\nHealing Crystal\n1\n100\nHealing Crystal\n1\n200\nHealing Crystal\n1\n200\nHealing Crystal\n1\n300\nHealing Crystal\n1\n300\nHealing Crystal\n1\n400\nHealing Crystal\n1\n400\nHealing Crystal\n1\n500\nHealing Crystal\n1\n500\nHealing Crystal\n1\n600\nHealing Crystal\n1\n600\nHealing Crystal\n1\n700\nHealing Crystal\n1\n700\nHealing Crystal\n1\n800\nHealing Crystal\n1\n800\nHealing Crystal\n1\nChallenge Rewards [Serious Matches]\nIncrease Exp\nChallenge Name\nReward\nAmount\nDefeat boss(Able to achieve repeatedly)\nIncense to Increase Exp S\n3\nCompleted without any tumble(Able to achieve repeatedly)\nLife Potion\n1\nCompleted within 7 minutes(Able to achieve repeatedly)\nRevive Crystal\n1\nIncrease Drop Rate\nChallenge Name\nReward\nAmount\nDefeat boss(Able to achieve repeatedly)\nIncense to Increase Luck S\n3\nCompleted without any tumble(Able to achieve repeatedly)\nLife Potion\n1\nCompleted within 7 minutes(Able to achieve repeatedly)\nRevive Crystal\n1\nImportant\n‧Challenge rewards will reset every day at 4:00 (JST/UTC+9)\n‧This event will be a solo dungeon.\n‧Koharu will not join for Serious Matches.\n‧The quest schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
