    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Fruit Princess Order\" is here! One of the new Skill Records is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2021-10-13 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nAsuna, Yuuki, Alice, and Lisbeth, in gorgeous fruit-themed dresses, are here as new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nFruit Princess Order\n\" is here! Get one new ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Malus Queen] Asuna\nSkill Name\nAcceleration/Enhance Blunt\nAttack\n54\nDefense\n40\nHP\n2575\nSkill effect\n[Acceleration 3] Critical damage +20% when HP is under 50%./[Enhance Blunt 4] Damage done to enemies weak to blunt +24%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n［During Rush］ Attack +5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Persica Girl] Lisbeth\nweapon type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nBurning Crush\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nBlunt/\nFire\nSkill effect\n1280% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Analyze 3/Debuff] Chance to raise critical damage against enemies by 15% for 15 sec./\n▲[Bonus] Recovers 5 SP when the monster is defeated with this skill.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nStack Boost\n[When Rush Activates] Raises 10 stacks for all Stack buffs that are on yourself.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Vitis Lady] Yuuki\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Ground Dance/Talent Shift\nAttack\n52\nDefense\n46\nHP\n2500\nSkill effect\n[Power Rise 3] Attack +800./[Ground Dance 5] Deals +25% Earth element's damage to enemy./[Talent Shift 4] Effect changes depending on the Skill Records in the same set.When equipping 1 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, +success rate for Burn.Damage done to enemies weak to slashing +30% when equipping no Kirito Skill Records in the same set.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Citron Knight] Alice\nweapon type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nShredding Light\nSP Cost\n21\nElement\nSlash/\nHoly\nSkill effect\n1250% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Mark/Debuff] The enemy receives will induce double damage.(Applies to other party member's attacks. Effect will disappear after 10 sec if not activated.)/[Holy Light Demon 3/Buff] Holy element damage +45% for 8 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nStack Boost\n[When Rush Activates] Raises 10 stacks for all Stack buffs that are on yourself.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n- Duration\nAfter the October 13, 2021 (Wed) maintenance - November 5, 2021 (Fri) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\n‧Please see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\n‧All Steps are 11 Orders.\n‧After Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\n‧Please be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\n‧The Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nGo to Notice List"
