    "full_details": "Notices\nGet equipment enhancement and transformation materials in \"Build Up Equipment with Lisbeth\" for our Worldwide 3.5 Year Anniversary!\nEVENT\n2021-09-17 04:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nSword Art Online Integral Factor's Worldwide 3.5 Year Anniversary!\nJoin Lisbeth and explore a dungeon with tons of equipment enhancement and transformation materials!\nGather lots of materials to power up your equipment.\nRewards\nYou can get\nGlare Dragon Stones\nfor equipment enhancement,\nRefining Hammers and Refining Hammers+\nfor transformation, and each kind of\nstone for transformation\nfrom dungeon rewards.\nYou can get the equipment refinement items Red Hot Ore and Common Metal Scrap from score rewards.\nMonster Drop Items\nSlicing Stone,Slicing Stone+,Piercing Stone,Piercing Stone+,Striking Stone,Striking Stone+,Blocking Stone,Blocking Stone+\nHow to Participate\nTalk to \"Lisbeth\" at the Teleport Gate Plaza to challenge the dungeon.\nEvent Period\nSeptember 17, 2021 (Fri) 4:00 - September 24, 2021 (Fri) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete Main quest [The Indomitable Fang]\nScore Rewards\nBuild Up Equipment with Lisbeth\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n30\nRefining Hammer\n12\n60\nRefining Hammer+\n11\n90\nCommon Metal Scrap\n2\n130\nStriking Stone\n12\n160\nStriking Stone+\n7\n190\nRed Hot Ore\n1\n230\nPiercing Stone\n12\n260\nPiercing Stone+\n7\n290\nCommon Metal Scrap\n2\n330\nRefining Hammer\n13\n360\nRefining Hammer+\n11\n390\nRed Hot Ore\n1\n430\nSlicing Stone\n12\n460\nSlicing Stone+\n7\n490\nCommon Metal Scrap\n3\n530\nBlocking Stone\n24\n560\nBlocking Stone+\n14\n590\nRed Hot Ore\n1\n630\nRefining Hammer\n13\n660\nRefining Hammer+\n11\n690\nCommon Metal Scrap\n3\nChallenge Rewards\nChallenge Name\nRewards\nAmount\nDefeat boss (Able to achieve repeatedly)\nCol\n20000\nCompleted without any tumble (Able to achieve repeatedly)\nRefining Hammer\n4\nCompleted within 3 minutes (Able to achieve repeatedly)\nGlare Dragon Stone\n5\nImportant\n‧The dungeon daily clear will update at 4:00 AM (JST/UTC+9).\n‧Challenge rewards will reset at 4:00 AM (JST/UTC+9).\n‧This is a solo event that you can challenge with Lisbeth as your partner.\n‧The quest schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
